[987]={ -- Ogromm
  ["Don't waste my time."]=1,
},
[988]={ -- Kartosh
  ["You know enough to be dangerous, but you still look like you need training to me adventurer."]=1,
  ["Your will is not strong enough to manipulate the forces we control $c."]=2,
},
[1073]={ -- Ashlan Stonesmirk
  ["They can drain the Loch until it's little more than a drip of mud, and we'll still fight to keep it ours."]=1,
},
[1103]={ -- Eldrin
  ["I can tell that your wardrobe is in dire need of care."]=1,
  ["I'm a simple man who knows a few things about tailoring, but you need more assistance than I can provide. I have heard of a Night Elf who is quite an accomplished tailor. He resides in Stormwind, in the Magic District."]=2,
},
[1139]={ -- Magistrate Bluntnose
  ["Hello, adventurer. Welcome to Thelsamar, and while you're here don't forget to visit our local brewery!"]=1,
},
[1154]={ -- Marek Ironheart
  ["Here at the Farstrider lodge, we prize hunting skills above all else. Wish to gain my approval? You'll have to earn it. You look up to the challenge, lad!"]=1,
},
[1156]={ -- Vyrin Swiftwind
  ["Get that head and it's sure to give Daryl a fright. Not that he doesn't deserve it, the bloody arrogant fool. But ha! I can't wait to see the look on his face when you show it to him."]=1,
  ["Welcome to the Farstrider Lodge, adventurer!"]=2,
  ["You're always welcome here, adventurer. Thanks for the laugh -- and don't worry about Daryl, he had one coming!"]=3,
},
[1212]={ -- Bishop Farthing
  ["Have you come to supplicate yourself before the Light? Or perhaps you have come here to train in the holy arts?$b$bIf you are here to speak with Archbishop Benedictus, I am sorry to inform you that he has left on a mission."]=1,
},
[1215]={ -- Alchemist Mallory
  ["Good day, sir. I'd shake your hand, but as you see, I'm in the middle of something. May I be of assistance?"]=1,
  ["You've made a good start, but you still have a great deal to learn, adventurer."]=2,
},
[1218]={ -- Herbalist Pomeroy
