  ["Elder Darkhorn can be found among the red rocks of Orgrimmar."]=2,
  ["Elder High Mountain is at Camp Taurajo in the Barrens."]=3,
  ["Elder Moonwarden is observing the Crossroads in the Barrens."]=4,
},
