  ["You'll find Elder Grimtotem at the Lariss Pavilion in Feralas."]=2,
  ["Elder High Mountain is at Camp Taurajo in the Barrens."]=3,
  ["Elder Mistwalker enjoys watching the struggles at the Maul in Feralas."]=4,
  ["Elder Moonwarden is observing the Crossroads in the Barrens."]=5,
  ["Go to the Freewind Post in Thousand Needles and you will find Elder Skyseer."]=6,
},
