},
[15864]={ -- Valadar Starsong
  ["To honor your elders is to honor your culture and your people, $c. For this, the Coins of Ancestry serve as a tangible means to recognize those who choose to follow a venerable path of respect. During this Lunar Festival, you may have the opportunity to honor many elders. As you do so, you will acquire the Coins of Ancestry. Bring me these coins, and I will reward your diligence with a selection of unique items."]=1,
},
[15871]={ -- Elder Bronzebeard
  ["Now is the time when the year is new and the moon shines bright. It is our time... when the ancients awake."]=1,
  ["Elder Bladeswift wanders the paths of Darnassus atop Teldrassil."]=2,
  ["Elder Hammershout can be found within the walls of Stormwind."]=3,
  ["Elder Goldwell spends his time in the village of Kharanos in Dun Morogh."]=4,
},
[15895]={ -- Lunar Festival Harbinger
  ["Greetings, adventurer. We've travelled from Moonglade to spread the spirit of the Lunar Festival far and wide.$B$BWon't you join us in our celebration?"]=1,
},
[15903]={ -- Sergeant Carnes
  ["'Great job collecting resources for the war,' they said, 'Have a promotion,' they said. What they really meant is 'You're stationed outside a bughive in Silithus with a bunch of sweaty dwarves, Carnes!'$B$BThanks for the promotion, Captain!"]=1,
},
[15905]={ -- Darnassus Reveler
  ["Well met, friend!"]=1,
  ["After the firework show, they'll put out goblets so we can raise a toast!"]=2,
  ["I don't know what they put in those kegs, but it goes down like honey!"]=3,
  ["Be sure to stick around for the next firework show! Starting at 6PM, they're every hour on the hour!"]=4,
},
