},
[16574]={ -- Far Seer Regulkut
  ["Well met, $c. Your arrival in Thrallmar could not have occurred at a better time. The warchief is depending on us, since he cannot be here himself."]=1,
},
[16576]={ -- Overlord Hun Maimfist
  ["Thrallmar needs you, $c. The warchief needs you. Stand ready to do your duty."]=1,
},
[16583]={ -- Rohok
  ["Have you honed your skills enough to learn what I have to teach?"]=1,
},
[16584]={ -- Watch Commander Krunk
  ["You look lost, $c. Don't make me put you to work on the walls with the other peons."]=1,
},
[16587]={ -- Barley
