},
[16774]={ -- Erett
  ["Your skill exceeds mine, though I've heard that Old Man Heming in Booty Bay has copies of 'The Bass and You'. That is sure to help you increase your skill."]=1,
  ["You will need to find Nat Pagle in Dustwallow Marsh to get any better than you are currently."]=2,
  ["I can teach you fishing skills."]=3,
},
[16780]={ -- Drathen
  ["Your skill exceeds mine, though I've heard that Old Man Heming in Booty Bay has copies of 'The Bass and You'. That is sure to help you increase your skill."]=1,
  ["You will need to find Nat Pagle in Dustwallow Marsh to get any better than you are currently."]=2,
  ["I can teach you fishing skills."]=3,
},
[16781]={ -- Midsummer Celebrant
  ["The Midsummer Fire Festival has something for everyone to enjoy!"]=1,
  ["Across the lands our fires burn strong and true!"]=2,
  ["Have you danced at the ribbon pole yet?"]=3,
  ["I admire the skill that torch jugglers have."]=4,
},
[16789]={ -- Ranger Captain Venn'ren
  ["Though we've arrived at the promised land, adventurer, much work remains to be done. Our people won't reach Kael'thas if we lunge desperately across Outland.$B$BSafe routes must be found, resources must be secured and our enemies must be avoided or destroyed."]=1,
},
[16790]={ -- Falconer Drenna Riverwind
  ["Here's to hoping not all of Outland is as barren as this region. This is quite a change from the green grasslands and forests of Eversong."]=1,
},
[16791]={ -- Ryathen the Somber
  ["There exist in Outland demonic presences much more powerful than anything we'd ever seen in the old world.$B$BGreat power shall come to those who do not shy away from it, but learn to harness and master its strength."]=1,
},
[16792]={ -- Arcanist Calesthris Dawnstar
  ["Outland just oozes with magical energy, it's in the very air. Can you feel it, adventurer? I can't think of a place better suited to our race. Soon the sin'dorei shall have a new land to call our own!"]=1,
},
[16793]={ -- Magistrix Carinda
  ["My husband's been missing for days. We went on this pilgrimage together; we were supposed to finish it together.$B$BAll this worry has gotten me tapping into mana crystals more often than I really should."]=1,
},
[16794]={ -- Apothecary Azethen
  ["Befriending the Sunstriders has paid off; I get to conduct research with subjects I can only find in Outland and they get... my charming personality and rugged good looks."]=1,
},
[16796]={ -- Amaan the Wise
  ["Come closer, friend. Do not let my eyes startle you.$B$BI might have lost my sight many years ago but I never needed it to see the things that really matter."]=1,
},
[16797]={ -- Scout Vanura
  ["It looks like help has finally arrived! The Omenai welcome you to our remnant camp, adventurer."]=1,
},
[16798]={ -- Provisioner Anir
  ["Do you need something, $c? Perhaps I can assist you."]=1,
},
[16799]={ -- Ikan
  ["It will take a while, but these Broken Ones will learn the ways of the Light!"]=1,
},
[16802]={ -- Lor'themar Theron
  ["Be strong. Kael'thas has betrayed us and what we know is in flux, but do not lose heart. We will endure, as we always have. Arthas did not crush our spirit when he swept through our land, and neither will Kael'thas. Let it serve as a lesson to us all as we move forward to our prosperous future."]=1,
},
[16806]={ -- Ebonlocke
  ["This party is pointless. Those foolish nobles will never get to see Medivh. Can't they see this? I should have just stayed in Darkshire with my family instead of wasting my time here."]=1,
},
[16811]={ -- Sebastian
  ["Greetings! Behold one of the finest musical instruments in all of Lordaeron. It's a true honor to perform for the Master and all his guests. Take a seat in the audience, I hear a show is starting soon."]=1,
},
[16812]={ -- Barnes
  ["Don't worry, you'll be fine. You look like a natural!"]=1,
},
[16813]={ -- Wravien
  ["Your presence here is interfering with very important work. Please leave at once. Where was I, again?"]=1,
},
[16814]={ -- Gradav
  ["It's here... somewhere... I know it. Somewhere in this library is the knowledge I'm looking for..."]=1,
},
[16815]={ -- Kamsis
  ["This tower is complete and utter madness. This isn't a library, it's a huge haystack of books and I don't think the needle even exists! Now, what was I doing?"]=1,
},
[16816]={ -- Echo of Medivh
  ["To pass beyond my Hall, you must defeat me in a game of skill! Control your king when you are ready to begin..."]=1,
  ["Now that you have bested me, test your skills against each other! Take control of either king to begin play."]=2,
},
[16817]={ -- Festival Loremaster
  ["Enjoying the festival, $c?$b$bWhile the Flame Wardens tend to the fires of the present, I am more of a historian, keeping close the festivals past. I'm also, of course, documenting this year's festivities. Things are going well thus far, don't you think?$b$bYou know, adventurer, there is power inherent in all festival fires burning throughout the holiday. We're taking care of ours, but I'm certain there are sacred flames burning deep within our enemy's cities..."]=1,
},
[16818]={ -- Festival Talespinner
  ["Enjoying the festival, $c?$b$bWhile the Flame Keepers tend to the fires of the present, I am more of a historian, keeping close the festivals past. I'm also, of course, documenting this year's festivities. Things are going well thus far, don't you think?$b$bYou know, adventurer, there is power inherent in all festival fires burning throughout the holiday. We're taking care of ours, but I'm certain there are sacred flames burning deep within our enemy's cities..."]=1,
},
[16819]={ -- Force Commander Danath Trollbane
  ["Ah, a new champion to aid our cause? What say you, adventurer?"]=1,
  ["adventurer, the Sons of Lothar have fought here, on the Hellfire Peninsula, for two decades. We are beset on all sides by indigenous orcs and hellish demons of the Burning Crusade, and though our hearts still beat fiercely, years of war have reduced our numbers.$B$BYou, and the influx of Azeroth's new generation of heroes, are a welcome sight indeed!"]=2,
  ["The men and women of Honor Hold have shed such blood and have lost their youth in this monstrous land... and yet they still hold their spirits high!$B$BNow, you and your cohorts from Azeroth can help us turn the tide. You give us hope that we may one day return to our homelands."]=3,
},
[16820]={ -- Lieutenant Amadi
  ["Greetings, adventurer. My fellow Sons of Lothar and I have been stuck on this miserable world for close to twenty years now. We held on as best we could, but it still amazes me that the threats we face today are just the shadows of our past failures.$B$BPerhaps you will help us atone for them?"]=1,
},
[16822]={ -- Flightmaster Krill Bitterhue
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[16823]={ -- Humphry
  ["I don't suppose you've come bearing news about the mines, have you?"]=1,
},
[16824]={ -- Master Sergeant Lorin Thalmerok
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[16826]={ -- Sid Limbardi
  ["Sid's the name. It's nice to see some new faces around here. What can I do you for?"]=1,
},
[16827]={ -- Honor Guard Wesilow
  ["About twenty years ago, the Alliance launched the first Expedition to this world in hopes of eradicating the orcs forever. It was a... terrible conflict. Many brave souls perished to assure Azeroth's safety.$B$BYet some souls remain...locked in eternal combat."]=1,
},
[16829]={ -- Magus Zabraxis
  ["Are you the correspondent from the Gadgetzan Times? If you just follow me, I'll show you my experimental apparatus...$B$B<You tell the magus that you're not the reporter she's expecting.>$B$BOh, you're not? Well then, if you need reagents, find what you need and don't tarry. I'm expecting someone."]=1,
},
[16830]={ -- Field Commander Romus
  ["The heroics of the Trollbane bloodline are legendary. I idolize the man.$B$BAnd to find him alive, in the Outland...$B$B<Romus gazes past you.>$B$BWhen I first saw him, I nearly fainted. The shock was overwhelming. As I knelt before him, I had to fight back tears.$B$BYou can bet your sweet behind that I'm going to do everything in my power to make sure the Sons of Lothar are kept safe."]=1,
},
[16832]={ -- Prospector Murantus
  ["If you're looking for work, $c, grab yourself a pick and get to digging. There're ruins out there as far as the eye can see!"]=1,
},
[16833]={ -- Makuru
  ["Ikan tries and tries. I think these Dreghood are much like the Lost Ones, you know... lost."]=1,
},
[16834]={ -- Anchorite Obadei
  ["Light be with you, $c."]=1,
},
[16837]={ -- Foreman Biggums
  ["Haven't got much time to talk, $r. That is, unless you're willin' to help with this mine trouble."]=1,
  ["Can't thank ya enough fer helpin' with the mines. Now, it's just a matter of convincing the miners to get back to work."]=2,
},
[16841]={ -- Watch Commander Relthorn Netherwane
  ["Not long ago, this place was the site of a terrible battle. We of Nethergarde and the Argent Dawn held at bay a wave of demons, surging relentlessly from the Dark Portal.$B$BThose were dark days, full of bloodshed and despair...$B$BBut the Kingdoms of Azeroth soon joined us and pushed the monsters back! The fighting continues on the far side of the Portal...$B$BThis camp is now calm, but I fear the quiet here belies the madness found through that hellish gate."]=1,
},
[16842]={ -- Honor Hold Defender
  ["OY! Wait in line, would ya? Outland food doesn't agree with me at all."]=1,
},
[16845]={ -- Gorkan Bloodfist
  ["You are welcome among us, $c. At least for the time being."]=1,
},
[16848]={ -- Provisioner Braknar
  ["Strength to the Clans, $c! What brings you here?"]=1,
},
[16850]={ -- Gremni Longbeard
  ["Mirren and I are two of the very best hunters on either side of the Dark Portal. Stick around, you might learn a thing or two."]=1,
},
[16851]={ -- Mirren Longbeard
  ["I hope yer not here for our ale. We're not sharing and that's final!$B$BIt's not our fault no one had the good sense to bring beer to Outland but us."]=1,
},
[16856]={ -- Caretaker Dilandrus
  ["I was born here, $r. This is my world - all that I know... As a boy, my mother and father would regale me with tales of your world and the splendor it held. How I longed to leave this place.$B$BAlas, fate is a cruel mistress. My mother and father have long since passed, buried in this very graveyard. I remain to uphold their honor and the honor of my family - the Sons of Lothar."]=1,
},
[16858]={ -- Grelag
  ["I've managed to work myself into quite a spot here. Far Seer Regulkut tried to warn me, but my carelessness has finally caught up with me.$B$BI came down here to study the ruins of Zeth'Gor, but ran afoul of the Legion on my way. Now, all I have to show for it is a nasty gash on my leg."]=1,
  ["Thank you for your help in making the salve, adventurer. Once it's had a chance to dull the pain, I'm going to see how far I can get on this leg."]=2,
},
[16860]={ -- Jilanne
  ["Dragonhawks, if raised properly, are really quite tame. Don't you think that is fascinating? To be so friendly and companionable if raised right and so vicious and deadly in the wild...I just love them so much."]=1,
},
[16862]={ -- Silanna
  ["I really don't think our situation is so bad. I am certain it will all be rectified soon and the Sunwell's power will be restored. It just can't possibly be as bad as everyone is making it out to be."]=1,
},
[16885]={ -- Amythiel Mistwalker
  ["The extent of the corruption in Outland is truly astonishing, $c. The Cenarion Circle hopes to understand how these creatures have managed to survive. Studying this broken, tortured land and its inhabitants may yet teach us how to heal ailing parts of our own world."]=1,
},
[16886]={ -- Arator
  ["I was only an infant when my father was deployed to this wasteland. All that I have ever known of him is what others have told me.$B$BDo your dreams change, adventurer? Mine do not. I have one dream: A crimson skyline envelops me as Legion, numbering beyond comprehension, battle in the distance. I kneel before the body of a man, presumably my father, and weep. As he is gasping for air, his body wholly crushed, he whispers something. Despite every effort, I am unable to hear what he is trying to tell me."]=1,
},
[16888]={ -- Mahuram Stouthoof
  ["It is sad to see what has happened to this land. The Cenarion Expedition will do what it can to understand and heal the damage that has been done."]=1,
},
[16908]={ -- Arielle Snapflash
  ["Oh, hi! Did you want to take a S.E.L.F.I.E. with me?"]=1,
},
[16915]={ -- Foreman Razelcraz
  ["All muscle and no brain, that's what peons are! They're great when you can motivate them, but they have to be 'kick' started, if you know what I mean."]=1,
},
[16924]={ -- Sergeant Kan'ren
  ["You think I'm being cruel to this worm?$B$BThey've killed two of my men this month! We're too kind to this Wretched scum."]=1,
},
[16991]={ -- Thiah Redmane
  ["I bid you welcome, $c."]=1,
},
[17002]={ -- Angela "The Claw" Kestrel
  ["<Angela coos to the felhunter again before turning her attention to you.>$B$BJir'see's always been smaller than all the other felhunters, but that's never bothered him. And Outland's going to change all that, right Jir'see?$B$BMomma's little angel is going to grow up to be a big, fierce felhunter, yes he is!"]=1,
},
[17005]={ -- Duelist Larenis
  ["Few bouts are won by sheer strength. It is cunning, reflexes and knowledge of your weapon that wins the day in the end."]=1,
},
[17006]={ -- Elsaana
  ["Walk always in the Light, adventurer."]=1,
},
[17015]={ -- Taleris Dawngazer
  ["I haven't time for idle chatter, $c. I must see to the pilgrims and ensure they are prepared for the long journey ahead."]=1,
},
[17046]={ -- Pilgrim Gal'ressa
  ["I think I'm beginning to regret undertaking this pilgrimage. I anticipated that the road would be rough and I'm no stranger to travel, but I wasn't prepared for the rigors of Outland.$B$BOn top of everything else, that Taleris seems to want to push me out of here before I've regained my strength completely."]=1,
},
[17056]={ -- Eversong Partygoer
  ["Oh... do I know you?"]=1,
  ["Sorry, I don't speak with the help."]=2,
  ["And you would be?"]=3,
  ["I'm afraid you have me confused with someone who wants to talk to you."]=4,
  ["Hi, adventurer! Enjoying the party?"]=5,
  ["Hey everyone, it's adventurer!"]=6,
  ["Word travels fast in this circle. Thanks for restocking the supplies!"]=7,
  ["This party is just the best! Don't you agree?"]=8,
  ["You should try the springpaw appetizers, they're to die for!"]=9,
  ["Hmm... I think this year's Suntouched Special isn't so special after all. Wouldn't you agree, adventurer?"]=10,
  ["I heard a rumor that we're all going to go watch the battle with the Scourge at the border tonight. How delightfully wicked!"]=11,
  ["Can you believe the nerve of that Elisara Sunstriker? Thinking that she can catch the eye of Lord Saltheril? And did you see what she's wearing? So last season. It's sad, really."]=12,
},
[17071]={ -- Technician Zhanaa
  ["This emitter is driving me nuts! I'm missing all sorts of parts that I need to fix it."]=1,
  ["adventurer! Thanks again for all the help."]=2,
  ["Nope, still not done with these repairs. Shouldn't be long though."]=3,
},
[17073]={ -- Draenei Mourner
  ["<Sobbing> I hate graveyards. So many dead. And my sweet Luhanaa...."]=1,
},
[17087]={ -- Spirit of the Vale
  ["Return to the draenei and tell them to send me one of their shaman."]=1,
  ["Your work here is complete, shaman. Return to your people."]=2,
  ["Do you have the understanding to continue, shaman? Do you know why you are here?"]=3,
},
[17088]={ -- Shadowy Summoner
  ["Did you hear that they lost total control of Murmur in the Shadow Labyrinth?!"]=1,
  ["They don't pay us enough for this. But this ruined village sure beats skulking around inside of Auchindoun."]=2,
  ["I joined up because they said they'd pay my way into the academy. My uncle says that I can go next season!"]=3,
  ["Hey there, you must be the new recruit! Good to meet you!$B$BAny word from the Shadow Labyrinth in Auchindoun on whether we've regained control of Murmur yet?"]=4,
  ["If you're interested, a couple of us are going into Shattrath for drinks later."]=5,
  ["Interested in joining up for the leather ball league? We play Monday through Wednesday, mostly. $B$BYou're welcome to join us after this shift. We're going to toss it around."]=6,
  ["I hope this place pans out as a forward base for Shadow Council operations. I know it sounds weird, but I kind of miss the Shadow Labyrinth."]=7,
  ["<He leans in closer.>$B$BJust between you and me, I'm thinking about 'mustering' out one of these nights. You know what I mean?"]=8,
},
[17089]={ -- Firmanvaar
  ["Remember to always show your respect for the elements of the world."]=1,
},
[17092]={ -- Advisor Duskingdawn
  ["Just remember, adventurer, it's in our best interests that you do as much as possible for these... these people."]=1,
},
[17098]={ -- Ambassador Dawnsinger
  ["Greetings, $r! I trust this day finds you well?"]=1,
  ["Any news from home, $c?"]=2,
},
[17099]={ -- Mehlar Dawnblade
  ["I WILL have my revenge!"]=1,
},
[17100]={ -- Advisor Sunsworn
  ["Hello. I trust that this day finds you well?"]=1,
  ["It's so good to see another sin'dorei $g brother : sister;! As you can imagine, there's not much in the way of conversation around here."]=2,
},
[17101]={ -- Diktynna
  ["Grab a net, young $c. Our people need sustenance!"]=1,
  ["I haven't got anymore work for you, adventurer. I do want you to know that the red snapper we shared was something special that I'll never forget..."]=2,
},
[17103]={ -- Emissary Taluun
  ["I am honored to make your acquaintance."]=1,
},
[17104]={ -- Anchorite Delan
  ["Greetings. I am Anchorite Delan - one of the draenei. I am a teacher of sorts. And who might you be?"]=1,
  ["While we have much to teach the other races of the Alliance, we have as much to learn from them. Keep your eyes, ears and mind open, $c."]=2,
},
[17105]={ -- Emissary Valustraa
  ["While we have much to teach the other races of the Alliance, we have as much to learn from them. Keep your eyes, ears and mind open, $c."]=1,
  ["Hail to thee, $c."]=2,
},
[17106]={ -- Vindicator Palanaar
  ["Greetings, I am Vindicator Palanaar, a traveling paladin of the Light. I am here to be of assistance to the night elves."]=1,
  ["It is my fervent hope that we will be able to bring the Light to those places in Ashenvale where it has been forsaken."]=2,
},
[17109]={ -- Cersei Dusksinger
  ["This is going to be such fun! Don't you think, my dear?"]=1,
},
[17110]={ -- Acteon
  ["Greetings, $c. Have you come to learn about combat specializations?"]=1,
},
[17116]={ -- Exarch Menelaous
  ["Gaze upon the Exodar, young $r. It is hard to imagine that we survived such a catastrophe.$B$B<Menelaous sighs.>$B$BThe Prophet states that it is here that our fate will finally be known. Ten lifetimes spent fleeing from the madness of the Burning Legion... here we finally make a stand.$B$BNo more running... I am ready to die."]=1,
  ["Thank you for the warning, adventurer. We will prepare our defenses."]=2,
  ["We are here to support our hero!"]=3,
  ["I wouldn't have missed this for the world, adventurer.$B$B<Exarch Menelaous hugs you.>$B$BWe are proud of you."]=4,
},
[17117]={ -- Injured Night Elf Priestess
  ["I am here to give thanks to the one that saved my life."]=1,
  ["You probably don't remember me, but you saved my life. I have only recently become healthy enough to walk on my own.$B$BI wanted to thank you for what you did for me and apologize for what I may have said... Thank you, adventurer. May Elune always watch over you."]=2,
},
[17119]={ -- Ithania
  ["Did Balandar Brightstar send you to rescue me?"]=1,
},
[17120]={ -- Behomat
  ["Do you seek further training in the ways of the warrior?"]=1,
  ["I would train you, but you are no warrior."]=2,
},
[17121]={ -- Kavaan
  ["Ours is the path of purity and righteousness in the Light."]=1,
  ["We are one in the Light, $g brother : sister;, but I cannot train you."]=2,
},
[17122]={ -- Vord
  ["I'm a hunter trainer. You'll want to find the $c trainer."]=1,
},
[17123]={ -- Earthcaller Ryga
  ["May the spirits guide you, $r."]=1,
},
[17127]={ -- Anchorite Avuun
  ["Greetings. I am Anchorite Avuun of the draenei. I am here studying the Lost Ones of the Fallow Sanctuary in the hope of being able to find a cure for their condition."]=1,
},
[17204]={ -- Farseer Nobundo
  ["It is a good day to be alive and one with the elements."]=1,
},
[17205]={ -- Temper
  ["And why would I speak with you, $r?"]=1,
  ["Look around you, shaman. Can you see the balance of the elements in the earth, the air, the water and the fire that has touched them all?"]=2,
},
[17209]={ -- William Kielar
  ["Don't be alarmed... while my gryphons may not be entirely alive, they will still carry you faithfully to your destination. Tell me... which tower do you seek?"]=1,
},
[17211]={ -- Human Footman
  ["<The footman stand resolute, muscles tense.>"]=1,
},
[17212]={ -- Tuluun
  ["Remember to always show your respect for the elements of the world."]=1,
},
[17214]={ -- Anchorite Fateema
  ["The esteemed Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen can train you further. He can be found in Theramore treating the wounded at the barracks."]=1,
  ["If you have not yet learned how to make use of bandages, I will be happy to show you the basics of creation and application. The difference between life and death can often come down to properly bandaging wounds."]=2,
},
[17215]={ -- Daedal
  ["An alchemist is able to work miracles with ordinary herbs, converting them into stable potions that range in effect from healing to breathing underwater and everything in between."]=1,
},
[17219]={ -- Sulaa
  ["Remember to always show your respect for the elements of the world."]=1,
  ["We must strive to understand the balance maintained by this world's elemental spirits."]=2,
},
[17222]={ -- Artificer Daelo
  ["Greetings, $c. I have been sent here from the Exodar to oversee the construction of Azure Watch."]=1,
},
[17223]={ -- Ambassador Rualeth
  ["My people have enjoyed a good relationship with the Wildhammer for quite some time now.$B$BA few of us have settled here... those who have found this land to be a home worth defending."]=1,
},
[17226]={ -- Viera Sunwhisper
  ["What do you want?$B$BIt's a bit rude to walk up to strangers for no reason, don't you think?"]=1,
},
[17228]={ -- Draenei Artificer
  ["I'm very busy right now, young $c. Please excuse me."]=1,
},
[17238]={ -- Anchorite Truuen
  ["Hello. What brings you to Chillwind Camp today?"]=1,
  ["How fares your search for the Mark?"]=2,
},
[17240]={ -- Admiral Odesyus
  ["Watch your step around here, stranger."]=1,
  ["You've been a great help thus far, adventurer. You would do well to help out the others at the encampment.$B$BAnd don't worry about those goblins, I'm taking care of everything."]=2,
  ["All hail the exalted hero!"]=3,
  ["The story of your journey will be told for years to come!"]=4,
  ["I finally have a story to tell my grandchildren about... A traitor to the kingdom was living among us!"]=5,
  ["Truth be told, I never liked that gnome..."]=6,
  ["We are lucky to have survived this ordeal. If it wasn't for you, everyone on this island could have been killed!"]=7,
  ["I wonder how many more of them live among us. I knew Spark for years - never could I have imagined that he was a traitor."]=8,
  ["Thanks for the warning, adventurer! We shall prepare!"]=9,
  ["You've come a long way, adventurer. A long way indeed... But I knew you were destined for great things. We all knew. All hail adventurer!$B$BAnd thanks again for taking care of our gnome problem..."]=10,
},
[17241]={ -- Priestess Kyleen Il'dinare
  ["<Priestess Il'dinare eyes you suspiciously.>"]=1,
  ["I am a night elf, stranger. While you may know nothing of my kind, we know much of you and your progenitors. You may not call yourself eredar but, in appearance, you share many similarities.$B$BYou have helped my allies, and for that I am thankful; but for the time being, you walk a tenuous path. Perhaps in time, you will be able to dissolve the doubts and fears that I hold in my heart."]=2,
  ["Greetings, $r. Your noble actions are acknowledged. May Elune protect you."]=3,
  ["All hail the exalted hero!"]=4,
  ["The story of your journey will be told for years to come!"]=5,
  ["I finally have a story to tell my grandchildren about... A traitor to the kingdom was living among us!"]=6,
  ["Truth be told, I never liked that gnome..."]=7,
  ["We are lucky to have survived this ordeal. If it wasn't for you, everyone on this island could have been killed!"]=8,
  ["I wonder how many more of them live among us. I knew Spark for years - never could I have imagined that he was a traitor."]=9,
},
[17242]={ -- Archaeologist Adamant Ironheart
  ["What are you lookin' at?"]=1,
  ["I am Adamant Ironheart of the great city of Ironforge. As you could probably guess by looking at my uniform, I was once part of the Ironforge elite guard. Yep, I was Magni's right hand man! At least until I retired. Now I dabble in archaeology. It's a hobby really; plus I figured it would be a great way to see the world!"]=2,
  ["All hail the exalted hero!"]=3,
  ["The story of your journey will be told for years to come!"]=4,
  ["I finally have a story to tell my grandchildren about... A traitor to the kingdom was living among us!"]=5,
  ["Truth be told, I never liked that gnome..."]=6,
  ["We are lucky to have survived this ordeal. If it wasn't for you, everyone on this island could have been killed!"]=7,
  ["I wonder how many more of them live among us. I knew Spark for years - never could I have imagined that he was a traitor."]=8,
},
[17243]={ -- Engineer "Spark" Overgrind
  ["Can't you see that I'm busy?"]=1,
},
[17245]={ -- Blacksmith Calypso
  ["All hail the exalted hero!"]=1,
  ["The story of your journey will be told for years to come!"]=2,
  ["I finally have a story to tell my grandchildren about... A traitor to the kingdom was living among us!"]=3,
  ["Truth be told, I never liked that gnome..."]=4,
  ["We are lucky to have survived this ordeal. If it wasn't for you, everyone on this island could have been killed!"]=5,
  ["I wonder how many more of them live among us. I knew Spark for years - never could I have imagined that he was a traitor."]=6,
},
[17246]={ -- "Cookie" McWeaksauce
  ["Avast ye, matey. Cookie is me name, cooking is me game. The McWeaksauce bloodline be a long line of cooks and tradesmen that work to please the more delicate senses o' man and woman."]=1,
},
[17249]={ -- Landro Longshot
  ["Welcome, adventurer. I am Landro Longshot, manager of the Black Flame. Perhaps you've not heard of the Black Flame until now. That doesn't surprise me. We work to keep things that way. We prefer to avoid... factional entanglements. The Black Flame specializes in providing the finest services and entertainment money can buy, whether they happen to be hard to find items, gladiatorial combat, or lucrative games of chance. Are you here seeking something specific?"]=1,
},
[17275]={ -- Aqueous
  ["You are brave to swim down to my realm, land-walker."]=1,
  ["Greetings, young shaman. Make yourself at home within my reef."]=2,
  ["Together we will deal with this corruption of the water."]=3,
  ["You have done a great thing, adventurer. You are welcome here at any time."]=4,
},
[17277]={ -- Provisioner Valine
  ["Like anything that you see, $c?"]=1,
},
[17287]={ -- Sentinel Luciel Starwhisper
  ["It's good to see a new face out here. We're barely hanging on and our enemies are plentiful.$B$BWe're surrounded by those who seek to destroy us: the satyr to the north, the orcs in the lumber camp here to the east, and the demons of Felfire Hill.$B$BWe're going to retake this place if it kills us. It looks like it just might!"]=1,
},
[17291]={ -- Architect Nemos
  ["Greetings, $c. Before the night elves invited the draenei to join them here, this glade was all but forgotten.$B$BThe kaldorei are deeply tied to these lands, and we draenei are honored that they have asked us to share in the task of revitalizing Forest Song."]=1,
},
[17303]={ -- Vindicator Vedaar
  ["Can you feel the evil all around us, $c? By the Hand, it must be cleansed!$B$BThe demons destroyed our homeworld, Argus. I will NOT countenance their presence here on our new home, Azeroth!"]=1,
},
[17310]={ -- Gnarl
  ["The forest sings with the seeds of change, but it also cries out in pain.$B$BOur new friends, the draenei, are here to help us, like you. We must put an end to the destruction of my brother and sister trees before all is lost and Ashenvale is no more."]=1,
},
[17311]={ -- Cowlen
  ["What could I have done to give the gods cause to lash out at me with such ferocity? All that I cherished is gone - dead or destroyed. My family taken from me by the brutes of the forest. My home razed. My ship sunk.$B$BI am a broken man, stranded on a broken island.$B$BPerhaps you are here to finish the job? Make it quick, I will not resist. Take my life, stranger; I am too cowardly to do it myself. My hand shivers... the blade will not strike true."]=1,
  ["We have traveled far to celebrate the hero of the draenei people."]=2,
  ["I would have traveled across the Great Sea to see you, friend. We will never forget what you did for us."]=3,
},
[17355]={ -- Valusha
  ["There are demons to kill, $c. Do you have the backbone to do what needs to be done?"]=1,
},
[17406]={ -- Artificer
  ["I'm very busy right now, young $c. Please excuse me."]=1,
},
[17412]={ -- Phaedra
  ["Welcome to Forest Song, $c. If there is anything I can do for you, please let me know."]=1,
},
[17421]={ -- Clopper Wizbang
  ["Shh! Be very quiet; I'm observing murlocs.$B$BLiving in an oversized turtle shell is a sacrifice I'm willing to make for science. After all, if the murlocs see me here, they'll react to my presence and contaminate my data!$B$BAs the first gnomish member of the Explorers' League, I'm boldly going places no dwarf has gone before!"]=1,
},
[17423]={ -- Harbinger Mikolaas
  ["If you only learn one thing during your time in Bloodmyst, $c, I hope that it is vigilance. This island claims the unwary first, then begins to wear down even the most guarded of warriors.$B$BEverywhere you turn, a foe stands ready to take your life."]=1,
},
[17424]={ -- Anchorite Paetheus
  ["Welcome to Blood Watch, $c. In my travels, I have amassed a wide variety of tools, artifacts, and knowledge from the various peoples we've encountered.$B$BShould you find yourself in need of this knowledge, you have only to ask."]=1,
},
[17431]={ -- Velaada
  ["Greetings, $c. I get so few visitors up here. To what do I owe the pleasure?"]=1,
  ["Susurrus is expecting you, adventurer."]=2,
  ["I have been expecting you."]=3,
},
[17434]={ -- Morae
  ["Everything that has happened since the crash is little more than a blur. It seems like a lifetime ago that I was aboard the Exodar.$B$BNow, my reality is restricted to this island with its mutant creatures and endless sea of blood elf agents. Soon, it will be as if I've never known anything different..."]=1,
},
[17435]={ -- Susurrus
  ["What brings you all the way up here, little $r?"]=1,
  ["Are you ready, adventurer?"]=2,
},
[17440]={ -- High Chief Stillpine
  ["[Furbolg] Mil'ork kix ilfin o oomtor..."]=1,
  ["It is you who will defend my people and usher in a new era of prosperity for Stillpine!"]=2,
  ["Promised One, we thank you for the warning. The Stillpine tribe will be prepared."]=3,
  ["[In broken Common] It is time celebrate we do."]=4,
  ["Promised One, do you remember us? Do you recall the prophecy of Kurz? This moment was pre-ordained. You have done what you were put on this world to do.$B$B<High Chief Stillpine bows before you.>$B$BDraenei will always be welcome among my people."]=5,
  ["[In broken Common] Stillpine be ready! Many thanks!"]=6,
},
[17441]={ -- Gurf
  ["[Furbolg] Mil'ork kix ilfin o oomtor..."]=1,
  ["Gurf is my name, stranger. Gurf the Brave!"]=2,
},
[17442]={ -- Moordo
  ["[Furbolg] Mil'ork kix ilfin o oomtor..."]=1,
  ["I am Moordo, elder hunter of Stillpine."]=2,
},
[17443]={ -- Kurz the Revelator
  ["[Furbolg] Mil'ork kix ilfin o oomtor..."]=1,
  ["Ah, the Promised One has arrived. Welcome to Stillpine Hold."]=2,
},
[17445]={ -- Stillpine the Younger
  ["[Furbolg] Mil'ork kix ilfin o oomtor..."]=1,
  ["Good tidings, $c. I am Stillpine the Younger, heir to the throne of Stillpine."]=2,
},
[17446]={ -- Parkat Steelfur
  ["[Furbolg] Mil'ork kix ilfin o oomtor..."]=1,
  ["Welcome to my shop!"]=2,
},
[17468]={ -- Prophet Velen
  ["As we attempt to gain the help of the peoples of this world against the Burning Legion, we must also learn to live peaceably amongst them.$B$BPlease keep this in mind as your journey takes you throughout Azeroth. May the Light guide you."]=1,
  ["The draenei champion walks among us. This is a celebration for the savior of Azuremyst and Bloodmyst!"]=2,
  ["This is all for you, adventurer. You did this. You saved all of these people and thousands more.$B$BYou have risen above the strife and tragedy of this world and in doing so, elevated all of us with you.$B$BYou have done so much - more than many could do in ten lifetimes - yet your life has just begun. If only we had a thousand heroes like you.$B$BBut listen well, adventurer. Your destiny lies in the Outland. I have seen it in visions, a prophecy yet untold.$B$BFind our people, adventurer. Find them and bring them home..."]=3,
},
[17469]={ -- Orc Grunt
  ["<The grunt's mouth waters, anticipating bloodshed.>"]=1,
},
[17479]={ -- Gunny
  ["What's that $T scrub : girlie;? You want your mommy? Well too bad. Maybe you should pay a visit to the Thrallmar officer's club to get her back?"]=1,
  ["Do you know where you are? This is Honor Hold, sweetheart! Love it or get out!"]=2,
  ["This isn't a field trip, maggot! You're in the Outland now! Shape up or take a stroll back through the portal."]=3,
  ["I have neither the time, nor the inclination, to explain things to you, scumbag! Now do you have something important to say, or are you just here to ask me out for a drink, princess?"]=4,
  ["What is your major malfunction?!"]=5,
  ["I've seen you prancing around. Why don't you do us all a favor and just drop your gear off at the armory?"]=6,
  ["Who in name of Kurdran let you through the Dark Portal?"]=7,
  ["Well, well, well, what have we here? A $T civilian : civilian;? Isn't that precious? You'll get no special treatment from me!"]=8,
},
[17480]={ -- Ruada
  ["I would train you, but you are no warrior."]=1,
},
[17481]={ -- Semid
  ["We practitioners of the arcane and elemental ways follow a never ending path of discovery. Is that why you seek my counsel? You wish further training?"]=1,
  ["By the Naaru, you are no mage! If you are looking for training, you must seek out a $c trainer."]=2,
},
[17482]={ -- Guvan
  ["In the Light we all cast shadows, my $g brother : sister;. Do you seek further guidance today?"]=1,
  ["Though I cannot offer you training, young $c, I can give you my blessing. Walk boldly in the Light!"]=2,
},
[17483]={ -- Tullas
  ["Ours is the path of purity and righteousness in the Light."]=1,
  ["We are one in the Light, $g brother : sister;, but I cannot train you."]=2,
},
[17484]={ -- Buruk
  ["You've come for training in order to pass it on to your pets?"]=1,
  ["Ah friend, I only help hunters and their pets."]=2,
},
[17485]={ -- Esbina
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[17487]={ -- Erin Kelly
  ["I can instruct you in tailoring. Interested?"]=1,
},
[17488]={ -- Dulvi
  ["I can instruct you in mining. Interested?"]=1,
},
[17490]={ -- Ergh of the Stillpine
  ["[Furbolg] Mil'ork kix ilfin o oomtor..."]=1,
  ["How can I help you, stranger?"]=2,
},
[17493]={ -- Stone Guard Stok'ton
  ["Keep your voice down, $c!"]=1,
  ["If you have something to say, say it!"]=2,
  ["You're a $T civilian : civilian;?"]=3,
  ["I'm busy, make it fast!"]=4,
},
[17504]={ -- Kazi
  ["Do you seek further training in the ways of the warrior?"]=1,
  ["I would train you, but you are no warrior."]=2,
},
[17505]={ -- Killac
  ["You come in search of training, hunter?"]=1,
  ["I'm a hunter trainer. You'll want to find the $c trainer."]=2,
},
[17509]={ -- Jol
  ["Ours is the path of purity and righteousness in the Light."]=1,
  ["We are one in the Light, $g brother : sister;, but I cannot train you."]=2,
},
[17510]={ -- Izmir
  ["In the Light we all cast shadows, my $g brother : sister;. Do you seek further guidance today?"]=1,
  ["Though I cannot offer you training, young $c, I can give you my blessing. Walk boldly in the Light!"]=2,
},
[17511]={ -- Fallat
  ["In the Light we all cast shadows, my $g brother : sister;. Do you seek further guidance today?"]=1,
  ["Though I cannot offer you training, young $c, I can give you my blessing. Walk boldly in the Light!"]=2,
},
[17513]={ -- Harnan
  ["We practitioners of the arcane and elemental ways follow a never ending path of discovery. Is that why you seek my counsel? You wish further training?"]=1,
  ["By the Naaru, you are no mage! If you are looking for training, you must seek out a $c trainer."]=2,
},
[17514]={ -- Bati
  ["We practitioners of the arcane and elemental ways follow a never ending path of discovery. Is that why you seek my counsel? You wish further training?"]=1,
  ["By the Naaru, you are no mage! If you are looking for training, you must seek out a $c trainer."]=2,
},
[17518]={ -- Ythyar
  ["Ah, such an odd place to find potential customers!"]=1,
},
[17519]={ -- Hobahken
  ["Remember to always show your respect for the elements of the world."]=1,
  ["We must strive to understand the balance maintained by this world's elemental spirits."]=2,
},
[17520]={ -- Gurrag
  ["Remember to always show your respect for the elements of the world."]=1,
  ["We must strive to understand the balance maintained by this world's elemental spirits."]=2,
},
[17553]={ -- Caregiver Topher Loaal
  ["Please, sit and make yourself comfortable."]=1,
},
[17554]={ -- Laando
  ["If you need to travel to the Exodar, I have just the hippogryph for you!"]=1,
},
[17555]={ -- Stephanos
  ["Good day, $c. Are you in need of a reliable hippogryph?"]=1,
},
[17558]={ -- Caza'rez
  ["Yes? What is it?"]=1,
},
[17584]={ -- Torallius the Pack Handler
  ["What are you after? Speak up. I'm not about to trust you with one of my Elekks until you prove your dedication and friendship to our people."]=1,
},
[17585]={ -- Quartermaster Urgronn
  ["Welcome to Thrallmar, adventurer! As you continue to aid us in our cause, I will grant you access to more of our supplies."]=1,
},
[17599]={ -- Aonar
  ["Hello, $c.$B$BOld man Kessel over there, he's a clever one. I'd be real careful in my dealings with him if I were you.$B$BHe offered me work 'caring for the elekk' and being the fool I was, I took it to mean feeding, training, and the like. Things became real clear when he handed me the shovel..."]=1,
},
[17613]={ -- Archmage Alturus
  ["Karazhan is more than a mere building, adventurer. If you traced the ley-lines traversing Azeroth you would find that they all converge right about there.$B$B<Alturus points at an invisible spot below the tower.>$B$BFascinating, isn't it?"]=1,
  ["Archmage Alvareux once wrote a treatise exploring a fascinating theory. He proposed the existence of an exact copy of Karazhan in a world other than our own and that both somehow shared the same space.$B$BHe went mad soon after. A real pity."]=2,
},
[17630]={ -- Innkeeper Jovia
  ["I offer what shelter I can in our shattered lands."]=1,
},
[17631]={ -- Ceera
  ["Thank you for choosing the Bank of Silvermoon. What may I do for you today?"]=1,
  ["Welcome to the Bank of Silvermoon, $g sir : ma'am;. Would you care to access the depository?"]=2,
},
[17632]={ -- Elana
  ["Thank you for choosing the Bank of Silvermoon. What may I do for you today?"]=1,
  ["Welcome to the Bank of Silvermoon, $g sir : ma'am;. Would you care to access the depository?"]=2,
},
[17634]={ -- K. Lee Smallfry
  ["Can you believe this place? 'Course, it's a mite stuffy up here if you ask me."]=1,
},
[17637]={ -- Mack Diver
  ["Say, you happen to see that arch in the lake to the west? I wonder where that goes? I should go divin' over there."]=1,
},
[17642]={ -- Tracker Lyceon
  ["The others look at this landscape and see only death, corruption, and adversity. None of those things are in short supply, true, but that view ignores the opportunities presented by our environment.$B$BI will not stand by and watch these opportunities go ignored, $c. With your help, we can demonstrate to the others here at Blood Watch just how to make use of the environment and its creatures."]=1,
},
[17649]={ -- Kessel
  ["I am Kessel, lord of the elekk, disciple of the Hand of Argus. Are you the new recruit?"]=1,
  ["I have come to support the draenei champion!"]=2,
  ["Good to see you again, adventurer. I brought a friend with me. She really wanted to see you.$B$B<Kessel laughs.>"]=3,
},
[17655]={ -- Blacksmith Frances
  ["Come for some blacksmithing supplies, have ya?"]=1,
},
[17656]={ -- Heron Skygaze
  ["I've got fresh meat, fish and mushrooms. And plenty to drink!"]=1,
},
[17657]={ -- Logistics Officer Ulrike
  ["Greetings, adventurer. As you rise in rank among the forces of Honor Hold, I will give you access to some of the different goods we keep in stock."]=1,
},
[17658]={ -- Exarch Admetius
  ["I am Admetius, leader of Blood Watch."]=1,
},
[17663]={ -- Maatparm
  ["On Argus, Eredath was the most sacred of our cities.$B$BWould you believe me if I told you that the walkways were lined with precious minerals? That the rivers glittered even in complete darkness?$B$BI long for those days... How long has it been? A thousand years? Ten-thousand?"]=1,
},
[17666]={ -- Astur
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[17674]={ -- Prince Toreth
  ["Are you mad? Look around you, mortal. Do you not see that you stand upon sundered earth? Leave this place lest you suffer as my people and I have..."]=1,
},
[17676]={ -- Achelus
  ["I am Achelus, chief expeditionary officer of Blood Watch."]=1,
},
[17684]={ -- Vindicator Boros
  ["What it means to be a Hand of Argus... We are agents of the Light. We serve without question. We die without question."]=1,
  ["You have served one of three with honor, adventurer. Our time is at an end. Kuros will call for you when he is ready."]=2,
},
[17686]={ -- Researcher Cornelius
  ["Did they send you to find me? Well I'm not going back without my men."]=1,
},
[17703]={ -- Messenger Hermesius
  ["I deliver the mail to and from Azuremyst, $c. If you need a message delivered, it'll more than likely be routed through me first."]=1,
},
[17712]={ -- Captain Edward Hanes
  ["This land still bears the scars of the past. I wonder if they will ever heal."]=1,
},
[17717]={ -- Knight-Lord Bloodvalor
  ["Welcome to the headquarters of the Blood Knights, the defenders of Quel'Thalas, the faithful servants of Silvermoon, and the true masters of the Light."]=1,
},
[17718]={ -- Magister Astalor Bloodsworn
  ["Kael'thas and his felbloods be damned! All we've worked for is gone, but they're fools to think we won't fight back. Already, Lady Liadrin seeks a new source of power for our order. We will not be destroyed so easily."]=1,
},
[17769]={ -- Blood Knight Adept
  ["There is nothing to see here. Move along."]=1,
  ["This does not concern you. Be on your way."]=2,
},
[17772]={ -- Lady Jaina Proudmoore
  ["I have no idea who you are, but your presence is most welcome. Archimonde and his Scourge army could attack at any time, $C. Will you stand with us against this evil?"]=1,
  ["Well done, adventurer. Rage Winterchill's death has earned us all a small pause in the enemy's advance. Use this short time wisely. Tend to your wounded and prepare your defenses, as soon Archimonde will send even deadlier forces at us. My meager force of reserve units will reinforce you when battle is joined again."]=2,
  ["Amazing! Anatheron's defeat at your hands has delayed Archimonde from his objective, and brought us that much closer to victory. My forces cannot stay here, however. My troops and I are exhausted, and now is the time for retreat. If your strength has not waned, head east to Thrall's encampment. That is where we make another stand. Be well."]=3,
},
[17773]={ -- Ossco
  ["The Exodar's vaults are vast and well-protected. Your goods will come to no harm here."]=1,
  ["We control access to the Exodar's storage facilities. Are there goods you wish to store or remove?"]=2,
},
[17804]={ -- Squire Rowe
  ["Greetings, citizen. I ask that you move along if you have nothing to ask of me."]=1,
  ["Hail, champion. The tale of your deeds will be told throughout the ages. Perhaps one day, a statue of you will stand amongst the heroes of Stormwind."]=2,
},
[17822]={ -- Landen Stilwell
  ["Stay away from me, $r! There's no telling when the sickness will take me again.$B$BJust leave me alone before it happens again."]=1,
},
[17824]={ -- Captured Sunhawk Agent
  ["Be thankful that I am locked inside this cage, $r."]=1,
  ["<The captured Sunhawk agent eyes you suspiciously.>$B$BI've never seen you before. Who are you?"]=2,
},
[17831]={ -- Watcher Leesa'oh
  ["Oh, pay no mind to Buddy. He won't hurt you, he just likes to scratch now and then.$B$BHe's just a big, loveable kitty.$B$BAren't you Buddy? Yes, you are, you cute, little thing. You're mommy's little baby, that's what you are!"]=1,
},
[17832]={ -- Blood Knight Dawnstar
  ["Examining the corpse, you conclude that this must be Blood Knight Dawnstar, the leader of the failed assault on Deatholme."]=1,
},
[17834]={ -- Lethyn Moonfire
  ["We Cenarion druids are the protectors of the balance of nature. The main point being the balance. When called for, we shouldn't wait too long before taking decisive action. Don't let anyone tell you otherwise, especially those of us who only want to observe!"]=1,
},
[17841]={ -- Ysiel Windsinger
  ["Greetings, $c. It is good you've decided to visit us."]=1,
},
[17843]={ -- Vindicator Kuros
  ["Greetings, $c. I am Kuros, second of the Triumvirate of the Hand."]=1,
  ["Their day will come, adventurer.$B$BAnd when it does, I will be there."]=2,
},
[17844]={ -- Vindicator Aesom
  ["I am Aesom, third of the Triumvirate."]=1,
  ["<Vindicator Aesom salutes you.>$B$BHave you spoken with Admetius? I believe he was inquiring as to your whereabouts."]=2,
},
[17852]={ -- Thrall
  ["Lady Proudmoore's forces have bled to delay Archimonde and his Burning Legion, and now this grim task falls to us. Are you ready to stand with me against the onslaught?"]=1,
  ["Outstanding! Kaz'rogal's death cry should strike fear into the core of the Burning Legion. They now know the power your forces possess, so expect the worst the Legion can offer."]=2,
  ["Outstanding! Killing a Pit Lord such as Azgalor is no small feat, my friend. If we had more time, I would love to hear the story of you and your companions. Archimonde will not give us that pause, however. My scouts have already reported that the Legion is amassing an immense force outside our camp, and Archimonde is very close to the World Tree. We are evacuating with the help of Lady Proudmoore. You should head to the World Tree at once. The fate of our world is still undecided."]=3,
},
[17856]={ -- Gzhun'tt
  ["If our enemies would see that we only wish to live in harmony with them, maybe we wouldn't have to attack them for our own survival?"]=1,
},
[17857]={ -- T'shu
  ["Filthy fungal giants! What did we ever do to them?"]=1,
},
[17858]={ -- Warden Hamoot
  ["Ysiel expected some enemy opposition to her foray into Outland. That's why us wardens were brought along.$B$BWe never expected our opposition to come in the strength or numbers that the naga have shown."]=1,
},
[17866]={ -- Khn'nix
  ["With new enemies on our doorsteps, we must not allow our ancient enemies to take advantage of our situation!"]=1,
},
[17876]={ -- Thrall
  ["Tarren Mill lies beyond these trees. The commotion at Durnholde should give us a little time to find Taretha before the entire countryside is flooded with human soldiers. Let's check the nearby barn, then head into town."]=1,
},
[17877]={ -- Fhwoor
  ["Fhwoor like little sporelings. They save Fhwoor. Not eat them.$B$BFhwoor hate naga. Fhwoor smash!"]=1,
},
[17884]={ -- Watcher Jhang
  ["If only I hadn't twisted my ankle coming into this place, I'd be in there with my friends. Hmmm, now that I think about it, maybe it's better that I'm out here?"]=1,
},
[17885]={ -- Earthbinder Rayge
  ["Thank goodness for you! Claw and I were investigating this place when we were jumped by Swamplord Musel'ek.$B$BUnfortunately, Claw was caught in bear form at the time, and is now the swamplord's pet.$B$BI'm afraid you'll have to fight Claw in order to save him."]=1,
},
[17890]={ -- Weeder Greenthumb
  ["Here lie the remains of Weeder Greenthumb, one of Watcher Jhang's druid companions. By all appearances he was killed quick and clean while trying to make his escape from the Slave Pens."]=1,
},
[17893]={ -- Naturalist Bite
  ["Now that the rude interruption is over, as I was saying, Quagmirran is nearby!$B$BAs promised, I can fortify you with a magical boon that should aid you in your fight with him."]=1,
},
[17894]={ -- Windcaller Claw
  ["How embarrassing to be taken as a pet by a hunter!$B$BI owe you my life. Now that you've freed me from Musel'ek, I'll be able to find my way out."]=1,
},
[17896]={ -- Kameel Longstride
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[17900]={ -- Ashyen
  ["Nature favors those willing to learn its secrets, adventurer."]=1,
},
[17901]={ -- Keleth
  ["Nature is a powerful force, $r. Those who seek to subdue never succeed in doing so permanently."]=1,
},
[17909]={ -- Lauranna Thar'well
  ["I've always liked sorting and organizing things. I guess I take after my mother."]=1,
  ["Learning about new plant species is extremely important for our expedition. Not just the medicinal or edible ones either.$B$BPlants provide the foundation for many other forms of life to exist. Understanding them allows us to better understand nature as a whole."]=2,
},
[17923]={ -- Fahssn
  ["The bog lords are devouring the spore sacs! They've got to be stopped!"]=1,
  ["Thanks to you our young ones will be safe, adventurer. Go to Sporeggar and meet my people. They've all heard great things about you."]=2,
},
[17924]={ -- Msshi'fn
  ["I welcome you to Sporeggar, $r. We don't normally see many of your kind around here, but you've proven your worth to us. Make yourself at home."]=1,
},
[17925]={ -- Gshaff
  ["I don't know what to think of your kind yet, $r. Some of you can be violent and kill sporelings on sight.$B$BYou seem friendly... though maybe a little bit funny looking, I suppose."]=1,
},
[17926]={ -- Scout Loryi
  ["Damn those blood elves and their reckless magic!"]=1,
},
[17927]={ -- Scout Jorli
  ["We've just arrived here and already we've buried too many of our friends and comrades."]=1,
},
[17948]={ -- Tyrande Whisperwind
  ["The moment we've been dreading is now at hand, $C. Archimonde has made his way to Nordrassil, and is beginning to devour the World Tree's energies. Malfurion needs more time for his plan to work, so we must do the unthinkable. You must attack Archimonde directly, while my own troops hold off the streams of Burning Legion forces approaching the top of the mount."]=1,
},
[17956]={ -- Ikeyen
  ["The druids protect me from the naga and evil Lost Ones. In exchange, I teach them about the plants and animals of the marsh."]=1,
},
[17982]={ -- Demolitionist Legoso
  ["The time has come to destroy the Vector Coil!"]=1,
},
[17986]={ -- Vindicator Corin
  ["I am patiently awaiting orders, $c."]=1,
},
[18003]={ -- Anchorite Ahuurn
  ["Telredor has seen more change in the last 20 years than it did in prior centuries. I cannot complain, adventurer, for the world has changed far more in that time.$B$BThe Light has brought me friends and companions I could not have met as a cloistered priest. Learn what you can of the past in your time here. It will help you to understand where your journey is leading you."]=1,
},
[18004]={ -- Vindicator Idaar
  ["Telredor was once a secluded retreat for draenei priests and pilgrims. The resident priests seldom received visitors.$B$BWhen the orcs started to attack draenei settlements, refugees began to arrive in larger numbers. Anchorite Ahuurn and the others transformed Telredor from a shrine into a safe haven. Many draenei, myself included, owe our survival to his efforts."]=1,
},
[18005]={ -- Haalrun
  ["Welcome to Telredor, $c. If you need anything, don't hesitate to ask."]=1,
},
[18006]={ -- Noraani
  ["The view from the top of Telredor is magnificent, isn't it?"]=1,
},
[18007]={ -- Ruam
  ["I've never seen so many different kinds of mushrooms in one place. Given enough time, I'm sure I could find a use for all of them."]=1,
},
[18008]={ -- Ikuti
  ["Welcome to the Orebor Harborage, friend. You have nothing to fear here. We are Broken, but we are not your enemies.$B$BI am Ikuti of the Kurenai, a group of Broken who desire to reestablish ties with our draenei brothers and their newfound allies."]=1,
},
[18009]={ -- Puluu
  ["Memories of this temple shroud my mind like a thick haze, yet I cannot assemble them into a coherent story. This place meant something to me once. Until I can restore that memory, I will feel as though a part of me is missing.$B$BPerhaps the draenei can help me recover what I've lost."]=1,
},
[18010]={ -- Maktu
  ["Maktu doesn't recognize you, $r, but he is pleased to meet you. If ever you need to buy or repair armor, look no further than Maktu."]=1,
},
[18011]={ -- Zurai
  ["Shadow Hunter Denjai sent me here with a small contingent of builders and warriors to establish this outpost. We've barely finished building it and he's already asking for reports!$B$BIf you need supplies, I can offer a few things, but we're still waiting for our first shipment."]=1,
},
[18012]={ -- Reavij
  ["If you ever meet Witch Doctor Tor'gash, tell him his concoctions and charms don't work! I did exactly as he told me to and still Magasha has eyes only for Zurai.$B$BDon't believe a thing that sham witch doctor tells you!"]=1,
},
[18013]={ -- Shadow Hunter Denjai
  ["Welcome to Zabra'jin, $c. I am Shadow Hunter Denjai, overseer of this outpost and commander of the Darkspear forces in Zangarmarsh."]=1,
},
[18014]={ -- Witch Doctor Tor'gash
  ["Now don't you be thinkin' about tryin' to make off with me baby murlocs! I got the eyes of a hawk and ears like... ears like... like somethin' with mighty powerful ears!"]=1,
},
[18015]={ -- Gambarinka
  ["The first time I saw mushrooms taller than trees, I wasn't so sure I could call this place home. After a while you just stop noticing."]=1,
},
[18016]={ -- Magasha
  ["Reavij has all the subtlety of a kodo! What's funny is that he doesn't think he's being obvious. I see the way he stares at me when he thinks no one's looking.$B$BHe creeps me out. I really wish Shadow Hunter Denjai hadn't sent him with us. Setting up Swamprat Post was the perfect opportunity to get away from him."]=1,
},
[18017]={ -- Seer Janidi
  ["Tor'gash believes he can see the future in the entrails of birds, or by tossing the knucklebones of his ancestors. Really, all you need to do is ask the spirits. But don't try telling him that, adventurer. He's very stubborn."]=1,
},
[18018]={ -- Zurjaya
  ["Don't forget to take some time out to fish while you're in Zangarmarsh. You never know when you'll see water again."]=1,
},
[18019]={ -- Timothy Daniels
  ["There are some who call me 'Tim,' but to my friends, I am 'the specialist.'"]=1,
},
[18020]={ -- Defender Adrielle
  ["I am patiently awaiting orders, $c."]=1,
},
[18030]={ -- Knight-Defender Zunade
  ["I am the leader of the Blood Watch defenses. What can I help you with?"]=1,
  ["Hello, are you here to learn about the conflict in Bloodmyst?"]=2,
  ["Can I help you?"]=3,
  ["We serve the light unquestioningly. Perhaps you might be a bit more curious about our purpose?"]=4,
},
[18038]={ -- Azuremyst Peacekeeper
  ["If the Light cannot guide you, my friend, perhaps I can be of assistance. What is it you need?"]=1,
  ["This isle can be strange, can it not? Is there something I can do for you?"]=2,
},
[18063]={ -- Garrosh
  ["What is it that you want, $r?"]=1,
},
[18066]={ -- Farseer Kurkush
  ["Garadar is in shambles, stranger. Since the Greatmother took ill, Garrosh has gone into a deep depression. He is most certainly not his father's boy.$B$B<Kurkush sighs.>"]=1,
},
[18067]={ -- Farseer Corhuk
  ["Dark times loom ahead, stranger..."]=1,
},
[18068]={ -- Farseer Margadesh
  ["The spirits are greatly agitated. We must find the cause of this disturbance."]=1,
},
[18070]={ -- Windcaller Blackhoof
  ["May the winds guide you, adventurer."]=1,
},
[18071]={ -- Elementalist Untrag
  ["I am Untrag of the Earthen Ring. Try not to upset the elements while you remain at the Throne of the Elements."]=1,
},
[18072]={ -- Elementalist Sharvak
  ["How can my people fight when the elements are in such turmoil? Do they not see that without the support of the elements, the world simply cannot be."]=1,
},
[18073]={ -- Elementalist Lo'ap
  ["The spirits are restless, $r. Be mindful of your surroundings while in Nagrand lest you be consumed by their fury."]=1,
},
[18074]={ -- Elementalist Morgh
  ["The Earthen Ring seeks to preserve the strength and majesty of the elements."]=1,
},
[18098]={ -- Kialon Nightblade
  ["If you haven't already, make sure that you offer your assistance to Rina Moonspring."]=1,
  ["If I heard correctly, you're already doing good work for Sylvanaar.$B$BKeep it up and maybe we'll be able to keep our home here."]=2,
},
[18099]={ -- Gordawg
  ["<The earth rumbles as Gordawg's movements come to a halt.>$B$BSpeak."]=1,
},
[18106]={ -- Jorin Deadeye
  ["Do you know who we are, stranger? We are Mag'har - brown orcs, as I have heard your kind call us. The Mag'har are survivors: Survivors of a fallen dynasty; Survivors of the Red Pox; Survivors of a shattered world...$B$BI am Jorin, son of Kilrogg; last of the lineage of Deadeye: Warchief of the Bleeding Hollow Clan."]=1,
},
[18141]={ -- Greatmother Geyah
  ["What did Garrosh tell you, adventurer?"]=1,
},
[18165]={ -- Archmage Cedric
  ["Do not be fooled by the ruins surrounding us, $c. Dalaran is as powerful as ever."]=1,
},
[18166]={ -- Archmage Khadgar
  ["The naaru are wise beyond our understanding. I've learned more from A'dal in the last five months than all the years I spent in the libraries of Dalaran."]=1,
},
[18180]={ -- Hemet Nesingwary
  ["Listen $g lad : lass;. I left the expedition in the capable hands of me son, Junior. When you've stalked the finest game in all of Azeroth you start to itch for something more.$B$BAnd have you seen the size of the beasties here?!$B$BI'm here hunting the most dangerous prey you'll ever lay your eyes on. I mean to bag myself Tusker and take her heart as my trophy!"]=1,
},
[18197]={ -- Elder Kuruti
  ["I humbly welcome you to our temple, spirit."]=1,
},
[18200]={ -- Shado 'Fitz' Farstrider
  ["Greetings, $c. You seek to push yourself to the limits of your hunting prowess? Look no further.$B$BHemet Nesingwary has assembled the finest expedition the remnant of this world has ever known. Join us on safari if you dare."]=1,
  ["Hemet is the greatest hunter that I know. We chanced upon each other in the hills of Winterspring back on Azeroth many moons ago. He and I were stalking the same quarry: the great cat known as Rak'shiri.$B$BRather than fight each other over our prey, we made a wager out of it; whoever collected the frostsaber's skin would get to demand something of the other. To my eternal shame, this is how I earned the nickname, Fitz.$B$BDo I look like a Fitz?"]=2,
  ["The mighty hunter, adventurer returns. Tell me the tale of stalking your latest prey."]=3,
},
[18218]={ -- Harold Lane
  ["There I was tumbling in a patch of prickly undergrowth with a talbuk stag, hand-to-hand, only my sharp knife...<cough>... and keen hunter's intellect to save me.$B$BAll of a sudden I'm jumped by a pair of fierce windroc hunters that came at me from the skies! Their cowardly attack...<cough>... didn't help them any though.$B$BAnd while I have their beaks as trophies, I received an infected scratch out of the ordeal. Kind of nasty, and I'm in a lot of pain, but I'm sure it'll heal up in a day or two."]=1,
  ["Yeah, yeah, I'm feeling better, but I kind of like it down here."]=2,
},
[18221]={ -- Holaaru
  ["Hello, $c. I am what is referred to as one of the Broken. Like the Lost Ones, though not as badly as they, we were afflicted with fel energies that transformed us from our original draenei forms."]=1,
},
[18229]={ -- Saurfang the Younger
  ["They died. All of them...$B$BAs the Murkbloods cut through us, something took hold of me that I cannot understand. Tell me, have you ever felt a rage so great that the whole of your being burns? A heat that wilts the living? A heat that incinerates the blood in your veins? That is what I felt.$B$B<Saurfang's eyes glow red for a brief moment.>$B$BI was the last one left alive. 30 of them surrounded me... Murkbloods... I remember nothing beyond that vision. I blacked out and awoke some time later."]=1,
},
[18244]={ -- Khalan
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[18245]={ -- Merajit
  ["If you be wantin' ta rest here, ya just need to ask!"]=1,
},
[18248]={ -- Nekthar
  ["It was not so long ago that we had to wrest control of Thunderlord Stronghold from the nearby ogres.$B$BYou are here to help us maintain our defenses? I know that Gor'drek is looking for assistance."]=1,
},
[18250]={ -- Joraal
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[18251]={ -- Caregiver Abidaar
  ["Please, sit and make yourself comfortable."]=1,
},
[18252]={ -- Andarl
  ["Welcome to the Allerian Stronghold, $c."]=1,
},
[18253]={ -- Archmage Leryda
  ["Karazhan wasn't always quite as... ominous. The darkening of Karazhan only came with Medivh's death. Or what we believe was Medivh's death."]=1,
},
[18261]={ -- Lantresor of the Blade
  ["Who so boldly stands before Lantresor of the Blade? Do you not know death by sight, $g boy:girl;?"]=1,
  ["You will stage a series of events that will lead the Kil'sorrow orcs of Kil'sorrow Fortress to believe that the Warmaul ogres have attacked their base and then another series of events to make the Warmaul ogres believe the Kil'sorrow orcs are attacking their base.$B$BDo this and you solve both of our problems.$B$BThe Boulderfist will have their territory back and your people will be free from attack from Boulderfist, Warmaul and Shadow Council."]=2,
},
[18265]={ -- Gezhe
  ["The Consortium has been planning this operation for months! We were to dig Oshu'gun, the largest known diamond in the universe.$B$BMinutes before we were to begin, Nexus-Prince Haramaad sends word that we're to hold off until a political matter is resolved in Netherstorm. I've transformed our operation into a clearing house for smuggled gems in the meantime, but this is slowly eating into our profits."]=1,
},
[18266]={ -- Warrant Officer Tracy Proudwell
  ["For years, Honor Hold has stood against the horrors of Hellfire Peninsula. Now, now that the portal has reopened and aid streams in from Azeroth, perhaps this bloody stalemate will end."]=1,
},
[18267]={ -- Battlecryer Blackeye
  ["It is regrettable that, among our many enemies in Hellfire Peninsula, the orcs of Hellfire Citadel stand among them.$B$BBut... who better to challenge and hone the Horde... than orcs?"]=1,
},
[18276]={ -- Zerid
  ["Gezhe is here to get a job done. I'm here to make sure no one bothers him while he does it."]=1,
},
[18278]={ -- Pilot Marsha
  ["We wouldn't have crashed if Hemet could learn how to avoid shooting through the ailerons when he's trying to bag game on the ground!$B$BNo worries though, I'll have her fixed up quick enough."]=1,
},
[18294]={ -- Kristen Dipswitch
  ["I am SO glad that evil Gankly Rottenfist got his just desserts! I have lots of skins if you want some to give to Harold."]=1,
  ["Hey! Didn't I give you a bundle of skins before?$B$BEither way, I'm glad to be saved from the ruthless clutches of that evil Gankly Rottenfist!"]=2,
},
[18295]={ -- Prospector Conall
  ["No overgrown bug's gonna chase me out of Zangarmarsh! I'll show 'em what the Explorers' League is made of..."]=1,
},
[18302]={ -- Matron Drakia
  ["The Greatmother raised all of us. Any Mag'hari that you see has had their life touched in some special way by the Greatmother. We will miss her greatly when she passes."]=1,
  ["Greatmother tells me that I was named after a great orcish hero."]=2,
},
[18333]={ -- Shadrek
  ["I think I'll make my own money on the side while the others try to decide whether it's okay to go into Oshu'gun.$B$BTime is profit!"]=1,
},
[18335]={ -- Consortium Recruiter
  ["You look like a reasonable $r. Perhaps we could be of mutual assistance."]=1,
},
[18350]={ -- Jaela
  ["The Exodar's vaults are vast and well-protected. Your goods will come to no harm here."]=1,
  ["We control access to the Exodar's storage facilities. Are there goods you wish to store or remove?"]=2,
},
[18351]={ -- Lump
  ["Why you mean to Lump? Lump hungry, dat's all."]=1,
},
[18369]={ -- Corki
  ["Get me out of here, $r!"]=1,
},
[18383]={ -- Kurgatok
  ["Be wary, $c. The forest is full of hidden dangers and potential enemies."]=1,
},
[18384]={ -- Malukaz
  ["Until I traveled through Nagrand and came to the forest, I feared that too much of our original culture was lost. I'm thankful to see that I was wrong.$B$BThere is so much to be done here!"]=1,
},
[18385]={ -- Rakoria
  ["Season's savings to you and yours!"]=1,
  ["Fresh from our farm to your plate - it's Smokywood Pastures wholesome goodness!"]=2,
  ["'Tis the season for great bargains! Fah la la la la!"]=3,
  ["Have a wondrous Feast of Winter Veil! Start it off right with treats from Smokywood Pastures!"]=4,
  ["Be sure to tell Greatfather Winter what secret surprise you'd like to get this Winter Veil!"]=5,
  ["Don't let the jingle of the bells take away from the jingle in your pocket! Buy Smokywood Pastures treats for your Winter Veil festivities!"]=6,
  ["If I had some chestnuts, you'd better believe I'd have them roasting over an open fire. Mmmm!"]=7,
  ["Don't forget to stock up on wrapping paper this holiday season! Nothing says 'Wondrous Winter Veil' like wrapped armors and weapons for your friends and family."]=8,
},
[18386]={ -- Rokag
  ["Malukaz chatters incessantly about the historical importance of this forest, but I don't have the luxury of indulging in history until our present problems are settled.$B$BI'm not saying his work here isn't important, but someone has to see to the defenses and logistics of running the hold."]=1,
},
[18387]={ -- Bertelm
  ["Have you seen the way Ros'eleth winks at me whenever I go to pick up a garment or hat? When things settle down around here, I'm going to take her for a nice walk in the woods.$B$BFor once, I miss all those fancy taverns in Stormwind."]=1,
},
[18389]={ -- Thander
  ["If you're expecting some kind of official welcome, you're going to be disappointed, $c. We don't stand on tradition, here. What works is what goes."]=1,
},
[18390]={ -- Ros'eleth
  ["When I first arrived, I'd hoped to meet the town's namesake.$B$B<Ros'eleth glances around.>$B$BMost young high elves outgrow the 'I wanna be a Farstrider' phase by the time they're taken as apprentices. Then, it's onto the 'I'm going to be a magister' stage.$B$BI don't think I ever quite outgrew the Farstrider phase, to be honest. No one dreams of growing up to be a seamstress, but we can't have the Farstriders running around naked, as my mother used to say."]=1,
},
[18407]={ -- Warden Bullrok
  ["Check the bulletin board if you're looking for work, $r."]=1,
},
[18408]={ -- Warden Moi'bff Jill
  ["I used to be known as Iolol until a secret vote was passed around town that resulted in me having to change my name. It was either change it or go the way of Corki. You would have done the same. What do you think of my new name? Huge improvement, right?$B$BBy the way, check the bulletin board if you're looking for work."]=1,
},
[18414]={ -- Elder Yorley
  ["They have no respect for the dead, $r. The ogres must be taught a lesson."]=1,
},
[18415]={ -- Elder Ungriz
  ["We must search for survivors. If anyone is still alive, we must at least try and get them back..."]=1,
},
[18416]={ -- Huntress Kima
  ["We've got to get those supply crates back!"]=1,
},
[18417]={ -- Altruis the Sufferer
  ["What do you see when you look to the west, mortal?"]=1,
  ["This is what I have gathered from the information that you collected from the survey.$B$BThere are two primary forge camps: Forge Camp: Hate, directly west of where we stand and Forge Camp: Fear, directly southwest. Each camp has a Legion transporter, one forge, and several spell warding towers. Additionally, the camps are guarded by wrathguards manning fel cannons. Lastly, each camp has a pit lord overseer.$B$BRight then, this should be no problem at all...$B$B<Altruis laughs.>"]=2,
},
[18424]={ -- Warden Treelos
  ["Who are you? What do you want here?"]=1,
  ["Why did you do this to us?"]=2,
  ["There are FOUR lights!"]=3,
  ["My vicious teromoths will avenge me!"]=4,
  ["Where did everyone go?"]=5,
  ["Dinner guests should show more respect!"]=6,
  ["Oh, what a sacred place is here overthrown!"]=7,
  ["Anoint my head with a healing balm. Do you like my crown of thorns?"]=8,
},
[18439]={ -- Garokk
  ["The Ring of Trials was once of place of great glory and honor. But then, the Steamwheedle Cartel came, with their wagons of gold and quill pens sharper than any orc axe..."]=1,
},
[18446]={ -- Earthbinder Tavgren
  ["Be careful going into the thicket, $c. There is a harmful aura lingering about the place. It must be the residue from whatever destroyed my fellow druids."]=1,
  ["We'll get to the bottom of this massacre if it's the last thing we do!"]=2,
  ["Thank you again, adventurer, for helping me to uncover what happened here at the thicket."]=3,
},
[18447]={ -- Tooki
  ["This forest be a spooky place. It's full of more bad juju than just the Alliance, so you watch out for yourself."]=1,
},
[18459]={ -- Jenai Starwhisper
  ["The Horde isn't the only danger in this forest. Don't let its seeming tranquility fool you."]=1,
},
[18471]={ -- Gurgthock
  ["You're definitely strong, $r, but do you have what it takes to become the Warmaul champion?"]=1,
  ["Hail, champion! Have you ever thought about going into the gladiator business full time? You and I could make a mountain of gold."]=2,
},
[18480]={ -- Broken Corpse
  ["The corpse of one of the Broken lies here. Mysteriously, the cause of its death does not appear to be from one of the mutated moths.$B$BPerhaps it has something to do with the strange object resting right next to its outstretched hand?"]=1,
},
[18481]={ -- A'dal
  ["<A soothing light fills you as you approach the naaru. Slow musical chimes echo within your mind and, though a word is not uttered, you feel an assurance of safety. You are welcome in Shattrath City.>"]=1,
},
[18482]={ -- Empoor
  ["Very busy... very busy! What?"]=1,
  ["Now that I've been beaten to within an inch of my life what do you want?"]=2,
  ["Oh no, not you again! Go away!"]=3,
},
[18484]={ -- Wind Trader Lathrai
  ["The World's End Tavern has nothing to offer those of my kind. However, I find that it attracts the type of clientele that are interested in what I have for sale.$B$BI specialize in exotic engineering goods acquired from far and wide. From time to time I might even have a rare thing or two for purchase.$B$BWhat might I interest you in?"]=1,
},
[18528]={ -- Xi'ri
  ["<The light surrounding Xi'ri pulses blue. The naaru welcomes you as an ally in the field of battle.>"]=1,
},
[18530]={ -- Voren'thal the Seer
  ["There are those who seek to lie and twist the truth. Seers, on the other hand, bring the truth to light.$B$BThe purpose of this library, adventurer, is to make a seer out of everyone."]=1,
},
[18531]={ -- Magistrix Fyalenn
  ["Leaving Kael'thas was the best thing any of us ever did. His followers are too blind or too scared to realize where he's leading them.$B$BWe, however, are not."]=1,
},
[18537]={ -- Adyen the Lightwarden
  ["The Lightwarden's job is twofold. Protect the priesthood at all costs first and foremost. Destroy the enemies of the Light wherever they may hide second."]=1,
},
[18538]={ -- Ishanah
  ["Shattrath is more than a staging ground for war against the Burning Legion and Illidan. It serves as a sanctuary to those seeking to escape the violence surrounding us.$B$BWe would be hypocrites if we turned the refugees away.$B$BIf your question refers to the Scryers, then I will respond that while I may not like them or their leader's wild claims of visions of redemption, it is not for us to question the wisdom of the naaru.$B$BThese are difficult times, adventurer. We need allies where we can find them."]=1,
},
[18542]={ -- Alexston Chrome
  ["Welcome to the Taverns of Time!"]=1,
  ["Rest your weary feet, we have all the time in the world..."]=2,
  ["Can I offer you a drink? I promise you its aged like none other!"]=3,
},
[18549]={ -- Aldor Vindicator
  ["Welcome to Aldor Rise. You seek guidance?"]=1,
},
[18564]={ -- Horde Field Scout
  ["Twin Spire Ruins is not yet secure! My orders are to only give out battle standards when the two beacons are lit and the area is secure. Get out there and gain control of those beacons!"]=1,
},
[18565]={ -- Theloria Shadecloak
  ["The opening of the Dark Portal brought news of my people's fate. In a way, my exile shielded me from sharing in their downfall, but to see the Farstriders throw their lot in with Kael'thas...$B$BI never imagined my one-time brethren capable of such a thing.$B$BThe homecoming I once dreamt of will never happen. This forest is the only home I have left."]=1,
},
[18566]={ -- Shadowstalker Kaide
  ["We may be working together, but that only increases the need for discretion. Once again, be mindful of your words and actions.$B$BI can guarantee we're far from the only ones out here."]=1,
},
[18568]={ -- Scryer Arcane Guardian
  ["<The Arcane Guardian seems to face you, but says nothing.>"]=1,
},
[18581]={ -- Alliance Field Scout
  ["The beacons are lit, now is the time to strike! Take one of these battle standards and plant it at the graveyard for the Alliance!"]=1,
  ["Twin Spire Ruins is not yet secure! My orders are to only give out battle standards when the two beacons are lit and the area is secure. Get out there and gain control of those beacons!"]=2,
},
[18584]={ -- Sal'salabim
  ["<Sal'salabim growls at you, then goes back to drinking his frothy beverage.>"]=1,
},
[18588]={ -- Floon
  ["<Floon makes a series of strange clicking and clucking sounds.>"]=1,
},
[18596]={ -- Arcanist Adyria
  ["Can you believe it? This ethereal does not have a single basilisk eye on him!$B$BAnd his leader has the gall to call himself 'the Smuggler Prince!'"]=1,
},
[18597]={ -- Sha'nir
  ["My job is to care for these poor souls. I accept the help of any willing to lend a hand, be they Aldor or Scryer.$B$BWe are so understaffed, I wouldn't turn an ogre away if they knew how to apply a tourniquet. The politics of the city are of little matter to me."]=1,
},
[18653]={ -- Seth
  ["I've been watching the Aldor working on the walls. They're gonna rebuild the whole city, you know.$B$BThey work much faster than old Foreman Oslow did back home in Lakeshire. He kept losing his tools in the lake, or the gnolls would take his supplies.$B$BI should ask the Aldor to send him some help. They'd have that bridge fixed faster'n anything."]=1,
},
[18675]={ -- Soolaveen
  ["This is just horrible.$B$BI care not for our own discomforts here, but we must do something to ease the pain of the dead in the Bone Wastes!"]=1,
},
[18704]={ -- Taela Everstride
  ["No, don't feel bad. I get that a lot.$B$B<Taela looks both amused and annoyed.>$B$BI'm a HIGH elf, not a blood elf. Don't worry, I'm not going to suck all of the magic out of you."]=1,
},
[18705]={ -- Mawg Grimshot
  ["Bonelashers, I hate them all!$B$BIf it weren't for the loss of my eye, and the fainting spells that I get sometimes, I'd be out there shooting them down all the time!"]=1,
},
[18712]={ -- Advisor Faila
  ["I must have made a misstep somewhere to be assigned here."]=1,
},
[18713]={ -- Lieutenant Gravelhammer
  ["We've a duty out here, $g boy : girl;, to see to it that we don't let anyone surprise us.$B$BThat means proactive action!"]=1,
},
[18714]={ -- Scout Neftis
  ["We need to figure out what this shadowy group is doing here at Grangol'var Village!"]=1,
},
[18715]={ -- Private Weeks
  ["I'm going to figure out what this shadowy group is up to no matter what!"]=1,
},
[18716]={ -- Shadowy Initiate
  ["Yes? Darn it all, now I'll have to start over from scratch!"]=1,
},
[18717]={ -- Shadowy Laborer
  ["Yeah, what do you want? Can't you see I'm busy here? The Shadow Council isn't paying me by the hour!"]=1,
},
[18719]={ -- Shadowy Advisor
  ["And what is it exactly that you think I can do for you? Can't you see that I'm very busy here discussing matters of import with our illustrious leader?$B$BBe quick about your business or I'll have you beaten, dog!"]=1,
},
[18720]={ -- Shadowmaster Grieve
  ["Who do you think you are that you can walk in here and address me? I'm the leader of the Shadow Council in this village. Get out of my sight!$B$BIf I see you again, I'll be the last person that you ever see. Understand?$B$BPerhaps you'd like to be buried in the labyrinth of Auchindoun, or sacrificed to Murmur?"]=1,
},
[18723]={ -- Erozion
  ["Here are more of the incendiary devices, adventurer. Be careful with these, they can cause a great deal of disruption to time if used improperly."]=1,
},
[18725]={ -- Brazen
  ["I can take you to Durnholde directly, if that is your wish."]=1,
  ["You should receive a pack of incendiary bombs from Erozion before I fly you to Durnholde. You wouldn't want to waste time, after all."]=2,
},
[18745]={ -- Captain Auric Sunchaser
  ["Yes, $t citizen : citizen;, what matter of import do you have to bring to my attention?"]=1,
},
[18747]={ -- Krugosh
  ["I can instruct you in mining. Interested?"]=1,
},
[18748]={ -- Ruak Stronghorn
  ["I can instruct you in herbalism. Interested?"]=1,
},
[18749]={ -- Dalinna
  ["Have you honed your skills enough to learn what I have to teach?"]=1,
},
[18751]={ -- Kalaen
  ["I can instruct you in jewelcrafting. Interested?"]=1,
},
[18752]={ -- Zebig
  ["Have you honed your skills enough to learn what I have to teach?"]=1,
},
[18753]={ -- Felannia
  ["Have you honed your skills enough to learn what I have to teach?"]=1,
},
[18754]={ -- Barim Spilthoof
  ["Have you honed your skills enough to learn what I have to teach?"]=1,
},
[18755]={ -- Moorutu
  ["I can instruct you in skinning. Interested?"]=1,
},
[18760]={ -- Isla Starmane
  ["Hi! Do you think you might help me to get out of here?"]=1,
},
[18772]={ -- Hama
  ["Have you honed your skills enough to learn what I have to teach?"]=1,
},
[18773]={ -- Johan Barnes
  ["Have you honed your skills enough to learn what I have to teach?"]=1,
},
[18774]={ -- Tatiana
  ["I can instruct you in jewelcrafting. Interested?"]=1,
},
[18775]={ -- Lebowski
  ["Have you honed your skills enough to learn what I have to teach?"]=1,
},
[18776]={ -- Rorelien
  ["I can instruct you in herbalism. Interested?"]=1,
},
[18777]={ -- Jelena Nightsky
  ["I can instruct you in skinning. Interested?"]=1,
},
[18779]={ -- Hurnak Grimmord
  ["I can instruct you in mining. Interested?"]=1,
},
[18785]={ -- Kuma
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[18788]={ -- Munci
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[18789]={ -- Furgu
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[18790]={ -- Gatewatcher Aendor
  ["There is nothing to see here. Move along."]=1,
  ["This does not concern you. Be on your way."]=2,
},
[18791]={ -- Du'ga
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[18792]={ -- Harassed Citizen
  ["Please, don't say anything to me. I don't want to get into any more trouble with them."]=1,
},
[18802]={ -- Alchemist Gribble
  ["Have you honed your skills enough to learn what I have to teach?"]=1,
},
[18803]={ -- Stillpine Ambassador Olorg
  ["<As you greet Ambassador Frasaboo in the furbolg language, he smiles.>$B$BYou must be the one spoken of in the prophecy. It is a great honor to meet you.$B$BI am Ambassador Frasaboo, High Chief Stillpine's representative in Blood Watch."]=1,
},
[18804]={ -- Prospector Nachlan
  ["In my years as a member of Explorers' League, I've been all over Azeroth, but I've never seen anythin' quite like Bloodmyst."]=1,
},
[18807]={ -- Kerna
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[18808]={ -- Gursha
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[18809]={ -- Furnan Skysoar
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[18816]={ -- Chief Researcher Amereldine
  ["If you are not here to help the cause, get out."]=1,
},
[18817]={ -- Chief Researcher Kartos
  ["With your help, we might be able to win this thing!"]=1,
},
[18822]={ -- Quartermaster Davian Vaclav
  ["You may make purchases from me by using Halaa tokens of battle and research."]=1,
},
[18887]={ -- Taretha
  ["Yes, friends. This man was no wizard of Dalaran. His clothes looked quite foreign, and his accent was unfamiliar. All he could mumble about was time this, time that. You'll have to find that wizard and convince him to release me."]=1,
},
[18893]={ -- Spymistress Mehlisah Highcrown
  ["As a representative of the Lower City, I'm here to put forward our case that Auchindoun must be cleared of its Shadow Council infestation. That is, if we're to have any hope for a future and stave off the possibility of a cataclysm greater than the creation of the Bone Wastes!$B$BAll of our peoples have suffered too much already. I am here to see to it that the suffering stops!"]=1,
},
[18895]={ -- Ear-Biter
  ["You don't have what it takes to fight in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit, $c. Stop wasting my time."]=1,
  ["All right, $c. You think you have what it takes to make it in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit's arena battlegrounds?"]=2,
},
[18897]={ -- "King" Dond
  ["You don't have what it takes to fight in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit, $c. Stop wasting my time."]=1,
  ["Ah, another $c looking to be a gladiator, eh? Good! I sell the arena team charters you'll need to participate in ranking Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit matches."]=2,
},
[18905]={ -- Innkeeper Bazil Olof'tazun
  ["I offer what shelter I can in our shattered lands."]=1,
},
[18906]={ -- Caregiver Ophera Windfury
  ["Please, sit and make yourself comfortable."]=1,
},
[18907]={ -- Innkeeper Coryth Stoktron
  ["Have a seat, $g brother:sister;. The ravages of Zangarmarsh can take a lot out of a $g man:woman;."]=1,
},
[18908]={ -- Innkeeper Kerp
  ["Please, sit and make yourself comfortable."]=1,
},
[18911]={ -- Juno Dufrain
  ["I can teach you fishing skills."]=1,
},
[18913]={ -- Matron Tikkit
  ["Welcome to Garadar, stranger. Are you looking for a place to rest?"]=1,
},
[18914]={ -- Caregiver Isel
  ["Please, sit and make yourself comfortable."]=1,
},
[18927]={ -- Human Commoner
  ["Dark times make for strange friendships. It may be worth visiting old Lordaeron to watch the Forsaken burn their little man of wicker."]=1,
  ["I understand this holiday is a creation not of our allies, but the Horde. Why we follow suit, I do not know."]=2,
  ["We're celebrating the who breaking free of the what? Bah, who cares?! More candy!"]=3,
  ["Why does everyone keep saying the LAST thing we gnomes need is more sugar?!"]=4,
  ["When Hallow's End is over we'll smash all these pumpkins. That'll be the greatest day I've ever known!"]=5,
  ["To celebrate the birth of yet another deadly enemy is an odd thing, to say the least. Still, we will join our allies in their festivities."]=6,
  ["The Forsaken are right to celebrate their freedom. What else is more important?"]=7,
  ["I do not understand the significance of the Forsaken burning a great wicker effigy each night, but our own rituals must seem just as strange to them."]=8,
  ["I don't know why the Forsaken burn a wicker man every night of Hallow's End instead of a real one, but it's their holiday."]=9,
  ["During Hallow's End we celebrate the day that the Banshee Queen herself delivered us from the clutches of the Lich King and the Scourge. Be sure to attend the Wickerman Festival that is held each evening outside Undercity."]=10,
  ["No other holiday matches the feasting and drinking of Brewfest!"]=11,
},
[18930]={ -- Vlagga Freyfeather
  ["Throm'ka, $c. Is this shattered land what you expected to see? It's nothing like the stories I've been told. It's hard to believe my people ever thrived in this desolate place."]=1,
},
[18931]={ -- Amish Wildhammer
  ["Another soldier on $ghis:her; way to Honor Hold... by Kurdran's beard, they can use the help!"]=1,
  ["By Muradin's beard, $c. This land is on the brink of annihilation. I cannot imagine anyone survived here since the end of the second war."]=2,
},
[18933]={ -- Isfar
  ["<Isfar sighs.>$B$BA couple of treehouses don't make a home, but it was vast improvement over the Sethekk Halls.$B$BComfortable as it was in Shattrath, I can't bring myself to return to my true home in Skettis without my sister. She's still trapped in the Sethekk Halls, held prisoner by our older brother."]=1,
},
[18937]={ -- Amerun Leafshade
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[18938]={ -- Krexcil
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[18939]={ -- Brubeck Stormfoot
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[18940]={ -- Nutral
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[18942]={ -- Innalia
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[18947]={ -- Solanin
  ["My sister Silanna is naive to the growing danger in these woods. But like it or not, as soon as I get this wagon loaded we're moving within the city walls. $b$bIt appears that I've got more bags here than I need. Perhaps you could make use of them."]=1,
},
[18953]={ -- Unoke Tenderhoof
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[18956]={ -- Lakka
  ["Please, $r, get me out of here! Unlocking the cage will surely attract my brother's attention. Kill Darkweaver Syth!"]=1,
  ["Now's our chance! Let me out of this cage!"]=2,
},
[18957]={ -- Innkeeper Grilka
  ["If we are to make these new lands ours then we must have places to rest our battle weary bodies. Lay your axe by the fire and share the stories of your mighty battles."]=1,
},
[18985]={ -- Seer Skaltesh
  ["I am Skaltesh, guide to the shaman seeking enlightenment here... but even those who follow different paths can be shown a thing or two. Do you wish to see?"]=1,
},
[18987]={ -- Gaston
  ["Have you honed your skills enough to learn what I have to teach?"]=1,
},
[18988]={ -- Baxter
  ["Have you honed your skills enough to learn what I have to teach?"]=1,
},
[18993]={ -- Naka
  ["Have you honed your skills enough to learn what I have to teach?"]=1,
},
[18997]={ -- Fallesh Sunfallow
  ["If you have the money, I have what you need."]=1,
},
[18998]={ -- Lursa Sunfallow
  ["Take a look around and let me know if there's anything that you're interested in."]=1,
},
[19001]={ -- Talaara
  ["Take your time, look the weapons over. I also repair weapons and armor if you need such services."]=1,
},
[19004]={ -- Vodesiin
  ["I have just the thing you need to cast your spell."]=1,
},
[19011]={ -- Osrok the Immovable
  ["It will take a sharp blade and reinforced armor to bring tranquility back to Nagrand. Shall I repair your equipment so that you may mete justice?"]=1,
},
[19012]={ -- Sparik
  ["It will take a sharp blade and reinforced armor to bring tranquility back to Nagrand. Shall I repair your equipment so that you may mete justice?"]=1,
},
[19014]={ -- Ogir
  ["Are you looking for reagents or poison supplies? If so, you've come to the right place!"]=1,
},
[19017]={ -- Borto
  ["I sell wares that crafters need. Just the basics, nothing fancy."]=1,
},
[19019]={ -- Luftasia
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[19021]={ -- Nancila
  ["I carry odds and ends, but mostly just odds."]=1,
},
[19033]={ -- Nicole Bartlett
  ["Hello, what business brings you here?$B$BThis is an orphanage for the children of Outland who have lost their parents and have no one else to look after them.$B$BPerhaps you are here because you are considering adoption?"]=1,
},
[19035]={ -- Wazat
  ["It's driving me crazy. I cannot reach those damned eggs!"]=1,
  ["Good to see you again, adventurer! Just a few more adjustments and the trajectory of the jump will be perfect!"]=2,
},
[19045]={ -- Oloraak
  ["Do you like fish, $r? I have fish here. If you like fresh fish, the freshest, come and sample my wares."]=1,
},
[19046]={ -- Minalei
  ["Please, sit and make yourself comfortable."]=1,
},
[19047]={ -- Lissaf
  ["You - come here. Are these blades not the finest quality? Surely you wish to purchase from me. You will not find such workmanship and care wrought into such weapons anywhere else, $r."]=1,
},
[19051]={ -- Araac
  ["What are you staring at, $r?"]=1,
},
[19052]={ -- Lorokeem
  ["Have you honed your skills enough to learn what I have to teach?"]=1,
},
[19063]={ -- Hamanar
  ["I can instruct you in jewelcrafting. Interested?"]=1,
},
[19133]={ -- Ohlorn Farstrider
  ["The untamed plains of Nagrand offer some of the best hunting I've ever experienced."]=1,
},
[19137]={ -- "Shotgun" Jones
  ["Never look these Broken directly in the eyes. I think they can suck the soul right out of you if they're so inclined!"]=1,
},
[19141]={ -- Kurenai Pitfighter
  ["Well look at you. Aren't you big and tough... Maybe you think you're tough enough to step into the Ring of Blood and face the Warmaul champion?$B$B<The pitfighter laughs.>$B$BNot very likely but if you ever wanna test your strength, the Ring of Blood is far to the north against the mountains dividing Nagrand and Zangarmarsh. Gurgthock runs the show at the old Laughing Skull Ruins and he also dispenses the prizes. Speaking of prizes, I hear the prizes this season are incredible!"]=1,
},
[19148]={ -- Dwarf Commoner
  ["Dark times make for strange friendships. It may be worth visiting old Lordaeron to watch the Forsaken burn their little man of wicker."]=1,
  ["I understand this holiday is a creation not of our allies, but the Horde. Why we follow suit, I do not know."]=2,
  ["We're celebrating the who breaking free of the what? Bah, who cares?! More candy!"]=3,
  ["Why does everyone keep saying the LAST thing we gnomes need is more sugar?!"]=4,
  ["When Hallow's End is over we'll smash all these pumpkins. That'll be the greatest day I've ever known!"]=5,
  ["To celebrate the birth of yet another deadly enemy is an odd thing, to say the least. Still, we will join our allies in their festivities."]=6,
  ["The Forsaken are right to celebrate their freedom. What else is more important?"]=7,
  ["I do not understand the significance of the Forsaken burning a great wicker effigy each night, but our own rituals must seem just as strange to them."]=8,
  ["I don't know why the Forsaken burn a wicker man every night of Hallow's End instead of a real one, but it's their holiday."]=9,
  ["During Hallow's End we celebrate the day that the Banshee Queen herself delivered us from the clutches of the Lich King and the Scourge. Be sure to attend the Wickerman Festival that is held each evening outside Undercity."]=10,
  ["No other holiday matches the feasting and drinking of Brewfest!"]=11,
},
[19156]={ -- Telaari Jailor
  ["The interrogator is trying to find out what these blood elves are doing here in Nagrand. From what I hear, they're after crystal powder residue from Oshu'gun, the diamond mountain to the west.$B$BNo doubt to use in some insidious scheme or concoction...$B$BIf you are looking to help our cause and stop these blood elves, the conflict is happening right now to the northwest at Halaa. Blood elves and those Hand of Argus soldiers are battling! Join in and show them what's right!"]=1,
},
[19158]={ -- Garadar Guard Captain
  ["Draenei have come back! This group jumped two of my best wolf riders as they were out patrolling the western roads. Needless to say, we were victorious in that skirmish.$B$BNow I'm not sure what's going on but from what my scouts tell me, there are blood elves and draenei all over Halaa. I'm no blood elf lover but if it's one thing I hate it's a draenei. If you see draenei or any of their allies at Halaa, be sure to put a boot in their backsides for me.$B$BHalaa's to the west... In case you want to go now."]=1,
},
[19169]={ -- Blood Elf Commoner
  ["Dark times make for strange friendships. It may be worth visiting old Lordaeron to watch the Forsaken burn their little man of wicker."]=1,
},
[19171]={ -- Draenei Commoner
  ["I understand this holiday is a creation not of our allies, but the Horde. Why we follow suit, I do not know."]=1,
},
