[19178]={ -- Forsaken Commoner
  ["During Hallow's End we celebrate the day that the Banshee Queen herself delivered us from the clutches of the Lich King and the Scourge. Be sure to attend the Wickerman Festival that is held each evening outside Undercity."]=1,
},
[19180]={ -- Seymour
  ["Have you honed your skills enough to learn what I have to teach?"]=1,
},
[19184]={ -- Mildred Fletcher
  ["The esteemed Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen can train you further. He can be found in Theramore treating the wounded at the barracks."]=1,
  ["I can train you in bandaging techniques."]=2,
},
[19185]={ -- Jack Trapper
  ["There's an old saying, 'Give a man a fish; you have fed him for a day. Teach a man to fish; and you have fed him for a lifetime.' Of course, you might want to cook that fish and that is where I come in."]=1,
},
[19186]={ -- Kylene
  ["What'll it be, sweety?"]=1,
},
[19187]={ -- Darmari
  ["Have you honed your skills enough to learn what I have to teach?"]=1,
},
[19217]={ -- Ravandwyr
  ["'Netherstorm' was not always as you see it now.$B$BThere was a time when this crumbling land was known as the Plains of Farahlon. Little of those days has survived the evil that has taken hold here."]=1,
  ["Archmage Vargoth enstrusted me with his staff when he told me to flee from the blood elf attack on Violet Tower. I did as he told me, hoping to take refuge in the old draenei settlement of Arklon.$B$BThere was to be no respite. I had walked right into the leading edge of a Burning Legion force. The demons wrested the staff from me, but I managed to escape with my life.$B$BThough my master knows nothing of my failure, it still shames me."]=2,
},
[19227]={ -- Griftah
  ["Ahaha, ya see this? Griftah's BACK! Back in my stall, back with my old wares, and ready to pass on the deals to ya!$b$bWant to be better, stronger, faster? Each one of these amulets be guaranteed to do just what I say they be doin'. Step up and buy one of these miraculous baubles! Cheap at twice the price!"]=1,
},
[19232]={ -- Innkeeper Haelthol
  ["I offer what shelter I can in our shattered lands."]=1,
},
[19252]={ -- High Enchanter Bardolan
  ["Have you honed your skills enough to learn what I have to teach?"]=1,
},
[19253]={ -- Lieutenant General Orion
  ["Throm'ka, $gbrother:sister;! Welcome to Outland. The Horde needs all the strength it can muster in this broken world. I promise you, if it's glorious battle you've come seeking, you'll have your fill of it here."]=1,
},
[19254]={ -- Warlord Dar'toon
  ["The ground of this place is still warm from freshly shed blood. Ah, I would have given my own eye to be here when the demons tore through that portal and clashed with Azeroth's heroes! What a battle it was!$B$BBut now, even more fierce fighting rages on the other side!"]=1,
},
[19255]={ -- General Krakork
  ["Make it quick, $c - we've got a war to fight here, or hadn't you noticed?"]=1,
},
[19256]={ -- Sergeant Shatterskull
  ["Throm'ka, $c. You must be new. You look fresh and unspoiled by the horrors of this land.$B$B<Sergeant Shatterskull spits into the dust.>$B$BThat'll change."]=1,
},
[19273]={ -- Forward Commander To'arch
  ["If you're ever captured by the Legion, tell them 'Xar il romath da tidesbi.' They will kill you instantly for insulting their god, saving you intolerable torture or worse..."]=1,
},
[19293]={ -- Tola'thion
  ["Sometimes the straightforward approach to a problem is the best."]=1,
},
[19294]={ -- Earthbinder Galandria Nightbreeze
  ["We must discover what's behind the mystery of the giant crystal that fell from the heavens on Fallen Sky Ridge."]=1,
  ["Your help was invaluable, my friend.$B$BI can assure you that the Cenarion Expedition will do everything in its power to counter any future tainted crystals dropped from the heavens by Illidan."]=2,
},
[19296]={ -- Innkeeper Biribi
  ["Welcome. Will you take your rest here, or perhaps a meal?"]=1,
},
[19310]={ -- Forward Commander Kingston
  ["Expedition Point is the Alliance's closest point of contact with the Legion Front. North of here is nothin' but demon, demon and more demon. Travel with a buddy."]=1,
},
[19314]={ -- Supply Officer Shandria
  ["Hellfire Peninsula is a shattered realm - ruthless and unforgiving to its inhabitants. Be sure to repair and stock up on supplies before venturing out."]=1,
},
[19315]={ -- Supply Officer Isabel
  ["Hellfire Peninsula is a shattered realm - ruthless and unforgiving to its inhabitants. Be sure to repair and stock up on supplies before venturing out."]=1,
},
[19317]={ -- Drek'Gol
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[19319]={ -- Innkeeper Darg Bloodclaw
  ["If we are to make these new lands ours then we must have places to rest our battle weary bodies. Lay your axe by the fire and share the stories of your mighty battles."]=1,
},
[19332]={ -- Stone Guard Ambelan
  ["Keep your voice low and your eyes open, adventurer. We're surrounded by enemies out here."]=1,
},
[19333]={ -- Grokom Deatheye
  ["Need your blade sharpened, or perhaps a new weapon? Better safe than sorry..."]=1,
},
[19340]={ -- Mi'irku Farstep
  ["Only a mage can learn portal magic, $c."]=1,
  ["A mage... you seek to learn the magic of portals, yes?"]=2,
},
[19341]={ -- Grutah
  ["Have you honed your skills enough to learn what I have to teach?"]=1,
},
[19344]={ -- Legassi
  ["Horrible... just horrible!$B$BWe were minding our own business on our way from Area 52 in Netherstorm and they shot us down! I knew we shouldn't have taken that shortcut to get to Terokkar Forest!"]=1,
},
[19352]={ -- Dreg Cloudsweeper
  ["Fill yer tankard and pull up a chair. We've stories to tell and kegs to empty."]=1,
},
[19361]={ -- Naladu
  ["The Illidari demons keep me here because of my knowledge of ancient draenei crystals and relics.$B$BThey've enslaved many of my people and use us to look for a powerful crystal... one that in all likelihood is not even here."]=1,
},
[19367]={ -- "Screaming" Screed Luckheed
  ["I'll never take another shortcut again, I swear! How was I supposed to know the skies over Hellfire Peninsula were that dangerous?"]=1,
},
[19368]={ -- Crinn Pathfinder
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[19370]={ -- Ordinn Thunderfist
  ["If it's a hammer you're looking for, you've come to the right place."]=1,
},
[19375]={ -- Eli Thunderstrike
  ["She's a beaut', isn't she? Sky'ree... the faithful gryphon of our commander. Kurdran himself, he holds his audiences in th' stronghold. I care fer our Sky'ree here when he's busy. Gorgeous creature, she is; as strong and fierce as they come. She'd die fer Kurdran, she would. A more loyal soul ye've ne'er seen. 'Tis an honor to care fer her, it is."]=1,
},
[19401]={ -- Wing Commander Brack
  ["Move along unless you've got business with the fleet."]=1,
  ["Hello, $c! Are you reporting for a flight mission?"]=2,
},
[19409]={ -- Wing Commander Dabir'ee
  ["Move along unless you've got business with the fleet."]=1,
},
[19417]={ -- Ramdor the Mad
  ["Lambs! Lemmings! All of them!"]=1,
},
[19466]={ -- Exarch Orelis
  ["It is good to see a friend of the Aldor around these remote parts. I fear I cannot stand for much more of these elves' insolent chatter."]=1,
},
[19467]={ -- Anchorite Karja
  ["While the focus of the Sha'tar remains on Shadowmoon Valley and Illidan, we cannot ignore the threat that Kael'thas Sunstrider presents."]=1,
},
[19468]={ -- Spymaster Thalodien
  ["For years I was convinced we were doing the right thing in Silvermoon - working to reach Outland so we could be reunited with Kael.$B$BHad I known what Kael'thas had in store for us, I would've stayed right in Falconwing Square."]=1,
},
[19470]={ -- Gholah
  ["If we are to make these new lands ours then we must have places to rest our battle weary bodies. Lay your axe by the fire and share the stories of your mighty battles."]=1,
},
[19476]={ -- Lor
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[19478]={ -- Fera Palerunner
  ["Only the renowned Doctor Gregory Victor can improve your skill now. He can be found in Arathi Highlands at Hammerfall."]=1,
  ["I can train you in bandaging techniques."]=2,
},
[19481]={ -- Archmage Vargoth
  ["The orb behind me was once capable of glimpsing into the happenings on Azeroth.$B$BKael'thas's curse changed all that, of course, but during our years of isolation many of the mages found solace in its images.$B$BSome scried to remember; some scried to forget."]=1,
  ["<Archmage Vargoth favors you with a wry smile.>$B$BPlenty of room at the cursed Violet Tower.$B$BAny time of year, you can find me here."]=2,
  ["The night Kael'thas leveled the village, I could do nothing to help. His magic had already sealed me in the tower, exacerbating my torment by forcing me to witness the deaths of my fellows.$B$BAnd still their voices are calling from far away, waking me up in the middle of the night."]=3,
},
[19488]={ -- Custodian Dieworth
  ["Kirin'Var survived 20 long years and countless orc assaults, but it could not withstand the forces of Kael'thas. A man who once called himself a member of the Kirin Tor murdered all of us, save one.$B$BArchmage Vargoth survived the attack, so Kael'thas imprisoned him within the Violet Tower, warding it with a magic that forbids the passage of any of the Kirin Tor."]=1,
},
[19489]={ -- Lieutenant-Sorcerer Morran
  ["Be careful among the ruins, $c. The Kirin Tor spirits you find there will not recognize you as a friend.$B$BThe custodian and I are the only ones whose spirits retained a strong enough tie to this place to preserve our full identities in death."]=1,
},
[19495]={ -- Innkeeper Shaunessy
  ["Your body looks worn and your spirit weary. Rest yourself beneath our roof and allow Elune to guide your dreams."]=1,
},
[19496]={ -- Spy Grik'tha
  ["$C, hold your attack, this is just a disguise! I'm a spy working for the Lower City coalition out of Shattrath City.$B$BI hope you're here to help!"]=1,
},
[19531]={ -- Eyonix
  ["Well. Look what the netherwinds swept in. Come in, sit down, and rest yourself a spell. The fee is modest; you can surely afford it."]=1,
},
[19539]={ -- Jazdalaad
  ["I can instruct you in jewelcrafting. Interested?"]=1,
},
[19540]={ -- Asarnan
  ["Have you honed your skills enough to learn what I have to teach?"]=1,
},
[19542]={ -- Field Commander Mahfuun
  ["Do they never rest?!$B$BIf we're to secure a future for the people of the Lower City, we must deal with the Shadow Council before they cause an even greater cataclysm than the Bone Wastes!$B$BBecause the leadership of Shattrath City will not move quickly, we the free people of the Lower City have taken matters into our own hands.$B$BBut our spies have been discovered. We will hold off the Shadow Council's agents while you slip into the labyrinth and see what you can uncover."]=1,
},
[19558]={ -- Amilya Airheart
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[19569]={ -- Netherologist Coppernickels
  ["Hey there! Good to see a new face - I don't get many visitors and the technicians aren't very good conversationalists.$B$BI bet you're on your way to Area 52. Am I right?"]=1,
},
[19570]={ -- Rocket-Chief Fuselage
  ["Rocket-Chief Fuselage, commander of B.O.O.M - the Braintrust of Orbital Operations and Mechanics - at your service.$B$BAre all systems go?! It looks like the X-52 Nether-Rocket still needs a lot of work!$B$BCome on people... we're T-minus NEVER here!"]=1,
},
[19571]={ -- Innkeeper Remi Dodoso
  ["These people arrived from Shattrath a few nights ago and they haven't stopped arguing since then.$B$BI'm glad to see that hasn't turned you away, I was beginning to think they were scaring off potential customers."]=1,
  ["I hope these Shattrath folks stop fighting soon. They're beginning to get on my nerves.$B$B How can I help you?"]=2,
},
[19576]={ -- Xyrol
  ["Have you honed your skills enough to learn what I have to teach?"]=1,
},
[19578]={ -- Bot-Specialist Alley
  ["This is delicate work out here, you know? It can't just be rushed, or something's likely to get broken.$B$BLike Fuselage's head!$B$BYou might be wondering about my bots? I'm always working on the Mk. I, and the Mk. II gained sentience for a split-second before his brain capacitor blew out and he went insane!$B$BI decided to skip III and IV, and went straight to the Mk. V - my pride and joy!"]=1,
},
[19581]={ -- Maddix
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
  ["You do not have enough reputation with or have not pledged allegiance to The Aldor."]=2,
},
[19583]={ -- Grennik
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[19617]={ -- Boots
  ["What's your pleasure? Pull up a seat and knock one back.$B$BI'm Boots, lead mixologist for B.O.O.M. and bartender extraordinaire!$B$BIf it's got kick, Ol' Boots can give it to ya."]=1,
},
[19634]={ -- Lead Sapper Blastfizzle
  ["Radiation?!$B$BNo, you don't need to worry about that! Sheesh, the things that people believe these days.$B$BSo, what do you think of our operations down here? State of the art, baby! You better believe it."]=1,
},
[19644]={ -- Image of Archmage Vargoth
  ["<The image's head blurs as it turns to take in its surroundings.>$B$BIf you had seen the Plains of Farahlon, you wouldn't believe this is the same place. Mere months ago, these fields would not have looked out of place in Westfall.$B$BAll that is gone now, but how and why?"]=1,
  ["The land is in worse shape than I could've imagined. If the damage continues at this rate, Farahlon -- err, Netherstorm will be nothing but cosmic gravel very soon.$B$BWhere will it stop, I wonder? Perhaps the better question is, 'will it stop?'"]=2,
  ["<The archmage's image seems to look through you, rather than at you.>$B$BRibbons and currents of arcane energy ebb and flow here as if the area is awash in a sea of magical power. Not even the first cataclysm caused this kind of damage."]=3,
  ["I will have my revenge on Kael'thas for this outrage against the Kirin Tor! He once walked among us as a brother, but we are brothers no more.$B$BThere will be a reckoning.$B$B<The archmage nods grimly, not relishing the prospect.>$B$BKael'thas is more than a mere rogue mage. Once I am free from my tower, Ravandwyr and I will assist anyone who opposes him."]=4,
},
[19645]={ -- Papa Wheeler
  ["Shredders?! They just won't cut it anymore. They're so yesterday!$B$BIf we're going to build rockets - if we're going to get the X-52 off the ground - we need better tech!"]=1,
},
[19664]={ -- Muffin Man Moser
  ["Oh yeah, I got muffins!"]=1,
},
[19669]={ -- Mamdy the "Ologist"
  ["What's an 'Ologist?' A better question might be what isn't an 'Ologist.' It means I study everything! In fact, I'm so well versed in 'everything' that I'm guaranteed to be the most intelligent ethereal you'll ever meet - or your money back.$B$BApologies. That's the dealer in me talking..."]=1,
},
[19674]={ -- Nexus-Prince Haramad
  ["If you've been sent to kill me, please take a number and wait your turn."]=1,
},
[19676]={ -- "Captain" Kaftiz
  ["That Shaffar is a clever one. He's rigged the entrance with some sort of ward to prevent other ethereal groups from entering. We're working on breaking through his defenses so we can get in there and take what's ours. I've got top ethereals working on this around the clock. We'll have it open any minute now. I can feel it..."]=1,
},
[19678]={ -- Fantei
  ["If you need reagents, you've come to the right place. You won't find a finer selection in all of Shattrath."]=1,
},
[19679]={ -- "Slim"
  ["I'm neither slim nor shady. As a matter of fact, I find both references insulting.$B$BNow, get out of my sight before I plant my staff up your backside."]=1,
  ["Ah, I see you are a friend to the Consortium. Perhaps you would be interested in making a purchase?"]=2,
},
[19687]={ -- Shattrath City Peacekeeper
  ["Welcome to Shattrath City, seat of the Sha'tar in Outland. You seek guidance?"]=1,
},
[19690]={ -- N. D. Meancamp
  ["Keep it down! I don't want them to see me over here.$B$BOoh, this really burns me up! Who do these ethereals think they are?$B$BThis is MY claim!"]=1,
},
[19693]={ -- Clarissa
  ["Please leave me to my sadness."]=1,
},
[19709]={ -- Chief Engineer Trep
  ["When Rocket-Chief Fuselage was asking for volunteers to help out with building the X-52 Nether-Rocket, I submitted my resume for the security division.$B$BUnfortunately, the only position that was left was chief engineer. Lucky for me, I have Xyrol here to look over my shoulder."]=1,
},
[19718]={ -- Provisioner Tsaalt
  ["Welcome, friend of the free people of the Lower City, but do not tarry long.$B$BThere are sounds of battle coming from within. My compatriots could use your assistance!"]=1,
  ["If you become a friend of the Lower City, perhaps we can do business?"]=2,
},
[19720]={ -- "Dirty" Larry
  ["Beat it, kid. I got business to attend to..."]=1,
},
[19728]={ -- Mama Wheeler
  ["Can you believe this ethereal technology?!$B$BI'm sure glad they let me stay out here with them. I'm gonna learn a lot... and maybe get some of it for myself, too!"]=1,
},
[19772]={ -- Spirit Sage Gartok
  ["It is said that those who are blessed by the spirits of Auchindoun possess the ability to capture powerful souls in the form of Spirit Shards. I have come across a few of these Spirit Shards throughout my travels but have yet to unlock their secrets. The only thing I have been able to discern is that they seem to originate from the depths of Auchindoun itself. If you happen to come across any of these Spirit Shards I'm sure I could make it worth your while to allow me to take them off your hands..."]=1,
},
[19773]={ -- Spirit Sage Zran
  ["It is said that those who are blessed by the spirits of Auchindoun possess the ability to capture powerful souls in the form of Spirit Shards. I have come across a few of these Spirit Shards throughout my travels but have yet to unlock their secrets. The only thing I have been able to discern is that they seem to originate from the depths of Auchindoun itself. If you happen to come across any of these Spirit Shards I'm sure I could make it worth your while to allow me to take them off your hands..."]=1,
},
[19775]={ -- Kalinda
  ["Until you have mastered the Apprentice level of Jewelcrafting we shall not speak again."]=1,
  ["My knowledge of Jewelcrafting I will share with you."]=2,
},
[19778]={ -- Farii
  ["I wish I had more time to teach all who came before me, but alas that is not the way of things. Until you have learned all that Padaar has to teach, I cannot help you."]=1,
},
[19830]={ -- Arcanist Ardonis
  ["What are you doing here? Shouldn't you be working on the energy pipeline?$B$BWe've more than doubled the amount of energy we're sending to Tempest Keep and can't afford anyone loafing. We don't want another Ultris to happen here."]=1,
},
[19831]={ -- Commander Dawnforge
  ["You ought to feel safe here; we've stepped up security at this facility after the attacks on Manaforge Duro."]=1,
},
[19832]={ -- Doctor Vomisa, Ph.T.
  ["Busy, busy! So much to do, so little time!$B$BNow where did I put that pyrospanner? I know it's around here somewhere... I burned my fingers on it just a moment ago!"]=1,
},
[19840]={ -- Caledis Brightdawn
  ["Knowing a little magic comes in handy in this line of work. Illusions can't always fool everyone, but they're usually good enough to get the job done."]=1,
},
[19858]={ -- "Lefty" Puddemup
  ["You don't have what it takes to fight in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit, $c. Stop wasting my time."]=1,
  ["All right, $c. You think you have what it takes to make it in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit's arena battlegrounds?"]=2,
},
[19879]={ -- Horvon the Armorer
  ["It's my passion, you know. In life and in death, armorcrafting is what I love. Please, treat me as if I were a living draenei, stranger. Let me know what it is to feel again... Allow me the honor of repairing your items."]=1,
},
[19880]={ -- Nether-Stalker Khay'ji
  ["The Consortium will exact its revenge upon the Zaxxis betrayers!"]=1,
},
[19882]={ -- Jero'me
  ["Finally, someone came down to talk to me! Want to hear some of my rhymes?"]=1,
},
[19905]={ -- The Black Bride
  ["Thank you for the offer, $c. Unfortunately you are not yet experienced enough to weather the hazards of Arathi Basin."]=1,
  ["Go, adventurer, into Arathi Basin! Slay, SLAY, as you've never slain before!"]=2,
},
[19907]={ -- Grumbol Grimhammer
  ["I am sorry $c, but you need to be more experienced before you can survive in Alterac Valley."]=1,
  ["What are ye doin' here?! Get yer chatty self ta Alterac Vallery, where ye're needed!"]=2,
},
[19908]={ -- Su'ura Swiftarrow
  ["I am sorry $c, but you are not seasoned enough yet to enter Warsong Gulch."]=1,
  ["$C, we are not ashamed to say that we are in need of all of the assistance that we can get in our fight at Warsong Gulch. But there is greater honor to be had now than at any time in the past if you so choose to lend us your skills. As well, the Silverwing Sentinels are sure to look more favorably upon your efforts on our behalf. Will you join the battle?"]=2,
  ["Well met, $c. Even now, the Horde attacks Warsong Gulch. Will you fight alongside the Alliance there?"]=3,
},
[19909]={ -- Rex Pixem
  ["You don't have what it takes to fight in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit, $c. Stop wasting my time."]=1,
  ["All right, $c. You think you have what it takes to make it in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit's arena battlegrounds?"]=2,
},
[19910]={ -- Gargok
  ["I am sorry $c, but you are not seasoned enough yet to enter Warsong Gulch."]=1,
  ["The entrance to Warsong Gulch stands before you. Will you fight the wretched Alliance there?"]=2,
},
[19911]={ -- Beka Zipwhistle
  ["You don't have what it takes to fight in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit, $c. Stop wasting my time."]=1,
  ["All right, $c. You think you have what it takes to make it in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit's arena battlegrounds?"]=2,
},
[19912]={ -- Zeggon Botsnap
  ["You don't have what it takes to fight in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit, $c. Stop wasting my time."]=1,
  ["All right, $c. You think you have what it takes to make it in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit's arena battlegrounds?"]=2,
},
[19915]={ -- Max Xim
  ["You don't have what it takes to fight in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit, $c. Stop wasting my time."]=1,
  ["All right, $c. You think you have what it takes to make it in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit's arena battlegrounds?"]=2,
},
[19923]={ -- Bipp Glizzitor
  ["You don't have what it takes to fight in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit, $c. Stop wasting my time."]=1,
  ["All right, $c. You think you have what it takes to make it in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit's arena battlegrounds?"]=2,
},
[19925]={ -- Miglik Blotstrom
  ["You don't have what it takes to fight in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit, $c. Stop wasting my time."]=1,
  ["All right, $c. You think you have what it takes to make it in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit's arena battlegrounds?"]=2,
},
[19935]={ -- Soridormi
  ["The Battle of Mount Hyjal is one of the most well-guarded events of this timeline. Should an intruder alter its outcome, the impact would extend to all subsequent moments in history.$B$BAs the Aspect's prime mate I'm far more in tune with the flow of time than other bronze dragons. I recently sensed a minute ripple in time emanating from the events surrounding the Battle of Mount Hyjal. Someone or something is attempting to change this timeline and they must be stopped."]=1,
  ["I am pleased that you've decided to take up our cause. As a reward I will infuse a ring with the remnants of the Well of Eternity you brought me.$B$BI offer you four different paths in which to unlock their power. Choose wisely, adventurer. The sands of time flow easily in one direction and not the other."]=2,
},
[20066]={ -- Gahruj
  ["As a representative of the Consortium, I am always mindful of the ramifications that my interactions have upon our business dealings.$B$BIt is unfortunate that the blood elves do not treat their partnerships with such respect."]=1,
},
[20067]={ -- Zuben Elgenubi
  ["My younger brother here is quite the rising star in the Consortium. Of course, he's too modest to acknowledge it."]=1,
},
[20068]={ -- Zuben Eschamali
  ["When he says, 'younger brother,' he fails to mention that we're twins. He's really only older by a couple of minutes.$B$BDon't let that 'rising star' bit of his fool you. I'll never be a trader of the same magnitude that he is."]=1,
},
[20071]={ -- Wind Trader Marid
  ["There are only three kinds of people in this world: competitors, customers, and employees. Competitors are to be crushed ruthlessly, customers indulged, and employees strictly supervised.$B$BIndependent contractors are a myth. They want to be paid better than employees, but treated like customers. Never trust one who calls himself by that title."]=1,
},
[20080]={ -- Galgrom
  ["Hail to you, $r. What I am doing here is a story for another time. Oof, that was a bad one.$B$BMy brother and I are stuck here, between our time and the present. We dare not leave for fear of causing a temporal paradox. Patiently we wait until the dragons restore us to our proper timeline.$B$BHow long has it been you ask? I'm not sure really. Ask my brother.$B$BCare for some cheese?"]=1,
},
[20081]={ -- Bortega
  ["No, you aren't hearing things. I actually do have the voice of a young orc woman. But you listen here, $g boy:girl;, time travel does strange things to a body.$B$BBy the way, it's 250 years."]=1,
},
[20082]={ -- Yarley
  ["Yep, I've been stuck here for as long as I can remember.$B$BIn my former life, I was an armorer. Perhaps I can fix something for you?"]=1,
},
[20084]={ -- Image of Nexus-Prince Haramad
  ["Welcome to the Stormspire, $c.$B$BPlease do not be put off by my being present through this imaging device. I have many enemies that would like to see me dead, so it is only a precaution.$B$BI assure you that you are perfectly safe here."]=1,
},
[20092]={ -- Dealer Hazzin
  ["All things for sale, my friend! Large and small, whatever you need, Hazzin will provide.$B$BIf you value your life, do not approach Manaforge Ultris without a resupply. Hazzin is the last chance that you have."]=1,
},
[20102]={ -- Goblin Commoner
  ["All this free candy is just bad business, I tell you. Or... maybe it's just a loss leader... they get you in the inn, and then gouge you on the meat. It's brilliant!"]=1,
},
[20110]={ -- Tyri
  ["I've never seen anything like these nether dragons. They seem to have inherited their sire's temperment, but they have become something entirely different."]=1,
},
[20112]={ -- Wind Trader Tuluman
  ["If you have come all the way out here, then it must be that you dare to venture near Manaforge Ara.$B$BCare to buy or sell before you head over?"]=1,
},
[20118]={ -- Jihi
  ["I am sorry $c, but you are not seasoned enough yet to enter Warsong Gulch."]=1,
  ["Our friends in the Alliance gather to fight alongside the Silverwing Sentinels in Warsong Gulch. Will you travel there to help them?"]=2,
},
[20119]={ -- Mahul
  ["I am sorry $c, but you need to be more experienced before you can survive in Alterac Valley."]=1,
  ["adventurer, I am pleased to see you. Our dwarven allies require our assistance in Alterac Valley. Will you help them?"]=2,
},
[20120]={ -- Tolo
  ["I am sorry $c, but you need to be more powerful before I can allow you to enter Arathi Basin."]=1,
},
[20142]={ -- Steward of Time
  ["Beware, mortal, beyond this hall lies dangers unheard of in your world. Tread carefully..."]=1,
  ["It is good to see you again, adventurer. Would you like me to take you to the master's lair?"]=2,
},
[20159]={ -- Magister Aledis
  ["What is it you want? I'm not one for small talk."]=1,
},
[20162]={ -- Veronia
  ["I'm a little busy negotiating a bribe right now. You might want to come back later."]=1,
  ["I've arranged for your flight to Manaforge Coruu. Are you ready, adventurer? You will be dropped off behind enemy lines so make sure you bring everything you need."]=2,
},
[20194]={ -- Dealer Dunar
  ["There is something that you wish to buy? There is something that you wish to sell?$B$BThis is why we are here, my friend.$B$BPlease, tell me your pleasure."]=1,
},
[20201]={ -- Sa'at
  ["Hail, adventurer. Heed my warnings before venturing into the Black Morass."]=1,
  ["Ah, welcome back, hero. You have returned to protect the Guardian once more? Do not forget to take a chrono-beacon with you!"]=2,
},
[20227]={ -- Apprentice Tedon
  ["With some help, I believe Taerix may be close to a breakthrough."]=1,
},
[20231]={ -- Supply Officer Pestle
  ["My brothers in Stormwind told me not to join the military... I'm glad I didn't listen to them!"]=1,
},
[20232]={ -- Wing Commander Gryphongar
  ["If you're feeling queasy, speak with Pestle. He might have something for motion sickness."]=1,
},
[20233]={ -- Apprentice Vishael
  ["I am sure that, with our help, Botanist Taerix will be able to find solutions to our problems."]=1,
},
[20234]={ -- Runetog Wildhammer
  ["Shatter Point is a great place for a Wildhammer dwarf. I've never had so much time in the air!"]=1,
},
[20235]={ -- Gryphoneer Windbellow
  ["Shatter Point is a great place for a Wildhammer dwarf. I've never had so much time in the air!"]=1,
},
[20236]={ -- Gryphoneer Leafbeard
  ["Don't worry. Shatter Point is as sturdy as they come! But just in case, be ready to jump on a gryphon if the base starts to break apart..."]=1,
},
[20269]={ -- Montok Redhands
  ["I am sorry $c, but you are not seasoned enough yet to enter Warsong Gulch."]=1,
  ["Throm'ka, $c. Did you know our fight with the Silverwing Sentinels in Warsong Gulch continues still? Your presence would be welcome there..."]=2,
},
[20271]={ -- Haelga Slatefist
  ["I'm afraid ye would not survive long in Alterac Valley, $c. Come back and see us when you have a few more seasons under your belt."]=1,
  ["How are ye? Had yer fill o' Outland, and ready ta head back ta Alterac Valley and give the Horde what for?"]=2,
},
[20272]={ -- Lylandor
  ["I am sorry $c, but you are not seasoned enough yet to enter Warsong Gulch."]=1,
  ["The Silverwing Sentinels still fight the Horde in Warsong Gulch, $c. What remains to be seen is if you will return there to help them."]=2,
},
[20273]={ -- Adam Eternum
  ["I am sorry $c, but you need to be more powerful before I can allow you to enter Arathi Basin."]=1,
  ["I came to Outland hoping to discover powerful artifacts to assist the League of Arathor against the Defilers in Arathi Basin... but all I've found is this smashing magical loincloth, a ridiculous gnome sidekick, and an egomaniacal undead stalker who insists I've stolen his grey skull, or some such. $b In any case, would you care to join the League in their fight while I continue my search?"]=2,
},
[20274]={ -- Keldor the Lost
  ["Thank you for the offer, $c. Unfortunately you are not yet experienced enough to weather the hazards of Arathi Basin."]=1,
  ["I have traveled far in search of a way to ultimately defeat the League of Arathor in Arathi Basin, but that loin-clothed lummox Adam Eternum hounds my every move. $b Still, if slayers such as you were to return to Azeroth, perhaps we could defeat the Alliance once and for all!"]=2,
},
[20276]={ -- Wolf-Sister Maka
  ["You need to be a stronger $c before you can help us in Alterac Valley."]=1,
  ["Do not forget, $c, battles still rage in Azeroth. Will you return to help the Horde in Alterac Valley?"]=2,
},
[20278]={ -- Vixton Pinchwhistle
  ["Yo. I'm Vixton Pinchwhistle, official Arena Vendor for the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit. If you've got the rep, I've got the goods that'll make your mouth water."]=1,
},
[20281]={ -- Drijya
  ["Feel like helping me to take down the warp-gate in that Burning Legion camp to the south?"]=1,
  ["adventurer, please make sure that you tell Gahruj of our success."]=2,
},
[20339]={ -- Oric Coe
  ["<One gets the sense that Oric is here only in a sorry attempt at comic relief and shouldn't be paid attention to, as it will only encourage him.>"]=1,
},
[20382]={ -- Mitia
  ["You are not yet strong enough to do battle in the Eye of the Storm. Return when you have gained more experience."]=1,
  ["Draenei forces and their Alliance allies are engaged with the Horde in the Eye of the Storm in Outland. Will you join them in an effort to turn the tide of battle in our favor?"]=2,
},
[20383]={ -- Enlae
  ["You are not yet strong enough to do battle in the Eye of the Storm. Return when you have gained more experience."]=1,
  ["Draenei forces and their Alliance allies are engaged with the Horde in the Eye of the Storm in Outland. Will you join them in an effort to turn the tide of battle in our favor?"]=2,
},
[20386]={ -- Lyrlia Blackshield
  ["You are not yet strong enough to do battle in the Eye of the Storm. Return when you have gained more experience."]=1,
  ["The Horde must not allow the draenei and their meddling Alliance to control all the mana cells in Outland. Will you join the blood elves in their assault on the Eye of the Storm?"]=2,
},
[20389]={ -- Lee Sparks
  ["If you've been to Zangarmarsh, you might've run into a fellow named Daniels. You know -- wears a strange helmet, only answers to 'the Specialist.'$B$BOf course, I taught him everything he knows.$B$BDon't let the fine clothing fool you. I'm still a rogue at heart. Daniels and I spent a lot of time in the trenches together, but that was before I retired. As far as I know, he's still out there, giving 'em hell."]=1,
},
[20390]={ -- Duyash the Cruel
  ["You are not yet strong enough to do battle in the Eye of the Storm. Return when you have gained more experience."]=1,
  ["The Horde must not allow the draenei and their meddling Alliance to control all the mana cells in Outland. Will you join the blood elves in their assault on the Eye of the Storm?"]=2,
},
[20393]={ -- Foreman Sundown
  ["Day in, day out, all we do is toil in this mine. The blood elf male was not built for such manual labor."]=1,
},
[20395]={ -- Battle-Tiger
  ["<It's a giant, armored, saddle-bearing attack cat. Isn't that already silly enough without it talking, too?>"]=1,
},
[20397]={ -- Overseer Seylanna
  ["Working with this technology is a huge headache. Everything is constructed in such an alien way."]=1,
},
[20406]={ -- Champion Cyssa Dawnrose
  ["Leave me, $c. I must attend to my duties with Ambassador Sunsorrow, dull as they are."]=1,
  ["I grow bored of guarding Ambassador Sunsorrow, adventurer. Care to spar a bit? Perhaps one of us will learn something."]=2,
},
[20407]={ -- Farseer Umbrua
  ["Emissary Taluun brought me with him hoping I could teach our new allies about the elements of this world... but no one will listen."]=1,
},
[20448]={ -- Commander Ameer
  ["What do you know about ethereals, fleshling? You undoubtedly view us all in the same light, oblivious to the conflicts and struggles between the differing factions. Perhaps it is time for an introduction. I am Commander Ameer of the Protectorate--also your only hope of resolving the infestation of both void creatures and Ethereum in this area."]=1,
},
[20449]={ -- Researcher Navuud
  ["Greetings, fleshling. I am Navuud, chief researcher here at the Protectorate Watch Post."]=1,
},
[20450]={ -- Flesh Handler Viridius
  ["Among ethereals, certain members deal specifically with flesh and beings of flesh. Those individuals are known as flesh handlers."]=1,
},
[20463]={ -- Apprentice Andrethan
  ["<The apprentice occasionally looks over his shoulder, apparently responding to sounds that you can't hear.>$B$BGood day, adventurer. Pardon me if I seem distracted, but I'm in the middle of a job for Farmer Natin. I want to have all of his horses shoed by the time he returns from the town hall. What can I help you with?"]=1,
},
[20470]={ -- Zephyrion
  ["I'm looking for someone to help me with a task that is long overdue.$B$BYou look capable."]=1,
},
[20471]={ -- Nether-Stalker Nauthis
  ["Legion everywhere... they must be dealt with!"]=1,
},
[20494]={ -- Dama Wildmane
  ["Fine beasts, aren't they? The wyverns we raise here are trained to handle the fiercest and strangest weather conditions Draenor has to offer. You'll find them dependable and hardy."]=1,
},
[20497]={ -- Fima Five-Fingers
  ["You don't have what it takes to fight in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit, $c. Stop wasting my time."]=1,
  ["All right, $c. You think you have what it takes to make it in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit's arena battlegrounds?"]=2,
},
[20499]={ -- Fizim Blastwrench
  ["You don't have what it takes to fight in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit, $c. Stop wasting my time."]=1,
  ["All right, $c. You think you have what it takes to make it in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit's arena battlegrounds?"]=2,
},
[20500]={ -- Olrokk
  ["You look like you may know your way around a beast that runs on land, but if you want to soar, it'll take training and dedication. And gold. You have gold, right?"]=1,
},
[20510]={ -- Brunn Flamebeard
  ["What do you think when you think Wildhammer, eh? Gryphon riders, if you've any sense! Shadowmoon is no Aerie Peak, but we've still got fine stock for you, aye, fine stock. Take a look at my beauties and see if one of 'em catches your eye!"]=1,
},
[20511]={ -- Ilsa Blusterbrew
  ["Ya may know a thing or two about handlin' animals, but have ya ever taken ta the skies? We Wildhammers know how ta ride the wind with the best of 'em. Fer a small fee, if ya've got the mettle, I'll train ya good and proper."]=1,
},
[20515]={ -- Harpax
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[20518]={ -- Image of Wind Trader Marid
  ["There are only three kinds of people in this world: competitors, customers, and employees. Competitors are to be crushed ruthlessly, customers indulged, and employees strictly supervised.$B$BIndependent contractors are a myth. They want to be paid better than employees, but treated like customers. Never trust one who calls himself by that title."]=1,
},
[20548]={ -- Thrall (1)
  ["Who are you? Just leave me be."]=1,
},
[20551]={ -- Agent Araxes
  ["Agent Ya-six and I were given a high priority mission from Protectorate command to eradicate all signs of void creature infestation at Ultris. These were to be tactical strikes. Our last hit before returning to the Protectorate Watch Post was to be on a void lord named Arconus who had been getting fat off the fleshlings of the area.$B$BUnfortunately, we arrived a bit late. Ya-six and I got separated in the firefight with the flesh beasts. Now he's trapped inside, pinned down behind enemy lines."]=1,
},
[20563]={ -- Grand Commander Ruusk
  ["Who dares interrupt the Grand Commander?"]=1,
},
[20604]={ -- Dugiru
  ["The Exodar's once-vast supply of textiles has dwindled dangerously low. Your reputation with the draenei here would increase were you to assist us by donating cloth."]=1,
},
[20612]={ -- Sorim Lightsong
  ["What? You wish to donate cloth to Silvermoon?$B$BYou're merely after a Hawkstrider, aren't you? Very well, very well... do the city this service, and I will see to it that your reputation here rises."]=1,
},
[20674]={ -- Shield of Velen
  ["Blessings of the Naaru. What can I help you find?"]=1,
},
[20677]={ -- Morod the Windstirrer
  ["The winds do not speak to our tribe anymore, adventurer. My people are lost without elders to bring the spirits to them."]=1,
},
[20678]={ -- Akoru the Firecaller
  ["These chains that bind me prevent me from bringing the spirit of fire to my people, adventurer. Souls without fire are souls that cannot rebel against their masters."]=1,
},
[20679]={ -- Aylaan the Waterwaker
  ["The spirit of water has left us. Our tribe is doomed."]=1,
},
[20722]={ -- Herald Bran'daan
  ["Greetings and salutations, hero! I have the latest news from both continents and points beyond for your consideration."]=1,
},
[20724]={ -- Herald Amorlin
  ["Greetings and salutations, hero! I have the latest news from both continents and points beyond for your consideration."]=1,
},
[20735]={ -- Archmage Lan'dalock
  ["Amongst the Kirin Tor, it is my duty to see to the strategic interests of the magocracy.$B$BThere is much yet to be done this week. Will you assist me, adventurer?"]=1,
},
[20762]={ -- Gur'zil
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[20780]={ -- Kaylaan
  ["In a different time and place I would've been considered but a youngling. Here I am a seasoned combatant ready to live and die for the glory of the naaru.$B$BTen of us went into Manaforge Ara. All the others fell to the Legion."]=1,
},
[20791]={ -- Iorioa
  ["Only a mage can learn portal magic, $c."]=1,
  ["A mage... you seek to learn the magic of portals, yes?"]=2,
},
[20810]={ -- Mehrdad
  ["Welcome to Eco-Dome Midrealm, traveler. I would warn you to be wary of dealing with that goblin, Shauly. I don't believe I've ever heard anyone use the word 'buddy' as punctuation before."]=1,
},
[20812]={ -- Corki
  ["Get me out of here, $r!"]=1,
},
[20876]={ -- Human Refugee
  ["...they told us not to go... but we went anyway... they told us not to go... but we went anyway..."]=1,
},
[20903]={ -- Protectorate Nether Drake
  ["<The nether drake looks upon you approvingly.>"]=1,
  ["The nether drake refuses to let you mount it. Be sure to get a phase disruptor from Professor Dabiri. It will not take you up without one."]=2,
},
[20907]={ -- Professor Dabiri
  ["Ameer might be worried about what the Ethereum are doing but I'm squarely focused on the real danger here: Dimensius."]=1,
},
[20914]={ -- Aalun
  ["I'm not about to train you until you're exalted in the eyes of the draenei."]=1,
  ["Come and I will show you how to ride the finest beasts you have ever seen. You... do have enough gold to cover the cost, I trust?"]=2,
},
[20920]={ -- Magister Theledorn
  ["Did the Scryers send you to contact me? You do not look like a Scryer at all."]=1,
},
[20977]={ -- Millhouse Manastorm
  ["Thanks for getting me out of there. I owe you one!"]=1,
  ["I should be able to get out here now. Thanks!"]=2,
  ["This place is crazy! I could spend years here investigating all this technology!"]=3,
},
[20985]={ -- Captain Saeed
  ["Fleshling, I am Captain Saeed of the Protectorate, and these soldiers that stand by me are my avengers. We await orders from the fleshling who destroyed the void conduit. On that fleshling's word, we will make our way up to Dimensius's lair and wait for the word to make a final strike! Too long it has been... The void lord will soon face our combined might!"]=1,
},
[21006]={ -- Lieutenant Meridian
  ["With the Allerian Stronghold surrounded by enemies on all sides it's time for us to take the fight to them."]=1,
},
[21007]={ -- Sergeant Chawni
  ["If you're going to come out here, make yourself useful because the shadowstalker over there isn't doing much."]=1,
},
[21024]={ -- Earthmender Torlok
  ["It is here that Gul'dan severed the tie between orcs and the elemental spirits. His unquenchable thirst for power could not be satiated with the complete annihilation of the draenei. He had to also destroy Draenor, razing the land and siphoning all of its energies for use in his war.$B$BNow all that is left are remnants of his madness.$B$BLook to the altar, $r - the land is forever haunted..."]=1,
},
[21066]={ -- Rina Moonspring
  ["Our work in the Living Grove must not be endangered. Our very lives hinge upon its continued health and growth."]=1,
},
[21088]={ -- Matron Varah
  ["Go and rest, wanderer. Our fires are yours."]=1,
},
[21107]={ -- Rip Pedalslam
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[21110]={ -- Fizit "Doc" Clocktock
  ["Welcome to the Toshley's Station inn. What can I do for you?"]=1,
},
[21112]={ -- Bossi Pentapiston
  ["If you're looking for gadgets, doodads, thingamajigs, widgets, whatsis, dohickeys, or gizmos, you've come to the right place!"]=1,
},
[21117]={ -- Gor'drek
  ["I honor my ancestors in the time-honored shamanistic tradition. We must never forget the sacrifices that they have made so that we can be here.$B$BAnd we, in turn, must make the necessary sacrifices so that our descendants will have a future.$B$BWhat brings you to me, $c?"]=1,
},
[21118]={ -- Razak Ironsides
  ["$G Son : Young lady;, I'm not going to lie to you; things aren't pretty around here. We're under constant assault by the bugs and our very way of life, our freedom, is at stake!$B$BAre you going to be a responsible citizen and help out?"]=1,
},
[21133]={ -- Corporal Ironridge
  ["How do you like the war, adventurer? Just remember why we're here...that makes the fighting, and the dying, a lot easier."]=1,
  ["Expedition Point is a tough place to be stationed, but it's critical to the defense of Honor Hold. The information gathered here, and the engagements our soldiers make against the Legion and the orcs of Zeth'Gor, are invaluable to the Alliance's Hellfire campaign."]=2,
},
[21145]={ -- Little Azimi
  ["Well met, I'm Azimi! I often make the walk out here to sell the men fresh fruit and water. Are you hungry, or perhaps thirsty?"]=1,
},
[21147]={ -- Tor'chunk Twoclaws
  ["Bah! Do I look like I have time for idle chit-chat?$B$BDo I?$B$BBe quick about your business. There are ogres to be killed!"]=1,
},
[21151]={ -- Borgrim Stouthammer
  ["As representatives of the Explorers' League, Bronwyn and I are here at the Alliance's behest to study these mountains.$B$BBut between you and me, after an extended stay in Silithus, we just needed a vacation. This seems like a nice enough spot."]=1,
},
[21158]={ -- Commander Skyshadow
  ["It's good to see a $r, such as yourself, contributing to the well-being of Sylvanaar. We've done a lot here in a very short time, but the forces that surround us threaten our way of life.$B$BI would hear what you have to say. Speak your mind, $c."]=1,
},
[21160]={ -- Conjured Water Elemental
  ["<The water elemental is ready to surge.>"]=1,
},
[21172]={ -- Sarinei Whitestar
  ["Welcome to the Cenarion Refuge, adventurer. I've been instructed to offer you basic supplies for purchase, should you need them."]=1,
},
[21183]={ -- Oronok Torn-heart
  ["Greetings, traveler. I am Oronok. Please, sit by my fire and warm yourself.$B$BBeware the ravenous beasts of the shattered shelf below us!"]=1,
  ["Are you ready to hear the story of the Cipher of Damnation, adventurer?"]=2,
},
[21197]={ -- Bronwyn Stouthammer
  ["Borgrim might be correct. Maybe we do need to take a break.$B$BBut now that we're here, I'm eager to get my hands dirty and study what this land has to offer."]=1,
},
[21209]={ -- Dumphry
  ["The Sons of Lothar have been fighting a war without end. I'm amazed we've kept our equipment in as good a shape as it is!"]=1,
},
[21235]={ -- "Backstab" Bindo Gearbomb
  ["You don't have what it takes to fight in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit, $c. Stop wasting my time."]=1,
  ["All right, $c. You think you have what it takes to make it in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit's arena battlegrounds?"]=2,
},
[21257]={ -- Apothecary Zelana
  ["The Royal Apothecary Society of the Undercity is eager to aid our orc allies here, in Outland. It is an opportunity to strengthen our bonds, and to find new specimens and compounds for study.$B$BCompounds...such as poisons."]=1,
},
[21277]={ -- Vindicator Vuuleen
  ["Hey, don't open the cage! Okay?$B$BThese ogres have got me right where I want them."]=1,
},
[21279]={ -- Apothecary Albreck
  ["I am told that the dust and heat of Hellfire Peninsula is quite irritating... I would not know, but I will trust my esteemed, and still living, allies."]=1,
},
[21283]={ -- Megzeg Nukklebust
  ["These orcs must really be eager to stake their claim in Outland! If I told you how much they were paying for my allegiance, you'd kill me out of jealousy!"]=1,
},
[21292]={ -- Ar'tor, Son of Oronok
  ["Ar'tor's lifeless body remains suspended in mid-air by demonic magic. They take from him, even in death..."]=1,
  ["I... died.$B$BWhy am I still here? Is there no great hunting ground that I ascend to?$B$BNo... I must first complete my task. Before I can leave this world, the second part of the Cipher of Damnation must be recovered."]=2,
},
[21293]={ -- Borak, Son of Oronok
  ["Tread lightly, $r. Beyond this bridge lies hell."]=1,
},
[21311]={ -- Rokgah Bloodgrip
  ["I came to this place because of my study into the backward culture that used to be the Thunderlord clan.$B$BThey were weak and succumbed to the lure of power that came with being transformed into fel orcs through Mannoroth's blood.$B$BI have read all of their texts. I am particularly interested in the recovery of an artifact, a drum, an arrow and a tablet that were lost when we crushed the Bladespire ogres and pushed them back down into their hold."]=1,
},
[21318]={ -- Spirit of Ar'tor
  ["I... died.$B$BWhy am I still here? Is there no great hunting ground that I ascend to?$B$BNo... I must first complete my task. Before I can leave this world, the second part of the Cipher of Damnation must be recovered."]=1,
},
[21357]={ -- Wing Commander Nuainn
  ["<Nuainn Stormwing shakes his head.>$B$BWith the Legion on one side and Illidan's minions on the other, it's going to take everything we've got to defend the stronghold, and defend it we will! Every true Wildhammer would sooner die than surrender our home."]=1,
},
[21382]={ -- Wyrmcult Zealot
  ["Hello, overseer. Ready for the attack?"]=1,
  ["Something you need, sir?"]=2,
  ["You don't look well, overseer."]=3,
  ["I heard that Kolphis Darkscale has been looking for you."]=4,
},
[21383]={ -- Wyrmcult Acolyte
  ["Hello, overseer. Ready for the attack?"]=1,
  ["Something you need, sir?"]=2,
  ["You don't look well, overseer."]=3,
  ["I heard that Kolphis Darkscale has been looking for you."]=4,
},
[21402]={ -- Anchorite Ceyla
  ["Glory to the naaru, adventurer. The Light will soon triumph over its enemies."]=1,
},
[21460]={ -- Tally Zapnabber
  ["Toshley's Station is the best! The solitude and supply of strange, Outland power sources is an ideal setting for extreme experiments!"]=1,
  ["Hello, adventurer! How goes your adventures? My experiments are progressing nicely...$B$BBe sure to check back with me later! I might have more test flight opportunities for you!"]=2,
},
[21461]={ -- Rally Zapnabber
  ["Have you talked to my clone--I mean... my twin?"]=1,
  ["I detect a charge in your paranarbulatric region! You must have used the Zephyrium Capacitorium lately -- you can't use it again until the charge wears off..."]=2,
},
[21465]={ -- David Wayne
  ["You can take a man away from the Sons of Lothar, but you can't take the Sons out of him.$B$B<The smith shrugs.>$B$BIt's hard to explain, but I don't feel like I'm meant to be at Honor Hold right now, is all.$B$BPerhaps I'm meant to be part of something larger."]=1,
},
[21493]={ -- Kablamm Farflinger
  ["With the help of my brother Zap in Everlook I have constructed a Dimensional Imploder right here in Area 52. Who needs a rocket when you have instant transportation via Goblin Engineering! Are you a skilled enough Goblin Engineer to learn how to build your own Imploder beacon?"]=1,
},
[21494]={ -- Smiles O'Byron
  ["With the help of Engineer Lapforge from Gadgetzan i have built a powerful gnomish transporter here at Toshley's Station! I would be happy to help any gnomish engineer with enough skill to build their own personal transport beacon."]=1,
  ["I cannot believe they made me move my transporter out of town! Most of the gnomes affected by the accident regained some sort of humanoid form within a few weeks and it should have been an honor to be a participant in such a grand gnomish experiment! Besides, we needed the eggs!"]=2,
},
[21517]={ -- Ilthuril
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[21518]={ -- Oruhe
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[21602]={ -- Millhouse Manastorm (1)
  ["Thanks for getting me out of there. I owe you one!"]=1,
  ["I should be able to get out here now. Thanks!"]=2,
  ["This place is crazy! I could spend years here investigating all this technology!"]=3,
},
[21637]={ -- Wyrmcult Scout
  ["Hello, overseer. Ready for the attack?"]=1,
  ["Something you need, sir?"]=2,
  ["You don't look well, overseer."]=3,
  ["I heard that Kolphis Darkscale has been looking for you."]=4,
},
[21657]={ -- Neltharaku
  ["Be gone, mortal! Your kind is unwelcome here..."]=1,
},
[21664]={ -- Human Charger
  ["<The charger stands proud, eager for battle.>"]=1,
},
[21682]={ -- Human Cleric
  ["<The cleric stares at you through the corner of its eye.>"]=1,
},
[21683]={ -- Human Conjurer
  ["<The conjurer stands fierce, its gaze distant.>"]=1,
},
[21684]={ -- King Llane
  ["<Llane's true wisdom and strength burn bright, even in this likeness of the king.>"]=1,
},
[21685]={ -- Oronok Torn-heart
  ["We will fight when you are ready, adventurer."]=1,
},
[21690]={ -- R-3D0
  ["I AM FLUENT IN OVER TWO LANGUAGES: DWARVISH, GNOMISH AND THE VERY COMMON TONGUE OF HUMANS. BUT I HAVE NO IDEA WHAT YOU ARE SAYING!$B$BSPEAK UP; I CANNOT HEAR YOU OVER THE GRINDING OF MY GEARS!"]=1,
},
[21691]={ -- Toshley
  ["Yeah, yeah... welcome to my station.$B$BSo, what do you think? Pretty nifty what we've done here, wouldn't you say?$B$BMakes me glad to be rid of those stuffy elves at Sylvanaar anyway.$B$BMake yourself useful around here; there're plenty of experiments and whatnot to help out with."]=1,
},
[21700]={ -- Akama
  ["To many of my people I am known as a traitor... as Illidan's lapdog. It is best that they continue to think that for now."]=1,
},
[21725]={ -- Kagrosh
  ["The orc's corpse has been casually tossed aside so as not to litter the walkway."]=1,
},
[21726]={ -- Summoned Daemon
  ["<The summoned daemon twitches, fighting against Medivh's rules of play. He wants your soul!>"]=1,
},
[21727]={ -- Flanis Swiftwing
  ["The dwarf appears to have been discovered and slain in the midst of a spy mission. The Deathforge's attendants have left the corpse in the open, perhaps as a warning to other would-be interlopers."]=1,
},
[21744]={ -- Roldemar
  ["I offer what shelter I can in our shattered lands."]=1,
},
[21746]={ -- Caretaker Aluuro
  ["I offer what shelter I can in our shattered lands."]=1,
},
[21747]={ -- Orc Necrolyte
  ["<Dark magic ripples from the necrolyte.>"]=1,
},
[21748]={ -- Orc Wolf
  ["<The orc wolf's frozen, snarling mouth shivers your bones.>"]=1,
},
[21750]={ -- Orc Warlock
  ["<Behind the warlock's eyes smolders a deep malevolence.>"]=1,
},
[21752]={ -- Warchief Blackhand
  ["<Warchief Blackhand towers over the field.>"]=1,
},
[21755]={ -- Nickwinkle the Metro-Gnome
  ["I'm a scientist who studies both time and sound, so I'm not quite certain how I'm supposed to think, or find the time to get any work done around here, with all of this racket?!$B$BWhy can't these fools go blow themselves up somewhere else?$B$BAh well, at least I look good. Say, $g boy : lovely;, have I seen you around here before?"]=1,
},
[21766]={ -- Alieshor
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
  ["You do not have enough reputation with or have not pledged allegiance to The Scryers."]=2,
},
[21772]={ -- Chief Apothecary Hildagard
  ["I'm extremely busy, $r.$B$BWe have a terrible problem on our hands that must be dealt with at once!"]=1,
},
[21773]={ -- Thane Yoregar
  ["What is it then? Can't you see I'm a busy dwarf?"]=1,
},
[21774]={ -- Zorus the Judicator
  ["Here to help with the disturbances?"]=1,
},
[21797]={ -- Ancient Shadowmoon Spirit
  ["Teron Gorefiend? Yes... I know of him."]=1,
},
[21822]={ -- Vindicator Aluumen
  ["Illidan's grasp on this land is slipping. Can you feel it, adventurer?"]=1,
},
[21824]={ -- Dizzy Dina
  ["When you run with Razak's Roughriders, you learn a thing or two about following orders.$B$BThe first thing is that you fight until you die. The second thing is, see the first thing."]=1,
},
[21860]={ -- Exarch Onaala
  ["When I was young I trained hard to become an anchorite in the priesthood. Female exarchs were practically unheard of.$B$BNowadays gender matters little - it is courage and conviction that make all the difference."]=1,
},
[21950]={ -- Garm Wolfbrother
  ["Whatever advice I can give to aid in your fight against the ogres, you shall have it!"]=1,
},
[21981]={ -- Overseer Nuaar
  ["The Blade's Edge Mountains are a place of great opportunity. How unfortunate that some deem themselves above all others on matters that pertain to taking advantage of such opportunities.$B$BWho do the Cenarion Expedition think they are to tell us what we can and cannot do here?"]=1,
},
[21983]={ -- Samia Inkling
  ["I am here at the behest of my master, Baron Sablemane, to help the Cenarion Expedition with its wyrmcult problems.$B$BI'm something of an expert on these things."]=1,
},
[21984]={ -- Rexxar
  ["The search for my people. Our struggle against the Alliance. The war with the ogres and their gronn masters.$B$BAll of these things weigh heavy upon my shoulders, $c.$B$BEven I can use some help from time to time."]=1,
},
[22004]={ -- Leoroxx
  ["Our enemies surround us. I would have a better life for the Mok'Nathal, but the forces we are at battle with have chosen otherwise for us.$B$BIf you would prove yourself worthy to the Mok'Nathal, aid us in their elimination."]=1,
},
[22007]={ -- Tree Warden Chawn
  ["We've come to the Ruuan Weald to see if we can reestablish the balance of nature to these mountains.$B$BThe interference of the arakkoa and the wyrmcult is making this a difficult task, however.$B$BLuckily, there are those like you and Samia that are willing to lend us a hand."]=1,
},
[22013]={ -- Eye of the Storm Emissary
  ["You are not yet strong enough to do battle in the Eye of the Storm. Return when you have gained more experience."]=1,
  ["Draenei forces and their Alliance allies are engaged with the Horde in the Eye of the Storm in Outland. Will you join them in an effort to turn the tide of battle in our favor?"]=2,
},
[22015]={ -- Eye of the Storm Envoy
  ["The mana cells within the Eye of the Storm are a precious thing; we cannot afford to lose them to the draenei! You there! Make yourself useful and aid us in the fight!"]=1,
},
[22019]={ -- Kolphis Darkscale
  ["Nuaar, are you feeling well? You don't look like yourself today."]=1,
  ["Begone, overseer! We've already spoken.$B$BStop dragging your feet and execute your orders at Ruuan Weald!"]=2,
},
[22020]={ -- O'Mally Zapnabber
  ["These druids have tapped a tremendous source of power! They can turn into animals... project lightning and intense moonlight... I must discover how they do it!$B$BPerhaps they're wearing batteries underneath those robes..."]=1,
},
[22024]={ -- Parshah
  ["<The arakkoa favors you with a haunted gaze and alternates between looking at you and looking through you.>$B$BWhat have our efforts wrought, but a greater abomination than we sought to prevent?"]=1,
},
[22053]={ -- Mosswood the Ancient
  ["Soon I will plant roots and sleep. Before I rest there are things that must yet be done."]=1,
  ["You brought the green to my land for a short time. It is enough. I am at peace. I am ready for my long sleep."]=2,
},
[22099]={ -- Wyrmcult Provisioner
  ["Hey there. Taking a break, overseer? We don't get to see you around here much anymore since you were reassigned to Ruuan Weald.$B$BTake a look at what I have to offer. It may not have changed much since last we spoke, but I've got plenty.$B$BAnd don't be such a stranger!"]=1,
},
[22103]={ -- Baron Sablemane
  ["My loathing of interruptions is overshadowed only by my hatred of Gruul the Dragonkiller and his seven sons!"]=1,
},
[22107]={ -- Captain Darkhowl
  ["Spinebreaker Post is a great place to be stationed! The Bleeding Hollow aberrations are so close you can smell their foul blood! What better place to gather vengeance from a clan that has forsaken its brethren and made a pact with demons?"]=1,
},
[22112]={ -- Karynaku
  ["You must... free... my children..."]=1,
},
[22113]={ -- Mordenai
  ["They can't keep this up! Their wings will eventually give..."]=1,
  ["It is good to see you again, friend."]=2,
  ["$G Brother:Sister;, you are now considered bound by blood to the Netherwing. All of Netherwing will be behind you now! The time to strike at the heart of our enemies is now, friend! We must reclaim our lost heritage."]=3,
},
[22127]={ -- Wildlord Antelarion
  ["It feels good to walk about and stretch all four limbs. Is there something I can help you with, $c?"]=1,
},
[22149]={ -- Commander Haephus Stonewall
  ["Fairweather and I are up here representing Sylvanaar's interests.$B$BThe druids have been more than accommodating, but allowing the Horde to travel through here gives me the willies."]=1,
},
[22208]={ -- Nasmara Moonsong
  ["Welcome, adventurer. My expertise is in the art of working with primal mooncloth. Tailors interested in becoming mooncloth specialists often ask me to teach them our ways."]=1,
},
[22211]={ -- Battlemage Vyara
  ["The fight against Kael'thas and Illidan continues on all fronts. Defeat is not an option."]=1,
},
[22212]={ -- Andrion Darkspinner
  ["If you're seeking patterns or knowledge about shadoweave tailoring, I'd be happy to help you."]=1,
},
[22213]={ -- Gidge Spellweaver
  ["Pleased to meet you! I'm Gidge, the resident spellfire tailoring expert here in Shattrath. Not that there's any competition, but if you're interested in learning to be a spellfire tailor and haven't settled on a specialization, I can help."]=1,
},
[22214]={ -- Harbinger Saronen
  ["Illidan's grasp on this land is slipping. Can you feel it, adventurer?"]=1,
},
[22215]={ -- Treebole
  ["There's trouble in the woods. We must uncover its source before it is too late!"]=1,
  ["You are always welcome with us here in the Raven's Wood, adventurer."]=2,
},
[22216]={ -- Fhyn Leafshadow
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[22231]={ -- Zezzak
  ["There are mysteries in this place that we, the orcs, are desperate to uncover. Mysteries of our past, mysteries of our future, and mysteries that offer glimpses inside us.$B$BIt is my hope to pierce these mysteries... will you walk that path with me?"]=1,
},
[22258]={ -- Demoniac Scryer
  ["Greetings, $c. If I might be so bold, may I remind you that -- while I attune myself to the magics of Hellfire Citadel -- there will undoubtedly be Hellfire wardens biting at my proverbial heels!$B$BSo, do be an upstanding member of your Horde and play the part of the hero... and protect me!"]=1,
},
[22264]={ -- Ogri'la Steelshaper
  ["Steel isn't strong, exalted one, flesh is stronger. Steel gains its strength from the one who wields it. But enough of that... How can we help you exalted one?"]=1,
  ["There are few things you can trust in life. Steel, you can trust."]=2,
  ["What is steel compared to the hand that shapes it?"]=3,
  ["Here in Ogri'la we have time to contemplate the riddle of steel. But enough of that, how can we help?"]=4,
  ["Do you have steel that needs shaping?"]=5,
},
[22266]={ -- Ogri'la Grubgiver
  ["Mighty one! We hope that you find our food to your satisfaction."]=1,
  ["Our food should satisfy even the mightiest of hungers."]=2,
  ["Still hungry $G brother:sister;? How can we help?"]=3,
  ["We have quite the feast for you friend."]=4,
  ["What tasty treats can we offer you?"]=5,
},
[22270]={ -- Ogri'la Merchant
  ["Welcome friend! What would you like to see?"]=1,
  ["Greetings $G brother:sister;. How can we be of service?"]=2,
  ["How can we help you?"]=3,
  ["Mighty one! How can we serve you?"]=4,
  ["We are honored by your presence, friend. How can we serve you today?"]=5,
},
[22271]={ -- Ogri'la Trader
  ["How can we be of service, exalted one?"]=1,
  ["We are happy to provide you with supplies."]=2,
  ["Honored $G brother:sister;, how can we help?"]=3,
  ["Friend! It's been too long. What can we get for you?"]=4,
  ["What are you looking for?"]=5,
},
[22278]={ -- High Priest Orglum
  ["I came to this land to cleanse troubled spirits, but after the attack I fear that my mission has failed. So many have been taken by the wastes. Please, you must help them."]=1,
},
[22312]={ -- Spiritcaller Dohgar
  ["Puzzled by what you see, stranger?$B$BWe give praise to the spirits of our ancestors by keeping the flame of their memory alive and paying it tribute."]=1,
},
[22364]={ -- Scout Navrin
  ["I have seen many dangers in these wastes. Who knows what creatures yet lurk in the dust to ambush the unwary?"]=1,
},
[22370]={ -- Mekeda
  ["Auchindoun is home to my ancestor's spirits. We might not look it, but all Broken were once draenei... our spirits are all the same."]=1,
},
[22386]={ -- Watcher Moonshade
  ["We know that the wyrmcultists are massing on the other side of the tunnel. We'll make our stand here."]=1,
},
[22420]={ -- Lakotae
  ["These wastes are scarred by terrible magic. We must do what we can to heal this great wound."]=1,
},
[22423]={ -- Evergrove Druid
  ["Death's Door is a portal that opens upon the world that the Burning Legion uses to breed their fel hounds and other canine-like terrors. Any time that you see one of those creatures, that is where it came from, and it passes through here, first.$B$BLately, we became aware that the Burning Legion have ramped up their summoning of these creatures through the portal.$B$BYou must shut down Death's Door before it becomes an inexorable tide, and all is lost!"]=1,
},
[22427]={ -- Zarevhi
  ["I am Zarevhi of the Consortium. My skills as a transmuter are known in a thousand worlds."]=1,
},
[22429]={ -- Vekax
  ["You wish to speak to me, $r?"]=1,
},
[22430]={ -- Assistant Klatu
  ["May the Light guide you, adventurer."]=1,
  ["I fear that Colonel Jules may only be saved through a dangerous ritual... an exorcism."]=2,
},
[22431]={ -- Anchorite Barada
  ["It is with solemn pride that I perform my services in Honor Hold."]=1,
},
[22432]={ -- Colonel Jules
  ["Oh, thank you! The pit of blackness inside of me has been lifted! I can see again... and I see the face of my savior!"]=1,
  ["Be gone, $c! Leave us be, or we will enter you next and show you true despair!"]=2,
},
[22433]={ -- Ja'y Nosliw
  ["Get lost before I beat you with my booterang."]=1,
},
[22442]={ -- Lonika Stillblade
  ["When I first set up my rogue academy in Shattrath, it wasn't nearly this crowded. Then, the refugees started flooding in and the naaru needed every available building to house them.$B$BI've closed the doors to my academy for now, but it's not permanent. I'll find a new place to set up.$B$BThen, a new generation of rogues will learn such staples as the gouge'n grin, combat looting, and blaming someone else for breaking polymorph. And who can forget the central rule of roguery --- real rogues don't feint."]=1,
  ["The trick to using evasion is realizing that the best fifteen seconds of your life are often the last."]=2,
  ["Swords, claws, daggers, of course -- I've trained rogues in the use of them all. Now maces, I won't touch maces and I won't instruct any rogue who gets it in his head to wield one.$B$BThere's nothing stealthy about a mace. You're in for a noisy kill and a long cleanup if you go that route."]=3,
  ["My early classes are always filled with bright-eyed young lads. Few make it past the first test, though.$B$BI've given up on shouting, 'when I yell vanish, you need to vanish.' They never listen. Now, the test simply kills the inept."]=4,
  ["Never leave home without ample supplies of flash powder, especially when working with others. I guarantee someone will run out every time.$B$BWhen the choice comes down to handing out materials or letting the poor sap die, I help... most of the time."]=5,
},
[22455]={ -- Sky-Master Maxxor
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[22468]={ -- Ogrin
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[22469]={ -- Fiskal Shadowsong
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[22477]={ -- Anchorite Ensham
  ["The esteemed Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen can train you further. He can be found in Theramore treating the wounded at the barracks."]=1,
  ["I can train you in bandaging techniques."]=2,
},
[22479]={ -- Sab'aoth
  ["I used to amuse myself by accepting challenges from anyone who would offer them, but I've long since grown tired of such easy victories.$B$BFor now, I'm taking some time to get my reagent business off the ground and write a book about my experiences in Twilight's Hammer."]=1,
},
[22485]={ -- Halu
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[22527]={ -- Arch Druid Renferal (1)
  ["My faith guides my actions, $r. I know that Ivus will come."]=1,
},
[22541]={ -- Druid of the Grove (1)
  ["We have been sent here from Darnassus to aid the Stormpike in their time of need."]=1,
  ["The Archdruid believes that Ivus the Forest Lord will come once he is made aware of the destructive forces within this valley."]=2,
  ["It is not for us to judge these atrocities. Ivus will pass judgment once he arrives."]=3,
},
[22551]={ -- Frostwolf Stable Master (1)
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[22571]={ -- Smith Regzar (1)
  ["Our units are upgraded to Seasoned, but I don't have enough supplies to upgrade them to Veteran."]=1,
},
[22577]={ -- Stormpike Stable Master (1)
  ["The indigenous rams of Alterac are vital to the functionality of our cavalry!"]=1,
},
[22597]={ -- Wing Commander Ichman (1)
  ["I was shot down by that reckless fool, Mulverick. I fear that if I do not make it back to base, all will be lost! Mulverick and his squad of War Riders must be stopped!"]=1,
},
[22628]={ -- Lieutenant Haggerdin (1)
  ["Hail, $r! I am Lieutenant Haggerdin, officer in charge of recruitment for the Stormpike Guard.$B$BAs you gain prestige and notoriety among the Stormpike, return to me and I shall see about upgrading your insignia. Also, should you ever lose your insignia, I am able to supply a replacement."]=1,
},
[22647]={ -- Frostwolf Envoy (1)
  ["You need to be a stronger $c before you can help us in Alterac Valley."]=1,
  ["Hail, $c. There is a great need and even greater honor and renown to be had in Alterac Valley at this time. Will you join our fight against the Stormpike Guard?"]=2,
  ["Strength and honor, $c. We need eager soldiers like you in Alterac Valley; the territory of the Frostwolves must be defended! Will you return to Azeroth and lend your aid?"]=3,
},
[22656]={ -- Stormpike Emissary (1)
  ["adventurer, the Stormpike Guard is in need of your aid in the battle against the Frostwolf Clan in Alterac Valley, now more than ever. The opportunities for honor and repute are greater than ever as well! Will you join the battle?"]=1,
},
[22658]={ -- Stormpike Quartermaster (1)
  ["They say an army travels on its stomach, and that's the truth. For any offensive to succeed, your troops have to be well-fed and well supplied."]=1,
},
[22722]={ -- Wing Commander Vipore (1)
  ["I can't believe it... I was doing a routine recon mission over the central DMZ when all hell broke loose. I saw the Horde Wing Commander, Mulverick, take out both Ichman and Slidore! Anger took hold of me and I broke from my wing man and drove that show-off, Mulverick, down. Unfortunately, he clipped my gryphon before he crashed, forcing me down as well. I ended up captured by these savages.$B$BI have to get back to base! Help!"]=1,
},
[22735]={ -- Corporal Noreg Stormpike (1)
  ["adventurer, it's good to see veterans like you in the field! I'm sorry to report that our supplies are currently too low to launch any large ground assaults against the Horde.$B$BSpeak with our quartermaster; he has supply missions available."]=1,
},
[22736]={ -- Corporal Teeka Bloodsnarl (1)
  ["Come to learn, eh? Well I just might have some work for you, scrub."]=1,
},
[22759]={ -- Sergeant Durgen Stormpike (1)
  ["<Sergeant Stormpike salutes.>$B$BName, rank, and serial number, soldier! That's the only bit of information you'll ever give those dirty Frostwolf dogs!"]=1,
},
[22817]={ -- Blood Elf Orphan
  ["Are we there yet?"]=1,
  ["If the demons fell, where did they fall from?"]=2,
  ["I think I need a bath. *sniff* I think you need one, too!"]=3,
  ["Would a tauren paladin be a holy cow?"]=4,
  ["Does this dress make me look fat?"]=5,
  ["I bet Illidan is a nice guy underneath. He just needs a mama, too."]=6,
  ["I bet ice cream would taste better if it were socketed!"]=7,
  ["Boys have cooties and girls have beauty!"]=8,
},
[22818]={ -- Draenei Orphan
  ["Why isn't the Outland called Draenor anymore?"]=1,
  ["Is the Twisting Nether shaped like a pretzel? And just what is a Nether? The orphan matron said I shouldn't ask people about their nethers."]=2,
  ["Are we there yet?"]=3,
  ["If I hold my breath, what color would I turn?"]=4,
  ["If a horse gets horseshoes, will I get draenei shoes?"]=5,
  ["If the Burning Legion is such a problem, why not just throw water on them? Then they'll just be a Legion."]=6,
  ["How do you drink and eat so much, and not get fat?"]=7,
  ["Does a naaru turn off the Light when it wants to sleep?"]=8,
},
[22819]={ -- Orphan Matron Mercy
  ["The conflicts in Outland are deadlier than any I have seen. And their most tragic victims are the children that are left behind.$B$BNow, with the threat against Shattrath from the arakkoa of Skettis, there will be even more orphans to take care of. These children often live without the hope of a bright future.$B$BBut you have the power to do something about that. It's Children's Week, $c, and I implore you to volunteer to bring joy and wonder into a child's life."]=1,
  ["It is good to see you again, $C adventurer. Dornaa has been asking about you."]=2,
},
[22820]={ -- Seer Olum
  ["I am free! But the secret... is now in peril. Akama must be warned!"]=1,
},
[22823]={ -- Hch'uu
  ["I'm lonely. I wish that there were more kids my age around here. Sometimes I miss being at the orphanage in Shattrath City."]=1,
},
[22832]={ -- Morthis Whisperwing
  ["<Morthis glances skyward.>$B$BIn a way, I envy the freedom Rook and Corvax enjoy. To be free of earthbound responsibilities is a great blessing indeed.$B$BThe future will see me on wing once more, but first there's a task I must complete."]=1,
},
[22834]={ -- Clintar Dreamwalker
  ["<The druid appears to be deep in sleep, oblivious to his surroundings.>"]=1,
},
[22836]={ -- Jheel
  ["Gezhe has been really nice letting me come here to apprentice and learn all of this fun stuff, $g mister : ma'am;.$B$B<Jheel hangs his head.>$B$BBut, I hate being away from my sister."]=1,
},
[22899]={ -- Protectorate Advisor Rahim
  ["I am here at the behest of Nexus-Prince Haramad. Strange things are afoot at the Stormspire."]=1,
},
[22919]={ -- Image of Commander Ameer
  ["Be wary of the Ethereum that surround us on all sides."]=1,
},
[22922]={ -- Innkeeper Aelerya
  ["Welcome to my inn, weary traveler. What can I do for you?"]=1,
},
[22924]={ -- Arthorn Windsong
  ["Welcome to the Evergrove, $c. Timeon and I have been studying the arakkoa of Blade's Edge for some time now, and we've found some alarming differences between them and their cousins in Terokkar."]=1,
},
[22931]={ -- Gorrim
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[22932]={ -- Sai'kkal the Elder
  ["<The arakkoa ghost reaches out toward you as though to try to identify you. You get the impression that it cannot see you clearly.>$B$BRokkaram, is that you?"]=1,
},
[22938]={ -- Naturalist Bite (1)
  ["I almost made it!$B$BI came in here to prove the existence of Quagmirran, that most mythical of fungal giants. I got my wish, sort of.$B$BYou must let me free! In return I will grant you a boon to help you to deal with Quagmirran."]=1,
},
[22940]={ -- Grok
  ["Grok look for help. Little $r go to the mountains and help the Bloodmaul!"]=1,
},
[22941]={ -- Mog'dorg the Wizened
  ["The Sons of Gruul must be defeated if we are to shake off our shackles and live as free ogres once more!$B$BWe must work quietly, yet quickly, if our underground resistance is to have a chance of success."]=1,
  ["You must have wondered how it is that I can speak so clearly for an ogre. It's a side effect of the crystals that grow on the terrace surrounding Ogri'la. The ogres there gifted me with this staff, and its crystal has in turn gifted me mentally.$B$BIt is through your continued actions, at Ogri'la above, that I hope to one day be able to bring this boon to all of my ogre brethren. You have my thanks, my $g king : queen;, for all that you have done and will do."]=2,
},
[22995]={ -- Chort
  ["Be quiet 'bout what you hear and see around here, $r."]=1,
  ["Da $g king : queen;! Chort ready to serve."]=2,
},
[22998]={ -- Blood Elf Female Winter Reveler
  ["A happy Winter Veil to you, friend!"]=1,
  ["Season's greetings, and peace to you!"]=2,
  ["I wish you a happy holiday, friend!"]=3,
},
[22999]={ -- Blood Elf Male Winter Reveler
  ["A happy Winter Veil to you, friend!"]=1,
  ["Season's greetings, and peace to you!"]=2,
  ["I wish you a happy holiday, friend!"]=3,
},
[23000]={ -- Draenei Male Winter Reveler
  ["A happy Winter Veil to you, friend!"]=1,
  ["Season's greetings, and peace to you!"]=2,
  ["I wish you a happy holiday, friend!"]=3,
},
[23001]={ -- Draenei Female Winter Reveler
  ["A happy Winter Veil to you, friend!"]=1,
  ["Season's greetings, and peace to you!"]=2,
  ["I wish you a happy holiday, friend!"]=3,
},
[23009]={ -- Bessbi Jinglepocket
  ["Season's savings to you and yours!"]=1,
  ["Fresh from our farm to your plate - it's Smokywood Pastures wholesome goodness!"]=2,
  ["'Tis the season for great bargains! Fah la la la la!"]=3,
  ["Have a wondrous Feast of Winter Veil! Start it off right with treats from Smokywood Pastures!"]=4,
  ["Be sure to tell Greatfather Winter what secret surprise you'd like to get this Winter Veil!"]=5,
  ["Don't let the jingle of the bells take away from the jingle in your pocket! Buy Smokywood Pastures treats for your Winter Veil festivities!"]=6,
  ["If I had some chestnuts, you'd better believe I'd have them roasting over an open fire. Mmmm!"]=7,
  ["Don't forget to stock up on wrapping paper this holiday season! Nothing says 'Wondrous Winter Veil' like wrapped armors and weapons for your friends and family."]=8,
},
