[23038]={ -- Sky Commander Adaris
  ["Unseen arakkoa... they're all around us... watching us... waiting!"]=1,
},
[23048]={ -- Sky Sergeant Doryn
  ["I don't care who you are or what you do outside of the Skyguard, but while you're here you will do as you're told."]=1,
},
[23050]={ -- Little Noah
  ["When I grow up I wanna be a tanner!"]=1,
},
[23052]={ -- Bloodmaul Supplicant
  ["Yes, $g king : queen;?"]=1,
  ["You kill gronn! Now you fight things from sky?"]=2,
  ["Me life for adventurer!"]=3,
  ["If $G King : Queen; adventurer dance, me dance!"]=4,
  ["$G King : Queen; not angry with me?"]=5,
  ["Why you look at me like dat? You not gonna kiss me, right!?"]=6,
  ["Now all Sons of Gruul dead! Now new $g king : queen; lead all ogres to Ogri'la!"]=7,
},
[23053]={ -- Bladespire Supplicant
  ["Yes, $g king : queen;?"]=1,
  ["You kill gronn! Now you fight things from sky?"]=2,
  ["Me life for adventurer!"]=3,
  ["If $G King : Queen; adventurer dance, me dance!"]=4,
  ["$G King : Queen; not angry with me?"]=5,
  ["Why you look at me like dat? You not gonna kiss me, right!?"]=6,
  ["Now all Sons of Gruul dead! Now new $g king : queen; lead all ogres to Ogri'la!"]=7,
},
[23064]={ -- Eebee Jinglepocket
  ["Season's savings to you and yours!"]=1,
  ["Fresh from our farm to your plate - it's Smokywood Pastures wholesome goodness!"]=2,
  ["'Tis the season for great bargains! Fah la la la la!"]=3,
  ["Have a wondrous Feast of Winter Veil! Start it off right with treats from Smokywood Pastures!"]=4,
  ["Be sure to tell Greatfather Winter what secret surprise you'd like to get this Winter Veil!"]=5,
  ["Don't let the jingle of the bells take away from the jingle in your pocket! Buy Smokywood Pastures treats for your Winter Veil festivities!"]=6,
  ["If I had some chestnuts, you'd better believe I'd have them roasting over an open fire. Mmmm!"]=7,
  ["Don't forget to stock up on wrapping paper this holiday season! Nothing says 'Wondrous Winter Veil' like wrapped armors and weapons for your friends and family."]=8,
},
[23089]={ -- Akama
  ["Be wary, friends. The Betrayer meditates in the court just beyond."]=1,
  ["The time has come to face Illidan, adventurer. Are you ready?"]=2,
},
[23093]={ -- Sar'this
  ["What is it that you want?"]=1,
},
[23101]={ -- Challe
  ["Shh! Keep your voice down. The babes are sleeping."]=1,
},
[23110]={ -- Ogri'la Keg King
  ["We'll let you in on our secret diet: Cocktails and dreams. We can help you with one."]=1,
  ["Everyone's gotta drink. What can we get for you?"]=2,
  ["Greetings $G brother:sister;, how can we help?"]=3,
  ["Our drinks should quench even the mightiest of thirsts."]=4,
  ["Drink or be gone!"]=5,
},
[23112]={ -- Mingo
  ["What can we get for you, our exalted $G brother:sister;?"]=1,
  ["How might we be of assistance?"]=2,
  ["Honored $G brother:sister;, how may we help?"]=3,
  ["Hello friend! What can we do for you?"]=4,
  ["We are here to help."]=5,
},
[23120]={ -- Sky Sergeant Vanderlip
  ["You better wake up real quick, rookie. This isn't our cushy backyard outside of Skettis; this is the Blade's Edge Mountains! One false move and it's crash and burn!"]=1,
  ["I see that you've been putting in your time around here, $c.$B$BPut in more; the demons aren't gone yet, rookie."]=2,
  ["Your name seems to be on everyone's lips around the outpost. Don't let it get to your head; I know that you can do better!$B$BI'll be watching you, rookie."]=3,
  ["Alright, I admit it, you've proven yourself and then some, adventurer.$B$BIf I was hard on you before it was because I saw the spark of a true Skyguard within you. I dare say that you're the finest ace that we have!$B$BAnytime that you want to help out, I'll be more than proud to hand you another set of bombs."]=4,
},
[23127]={ -- Farseer Javad
  ["Remember to always show your respect for the elements of the world."]=1,
  ["We must strive to understand the balance maintained by this world's elemental spirits."]=2,
},
[23128]={ -- Master Pyreanor
  ["You seek further instruction, adventurer?"]=1,
  ["Ours is a path for those with an iron will and unfaltering resolve. You seem to possess none of these traits, $c."]=2,
},
[23139]={ -- Overlord Mor'ghor
  ["Stand at attention, grunt!"]=1,
},
[23140]={ -- Taskmaster Varkule Dragonbreath
  ["Another one, eh? You'll never make it..."]=1,
  ["I got nothing new for you, kid. You've outgrown manual labor..."]=2,
},
[23143]={ -- Horus
  ["You no make dis your home. Maybe you want eat someting?"]=1,
},
[23144]={ -- Gug
  ["Wut you want? Smell funny for fel orc..."]=1,
},
[23145]={ -- Rumpus
  ["Sometimes those damnable blood elves stop by and require some inane reagent or poison. I must keep my stock of such items full at all times lest Lord Illidan get word of the Dragonmaw not cooperating...$B$B<Rumpus swallows hard.>$B$BWe don't want that..."]=1,
},
[23149]={ -- Mistress of the Mines
  ["We must re-establish our stranglehold on these mines!"]=1,
},
[23164]={ -- Toranaku
  ["I must leave this place at once!"]=1,
},
[23191]={ -- Akama
  ["Illidan's grasp over my tribe is strong, adventurer. It shall all be over soon, one way or another.$B$BAre you ready, adventurer? My people's future depends on us."]=1,
  ["Newt claims this rocket makes a safe one way vehicle. The flimsy construction suggests otherwise."]=2,
},
[23208]={ -- Skyguard Pyrotechnician
  ["Need supplies for the field?"]=1,
  ["How can I outfit you today, sir?"]=2,
  ["Need to requisition some supplies?"]=3,
  ["You can never be too prepared."]=4,
},
[23233]={ -- Chu'a'lor
  ["Welcome to Ogri'la, $c.$B$BThe ogres here have managed to gain a great mental acuity through the magical emanations of the surrounding crystals. Though we do not fully understand how they work, we have come to appreciate our new home and only want to live in peace.$B$BUnfortunate then that the demons and ethereals, and especially the Black Dragonflight, will not leave us to that peace."]=1,
  ["On behalf of all of Ogri'la, we give you thanks for your efforts, adventurer.$B$B<Chu'a'lor's left head nods while his right head smiles at you.>$B$BAnd do not forget that by helping us here you are also helping to protect our brethren down below whom you have become like a $g king : queen; to."]=2,
  ["The relics are truly a great mystery. Perhaps by studying them regularly, you will gain a finer appreciation of their capabilities."]=3,
  ["<Chu'a'lor's left head says,>$B$BWe find your zeal to help us most appealing...$B$B<His right head concludes,>$B$B... and we want you to know that we greatly appreciate your efforts!"]=4,
  ["Your name is beginning to be revered around here.$B$B<Chu'a'lor's left eye pierces you with its stony gaze.>$B$BKeep up the good work, adventurer!"]=5,
  ["First you became $g king : queen; of the ogres below, and now you have exalted yourself amongst us of Ogri'la.$B$BThis is unheard of for a $r, and yet, there you stand as living proof. I thank you, adventurer, and we all owe you a debt that we will never truly be able to repay!"]=6,
},
[23253]={ -- Kronk
  ["As a relative newcomer to Ogri'la, you don't have enough exposure to the crystals here to reap their full benefits. Besides, you only have one head.$B$BWe, on the other hand, have been here a very long time. So, as you can imagine, we're fairly well-versed in a great many things.$B$BOf late, we've taken a keen interest in the demons of the forge camps. More specifically, we've devised a way to rid us of them for good.$B$BAt least, that's the theory."]=1,
  ["We wish that we could create more than one darkrune in a day, but that would be a waste of time. It's simply not physically possible. Besides, we can't even reliably create them at that rate.$B$BAnd trust us, if there were anyone else here smart enough to help, they'd be conscripted and we'd have as many darkrunes as needed."]=2,
  ["You've been making quite a name for yourself around here, $r. Good for you.$B$BWe trust that you won't let that go to your single head, and that you'll still help out by banishing demons?"]=3,
  ["We are humbled by your selflessness, adventurer. If in the past we've seemed a bit conceited, realize that it is by your example that we were able to change our attitudes.$B$BWe thank you, and hope that you'll continue to assist us in our struggle against the forge camps."]=4,
},
[23268]={ -- Seer Jovar
  ["My sight is filled with visions of events taking place throughout the world and ones that may yet happen. Many of them are grim, but we needn't believe they are incapable of changing."]=1,
},
[23291]={ -- Chief Overseer Mudlump
  ["<Mudlump is polishing his boots.>"]=1,
},
[23300]={ -- Gahk
  ["Gahk new at Ogri'la like little $r. It like heaven da other ogres below always talk about. But, Gahk's heads hurt from crystal making Gahk smarter.$B$B<Both of Gahk's heads nod to each other.>$B$BUs learning ta make da crystalforged darkrune. When us learn dat, we smash da demon's warp-gate!"]=1,
  ["Gahk now smart! Us know how ta make da darkrune into da crystalforged darkrune!"]=2,
  ["adventurer smash warp-gate good, but da demons make it strong again.$B$Badventurer bring Gahk another darkrune and Gahk make special crystalforged darkrune for adventurer!"]=3,
  ["Us starting ta like little adventurer! Yous bashem da demons real good!"]=4,
  ["Gahk like little, $r adventurer. Yous kill da big demon; make all da little demons scared!$B$B<Gahk's heads both grin at you.>"]=5,
  ["Us sure see yous here all da time!$B$BChu'a'lor say little $r our $g hero : heroine;!$B$Badventurer like one of us ogres now. Only, Gahk confused because adventurer need to be bigger for dat!"]=6,
},
[23306]={ -- Hazzik
  ["A thousand curses upon you, $r! This prison will not hold me for long!"]=1,
},
[23309]={ -- Murkblood Overseer
  ["<The Murkblood overseer grunts.>"]=1,
},
[23316]={ -- Torkus
  ["We hope you'll be able to ease our headaches. You try having ten sons, all of them wanting to do something they weren't meant for!$B$BStill, as a father, we do what we must."]=1,
  ["Do you have any sons, $c?$B$BLet us tell you something, we think we were much happier before we came to Ogri'la and the crystals made us more aware. Before, we would have just bashed them over the head to get them to shut up. Now all they do is bother us about the Sha'tari Skyguard.$B$BIgnorance is bliss!"]=2,
  ["The boy's too stupid still to say it -- not enough crystal exposure yet -- but, he's thankful for what you did in getting him those flasks.$B$BNow, only nine more sons to go. Gah!$B$B<Both of Torkus's heads sigh.>$B$BWant to take one of them off of our hands? We'll sell him to you cheap."]=3,
  ["It's an honor to have a $r such as yourself aiding us ogres. You're keeping our hope of a better future alive.$B$BNow if we could just get rid of these headaches. Are you sure you don't want one of our sons?"]=4,
  ["It's amazing how much you've helped us out. We dare say that if it weren't for you, we'd already have been overrun by the demons, or fried to a crisp by the Black Dragonflight!$B$BOn a side note, we did mention that we'd sell you one of our sons, cheap, right? No, not interested?"]=5,
  ["We cannot thank you enough for everything you've done to protect our family, adventurer.$B$BAnd, you do realize that we were joking before when we offered to sell you one of our sons? No, really... although we do feel a couple more headaches coming on.$B$BJunior, be still, will you?!"]=6,
},
[23334]={ -- Sky Commander Keller
  ["Oh, ye like me eyepatch now do ya? Well, just make sure that ya don't have ta be wearing one yerself now $g boyo : girly;."]=1,
  ["Ack, ye've been busy now haven't ye?! I canna thank ye enough for bombing them demons and resupplying us with mounts.$B$BYer making our job all the more easier. Keep up the good work, $g laddy : lassie;!"]=2,
  ["Don't ya have something better ta do, $g lad : lass; than jaw with me?$B$BNow get out there and prove yer mettle!"]=3,
  ["That's the spirit, $g laddy : lassie;! Yer making all of us proud with all o' the work ye be doing!$B$BAnd ya know, if ya want a quick trip ta our other base in the Skethyl Mountains, go down an talk ta Skyguard Handler Irena. She'll set ya up nicely."]=4,
  ["Yer gettin' ta be something of a revered figure 'round here, $g boy : girl;! If'n I didn't know better, I'd say ye were gunnin' fer me job!!!$B$BAll the same, if ye keep up the way ye have been, ye'll deserve it!"]=5,
  ["What can I say, adventurer? Yer the finest o' the Sha'tari Skyguard!$B$BJust don't be lettin' that go ta yer head. I can still teach ya a thing or two, $g lad : lass;!$B$B<Sky Commander Keller grins at you and winks.>"]=6,
},
[23335]={ -- Skyguard Khatie
  ["Huh? What? I'm a little busy here, friend!$B$BOf course, if you're here to help, I've got all the time in the world."]=1,
  ["Hey there, $c!$B$B<Khatie looks at you slyly.>$B$BAnytime you want to wrangle us up some more aether rays, you make sure to come and see me!"]=2,
  ["You know, adventurer, it's such an honor to work with you!$B$BWhen you're not busy wrangling, maybe we could $g go out some place for dinner? : get together for a girl's night?;$B$BOh, did I mention that we can now get you to our base in the Skethyl Mountains real quick? If you want, speak with Skyguard Handler Irena about that."]=3,
  ["So, you've been around a lot, but we seem to keep missing each other for getting together after work.$B$BIs it me?$B$B<Khatie purposely cheers up.>$B$BAnyway, I just wanted to say that I... we really appreciate everything that you've been doing for the Skyguard!"]=4,
  ["I hope you don't think I'm a stalker, or anything like that, adventurer.$B$BI mean, I know that you're real famous within the Skyguard now, and well... I'm sure that you wouldn't want to hang out with a lowly peon like me.$B$BBut, if you ever want to get together to just hang out, or even wrangle some more rays, drop by anytime! I'll be here.$B$BI miss you..."]=5,
},
[23363]={ -- Sahaak
  ["Have you come to hurt me? I have nothing to do with the war, $r.$B$BI'm just a sickly scholar, please leave me alone!"]=1,
  ["You're a young hatchling aren't you? My eyes fail me.$B$BI assume you're here to purchase one of my exotic texts?"]=2,
},
[23373]={ -- Mortog Steamhead
  ["The Cenarion Expedition rescued me from certain death inside the mines. I owe them my life! I offer up my services of repair and reagent sales to those that are allies of the Cenarion Expedition."]=1,
},
[23376]={ -- Dragonmaw Foreman
  ["You'll find plenty to do here, adventurer."]=1,
},
[23392]={ -- Skyguard Stable Master
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[23396]={ -- Krixel Pinchwhistle
  ["Forget Vixton's spread. You want the good stuff? You talk to Krixel here. I got just what you need, provided you got the right rep. You know, in the arena. This stuff isn't for sissies, kid."]=1,
},
[23410]={ -- Spirit of Udalo
  ["Illidan's lackeys still guard these halls, adventurer. Once they are defeated, my powers will allow me to take you deeper inside the temple."]=1,
},
[23411]={ -- Spirit of Olum
  ["I sense you've cleared the path to my brethren. My connection to them and to the temple is still strong. Do you wish to delve deeper inside?"]=1,
  ["My brethren were here not long ago. My connection to them has grown tenuous. A powerful presence in the courtyard guards the way forward."]=2,
},
[23413]={ -- Skyguard Handler Irena
  ["Hey, comrade. If you get yourself in good with the Skyguard, I can offer you a direct flight to our base, Blackwind Landing, in the Skethyl Mountains.$B$BDo you like my beautiful nether ray? It is lovely."]=1,
  ["Hello, adventurer. Need to quickly get to Blackwind Landing, our base in the Skethyl Mountains? I've got a pretty little nether ray ready.$B$BYou want to go now? You just say the word, $g big guy : bunny;!"]=2,
},
[23415]={ -- Skyguard Handler Deesak
  ["Hello, $g sir : ma'am;! If you want, I have a nether ray waiting to take you to the Skyguard Outpost atop the Blade's Edge Mountains.$B$BJust let me know."]=1,
  ["Good day to you. When you've risen a bit more in the ranks of the Sha'tari Skyguard, I will be able offer you a direct flight to the Skyguard Outpost, our base atop the Blade's Edge Mountains."]=2,
},
[23428]={ -- Jho'nass
  ["You having a good time here with us in Ogri'la?$B$BWe have a lot of stuff that our ogres are making, day and night. We save the best to sell to our coolest guests like you!$B$BSo, as you're out there doing your thing, and making the mountains a safer place, stop by from time to time to see what we have.$B$BGood luck out there, $g man : chicky;."]=1,
  ["Hey, remember, adventurer, we'll make this stuff available for you to buy as you do good deeds. It's like a karma thing, or something.$B$BSo, help out where you can, including with our Skyguard friends just to the north.$B$BAwesome... thanks!"]=2,
  ["Chu'a'lor's been saying good things about you, adventurer. If you want, we have a couple of special ogre brews for sale.$B$BThey're really tasty!"]=3,
  ["You're like something of a revered figure around here, $g man : kitten;. Seems like everyone's talking about you. That's cool.$B$BLet's see if there's something in stock that you're interested in. We have a lot of nice stuff."]=4,
  ["What can we say, adventurer? $G Dude : Dudette;, anything that we have in the store is yours to purchase!$B$BRight on!"]=5,
},
[23473]={ -- Aether-Tech Apprentice
  ["We are launching an assault on Bash'ir Landing, to study their Crystalforge. Help us if you can! Our Skyguard Aether-tech will leave in about $4581d."]=1,
  ["Our Skyguard Aether-tech and her escort is studying the Bash'ir crystal forge. She needs help! Go to Bash'ir Landing, find the aether-tech and keep her safe!"]=2,
},
[23482]={ -- Barleybrew Apprentice
  ["You won't find a better brew in Azeroth."]=1,
},
[23483]={ -- Arcanist Xorith
  ["Only the most seasoned hunters of Illidan's minions gain access to my wares.$B$BYou will be considered worthy when your status with the Sha'tar, Cenarion Expedition and the Scryers is exalted."]=1,
  ["Welcome, adventurer. Bring me the marks that Illidan bestows upon his most powerful minions and I shall grant you access to my alchemical goods."]=2,
},
[23484]={ -- Haldor the Compulsive
  ["Only the most seasoned hunters of Illidan's minions gain access to my wares.$B$BYou will be considered worthy when your status with the Sha'tar, Cenarion Expedition and the Aldor is exalted."]=1,
  ["Welcome, adventurer. Bring me the marks that Illidan bestows upon his most powerful minions and I shall grant you access to my alchemical goods."]=2,
},
[23486]={ -- Goldark Snipehunter
  ["I'll tell ya, the only proper way to hunt is when yer good an' goggled!"]=1,
},
[23489]={ -- Drake Dealer Hurlunk
  ["Drakes is my business, adventurer. I'm authorized to sell them to our highest ranking officers."]=1,
},
[23510]={ -- Thunderbrew Apprentice
  ["We Thunderbrews take pride knowing that we are the best brewhouse in all the realms."]=1,
},
[23511]={ -- Gordok Brew Apprentice
  ["Whoah! You really want buy from us?"]=1,
},
[23533]={ -- T'chali's Voodoo Brewery Apprentice
  ["Hey mon, you ready to try da best brew in all da realms?"]=1,
},
[23535]={ -- Matero Zeshuwal
  ["Sorry, but my services are only of use to warlocks."]=1,
  ["Weary of one of your demonic charges? Hoping for one with a more pleasing name? For a price, I can assist you in the obliteration of a current minion so that you may summon an entirely new one..."]=2,
},
[23546]={ -- Vice Admiral Keller
  ["We built this place with our bare hands! Blood and tears, my friend.$B$BBelieve me when I tell you this: We have no plans on ever giving up our hold on Valgarde."]=1,
},
[23558]={ -- Neill Ramstein
  ["Hey there! Just because I can race rams better than anyone else, doesn't mean I won't pitch in and help out the brewers. You can join me if you like.$b$bBut wait, there's more!$b$bHelping out with Brewfest means you get a chance to ride some of the fastest rams in the realms!"]=1,
},
[23559]={ -- Budd
  ["I can only assume that you know who I am. And yet you insist on disturbing me?$b$bWhat could you possibly want that requires my attention?"]=1,
  ["Listen, $c, it's clear that you and your friends know your way around Azeroth. Surely you've come across certain folks who hunger for fame and fortune. $b$bSend me anyone who might be willing to enter Zul'Aman and I'll make it worth your while."]=2,
},
[23566]={ -- Calia Hastings
  ["I don't think you want to learn anything I can teach. Might want to find a $c trainer to help you out."]=1,
},
[23567]={ -- Inspector Tarem
  ["This crime cannot be allowed to go unsolved. The location of the inn and the violence of its destruction make this a very delicate matter. Inspect the site with the utmost respect, friend."]=1,
  ["What are you doing here? Do you wish to defile the ashes of this slain family further? Leave this place. You are not welcome."]=2,
},
[23568]={ -- Captain Darill
  ["Now that the deserters have taken over Lost Point, North Point Tower is the most distant of Theramore's outposts."]=1,
},
[23569]={ -- Renn McGill
  ["Thank the Light the Defias don't know the first thing about diving!"]=1,
},
[23579]={ -- Brogg
  ["Brogg is glad Mudsprocket goblins have let him stay here, but sometimes thinks he hears them laughing at him."]=1,
},
[23600]={ -- Apprentice Morlann
  ["If you need to speak with Apprentice Garion, you'll find him inside the cottage with Tabetha. At least there, he can't steal all the reagents."]=1,
},
[23601]={ -- Apprentice Garion
  ["I wish we had a priest or a druid out here. I can't continue my studies until I've recovered from my injuries."]=1,
},
[23602]={ -- Deserter Agitator
  ["You seem like a sensible $c, friend. Do you remember the glory days of Theramore, back before Jaina made us give up the fight against the Horde? Are you sick of being told to stay your blade while the orcs continue to provoke us?"]=1,
},
[23612]={ -- [UNUSED]Dyslix Silvergrub
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[23635]={ -- Krixx
  ["The zeppelin should have just reached Orgrimmar."]=1,
  ["The zeppelin should just have arrived at Undercity."]=2,
  ["The zeppelin should have just departed from Orgrimmar."]=3,
  ["The zeppelin should have just departed from Undercity."]=4,
},
[23699]={ -- Kevin Browning
  ["Can't you see that I've got places to go and people to see! Step aside, peasant!"]=1,
},
[23704]={ -- Cassa Crimsonwing
  ["Well met, $c. I'm learning the art of gryphon handling from Baldruc over there. One day, I hope to run my own stable of gryphons."]=1,
},
[23710]={ -- Belbi Quikswitch
  ["Hey there, good looking! What can I do to help you out?"]=1,
},
[23712]={ -- Touring Orphan
  ["The Headless Horseman was scary, but I wasn't scared! Not me!"]=1,
  ["The Headless Horseman was scared away!"]=2,
  ["If he comes back, are you going to fight him again?"]=3,
  ["I wish I had a $gfather:mother; like you!"]=4,
  ["Hallow's End is a scary holiday, but I like it!"]=5,
  ["Have you seen the Headless Horseman? The matron says if I look at him, then he'll turn me into a pumpkin!"]=6,
  ["You can fill a bucket at the water barrel. It's fun to splash!"]=7,
  ["I saw soldiers from Stormwind fighting a fire before. They were heroes!"]=8,
  ["The Headless Horseman lives in the Scarlet Monastery. Sometimes he comes out and scares the grown ups, but not me!"]=9,
  ["I got some candy at the inn before. I can't wait to get some more!"]=10,
},
[23713]={ -- Kraxx
  ["My brother Krixx thinks he has it bad working in Orgrimmar. Nothing compares to the stench of this place. At least the boss had the decency to give me hazard pay! What? Do you want to see where the zeppelin is? Good thing I've got my zeppelin tracker right here!"]=1,
},
[23718]={ -- Mack
  ["What can a guy like me be doin' for a $r like you at a time like this?"]=1,
  ["Sumthin' I can do fer ya, $c?"]=2,
  ["If yer here to partake in the big spoils, ya best be gettin' in line!$b$bMy share be long overdue...."]=3,
},
[23723]={ -- Sergeant Lukas
  ["Be on your guard. We are Theramore's first line of defense against its many enemies in the marsh."]=1,
},
[23728]={ -- Guard Captain Zorek
  ["So you're the new hot shot in town, eh?$B$B<Zorek spits on the ground.>$B$BYea..."]=1,
},
[23731]={ -- Innkeeper Hazel Lagras
  ["This inn was built before the savages from the north awoke. Thank the Light for that, at least!$B$BWill you be staying long?"]=1,
},
[23732]={ -- Sorely Twitchblade
  ["Dealin' wit' *hic* poison and alco... *hic* booze ish dangeroush..."]=1,
},
[23733]={ -- Horatio the Stable Boy
  ["When I grow up I want to be a stable man!"]=1,
},
[23734]={ -- Anchorite Yazmina
  ["I've never experienced cold like this, $r. Even in the absence of ice and snow, the frozen wastes of Northrend are extremely taxing."]=1,
},
[23736]={ -- Pricilla Winterwind
  ["How can I help you?"]=1,
},
[23737]={ -- Coot "The Stranger" Albertson
  ["Say, you look familiar. Have we met?"]=1,
  ["Do I know you?"]=2,
  ["Lemme give you some advice: Never trust a gnome."]=3,
},
[23749]={ -- Captain Adams
  ["We shouldn't have left so many behind at Valgarde. Admiral Keller, that insufferable egomaniac!$B$BHow am I to fulfill my orders with so few? I need enough men to stay here at the keep and still properly garrison Fort Wildervar when it's ready!$B$BAt least we have a hope of dealing with our problems now that you're here."]=1,
},
[23770]={ -- Cannoneer Ely
  ["All o' this shootin' at Skorn and other places o'er the horizon, and what do ya think it's gotten me?$B$BCannonball recovery duty!$B$BNot exactly what I signed up fer, ya know?"]=1,
},
[23773]={ -- Chef Kettleblack
  ["All of these mouths to feed, and who has to do it? Me!$B$BAll the cooking, and the cleaning, and everything else!"]=1,
},
[23778]={ -- Dark Ranger Lyana
  ["The stranded Alliance sailors know they're going to die, yet they fight us tooth and nail.$B$BImpressive and pathetic at the same time."]=1,
  ["It will be a matter of hours before the Alliance in the Derelict Strand are crushed. They are surrounded and outnumbered."]=2,
  ["By the will of Sylvanas, our enemies will fall."]=3,
},
[23780]={ -- High Executor Anselm
  ["I've been in the military my whole life. I've fought in many wars, under many banners - but they've always been other people's battles.$B$BNot this time. Every Forsaken soldier you see here has come for one reason alone. Arthas must be killed."]=1,
},
[23790]={ -- Tanzar
  ["Listen, mon!$b$bI tell ya all I be knowin', but first ya gotta be savin' me from these savages and their killer bears.$b$bDeal?"]=1,
},
[23797]={ -- Moxie Steelgrille
  ["The situation out here is worse than I thought! The zeppelin is little better than a heap of twisted metal and burning fuel!"]=1,
},
[23804]={ -- Orfus of Kamagua
  ["The dead rise and seek vengeance on any that dare pass through their domain. Turn back!"]=1,
},
[23816]={ -- Bat Handler Camille
  ["You seek passage somewhere, adventurer? My bats will get you there in no time."]=1,
},
[23823]={ -- Harrowmeiser
  ["I'm a prisoner!$B$BThey shot me and my beautiful zeppelin out of the sky. And what for? Because I was ferrying men and materiel for the Horde? That's nothing new!$B$BNow they have me running her in circles around the bay so that they can bomb the pirates. I just don't have the parts to keep her going like this! I'm barely keeping her together on spit and bailing wire!$B$BI won't be held responsible for what happens to you, but you might as well get on board before she leaves.$B$BIt's a crime I tell you!"]=1,
  ["I'm a prisoner!$B$BThey shot me and my beautiful zeppelin out of the sky. And what for? Because I was ferrying men and materiel for the Horde? That's nothing new!$B$BNow they have me running her in circles around the bay so that they can bomb the pirates. I just don't have the parts to keep her going like this! I'm barely keeping her together on spit and bailing wire!$B$BIf you're determined to help them out, she's due to arrive back in port in less than a minute.$B$BIt's a crime I tell you!"]=2,
  ["I'm a prisoner!$B$BThey shot me and my beautiful zeppelin out of the sky. And what for? Because I was ferrying men and materiel for the Horde? That's nothing new!$B$BNow they have me running her in circles around the bay so that they can bomb the pirates. I just don't have the parts to keep her going like this! I'm barely keeping her together on spit and bailing wire!$B$BIf you're determined to help them out, she's due to arrive back in port in less than $3078w minutes.$B$BIt's a crime I tell you!"]=3,
},
[23831]={ -- Old Man Stonemantle
  ["In all of my days I never thought to see such a magnificent new frontier.$B$BIf only it weren't tainted by evil and knowledge which is best left hidden."]=1,
},
[23833]={ -- Explorer Jaren
  ["Keep your voice down, $c. We wouldn't want them to hear us."]=1,
},
[23835]={ -- Sergeant Amelyn
  ["Welcome to Theramore, $c."]=1,
},
[23859]={ -- Greer Orehammer
  ["Where can I send ya to today?"]=1,
},
[23862]={ -- Finlay Fletcher
  ["Day and night all I do is sit here and make ammo and restring crossbows.$B$BI suppose you want me to do something for you too?"]=1,
},
[23870]={ -- Ember Clutch Ancient
  ["For years beyond counting these woods have burned. They are fueled by an ancient magic and are the mating grounds for the brood mother and her proto-drake consorts.$B$BBut now a long-forgotten evil has reawakened and seeks once again to enslave the offspring of the brood mother for their own purposes.$B$BThese vrykul have caused a disturbance that is extending the boundary of the clutch, and threatens your people."]=1,
},
[23872]={ -- Coren Direbrew
  ["Ye've got some stones, $glad:lass;, comin' in here unannounced. What do ye want?"]=1,
},
[23888]={ -- Mage-Lieutenant Malister
  ["I advise the captain on matters that he chooses to share with me, but I have a feeling that he'd rather hear from you."]=1,
},
[23891]={ -- Overseer Irena Stonemantle
  ["Aren't you a sight for sore eyes!$B$BThere's work to be done and not much time."]=1,
},
[23895]={ -- Bombardier Petrov
  ["Hi there! We're being blockaded by those good-for-nothing pirates out in the bay! Do you think you can help us out by dropping a few bombs on them?!$B$BOur stolen zeppelin's less than $3078w minutes away. Make sure you're onboard when she leaves!"]=1,
  ["Hi there! We're being blockaded by those good-for-nothing pirates out in the bay! Do you think you can help us out by dropping a few bombs on them?!$B$BOur stolen zeppelin's almost here... I think I hear her now. Make sure you're onboard when she leaves!"]=2,
},
[23896]={ -- "Dirty" Michael Crowe
  ["You might wanna stand back. Fish guttin' is a dirty job."]=1,
},
[23906]={ -- Scout Knowles
  ["Captain Adams sent me out here to investigate what's happening at Halgrind. This is as close as I've been able to get, however; the abandoned Vrykul tower affords me some amount of cover from prying eyes.$B$BThe Forsaken are up to no good over there. I can feel it!"]=1,
},
[23937]={ -- Innkeeper Celeste Goodhutch
  ["Time for some rest, sweety, or just something to eat and some relaxation?$B$BWell, if anyone deserves it, it's you!"]=1,
},
[23938]={ -- Pontius
  ["Normal dogs won't come anywhere near me nowadays. I was devastated when I found out... I used to love the beasts.$B$BPlaguehounds make for a fine substitute, however. They're not quite as... easy on the eyes. But then again, neither am I!"]=1,
},
[23949]={ -- Lieutenant Nath
  ["Lieutenant Aden always volunteers for gate duty. That's fine by me.$B$BI've got a post that allows me a good view of my guards AND the daughters of the tradesmen at the same time."]=1,
},
[23950]={ -- Lieutenant Khand
  ["Are you here to relieve me? I'm certain it's almost time. Well, if you want to relieve me anyway, let me know. I could use a drink or three."]=1,
},
[23951]={ -- Lieutenant Aden
  ["I haven't much time to talk unless it's urgent, citizen. The gates of Theramore are my greatest responsibility."]=1,
},
[23971]={ -- Traveling Orphan
  ["Hallow's End is a scary holiday, but I like it!"]=1,
  ["Have you seen the Headless Horseman? If he comes here then I'll fight him and steal his pumpkin!"]=2,
  ["I like to play in the water barrel but I'm told it's not for children."]=3,
  ["They say the barrel and buckets are for fighting fires. Are you a fire fighter?"]=4,
  ["The Headless Horseman lives in the Scarlet Monastery with all the other creepy ghosts and humans."]=5,
  ["They're giving candies and treats at the inn! Guardian Grimwatch says if they don't give us a treat... then we get to play a trick on them!"]=6,
},
[23973]={ -- Masked Orphan Matron
  ["The Headless Horseman's mind is plagued with dementia! During Hallow's End, he might attack this village at any moment."]=1,
},
[23976]={ -- Sapper Steelring
  ["I've seen a lot of things in my time, but the change that came over the Explorers' League in the Whisper Gulch takes the cake.$B$BI'm just glad that I got out of there with my skin intact!"]=1,
},
[23988]={ -- Michael Schweitzer
  ["The Tauren Chieftains are staying in Silvermoon while I arrange their next tour. They often lounge on the balcony above me when they're not practicing. Feel free to wave... they love the attention. We're not currently hiring for the show or the crew, but you can always check back later. Who knows what will arise?"]=1,
},
[23995]={ -- Axle
  ["Come in out of the ash and muck. Dry yourself a spell."]=1,
},
[23998]={ -- Deathstalker Razael
  ["What does it look like? The ground is frozen like a rock!$B$BThe wheels on these meatwagons were built to go over mud at best. We're going to need an abomination and some chains to salvage them."]=1,
},
[23999]={ -- Harkor
  ["Well then, I spose I be owin' ya my thanks, $r.$b$bTruth is, I thought I'd swallowed me last tankard 'til ye showed up."]=1,
},
[24027]={ -- Sergeant Gorth
  ["Gorth not afraid of getting killed. Them Forsaken just put me back together again."]=1,
  ["Gorth is confused sometimes. Gorth is good at killing people so Gorth is made sergeant. But now Gorth never gets to kill nothing!"]=2,
  ["Vrykuls is bigger and stronger than us. But we is better looking!"]=3,
},
[24032]={ -- Celea Frozenmane
  ["Here for a ride, $r?$B$BOr, is something else bothering you?"]=1,
},
[24033]={ -- Bori Wintertotem
  ["Come in out of the cold and rest your weary bones a while. Our hospitality is yours."]=1,
},
[24037]={ -- Captain Harker
  ["These Alliance pondsuckers sure are gutsy! Boarding fully-manned Forsaken destroyers... now that's suicidal behavior if I ever heard of it."]=1,
},
[24038]={ -- Father Levariol
  ["Walk in the Light, my child."]=1,
},
[24040]={ -- McGoyver
  ["Yarp? Yar wannar fly? Narp... No-no-no-norp gonnarp ha-hap-hap-happen!"]=1,
},
[24057]={ -- Christina Daniels
  ["Welcome to my Inn, weary traveler. What can I do for you?"]=1,
},
[24060]={ -- Westguard Sergeant
  ["$G Sir : Ma'am;! I'm here to assist and defend you.$B$BYour orders?"]=1,
},
[24066]={ -- Artie Grizzlehand
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[24067]={ -- Mahana Frosthoof
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[24106]={ -- Scout Valory
  ["Make haste, $c!$b$bThis crisis is nowhere near being under control."]=1,
},
[24111]={ -- Defender Mordun
  ["Tread carefully, $r.$b$bYou wouldn't be the first to die here."]=1,
},
[24117]={ -- Lurielle
  ["My sisters and I welcome you, $r."]=1,
},
[24123]={ -- Nokoma Snowseer
  ["I'm going to miss Camp Winterhoof, but I understand why Chieftain Ashtotem made his decision. Home is a comfort we cannot always afford."]=1,
},
[24126]={ -- Apothecary Lysander
  ["The Royal Apothecary Society welcomes you to Northrend, $c. Now, what is it that you will do to aid us in Sylvanas' service?"]=1,
},
[24127]={ -- Ahota Whitefrost
  ["Enemies are closing in on us from all sides, and all the elders talk of abandoning this post. I say we should stand and fight like the warriors we are."]=1,
},
[24129]={ -- Chieftain Ashtotem
  ["Hail, stranger. If you are looking for a place in need of your help, you have found it.$B$BThe dead reawaken, walk the land, and arrive on ships from across the great ocean. The fjord grows too dangerous even for us, and soon we must leave for safer lands to the north."]=1,
},
[24130]={ -- Winterhoof Brave
  ["I am here to assist and defend you.$B$BHow next shall we strike at the enemy?"]=1,
},
[24135]={ -- Greatmother Ankha
  ["Come closer, young one; my ears aren't what they once were, and I care not for raising my voice."]=1,
},
[24137]={ -- Dark Ranger Marrah
  ["Make it quick, $r. I am weary and have no time for pleasantries.."]=1,
},
[24149]={ -- Basil Osgood
  ["Rest your weary bones for a spell."]=1,
},
[24154]={ -- Mary Darrow
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[24157]={ -- Plaguebringer Tillinghast
  ["So many uses for the plague, so little time!"]=1,
},
[24208]={ -- "Little" Logok
  ["Hungry? Can sleep here, too."]=1,
},
[24209]={ -- Longrunner Skycloud
  ["Keep your wits about you, $r, we're surrounded by the walking dead here."]=1,
},
[24227]={ -- Engineer Feknut
  ["How'd I ever let Petrov talk me into coming out here with these incompetent dwarves?!"]=1,
},
[24251]={ -- Chief Plaguebringer Harris
  ["We plaguebringers tend to be slightly more practical than the average apothecary. After all, we deal with the logistics of deploying the plague.$B$BThat doesn't mean our theoretical background isn't rock solid. We just prefer... hands on tasks."]=1,
},
[24252]={ -- "Hacksaw" Jenny
  ["Bones... flesh... muscles... tendons... cartilage... it all comes together here under my hacksaw."]=1,
},
[24261]={ -- Ulfang
  ["<Ulfang howls and sniffs at you, and you can understand what he says.>$B$BThe strange white worg of the north, Garwal, has taken my pack from me. We must rip out his throat so that I will be the alpha worg once again."]=1,
},
[24273]={ -- Watcher Moonleaf
  ["It was kind of the Explorers' League to allow me to tag along. However, with the dangers in the Rivenwood and surrounding area, it looks like it may have been foolish of me to come without help."]=1,
},
[24283]={ -- Peppy Wrongnozzle
  ["Hey, can't you shee I'm trying to drink here?"]=1,
},
[24342]={ -- Timothy Holland
  ["Rest your weary bones for a spell."]=1,
},
[24350]={ -- Robert Clarke
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[24359]={ -- Apothecary Anastasia
  ["Yes? What is it?$B$BTime waits for no one!"]=1,
},
[24366]={ -- Nizzle
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[24369]={ -- Wind Trader Zhareem
  ["Many are the rare and precious objects that my clientele seek.$B$BYou could be the one to bring them to me, $c. In return I offer that which you covet.$B$BShall we speak more on that which I look to procure today?"]=1,
},
[24370]={ -- Nether-Stalker Mah'duun
  ["An order is whispered upon the nether winds and Mah'duun hears.$B$BA $g man : woman; comes before Mah'duun, and they speak of those which the winds demand be slain today."]=1,
},
[24399]={ -- Steel Gate Chief Archaeologist
  ["Ain't she a beauty? Want to take her for a spin?"]=1,
},
[24456]={ -- Captain Taldar Windsinger
  ["On behalf of the crew of the Moonspray, I welcome you $c. I hope you take advantage of our provisions before parting with us."]=1,
},
[24468]={ -- Pol Amberstill
  ["Hey there! Are you interested in learning some more about racing rams and ram racing?"]=1,
},
[24491]={ -- Deathguard Florence
  ["Here we practice fire fighting techniques. Power to the Forsaken!"]=1,
},
[24495]={ -- Blix Fixwidget
  ["I saw you across the way and was hoping you were going to stop by. So what can I do for you sweetie?"]=1,
},
[24497]={ -- Ram Master Ray
  ["I see you checking out our legally obtained racing rams... I can see you want in on the ram racing sensation... But before you can play, you gotta work.$b$bWell, work and play are pretty much the same when it comes to these rams."]=1,
},
[24501]={ -- Drohn's Distillery Apprentice
  ["You won't find a better brew in Azeroth."]=1,
},
[24510]={ -- Driz Tumblequick
  ["Hey there! Are you interested in learning some more about racing rams and ram racing?"]=1,
},
[24519]={ -- Costumed Orphan Matron
  ["The Headless Horseman's undead mind is obsessed! During Hallow's End, his attacks on this village are frequent, and terrible."]=1,
  ["The Headless Horseman attacks! The fires threaten to consume the whole village! What will we do?"]=2,
},
[24525]={ -- Zeh'gehn
  ["Ahoy, mon! What be happenin', ye salty 'at steppa!$B$BDis place be all chacka-chacka, ye scallywag!"]=1,
  ["Lookin' mighty cris, me bucko! Ye pillage a fat sutler? Best ye spread da wealth... don't be a craven choke puppy, mon!"]=2,
  ["Ku ovah yonder, matey! Dat scurvy bobo be all up inne swabbie's face. Dat hard-eared swab gonnna get salt, mon... gonna get keelhauled and gonna be made into a duppy, mon."]=3,
  ["Issa truut, matey! Neh tougher salts anyweh but da northsea freebootahs yahso, mon!$B$BBest not brindle s'mady, mon. Scuppah dat! 'Alf eediat swabs get feh kiss da gunnah's dawta, mate!"]=4,
},
[24537]={ -- Handsome Terry
  ["I never understood why some pirates bury their treasure. Me... I like to keep it within arm's reach."]=1,
},
[24539]={ -- "Silvermoon" Harry
  ["Blood elf treasure's unlike any other. It's not just the gold or the silk or gems used as materials, sin'dorei craftsmanship is valuable in and of itself."]=1,
},
[24541]={ -- Taruk
  ["I run the fights around here. You want to place a bet, gamble with confidence - anyone caught fixin' fights gets to walk the plank.$B$BI'll make sure of that myself!"]=1,
},
[24544]={ -- Old Icefin
  ["<Old Icefin draws in the sand. From the crude pictures he traces you can make out that he wants your help.>"]=1,
  ["<Old Icefin eyes you warily, his fishy eye blinking as he bobs his head up and down once in a curt dismissal.>"]=2,
},
[24545]={ -- Thunderbrew "Apprentice"
  ["We Thunderbrews take pride knowing that we are the best brewhouse in all the realms."]=1,
},
[24639]={ -- Olga, the Scalawag Wench
  ["You're going to pull off a stunt on Jack in front of his boys?$B$BThat takes a good amount of... stupidity. Well, it's going to cost you. I'm not going to risk my life for anything less than a gold. And you best wait til I'm out of the way before you make a move."]=1,
},
[24643]={ -- Grezzix Spindlesnap
  ["Best keep yer head down, 'matey!' If ye know what I mean!$B$BYarrrr!"]=1,
},
[24657]={ -- Glodrak Huntsniper
  ["You ever tried on Synthebrew Goggles? They're surprisingly uncomfortable!"]=1,
},
[24710]={ -- Ipfelkofer Ironkeg
  ["Welcome, friend, to the Brewfest Grounds! There's much to enjoy here while we celebrate the spirit of friendly competition between rival breweries. If you have any questions, let me know!"]=1,
},
[24711]={ -- Tapper Swindlekeg
  ["Hey there, welcome to Brewfest! There's a mess of ways to keep yourself entertained in there, so you got any questions, you let me know. Otherwise, go buy some beer and a pretzel!"]=1,
},
[24713]={ -- "Crowleg" Dan
  ["What ye be lookin' at, matey?"]=1,
},
[24727]={ -- Caylee Dak
  ["Greetings, Light of Elune be with you."]=1,
},
[24734]={ -- Aleanna Edune
  ["Hello $r, it is a pleasure to make your acquaintance."]=1,
},
[24741]={ -- Annie Bonn
  ["That cursed Jonah Sterling will lead us right into doom. If he spent more time outside of his cave, he would realize the folly of attacking professional navies in a time of war."]=1,
  ["You'd best scram, adventurer. I do not want Jonah's death to be linked back to me.$B$BIt'll be hard enough to establish myself as leader of this lot without them knowing I had their previous skipper killed."]=2,
},
[24750]={ -- Hidalgo the Master Falconer
  ["Greetings, $r. I am Hidalgo, master of the hunt and world class falconer. This killing machine that you see perched atop my shoulder is Excelsior.$B$BYou might be thinking to yourself, 'What does a falconer even do?' Well I'll tell you what we do - we hunt! Falconry is the art of using a bird of prey to hunt and catch game. Perhaps you are interested in learning to hunt with a trained raptor? Hidalgo can teach you such things!"]=1,
},
[24752]={ -- Rock Falcon
  ["<The creature pecks at your hand.>"]=1,
  ["<The falcon squawks hungrily for a grub.>"]=2,
},
[24755]={ -- Elder Atuik
  ["I am Atuik, chieftain of the Kalu'ak of Kamagua."]=1,
},
[24784]={ -- Scuttle Frostprow
  ["Day in and day out all Mad Jonah Sterling wants me to do is swab the decks.$B$BSwab the decks?!$B$BI'm a mage, I don't DO swabbin'! At least not the mundane way."]=1,
},
[24788]={ -- Jack Adams
  ["<This pirate has obviously had too much to drink. He appears to be out cold for the time being.>"]=1,
},
[24795]={ -- Surristrasz
  ["Why do you disturb me?"]=1,
},
[24807]={ -- Walt
  ["The Dude, over yonder, is pretty upset about his rug."]=1,
},
[24810]={ -- Anuniaq
  ["Many changes come to the land and water: you, them... much change.$B$BKamagua's way of life is threatened by these changes. What will you do?"]=1,
},
[24811]={ -- Donny
  ["I'm out of my element, eh? Walt doesn't know what he's talking about! I single-handedly kicked the iron out of these dwarves and set up camp to observe the goings-on of the dig site."]=1,
},
[24833]={ -- Captain "Stash" Torgoley
  ["Welcome to the majestic Lady Mehley. I am Captain Torgoley.$b$bIf you've questions about the ship, feel free to ask; otherwise, please, enjoy the journey, as I always do... After all, to quote a favorite scribe of mine: My experience of ships is that on them one makes an interesting discovery about the world. One finds one can do without it completely."]=1,
},
[24835]={ -- First Mate Kowalski
  ["I must keep my eyes on ship and crew, good $gsir:madame;. You must forgive my not pausing to speak with you."]=1,
},
[24836]={ -- Abe the Cabin Boy
  ["Cap'n Stash is the BEST!"]=1,
  ["I swab the decks!"]=2,
  ["The Lady Mehley is the best ship EVER!"]=3,
  ["Swabbin' decks cured my rickets!"]=4,
},
[24837]={ -- Navigator Mehran
  ["I've little time for talk, sorry."]=1,
},
[24838]={ -- Sailor Henders
  ["Fine day fer sailin', innit?"]=1,
},
[24839]={ -- Sailor Wicks
  ["Torgoley works us hard, but he's a good captain, aye."]=1,
},
[24840]={ -- Sailor Vines
  ["Can't ya see I'm workin' here, $glad:lass;? Off with ya, afore Kowalski sees me jawin.'"]=1,
},
[24841]={ -- Marine Halters
  ["The Lady Mehley is in Theramore enough that we've been assigned to guard her passengers."]=1,
},
[24842]={ -- Marine Anderson
  ["The Lady Mehley is in Theramore enough that we've been assigned to guard her passengers."]=1,
},
[24848]={ -- Kalecgos
  ["Do not be frightened, $r. Our ends are the same."]=1,
},
[24866]={ -- Lakoor
  ["Times are changing, adventurer. War has arrived.$B$BWill our people rise to the occasion and aid our allies... or will we linger in the sidelines?"]=1,
},
[24881]={ -- Karrtog
  ["There aren't many of us left, adventurer. The return of our old enemy is a cause for great concern."]=1,
},
[24896]={ -- Lou the Cabin Boy
  ["I lucked out. Not many tauren get to be cabin boy on a frigate like this! Grezzix even lets me man these incredible battle canoes."]=1,
},
[24905]={ -- Leassian
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[24932]={ -- Exarch Nasuun
  ["This portal is not like the others that lead back to Azeroth. To maintain it, we must acquire more mana cells.$B$BIt is either that or risk losing our access to the Isle of Quel'Danas and the Sunwell."]=1,
},
[24937]={ -- Magistrix Seyla
  ["This is the gateway that Kael's armies used to retreat to the Sunwell. Some of his lapdogs remain here; the Legion has rewarded them in a most... unusual way."]=1,
},
[24956]={ -- Juniper
  ["Ahoy! Ye be lookin' to book passage board the Sister Mercy, matey? Ye've come to the right place..."]=1,
},
[24965]={ -- Vindicator Xayann
  ["We succeeded in taking the Sanctum. We can continue to convert sentries and use them as guards at other tactical locations."]=1,
},
[24967]={ -- Captain Theris Dawnhearth
  ["Our efforts have paid off. We've captured the Sun's Reach Sanctum, adventurer. Go there and see if there's anyone you can assist."]=1,
},
[24974]={ -- Liza Cutlerflix
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[24975]={ -- Mar'nah
  ["Greetings, $r.$b$bMy shop is finally open. I hope you like what you see!"]=1,
},
[24996]={ -- Mariner Bladewhisper
  ["The seas are a dangerous place, $c. We must be alert."]=1,
},
[24997]={ -- Mariner Swiftstar
  ["The seas are a dangerous place, $c. We must be alert."]=1,
},
[24998]={ -- Mariner Farsight
  ["The wisps and I watch the seas for any lost souls."]=1,
},
[25007]={ -- Mariner Evenmist
  ["I'm afraid I cannot speak with you at the moment."]=1,
},
[25009]={ -- Captain Angelina Soluna
  ["Welcome to The Bravery, $gsir:madame;. Now if you'll excuse me..."]=1,
},
[25011]={ -- First Mate Wavesinger
  ["The Bravery's crew will do its best to make your journey as swift and pleasant as possible."]=1,
},
[25013]={ -- Sentinel Brightgrass
  ["We've sworn to do our very best to protect the passengers of The Bravery. The sea lane between Rut'theran Village and Stormwind Harbor must remain safe."]=1,
},
[25014]={ -- Sentinel Winterdew
  ["We've sworn to do our very best to protect the passengers of The Bravery. The sea lane between Rut'theran Village and Stormwind Harbor must remain safe."]=1,
},
[25015]={ -- Navigator Landerson
  ["Sorry, but we'll have to speak some other time. Farewell."]=1,
},
[25016]={ -- Sailor Wills
  ["This greyin' seadog may be the oldest of the crew, but he's also the toughest of the lot! Eh? Eh? Arms like an ogre!"]=1,
},
[25017]={ -- Sailor Fairfolk
  ["I'm almost jealous of our Mr. Wavesinger. Why, he may well be prettier than me!"]=1,
},
[25018]={ -- Sailor Stoneheel
  ["Unlucky name fer a sailor, innit?"]=1,
},
[25021]={ -- Mariner Moonblade
  ["We must make sure not to lose any more souls to the seas."]=1,
},
[25022]={ -- Mariner Stillwake
  ["Forgive me $c, but I must concentrate on my job."]=1,
},
[25023]={ -- Mariner Everwatch
  ["Many have been lost to the seas. I, and the wisps, are charged with looking for those souls."]=1,
},
[25024]={ -- Mariner Softsong
  ["We must make sure not to lose any more souls to the seas."]=1,
},
[25025]={ -- Captain Idrilae
  ["Welcome aboard the Feathermoon Ferry. We travel between Feathermoon Stronghold and the Forgotten Coast looking for those lost at sea. The sea can be a dangerous place if you are not prepared.$b$bIf you need to get prepared, please speak to our provisioners. They are more than happy to help you."]=1,
},
[25032]={ -- Eldara Dawnrunner
  ["Do not fight the enemy unprepared, adventurer. I can provide you with very powerful items... provided you have proven yourself to us."]=1,
},
[25034]={ -- Tradesman Portanuus
  ["Blessings of the naaru upon you, my friend."]=1,
},
[25036]={ -- Caregiver Inaara
  ["Please, sit and make yourself comfortable."]=1,
},
[25046]={ -- Smith Hauthaa
  ["Hello, adventurer.$b$bNow that I've finished creating my anvil I can begin outfitting our troops. It's an important step, but there's still much to be done.$b$bMore importantly for you, there are new things that I can create, which you may be interested in."]=1,
},
[25050]={ -- Captain Galind Windsword
  ["Watch your step aboard Elune's Blessing, $r. Though Elune's blessed us with the discovery of our new friends, we've also had our share of hardships at sea.$b$bHowever, recovering souls lost at sea or lost in a new world is truly a blessing from Elune."]=1,
},
[25053]={ -- Mariner Farseeker
  ["I'm sorry, I've little time for speaking to anyone other than the wisps and the captain to report my findings. Forgive me."]=1,
},
[25054]={ -- Mariner Keenstar
  ["Elune has blessed us many times over with all the discoveries we have made. But we must remain vigilant, $c."]=1,
},
[25055]={ -- Mariner Frostnight
  ["Elune has blessed us many times over with all the discoveries we have made. But we must remain vigilant, $c."]=1,
},
[25056]={ -- Mariner Stillglider
  ["Forgive me, $r, I must focus on my job."]=1,
},
[25057]={ -- Battlemage Arynna
  ["We've captured the armory, adventurer. Let's not rest on our laurels, however. The Legion sure will not."]=1,
},
[25059]={ -- Ayren Cloudbreaker
  ["You don't get to see much action in my line of work. Serving this close to the front lines in a combat zone is a nice change of pace."]=1,
},
[25061]={ -- Harbinger Inuuro
  ["We have gained control of the armory, but our work on the island is not yet finished."]=1,
},
[25069]={ -- Magister Ilastar
  ["Sun's Reach is ours. Kael's dogs are on the run... it is time to put them out of their misery!"]=1,
},
[25070]={ -- Chief Officer Coppernut
  ["If you like excitement, our captain's the best! I love this job!"]=1,
},
[25074]={ -- Crewman Sparkfly
  ["<Grumbles> I guess those mountains came out of nowhere... All five times!"]=1,
  ["<Grumbles> You'd think it would be hard to crash a zeppelin into the ocean. You'd think it'd be even harder to do it four separate times!"]=2,
  ["<Grumbles> I wish I could say we've managed to avoid crash landing into lakes. I wish I could say we've only crashed into a lake once... but we've managed to crash into four separate lakes, including Lordamere Lake!"]=3,
  ["I am impressed that pine tree branches don't seem to damage our ship much.$b$bNot that it excuses the three times we've crashed into some forest."]=4,
  ["I never thought I'd get to see Teldrassil... I certainly never thought we'd crash into Teldrassil."]=5,
  ["We've managed to squeeze through Thunder Bluff twice now!"]=6,
  ["<Grumbles> I still don't know how we managed to snake through Thousand Needles without a scratch, only to crash and burn in the Shimmering Flats!"]=7,
},
[25076]={ -- Navigator Fairweather
  ["You can't blame me for our mishaps... I can't even see where I'm going!$b$bThough maybe that means you can blame me...$b$bNo! Wait! I can dock this ship just fine... It's gotta be the orders the captain issues! Maybe he likes pushing us to our limits and testing out our survival and repair skills."]=1,
},
[25077]={ -- Sky-Captain Cloudkicker
  ["Welcome aboard the Thundercaller!$b$bDon't pay attention to the people that complain about explosions or the like. I mean really, everyone makes mistakes. We should cut people some slack.$b$bLook, I'd understand if a captain managed to crash his ship 22 or 23 times... But anything less than that isn't worth mentioning."]=1,
},
[25081]={ -- Grunt Ounda
  ["We protect this airship on its way from Orgrimmar to Grom'gol base camp in Stranglethorn Vale."]=1,
},
[25088]={ -- Captain Valindria
  ["We've taken the harbor, and this ship is a nice bonus. Too bad she's not yet sea-worthy.$B$BIn the meantime, I've been instructed to oversee the disruption of the naga on the Greengill Coast.$B$BThink you can help me out?"]=1,
},
[25093]={ -- First Mate Masker
  ["Welcome aboard the Maiden's Fancy. It should be smooth sailing all the way to port."]=1,
},
[25099]={ -- Jonathan Garrett
  ["It's amazing what you can learn from a gnome if you squeeze them hard enough: clever little tricks about getting out of a bind, making delicious cookies, and even how to make a flying machine."]=1,
},
[25102]={ -- Crewman Spinshaft
  ["I'm busy right now."]=1,
  ["You need something fixed? Use the Vend-O-Tron."]=2,
  ["I don't have time to talk right now."]=3,
},
[25108]={ -- Vindicator Kaalan
  ["We've almost consolidated our control over Sun's Reach. If we manage to keep the harbor from getting any reinforcements we will certainly succeed.$B$BWe are $3238w percent done with our goal."]=1,
  ["We've done it, adventurer. With Sun's Reach under our control we are but mere moments away from absolute victory."]=2,
},
[25112]={ -- Anchorite Ayuri
  ["Isn't the memorial beautiful? It is important to remember moments in our history when great sacrifices are made, lest we forget the price of all wars - even ones that are won."]=1,
},
[25167]={ -- General Tiras'alan
  ["Should Kil'jaeden rise up through the Sunwell our world will be thrown into a war the likes of which has not been seen for 10,000 years!"]=1,
},
[25169]={ -- Archmage Ne'thul
  ["Should Kil'jaeden rise up through the Sunwell our world will be thrown into a war the likes of which has not been seen for 10,000 years!"]=1,
},
[25197]={ -- King Mrgl-Mrgl
  ["I recently came here to observe the Winterfin murlocs. Disguised as one of them, I kept my distance and took notes on their day-to-day life.$B$BHowever, not long after I arrived, that all changed.$B$BAn earthquake in Coldarra caused a landslide, which exposed the nearby caverns. Out came a strange makrura who stole away with the Winterfins' tadpoles. When the murlocs went into the caverns to rescue their young, they re-emerged, glowing and under the makrura's influence.$B$BNow the unaffected have retreated to here, and I have reluctantly assumed their leadership."]=1,
},
[25198]={ -- Winterfin Gatherer
  ["No time to talk -- I have work to do!"]=1,
  ["You can understand me? I can understand you!"]=2,
  ["$R, why would I want to talk to you? Your people probably caused this mess in the first place!"]=3,
  ["There are clams to be collected and orcas to be killed. Help or stay out of the way!"]=4,
  ["Blurglgr murbrgl... just kidding, I can understand you."]=5,
  ["You figure out yet why our brothers and sisters over in the village have gone insane?"]=6,
  ["I knew that we never should have gone into those caves. It's not natural!"]=7,
  ["There's something fishy about new King Mrgl-Mrgl, but I can't quite put my finger on it."]=8,
},
[25199]={ -- Brglmurgl
  ["You have learned a trick to speak with us, $r, but I am not impressed.$B$BThere are Winterfin betrayers across the water that need killing."]=1,
},
[25200]={ -- Steven Thomas
  ["Schweitzer here is an old friend of mine... a valuable thing, that. Friendship, I mean. I thought I'd forgotten the feeling until we met again in Shattrath City. He's not in Tirisfal so much these days, so I thought I'd take the Orb of Translocation here to give my hellos."]=1,
},
[25202]={ -- Arcanist Myndimendez
  ["Did you manage to see their show in Terokkar Forest? It was amazing!"]=1,
  ["The Tauren Chieftains must be the best-known minstrels in all of Azeroth!"]=2,
  ["I wonder how much longer they'll be in Silvermoon City. I hope they play here!"]=3,
  ["I'd give nearly anything for a chance to go up there and speak with them..."]=4,
},
[25205]={ -- Mrmrglmr
  ["I'm not blind, you know. I can see what's going on around here!"]=1,
},
[25206]={ -- Ahlurglgr
  ["Mmrrglglglg? Glbmr brmmrggl glmrrbmrgl.$B$BGrglgrlbrr mrgl!!!"]=1,
  ["<Ahlurglgr looks surprised to be able to understand you.>"]=2,
},
[25207]={ -- Roitau
  ["I'm in charge of the workers that support the Tauren Chieftains. You know: packing, driving, and unpacking the wagons, building and taking down the stage, setting up the pyrotechnics, all that sort of thing."]=1,
},
[25208]={ -- Lurgglbr
  ["My brothers and sisters have gone insane! Do you think you could help me get out of here?"]=1,
},
[25236]={ -- Unrestrained Dragonhawk
  ["<The dragonhawk appears to be unsettled by the commotion in the surrounding area.>"]=1,
},
[25237]={ -- Garrosh Hellscream
  ["The razing of Orgrimmar was not just an attack against orcs, it was an affront to the Horde. An assault against our very existence!$B$BThe Lich King sought to sow the seeds of fear.$B$BThis...$B$B<Garrosh points to the fortified walls that surround him.>$B$BThis is the result of Arthas's campaign.$B$BThe Horde fears nothing..."]=1,
},
[25245]={ -- James Deacon
  ["Can I get you anything? My selection is a little limited, but that's to be expected... all things considered."]=1,
},
[25248]={ -- "Salty" John Thorpe
  ["Just another day workin' the kitchen. Sure gets dull after a while."]=1,
},
[25251]={ -- Leryssa
  ["Arthas was once a human prince. The army he led into Northrend suffered a horrible fate.$B$BMy brother, Thassarian, was a part of that army."]=1,
  ["I'll never forget what you did for Thassarian. I will always be in your debt."]=2,
},
[25256]={ -- High Overlord Saurfang
  ["Fear has always been our greatest weapon. Entire wars have been won and lost upon the shifting shoulders of trepidation and doubt. So how, then, does one fight an enemy that knows no fear?$B$B<Saurfang shakes his head.>$B$BWe do not just fight the Scourge in Northrend, we fight to gain control of our senses before they tear us apart..."]=1,
},
[25257]={ -- Saurfang the Younger
  ["My father has gifted me with his battle armor and axe. Soon I put it to good use."]=1,
},
[25278]={ -- Williamson
  ["Rest your weary bones for a spell."]=1,
},
[25285]={ -- Harbinger Vurenn
  ["Dark forces are at work in this land, adventurer. Keep your eyes open and your courage strong."]=1,
},
[25288]={ -- Turida Coldwind
  ["How can I help you?"]=1,
},
[25291]={ -- Librarian Garren
  ["What can I do for you, $r?"]=1,
},
[25314]={ -- Archmage Berinand
  ["Greetings! Do you need something?"]=1,
},
[25319]={ -- Kalecgos
  ["Anveena's sacrifice has given us all a new hope for the future."]=1,
},
[25326]={ -- Overlord Bor'gorok
  ["We need to get this outpost ready for the push into Sholazar Basin.$B$BDon't just stand there, $c. Go out and represent the Horde with honor and spilled blood!"]=1,
},
[25335]={ -- Longrunner Proudhoof
  ["It pains me to see my ancestors disturbed from their graves.$B$BWe must strike down the cursed spirit of your Force-Commander Steeljaw, the one who foolishly led his caravan through these sacred grounds."]=1,
},
[25336]={ -- Grunt Ragefist
  ["I have to clean up this mess, but I'll do it without complaint.$B$BYou'll help if you have any Horde pride at all!"]=1,
},
[25339]={ -- Spirit Talker Snarlfang
  ["The spirits speak all around us. Are you listening, $r?"]=1,
},
[25342]={ -- Dead Caravan Guard
  ["Here lies the corpse of one of the Steeljaw's caravan guards."]=1,
},
[25343]={ -- Dead Caravan Worker
  ["Here lies the corpse of one of the Steeljaw's caravan workers."]=1,
},
[25374]={ -- Ortrosh
  ["I am dishonored. I should have died with the farseer at Magmoth.$B$BLeave me to my thoughts."]=1,
},
[25376]={ -- Imperean
  ["The element of air here is restless. Beware... they will not let you pass unharmed."]=1,
},
[25379]={ -- Warden Nork Bloodfrenzy
  ["The actions of these deserters shames us all. A shame so powerful that it must be witnessed to be understood. It is why Ug'thor is here... The boy must learn."]=1,
},
[25381]={ -- Bloodmage Laurith
  ["Be careful around these parts, $r. The natives are ruthless."]=1,
},
[25395]={ -- Private Brau
  ["Dying for one's country is a soldier's duty. But if calling this war folly is treason, then I'm a traitor."]=1,
},
[25435]={ -- Karuk
  ["I am sworn by tuskarr law to avenge my kin... these murderers burned Pal'ea to the ground."]=1,
},
[25450]={ -- Veehja
  ["Riplash will never return to its former glory, but these boat-riding scum will pay for their deeds - I swear it!"]=1,
},
[25459]={ -- Yanni
  ["We've lost a good many of our wind riders on scouting missions to the west. The Scourge is ruthless in their assault against any would-be spies.$B$BFortunately, I've come up with a solution that only risks the life of the rider. It's seen a 30% survival rate to those being ferried across the Plains of Nasam. That's a 30% improvement over when we were using wind riders!"]=1,
},
[25475]={ -- Mobu
  ["Both Garrosh's Landing and Pal'ea were wiped out by the mist. We're the only ones crazy enough to stay here, buddy!"]=1,
},
[25476]={ -- Waltor of Pal'ea
  ["What you see here on this coast is not a result of the Scourge. In fact, we believe that the Scourge also fear the mist - which might be why they do not come here.$B$BYou see, the mist is alive, friend. Inside those airy tendrils lies death...$B$BShould you step within its grasp, you will vanish. The mist will take you!$B$BWe have never seen anyone return alive from the mist."]=1,
},
[25477]={ -- Crafty Wobblesprocket
  ["How am I supposed to get anything done with Fizzcrank breathing down my neck and me without all of my stuff?!"]=1,
},
[25503]={ -- Elder Mootoo
  ["Since landing here I have seen horrors that had previously only haunted my darkest nightmares, but nothing could have prepared me for what lies beyond the mist.$B$B<Mootoo nods.>$B$BThrough that fog, not more than a few yards from us, stand the bloodthirsty creatures known as Kvaldir. None have returned from the fog and few that were originally at the landing when the mist rolled in have escaped. The area has since been condemned by Hellscream. Enter at your own risk..."]=1,
},
[25504]={ -- Mootoo the Younger
  ["I... Are you...$B$B<Mootoo shivers.>$B$BAre you here to save me?"]=1,
},
[25580]={ -- Old Man Barlo
  ["Ah, a fellow Fisherman. Are you perhaps in need of a little training? Maybe I can show you a thing or two?"]=1,
},
[25589]={ -- Bonker Togglevolt
  ["You're a sight for sore eyes! I'm too weak to break the links on this rusty ball and chain.$B$BWell, don't just stand there! Get me loose!"]=1,
},
[25590]={ -- Fizzcrank Fullthrottle
  ["I've got my hands full here at the moment, $c.$B$BWhat can I do for you?"]=1,
},
[25602]={ -- Greatmother Taiga
  ["Speak slowly, child, I am new to your strange tongue."]=1,
},
[25604]={ -- Sage Highmesa
  ["Please, keep your voice down, $r. Hamat is old and needs her rest."]=1,
},
[25632]={ -- Vindicator Moorba
  ["All of the barriers blocking you from reaching the Sunwell have been destroyed. Enter the Sunwell and stop Kil'jaeden from entering this world!"]=1,
},
[25638]={ -- Captain Selana
  ["Take advantage of their deactivated Sunblade Protectors. If one of their Sunblade Scouts spot you, I'm sure the elf will try to reactivate a nearby Sunblade Protector. Kill him quickly to prevent this. With the blood elves eliminated, as long as you do not trigger the Protector's proximity sensors you should be able to move past them without a fight. That will save you both time and resources."]=1,
},
[25697]={ -- Luma Skymother
  ["The Twilight Cult seeks to undo everything we fight to preserve. It is our sworn duty to prevent this calamity from coming to pass, $r."]=1,
},
[25702]={ -- Mordle Cogspinner
  ["What? Can't you see that I'm busy here?$B$BYou think this transmatter is going to fix itself?!"]=1,
},
[25705]={ -- Bixie Wrenchshanker
  ["Keep your voice down. We wouldn't want to attract any attention from these beasties!"]=1,
},
[25736]={ -- Supply Master Taz'ishi
  ["Hey dere. You need anythin', you let me know."]=1,
},
[25754]={ -- Earthen Ring Flamecaller
  ["You must survive Ahune's minions while we channel our flames. Do not approach the Frost Lord until we can wither him."]=1,
  ["When Ahune surfaces, will we be ready?"]=2,
},
[25809]={ -- Archdruid Lathorius
  ["Is your cause righteous and your heart true? If so, you are welcome here - among the druids for the ethical and humane treatment of animals. So long as you do not veer down the dark path of depravity and harm the animals that have allowed us to coexist within their world, D.E.H.T.A. will consider you an ally."]=1,
  ["While Nesingwary's advances upon the wildlife of Northrend has been halted, it is only a matter of time before he attempts another incursion. You must remain vigilant, adventurer!$B$BAbove all else, do not give in to whatever temptations may be set before you... The demon will attempt to charm you. When it happens, you must resist!"]=2,
},
[25816]={ -- Sergeant Hammerhill
  ["Arthas thinks a few of his undead bugs are going to send us running back to the Eastern Kingdoms... he's got another thing coming."]=1,
},
[25825]={ -- Medic Hawthorn
  ["I've treated peasants, nobles, merchants' sons and beggars. Allow me to share one piece of wisdom with you - we're all the same when staring death in the face."]=1,
},
[25827]={ -- Tom Hegger
  ["Some of us get to avoid military duty. A good fisherman's always handy... even generals need to eat."]=1,
},
[25828]={ -- Guard Mitchells
  ["My shift's almost over. Can't wait to catch some shut-eye, know what I mean?"]=1,
},
[25841]={ -- Fizzcrank Recon Pilot
  ["This recon pilot did not survive his squadron's crash."]=1,
},
[25883]={ -- Ashenvale Flame Warden
  ["Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame?$b$bRemember: Our festival fires burn in every land with an Alliance settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can.$b$bThe Horde, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them."]=1,
},
[25884]={ -- Ashenvale Flame Keeper
  ["Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame?$b$bRemember: Our festival fires burn in every land with a Horde settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can.$b$bThe Alliance, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them."]=1,
},
[25887]={ -- Arathi Flame Warden
  ["Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame?$b$bRemember: Our festival fires burn in every land with an Alliance settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can.$b$bThe Horde, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them."]=1,
},
