},
[25950]={ -- Shaani
  ["We've done it, adventurer. Mar'nah has learned how to transmute very special gems. And I've learned how to work them."]=1,
},
[25962]={ -- Fire Eater
  ["Behold, the Flames of Summer!"]=1,
  ["Careful, don't get burned!"]=2,
  ["Enjoying the Fire Festival?"]=3,
  ["Welcome! Have you yet honored this land's flame?"]=4,
},
[25967]={ -- Zephyr
  ["This world has been damaged in ways beyond what our eyes can see. Even the passage of time feels different somehow."]=1,
},
[25975]={ -- Master Fire Eater
  ["Behold, the Flames of Summer!"]=1,
  ["Careful, don't get burned!"]=2,
  ["Enjoying the Fire Festival?"]=3,
  ["Welcome! Have you yet honored this land's flame?"]=4,
},
[25991]={ -- Kixi the Shiv
  ["You don't have what it takes to fight in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit, $c. Stop wasting my time."]=1,
  ["All right, $c. You think you have what it takes to make it in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit's arena battlegrounds?"]=2,
},
[25994]={ -- Flame Eater
  ["Behold, the Flames of Summer!"]=1,
  ["Careful, don't get burned!"]=2,
  ["Enjoying the Fire Festival?"]=3,
  ["Welcome! Have you yet honored this land's flame?"]=4,
},
[26007]={ -- Arena Battlemaster
  ["You don't have what it takes to fight in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit, $c. Stop wasting my time."]=1,
  ["All right, $c. You think you have what it takes to make it in the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit's arena battlegrounds?"]=2,
},
[26044]={ -- Durkot Wolfbrother
  ["Greetings, adventurer. I am Durkot Wolfbrother, protector of the pack."]=1,
},
[26083]={ -- Gerald Green
  ["We're miners, farmers and craftsmen - not soldiers. But we'll defend our land with our bare fists if we must."]=1,
},
[26084]={ -- Jeremiah Hawning
  ["The Scourge are everywhere! This is... a nightmare!"]=1,
},
[26085]={ -- Wendy Darren
  ["I'll be damned if these blasted Scourge are going to drive us away! Us settlers gave everything up to start new lives in Northrend.$B$BYou'd better believe we're going to fight tooth and nail."]=1,
},
[26110]={ -- Librarian Serrah
  ["Our food and drink are in short supply. I'm afraid I do not have anything to offer you."]=1,
  ["Thank you for your help, adventurer. These frostberries are literally the fruits of your labor."]=2,
},
[26113]={ -- Master Flame Eater
  ["Behold, the Flames of Summer!"]=1,
  ["Careful, don't get burned!"]=2,
  ["Enjoying the Fire Festival?"]=3,
  ["Welcome! Have you yet honored this land's flame?"]=4,
},
[26117]={ -- Raelorasz
  ["Focus your mind, mortal. This is the front line of a war unlike any you've witnessed.$b$bYou'll need full command of your faculties if you are to be of any use."]=1,
  ["We're making progress, $r, but far too slowly."]=2,
  ["We must succceed! Azeroth's fate lies in the balance...."]=3,
},
[26158]={ -- Mother Tauranook
  ["I'm very busy right now, $r. Please leave me alone."]=1,
},
[26169]={ -- Ataika
  ["Cursed giant-men! If they want a fight, a fight they'll get!"]=1,
},
[26170]={ -- Thassarian
  ["All I ever wished for was to serve my king once again. For humanity, against a common enemy.$B$BInstead, I find that our numbers have been infiltrated by cultist scum.... and all signs point to Naxxanar as the origin of this rot."]=1,
  ["This is where the cultists' orders are coming from. Their leader is bound to show up soon.$B$BLet's not miss this opportunity."]=2,
},
[26179]={ -- Taunka'le Refugee
  ["There is nothing left for us here."]=1,
  ["My family was slaughtered without mercy. Even the young."]=2,
  ["May the Lich King burn in hellfire for what he has called down upon this land."]=3,
  ["We are a people without a home to call our own now."]=4,
  ["The Scourge are a fearless machine set to bring about the end of all life on this world."]=5,
  ["The one that they call Hellscream might be our only hope."]=6,
  ["Only the Horde can save us now."]=7,
},
[26181]={ -- Emissary Brighthoof
  ["It is our duty to protect these taunka and provide them with what little comfort we can offer."]=1,
},
[26184]={ -- Taunka'le Refugee
  ["There is nothing left for us here."]=1,
  ["My family was slaughtered without mercy. Even the young."]=2,
  ["May the Lich King burn in hellfire for what he has called down upon this land."]=3,
  ["We are a people without a home to call our own now."]=4,
  ["The Scourge are a fearless machine set to bring about the end of all life on this world."]=5,
  ["The one that they call Hellscream might be our only hope."]=6,
  ["Only the Horde can save us now."]=7,
},
[26194]={ -- Elder Ko'nani
  ["The land is in great upheaval!$B$BThe Dark One rides forth again with his San'layn, the dragons fight in their great Nexus War, and the vrykul are reawakened.$B$BYour people sail north on your wooden ships to fight them and one another, and we Kalu'ak are caught in the middle.$B$BAnd now some great evil has been done so that the land explodes with the magical power of the world. We must find a safe haven where we will have a chance to survive.$B$BThese two ambassadors make my head hurt... perhaps you can help my people, $r?"]=1,
},
[26206]={ -- Keristrasza
  ["It is truly a pleasure to see you again, adventurer."]=1,
  ["adventurer! I've been wondering how you were. What's kept you?"]=2,
  ["I trust you're taking every precaution....$b$bThis is a dangerous place and I couldn't forgive myself if something were to happen to you."]=3,
  ["We must hurry, adventurer. Malygos' ruinous plans will soon be irreversible."]=4,
  ["In times such as these, dear friends are invaluable.$b$bBe safe, adventurer. As safe as one can be in a place like this...."]=5,
  ["If you hadn't rescued me from that prison I surely would have succumbed by now.$b$bI have not forgotten...."]=6,
  ["When our duty here is behind us, I shall find a way to repay you for my rescue."]=7,
  ["My strength is returning, slowly....$b$bI hope to be able to show you the glory of my true form soon."]=8,
},
[26212]={ -- Captain Gryan Stoutmantle
  ["I left a war once to tend to the troubles back home in Westfall. That seems like a lifetime ago. Thank the Light that the Defias are no longer a threat.$B$BWe're a long way from home up here, but if we don't win this battle, there may not be a Westfall to return to."]=1,
  ["With the Light's blessing and your help, adventurer, the Defias are no longer a threat.$B$BBut we're a long way from Westfall up here, and if we don't win this battle, there may not be a home to return to."]=2,
},
[26213]={ -- Utaik
  ["Kaskala's under attack! We must hold them off until we can escape."]=1,
},
[26218]={ -- Elder Muahit
  ["The Kvaldir are without mercy, adventurer. But I cannot abandon sacred Kaskala. If we don't abandon the spirits, the spirits will not abandon us either."]=1,
},
[26219]={ -- Iruk
  ["This young tuskarr appears to have been slain in combat rather than drowned."]=1,
},
[26221]={ -- Earthen Ring Elder
  ["The Twilight Cult seeks to undo everything we fight to preserve. It is our sworn duty to prevent this calamity from coming to pass, $r."]=1,
},
[26375]={ -- Quartermaster McCarty
  ["Welcome to our camp, $c. You're free to rest here if you'd like."]=1,
},
[26377]={ -- Squire Percy
  ["Hello. Squire Walter and I are responsible for taking care of Old Blanchy here, along with the rest of the mounts."]=1,
},
[26379]={ -- Overlord Agmar
  ["It is from this throne that I issue the command of Hellscream. His word is life and his word is death."]=1,
},
[26415]={ -- Senior Sergeant Juktok
  ["We will crush Arthas! The Scourge cannot stand up to the might of the Horde!"]=1,
},
[26420]={ -- Gavrock
  ["What brings you out here, little one?"]=1,
},
[26422]={ -- Budd
  ["<Budd holds very still, pretending not to hear you. Looking closely you see a bit of drool drip from under his mask.>"]=1,
  ["<Budd rocks back and forth on his haunches, muttering something that sounds like troll speech.>"]=2,
  ["No time to be talkin', mon. I be needin' to rest now...."]=3,
  ["What be wrong wit you, mon? Ain't ya never seen a troll before?"]=4,
},
[26423]={ -- Drakuru
  ["<Drakuru extends his bleeding hand through the cage and looks at you with anticipation.>"]=1,
  ["Time was when I'd pull yer heart out ya just ta see da look on yer face...."]=2,
  ["Ey, mon!$b$bGood to be seein' ya again... adventurer, right? Yes, yes, of course.$b$bYou and I gunna be real good friends. Drakuru know dese things.$b$b<A grin slowly spreads across the troll's painted face.>"]=3,
},
[26424]={ -- Samir
  ["Welcome to Granite Springs, friend.$b$bIf you manage to catch any of these ice trolls alive, be sure to let me know. We're paying well for 'em."]=1,
},
[26443]={ -- Tariolstrasz
  ["Welcome to Wyrmrest Temple, traveler.$B$BHere the dragonflights confer in peace with one another amidst the bones of their honored ancestors.$B$BAt least, we were peaceful until the Blue Dragonflight launched a surprise attack upon the temple itself.$B$BEnter with our blessing, but know that we will brook no aggression within our walls."]=1,
},
[26471]={ -- Image of Archmage Aethas Sunreaver
  ["Yes? What is it?"]=1,
},
[26473]={ -- Ko'char the Unbreakable
  ["Hello, $r. You are welcome to share this canyon with us as refuge from the dragons. Beware the goblin runt though... his kind cannot be trusted."]=1,
},
[26484]={ -- Hugh Glass
  ["Limpy Joe, it's you. It's really you!"]=1,
},
[26485]={ -- Orphan Matron Twinbreeze
  ["These infants will live. With love and affection they will grow to be strong members of the Horde, and with time the horrible reminders of their shattered lives will fade."]=1,
},
[26499]={ -- Arthas
  ["Are you ready to do whatever must be done to protect Lordaeron?"]=1,
},
[26505]={ -- Doctor Sintar Malefious
  ["What is it? Can't you see that I'm busy?"]=1,
},
[26519]={ -- Prigmon
  ["Oy, mon!$b$bThis not be what it looks like. Well, maybe...$b$bIt be complicated."]=1,
},
[26527]={ -- Chromie
  ["Welcome, adventurer. You've come just in the nick of time."]=1,
  ["What are you doing all the way back here? You need to get back to Stratholme immediately!$B$BShall I teleport you to Stratholme?"]=2,
  ["Go find those hidden plagued grain crates and use your Arcane Disruptor on them!$B$BArthas will then have the evidence he needs to begin the culling of Stratholme."]=3,
},
[26537]={ -- Greeb Ramrocket
  ["Hey there. If you wanna get to Northrend, then The Mighty Wind is the way to go. She'll fly you straight to Warsong Hold in the Borean Tundra."]=1,
},
[26538]={ -- Nargo Screwbore
  ["Heading home, $c? The Mighty Wind will get you there, if home's in Kalimdor. She flies straight from here to Durotar."]=1,
},
[26539]={ -- Meefi Farthrottle
  ["We lost contact with the Cloudkisser somewhere over the Great Sea. We were going for a record, eight-hundred and fifteen flights without refueling! I'm sure they're fine."]=1,
},
[26540]={ -- Drenk Spannerspark
  ["Yo. Lookin' to get back to the Old World? Fly to Tirisfal Glades in style on the Cloudkisser."]=1,
},
[26546]={ -- Ludin Farrow
  ["If you're looking to travel to Northrend, the icebreaker Northspear sails from here to Valgarde in the Howling Fjord."]=1,
},
[26547]={ -- Basil Crowe
  ["The steam-powered Alliance icebreaker Northspear sails from here to Menethil Harbor in the Wetlands, across the sea in the Eastern Kingdoms."]=1,
},
[26548]={ -- Leesha Tannerby
  ["Eager to get to Northrend, are you? The steam-powered Kraken sails from here to Valiance Keep in Borean Tundra."]=1,
},
[26549]={ -- Nelno Copperbeam
  ["Hey there! Miss the Eastern Kingdoms, huh? Well, the Kraken sails back to Stormwind if you're really itching to return. I know I'd enjoy the warmer weather!"]=1,
},
[26556]={ -- Agloolik
  ["The great sea turtle Walker of Waves travels from this dock to Moa'ki Harbor in Dragonblight."]=1,
},
[26557]={ -- Kanosak
  ["Moa'ki Harbor is blessed with two great sea turtles: Walker of Waves and Green Island. They swim between Unu'pe and Kamagua."]=1,
},
[26558]={ -- Nutaaq
  ["Our blessed great sea turtle, Green Island, travels from here to Moa'ki Harbor in Dragonblight."]=1,
},
[26564]={ -- Borus Ironbender
  ["What? You want to train under me, $c? You better be ready to work."]=1,
},
[26581]={ -- Koltira Deathweaver
  ["Leave me be, fool!"]=1,
},
[26588]={ -- Emily
  ["Mr. Floppy and I went for a walk, but then we got lost and I was really scared, cause there were these wolves, you know, and they chased us, but then I saw this tower and Mr. Floppy and I hid here and the wolves finally went away after a while and it was terrible and now we don't know how to get back home."]=1,
  ["I think you should go, $g mister:miss;. You're scaring Mr. Floppy."]=2,
},
[26593]={ -- Serinar
  ["I've played my part in destroying entire civilizations... to have to lower myself to dealing with the wretched Cult of the Damned disgusts me."]=1,
},
[26596]={ -- "Charlie" Northtop
  ["Welcome! If you need a place to rest, I can solve that problem."]=1,
},
[26597]={ -- Toby "Mother Goose" Ironbolt
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[26602]={ -- Kara Thricestar
  ["If you've got somewhere to go, I can get you there."]=1,
},
[26604]={ -- Mack Fearsen
  ["G'day mate! Sit an' have yerself a sip, won't yeh?"]=1,
},
[26618]={ -- Captain Gort
  ["Do your part in keeping the Scourge at bay, soldier! Report all suspicious activity and kill first, ask questions later!"]=1,
},
[26619]={ -- Fizzcrank Paratrooper
  ["Hello there! Fizzcrank's pilots are the best of the best. We stay that way through constant training. That includes parachute training. You never know when you will need to use your chute, but you do know that one day you'll have to use it.$b$bSo what we have here is a teleporter to the top of this spire. Once you get up there, the only way for a real soldier to get back down is with a parachute. We've got another trooper stationed up top ready with the parachutes.$b$bIf you feel like trying it out, $c, I'll clear you for teleporter use. Then just step onto the teleporter."]=1,
},
[26647]={ -- Narf
  ["Huh? What?! Go away."]=1,
},
[26653]={ -- Kilix the Unraveler
  ["Be wary, $r.$b$bThis is no place for the meek."]=1,
},
[26659]={ -- Zort
  ["Impressive, aren't they? These giants would be the perfect fodd... er, allies. This one is their leader, but he continues to refuse to speak with me."]=1,
},
[26660]={ -- Xink
  ["There's money to be made! Just like pops always said - no better time for raking in the cash than a time of war."]=1,
},
[26661]={ -- Zivlix
  ["If I can make a new war machine, I know I can get a pretty penny for it over at the Wrath Gate. $B$BSome of our previous iterations haven't been entirely... stable, but my flying machine should do the trick if I can just develop an effective bomb system for it."]=1,
},
[26666]={ -- Scout Vor'takh
  ["With the help of our new taunka allies, the Northrend will belong to the Horde."]=1,
},
[26673]={ -- Image of Archmage Modera
  ["Greetings, $c.$B$BHow may I help you?"]=1,
},
[26680]={ -- Aiyan Coldwind
  ["As the wind on the plains, you are always welcome here."]=1,
},
[26709]={ -- Pahu Frosthoof
  ["Come in out of the cold and rest your weary bones a while. Our hospitality is yours."]=1,
},
[26721]={ -- Halona Stormwhisper
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[26810]={ -- Roanauk Icemist
  ["Thank you for rescuing me, adventurer. I will never forget your courage and determination."]=1,
},
[26814]={ -- Harrison Jones
  ["You'd better get outta here unless you want to find yourself in one of these cages...."]=1,
},
[26853]={ -- Makki Wintergale
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[26854]={ -- Earthwarden Grife
  ["Mark my words, these forsaken fools will be the death of us all!"]=1,
  ["If you ask me, and you DID, I think we should kill all of the apothecaries before it's too late!"]=2,
  ["The Horde is about honor and war. I am certain that there is nothing honorable about what these apothecaries are doing."]=3,
  ["I'm keeping an eye on the forsaken idiots down there. You can never be too cautious around them!"]=4,
  ["If you have dealings with the doctor over there, be cautious. Whatever they're up to, it's unnatural."]=5,
},
[26859]={ -- Rokhan
  ["Mon, da west wastes of dis place be full o' baddies. Stay away from dis here area if ya want to live!"]=1,
},
[26860]={ -- Conqueror Krenna
  ["Do not think for a second that your past accomplishments entitle you to anything, adventurer. They don't.$B$BIf you want my respect you're going to have to earn it. This means following my orders without question and fulfilling them... without exceptions."]=1,
},
[26868]={ -- Provisioner Lorkran
  ["Some supplies for the road? Perhaps a refreshment to enjoy while you watch the fights?"]=1,
},
[26875]={ -- Lieutenant Dumont
  ["The Alliance has maintained this remote lodge for a while. It's seen some use by our hunters and woodsmen.$B$BWith the war going on, you'd better believe the military is in charge here now, though."]=1,
},
[26876]={ -- Samuel Clearbook
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[26878]={ -- Rodney Wells
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[26883]={ -- Raegar Breakbrow
  ["Welcome to the camp, $c."]=1,
},
[26884]={ -- Harkor
  ["Welcome to me camp, $r.$b$bShe don't look like much, but she's home fer now."]=1,
},
[26898]={ -- Troz
  ["With enough money, I could take over the world..."]=1,
},
[26915]={ -- Ounhulo
  ["How may I serve you?"]=1,
},
[26916]={ -- Mindri Dinkles
  ["How may I help you?"]=1,
},
[26924]={ -- Gan'jo
  ["Finally!$b$bDa $r $c foretold in da prophecies has arrived!"]=1,
},
[26935]={ -- Sasha
  ["These monsters killed my father and kidnapped my sister. They're going to pay for this!"]=1,
},
[26944]={ -- Soulok Stormfury
  ["Welcome to Camp Oneqwah."]=1,
},
[26949]={ -- Torastrasza
  ["Would you like to head back down, $c?$B$BI can see to it that one of these drakes sees you safely to where you need to go."]=1,
},
[26953]={ -- Thomas Kolichio
  ["What do you need?"]=1,
},
[26959]={ -- Booker Kells
  ["How may I help you?"]=1,
},
[26960]={ -- Carter Tiffens
  ["What do you want?"]=1,
},
[26964]={ -- Alexandra McQueen
  ["Is there anything you can pay me to do?"]=1,
},
[26969]={ -- Raenah
  ["What can I be helping you with?"]=1,
},
[26972]={ -- Orn Tenderhoof
  ["What brings you to me?"]=1,
},
[26973]={ -- Warden Jodi Moonsong
  ["Be welcome amongst us, $c."]=1,
},
[26977]={ -- Adelene Sunlance
  ["How may I help you?"]=1,
},
[26978]={ -- Duane
  ["There's no thrill like the thrill of a dragon hunt."]=1,
},
[26979]={ -- Kontokanis
  ["You not a real mon til you killed a dragon... mon."]=1,
},
[26982]={ -- Geba'li
  ["How you be doin' mon?"]=1,
},
[26983]={ -- Aurastrasza
  ["Hello, $r. I'm sorry that you had to see our sacred land for the first time in such a state."]=1,
},
[26985]={ -- Barracks Master Harga
  ["You can sleep in the barracks, if you'd like. Just don't wake my men, or I'll throw you out in the snow myself."]=1,
},
[26995]={ -- Tink Brightbolt
  ["How may I help you?"]=1,
},
[26997]={ -- Alestos
  ["What can I do for you?"]=1,
},
[27001]={ -- Darin Goodstitch
  ["How can I help?"]=1,
},
[27010]={ -- Celidh Aletracker
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[27027]={ -- Mrs. Winterby
  ["Rest your weary bones for a spell."]=1,
},
[27037]={ -- Hidetrader Jun'ik
  ["Hides for the Horde, mon! Only the best for our troops!"]=1,
},
[27040]={ -- Zybarus of Darnassus
  ["Zybarus thanks you from the bottom of his heart, hero. Without you, Zybarus would have died, or worse, Zybarus would have become one of them..."]=1,
},
[27042]={ -- Illusia Lune
  ["We will never forget your bravery, adventurer. You are always welcome in Wintergarde.$B$BWould you like to make this inn your home?"]=1,
},
[27052]={ -- Naohain
  ["I have food, if you are hungry, and you may make use of my tent, should you require rest."]=1,
},
[27056]={ -- Sentinel Sweetspring
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[27060]={ -- Courier Lanson
  ["Scourge aberrations... They'll get what's coming to them soon enough."]=1,
},
[27065]={ -- Breka Wolfsister
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[27066]={ -- Jennifer Bell
  ["Welcome to my Inn, weary traveler. What can I do for you?"]=1,
},
[27068]={ -- Matthew Ackerman
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[27069]={ -- Matron Magah
  ["If we are to make these new lands ours then we must have places to rest our battle weary bodies. Lay your axe by the fire and share the stories of your mighty battles."]=1,
},
[27125]={ -- Barracks Master Rhekku
  ["Might not be snowy out there, but the nights here can freeze your nose right off. The bunks are in the back - just don't make a nuisance of yourself."]=1,
},
[27136]={ -- High Commander Halford Wyrmbane
  ["Through the valleys and peaks of Mount Hyjal, across the shifting sands of Silithus, against the Legion's dread armies - we have fought. We are the nameless, faceless, sons and daughters of the Alliance. By the Light and by the might of the Alliance, the first strike belongs to us and the last strike is all that our enemies see.$B$BWe are 7th Legion."]=1,
},
[27148]={ -- Caregiver Iqniq
  ["Come in by the fire and rest, $r. I hope you don't mind the smell of fish."]=1,
  ["<The Tuskarr eyes you suspiciously.>$b$bDo not stay long. You do not understand our people, and I don't want trouble."]=2,
},
[27150]={ -- Trapper Shesh
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[27155]={ -- Commander Lynore Windstryke
  ["We are quickly learning the price of death in this frigid wasteland, adventurer. The Lich King's power extends across every inch of Northrend, permeating into the earth itself! He turns our own fallen people against us.$B$BFrom the sky, risen gryphon riders rain down their vengeful stormhammers as the walking dead assail us on the ground."]=1,
},
[27156]={ -- Highlord Leoric Von Zeldig
  ["Thel'zan needs to die, if only to stop the incessant yammering!"]=1,
},
[27159]={ -- Siege Engineer Quarterflash
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[27172]={ -- Chief Plaguebringer Middleton
  ["We will ravage the living... I mean the Scourge, of course."]=1,
},
[27174]={ -- Caregiver Mumik
  ["Come in by the fire and rest, $r. I hope you don't mind the smell of fish."]=1,
  ["<The Tuskarr eyes you suspiciously.>$b$bDo not stay long. You do not understand our people, and I don't want trouble."]=2,
},
[27183]={ -- Trapper Tikaani
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[27187]={ -- Caregiver Poallu
  ["Come in by the fire and rest, $r. I hope you don't mind the smell of fish."]=1,
  ["<The Tuskarr eyes you suspiciously.>$b$bDo not stay long. You do not understand our people, and I don't want trouble."]=2,
},
[27194]={ -- Trapper Saghani
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[27215]={ -- Boxey Boltspinner
  ["My S.T.O.U.T. is more than just a target for throwing steins, it's a valuable training asset. If you can hit S.T.O.U.T. you can probably hit anything!$b$bJust try not to hit me."]=1,
},
[27216]={ -- Bizzle Quicklift
  ["S.T.O.U.T. is more than just a target for throwing steins, it's a valuable training asset. If you can hit S.T.O.U.T. you can probably hit anything!$b$bJust try not to hit me."]=1,
},
[27224]={ -- Forgotten Knight
  ["When we saw that the ships had been burned by those savage beasts our hearts sank. Never have I felt so helpless..."]=1,
  ["Rage. That's how I can sum up my feelings towards this whole mess. We worked our fingers to the bone trying to get through the woods to the shore only to find that we were too late. Our only way home had been destroyed."]=2,
  ["Despite the hardships we've had to go through in this wasteland, I believe that the young prince will see us to victory. I pray each night for his safety."]=3,
},
[27225]={ -- Forgotten Rifleman
  ["Those damned peasants need to work faster! I wanna get back home to Ironforge. I surely do miss my wife and children."]=1,
  ["The cap'n says that as soon as Prince Arthas returns we'll be on our way back to Lordaeron."]=2,
  ["I don't know what could be takin' the young prince so long, but I don't think we can hold out for much longer. The cold is gettin' to some of the soldiers."]=3,
},
[27226]={ -- Forgotten Peasant
  ["Can't you see that I'm busy! We'll never have this base ready in time for the Prince's return!"]=1,
  ["If it weren't for those damned beasts burning our ships, we'd have been home by now. Now leave me alone so I can get back to work!"]=2,
},
[27229]={ -- Forgotten Footman
  ["<Forgotten footman shakes his head.>$B$BWe can't keep this up, friend. If Prince Arthas doesn't return soon we will all perish."]=1,
  ["We'll never get these ships ready in time. The winter comes and with it our doom. I fear that the young prince has damned us all."]=2,
  ["Arthas and Muradin have been gone a long time. I hope they aren't in danger."]=3,
},
[27243]={ -- High Executor Wroth
  ["Don't bother me with trifles!"]=1,
},
[27245]={ -- High Abbot Landgren
  ["Yes, my $g son : daughter;?"]=1,
},
[27255]={ -- Nishera the Garden Keeper
  ["Do watch your step in the garden of Ysera, mortal. Things are not always as they seem."]=1,
},
[27262]={ -- Windseer Grayhorn
  ["The natural beauty of these hills belies a great darkness below. Tread carefully, friend."]=1,
},
[27267]={ -- Quartermaster Bartlett
  ["You need something? Maybe your armor or weapon repaired? Hmm?"]=1,
},
[27274]={ -- Orsonn
  ["The sapling they grew bore a fruit. At first it seemed to work. Ursoc did come back and I was filled with joy for a brief moment.$B$BAs he recovered, it was clear that he wasn't the same. Neither were the furbolg.$B$BWhatever evil caused the ancient druids to tear down Vordrassil manifested itself in the new tree and turned them all into monsters filled with bloodlust.$B$BThe thing that now walks the Grizzly Hills is not my father and it must be put to rest."]=1,
},
[27275]={ -- Kodian
  ["A furbolg named Tur Ragepaw. Not one of ours.$B$BThis one came from the southern lands. He was of the Timbermaw tribe.$B$BHe wanted to see Ursoc. He seemed to think that Vordrassil's taint could be purified and used to save my father.$B$BIt is foolish to entertain such hopes. You will agree when you see the darkness that has afflicted him like I have."]=1,
},
[27277]={ -- Master Woodsman Anderhol
  ["Greetings, $c!$b$bI hope you don't mind a little hard work. We could sure use a hand here."]=1,
},
[27291]={ -- Initiate Mehrtens
  ["Desperate times call for desperate measures, $c."]=1,
},
[27292]={ -- Flamebringer
  ["Thane Torvald Eriksson's temperamental proto-drake is chained up here."]=1,
},
[27295]={ -- Hierophant Thayreen
  ["The wind and trees whisper of unseen troubles. The land appears healthy, but there's more going on here than meets the eye."]=1,
  ["<Thayreen's stare is blank. Cleansing Vordrassil's corruption has taken its toll on the druid.>"]=2,
},
[27317]={ -- Gryphon Commander Urik
  ["The gryphons of the Northrend peaks are the most resilient of the species."]=1,
  ["The gryphon riders are standing 10 paces from us, friend. They'll be giving you a ride to Thorson's Post. Get going!"]=2,
},
[27318]={ -- Cavalier Durkon
  ["The dead rise from our very own crypt!"]=1,
  ["You made it $g lad:lass;! I thought you were a goner for sure!"]=2,
  ["What are you still doing here? Go back to town!"]=3,
},
[27328]={ -- Tur Ragepaw
  ["When I learned about my relatives here in the north, I came to learn more. What I found was warring tribes acting against our very nature.$B$BI have no hope left, $r. Even great Ursoc has been tainted by this cursed place.$B$BI've lost all hope."]=1,
},
[27344]={ -- Adeline Chambers
  ["How may I help you?"]=1,
},
[27347]={ -- Orik Trueheart
  ["The Argent Crusade is here in force, friend. We weren't going to let you have all the glory!"]=1,
},
[27350]={ -- Agent Skully
  ["Keep your voice down, $c. I'm in disguise and spying for Venomspite."]=1,
},
[27376]={ -- Deathguard Schneider
  ["Think you could get me out of here, $c?"]=1,
},
[27378]={ -- Senior Scrivener Kinnedius
  ["Oh good, you're here to rescue me. Now let me out of here!"]=1,
},
[27379]={ -- Engineer Burke
  ["Hey, $g buddy : ma'am;. I've seen you around.$B$BMind getting me out of here?"]=1,
},
[27381]={ -- Chancellor Amai
  ["I don't know what happened. I had just arrived at Venomspite and then all of a sudden I woke up in this cage!$B$BAre you here to rescue me?"]=1,
},
[27385]={ -- Ronald Anderson
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[27388]={ -- Sergeant Nazgrim
  ["Krenna must doubt my abilities. While our elite warriors march out to face the Alliance and their trapper allies, or wreak havoc among the trolls, I've been assigned to mop up those pesky Dragonflayer vrykul.$B$BPerhaps if we combine our efforts, we can both prove ourselves in the conqueror's sight."]=1,
},
[27391]={ -- Woodsman Drake
  ["Welcome to Amberpine Lodge, $c."]=1,
},
[27398]={ -- Gilbarta Grandhammer
  ["You know of the Spirits of Competition, yes?$B$BEvery two years they draw close to the mortal realm. During such times, members of both the Alliance and Horde wear Competitor's Tabards into the Battlegrounds to honor the spirits, seeking to defeat one another and earn their favor.$B$BI stockpile souvenirs from such turbulent times. If you've learned the proper word, I might be convinced to part with one..."]=1,
},
[27414]={ -- Gordun
  ["'Ello, $c!$b$bYa ready ta head on down to Venture Bay and crack some Horde skulls?"]=1,
},
[27425]={ -- Darrok
  ["Greetings, $c.$b$bYou want Darrok to send you to Venture Bay?"]=1,
},
[27489]={ -- Ray'ma
  ["It's great bein' a member of da 'Brew of the Month' club."]=1,
  ["Hey, I see ya got some Brewfest tokens. If ya want, I still got a few Brewfest goods to sell."]=2,
},
[27495]={ -- Barblefink
  ["Howdy, $r!$b$bIf you're lookin' for a shredder to ride, you'll need to head on up into the hills.$b$bThis one's out of commission."]=1,
},
[27565]={ -- Gurtor
  ["Listen, $r.$b$bIf you're lookin' for a shredder to ride, you'll need to head up into the hills just north there.$b$bThis one's out of commission."]=1,
},
[27575]={ -- Lord Devrestrasz
  ["Queen Alexstrasza has placed me in charge of the defense of Wyrmrest Temple.$B$BAs you know, Malygos had his forces destroy a nearby ley line anchor. The forces of the dragonflight then redirected that power to the Azure Dragonshrine.$B$BThe blue dragons are using that power to strengthen themselves; so much so that they dare attack the temple itself! They're starting to win.$B$BAre you here to help us, $r?"]=1,
},
[27628]={ -- Bubb Lazarr
  ["Hey, $c, did you see that? Out there, lingering near the water's surface....$b$bYou saw it too didn't ya?"]=1,
},
[27629]={ -- Wyrmrest Defender
  ["Very well, let's go!"]=1,
},
[27657]={ -- Verdisa
  ["Belgaristrasz speaks the truth; the situation is grave indeed. I can grant you the power to call upon a drake from the green flight. Speak to Belgaristrasz or Eternos if you prefer to draw on the power of the red or the bronze."]=1,
  ["The green flight is in your debt."]=2,
  ["Belgaristrasz speaks the truth; the situation is grave indeed. The full power of your drakes has been unlocked. Use their power to defeat Eregos!"]=3,
},
[27658]={ -- Belgaristrasz
  ["Malygos' most powerful agents protect the rings above. Alone, you cannot hope to defeat them. We can grant you power to call upon drakes from our dragon flights. Mounted on the back of a drake, you will be able to fly here in the Oculus and command powerful dragon magic."]=1,
},
[27659]={ -- Eternos
  ["Belgaristrasz speaks the truth; time is running out! I can grant you the power to call upon a drake from the bronze flight. Speak to Belgaristrasz or Verdisa if you prefer to draw on the power of the red or the green."]=1,
  ["The bronze flight is in your debt."]=2,
  ["Belgaristrasz speaks the truth; time is running out! The full power of your drakes has been unlocked. Use their power to defeat Eregos!"]=3,
},
[27703]={ -- Ysuria
  ["Sinu a'manore. If you seek to learn how to conjure a portal to Theramore, I can show you."]=1,
},
[27704]={ -- Horace Alder
  ["Hrm? Oh. Pardon me if I seem distracted; I fear for the men of Northwatch. I should have sent some of my students to aid them. Now, how may I help you?"]=1,
  ["Hrm? Oh. Pardon me if I seem distracted; I fear for the men of Northwatch. I should have sent some of my students to aid them..."]=2,
},
[27705]={ -- Lorrin Foxfire
  ["Most of my brethren are disdainful of the Horde's 'barbaric' ways, and I once counted myself among them. When I was first ordered to this somewhat humid and... fragrant place, I cursed my lot in life.$b$bDuring my studies, however, I grew to appreciate my surroundings. It has a certain charm, don't you think?$b$bAh, and my studies, of course, were to allow other mages to return here with a spell. Shall I teach you?"]=1,
  ["Most of my brethren are disdainful of the Horde's 'barbaric' ways, and I once counted myself among them. When I was first ordered to this somewhat humid and... fragrant place, I cursed my lot in life.$b$bDuring my studies, however, I grew to appreciate my surroundings. It has a certain charm, don't you think?$b$b...you wouldn't be interested in my studies, of course, not being a mage yourself."]=2,
},
[27765]={ -- Nalice
  ["Does being in the presence of a Black Dragon make you nervous?$B$BGood. It should. It makes these dragons nervous too. They cling to their ancient virtues though - they wouldn't dare attack me here.$B$BFools."]=1,
},
[27784]={ -- Commander Eligor Dawnbringer
  ["<The commander stops his lesson and turns, his eyes appraising you, sizing you up.>$B$BI have use for one such as yourself, $c."]=1,
  ["Yes, $c, what is it?"]=2,
  ["It's good to see you again, adventurer.$B$BCome for a refresher in Scourge tactics?"]=3,
},
[27801]={ -- Avatar of Freya
  ["The Scourge are a blemish upon these pristine lands. By the might of my creators, I will crush every last one of their decrepit bones under my heel."]=1,
},
[27803]={ -- Lauriel Trueblade
  ["I don't think we can afford to pass an opportunity to ingratiate ourselves with the red flight. With the battles ahead, having them as allies would be invaluable."]=1,
},
[27804]={ -- Golluck Rockfist
  ["In years past, the warlock Nekros Skullcrusher abused a powerful artifact to enslave Alexstrasza and much of the red dragonflight. Zuluhed and Nekros are dead, but the debt we owe to the reds is far from repaid."]=1,
},
[27806]={ -- Brew Vendor
  ["I'm sorry, our brews are exclusive to members of the 'Brew of the Month Club.'"]=1,
},
[27810]={ -- Brew Vendor
  ["I'm sorry, our brews are exclusive to members of the 'Brew of the Month Club.'"]=1,
},
[27811]={ -- Brew Vendor
  ["I'm sorry, our brews are exclusive to members of the 'Brew of the Month Club.'"]=1,
},
[27812]={ -- Brew Vendor
  ["I'm sorry, our brews are exclusive to members of the 'Brew of the Month Club.'"]=1,
},
[27813]={ -- Brew Vendor
  ["I'm sorry, our brews are exclusive to members of the 'Brew of the Month Club.'"]=1,
},
[27814]={ -- Brew Vendor
  ["I'm sorry, our brews are exclusive to members of the 'Brew of the Month Club.'"]=1,
