[27818]={ -- Brew Vendor
  ["I'm sorry, our brews are exclusive to members of the 'Brew of the Month Club.'"]=1,
},
[27819]={ -- Brew Vendor
  ["I'm sorry, our brews are exclusive to members of the 'Brew of the Month Club.'"]=1,
},
[27820]={ -- Brew Vendor
  ["I'm sorry, our brews are exclusive to members of the 'Brew of the Month Club.'"]=1,
},
[27846]={ -- Junior Apothecary Lawrence
  ["Blight, Blight, Blight... that's all I hear about around here. I miss the diversity!$b$bHere, here. You have pets, yes? Of course you do. Of course. Little pets. I have a mixture for them. It will make them ca-- ah, clever and strong creatures, yes. Yes. Strong.$b$bTry it!"]=1,
},
[27856]={ -- Chromie
  ["adventurer, good to see you!$B$BOr is this the first time that we've met?$B$BI'm in so many places and times right now, I sometimes have a hard time keeping track of all of it."]=1,
},
[27914]={ -- Ethereal Soul-Trader
  ["How may this one help you, $gsir:madame;?"]=1,
},
[27915]={ -- Chromie
  ["Good work! Arthas now knows about the plagued grain in Stratholme, and is about to begin the culling.$B$BSomething is still not quite right, though. I sense a foreign presence in this timeline besides us, and that must mean the Infinite Dragonflight are here somewhere."]=1,
  ["You should be sticking close to Arthas right now!"]=2,
},
[27928]={ -- Siouxsie the Banshee
  ["I no longer train Death Knights, having grown weary of cretinous Initiates and their constant questions.$B$BNow begone."]=1,
},
[27930]={ -- Emilune Winterwind
  ["Elune watch over you, $r."]=1,
},
[27933]={ -- Alanya
  ["This is the only way Harry will even talk to me! I have to keep this stupid mask on all the time..."]=1,
},
[27948]={ -- Risera
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[27950]={ -- Demestrasz
  ["You are welcome in Wyrmrest Temple, $r. Forgive the commotion outside; with Malygos' recent acts, we have found ourselves besieged. You may still rest here under our protection should you need it."]=1,
},
[27990]={ -- Krasus
  ["<The queen's consort nods in acknowledgment of your presence.>"]=1,
},
[28016]={ -- Drakuru
  ["Ponder on da thing you have witnessed this day, adventurer.$b$bDa future already be written. Only thing to decide be your part in it, mon."]=1,
},
[28027]={ -- High-Oracle Soo-say
  ["This the Great Rain Stone. We keep it safe and bring it shinies and it take care of us.$B$BHave more shinies for stone maybe?"]=1,
},
[28030]={ -- Quetz'lun's Spirit
  ["Do you like the new home that I've carved out for my so-called worshippers?$B$BIn the throes of my death, I cursed them all and dragged them along with me into this special underworld of my own creation.$B$BI think that I shall delight in their eternal torment, but what I really want is to exact revenge upon my former prophet!"]=1,
},
[28032]={ -- Debaar
  ["Why is everyone looking at me as if I crashed the ship?"]=1,
},
[28033]={ -- Weslex Quickwrench
  ["I call 'er the Spirit of Gnomeregan. Isn't she a beaut? Without your help, she'd've never been restored."]=1,
  ["My poor flying machine. She didn't survive the crash and without spare parts, I'll never get 'er up and running again!"]=2,
},
[28038]={ -- Purser Boulian
  ["This isn't quite what I signed up for, but hey... at least it's warm here."]=1,
},
[28039]={ -- Commander Kunz
  ["Welcome to Argent Stand, $c.$b$bMake yourself at home, but don't get too comfortable. We're not out of the woods yet - far from it.$b$bIf we're going to make it out of here in one piece, everyone's going to have to do their share... including you."]=1,
},
[28041]={ -- Argent Soldier
  ["Thank the Light for you!"]=1,
  ["Hey there, $c. We're in the middle of a battle here."]=2,
  ["What are you doing out here?"]=3,
  ["Aren't you adventurer? I'd heard you were dead."]=4,
  ["Make it quick... the fighting here is grim. I need to stay sharp."]=5,
  ["You a new recruit? That's not standard issue armor."]=6,
  ["You have a message for me?"]=7,
},
[28042]={ -- Captain Brandon
  ["Little hairier out here than you expected, $r?$b$bCan't say I'm surprised. I hear that from most everyone who makes it this far."]=1,
},
[28044]={ -- Captain Rupert
  ["Truly, the horrors here surpass those we've endured in the Plaguelands.$b$bThe Scourge are more powerful now than ever before."]=1,
},
[28045]={ -- Captain Arnath
  ["This post is secure, $r.$b$bThe enemy has been cleared from the area for some time now."]=1,
},
[28046]={ -- Korg the Cleaver
  ["What can Korg do for you today?"]=1,
},
[28047]={ -- Hadrius Harlowe
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[28048]={ -- Dread Captain DeMeza
  ["Ye've got some stones comin' up here, $glad:lass;. It's Pirates' Day, ye know... and 'til the sun rises on the morrow, Booty Bay is MINE.$B$BSo! What do ye say? Raise a drink ta me and me crew, and join the celebration?"]=1,
  ["Ahoy! It's Pirates' Day, ye know... and 'til the sun rises on the morrow, Booty Bay is MINE."]=2,
},
[28049]={ -- First Mate Hapana
  ["<Hapana simply grunts and waves you away towards the Dread Captain DeMeza.$B$BBeneath the fur of one massive arm can be seen a tattoo of the word 'MAGATHA' in an arrow-pierced heart.>"]=1,
},
[28050]={ -- Ol' Chumbucket
  ["Tomorrow, the baron gets his town back... but for today - Pirates' Day - it belongs to the Dread Captain DeMeza and her crew. Yarrr!$B$BAnd remember: lookin' the part's only HALF the celebration. Talk like a pirate, $glad:lass;!"]=1,
},
[28051]={ -- Cap'n Slappy
  ["Ahoy, me hearty!$B$BToday's OUR day, ye know... PIRATES' DAY!$B$BOl' Chumbucket and I came up with the idea, and once the Dread Captain heard of it... well, here we are!"]=1,
},
[28056]={ -- Sergeant Stackhammer
  ["We're in a fine mess here."]=1,
},
[28057]={ -- Garmin Herzog
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[28059]={ -- Commander Falstaav
  ["The land is defiled by the presence of the Scourge on one side and the rituals of the Drakkari on the other.$B$BWe stand resolute betwixt the two."]=1,
},
[28060]={ -- Nyuni
  ["SQUAWK! Keelhaul the lad! Keelhaul!"]=1,
  ["SQUAWK! Walk the plank! Walk!"]=2,
  ["SQUAWK! Shiver me timbers! Shiver!"]=3,
  ["SQUAWK! Avast, ye scurvy dogs! Avast!"]=4,
},
[28062]={ -- Hexxer Ubungo
  ["I am Ubungo. I represent the Zandalar tribe.$B$BBad things are afoot, $r. The Drakkari are going to be their own doom with what they're up to.$B$BSome trolls never learn."]=1,
},
[28067]={ -- Dark Iron Brewer
  ["Oh... I'm feeling groggy..."]=1,
  ["Don't bother me, $c! I have two whole cauldrons of bubbling brew here and I must ensure they taste just right! If they don't, then Master Coren Direbrew will flay and boil me!"]=2,
  ["This is getting good! It really warms the stomach! And adventurer, I have to say, you're a sharp dressing $gfellow:lass;!"]=3,
  ["Yes $gsir:ma'am;, this is quite a drink! Quite a drink indeed!"]=4,
  ["Let's sing a song! Brew, brawl, brew, brawl! A Dark Iron's life for me! Hah hah! adventurer, I like you!"]=5,
  ["Now where was I? I, yeah... So I said to her, 'But I need you! I need you!' And she just laughed and slithered away! It's the honest truth, adventurer. Naga can be so cruel!"]=6,
  ["This is good stuff! But it's a little weak. I think I'll add a little more garlic breath to it..."]=7,
  ["This is good stuff! But I think it's a little flat. Let's round it out with a few squishy basilisk eyeballs..."]=8,
  ["Not bad, not bad... But it's missing spice! How about adding scorpid venom? Yes! That'll fix it right up!"]=9,
  ["It's shaping up! But it needs more kick. Yep, you guessed it... Let's wash yesterday's socks in the cauldron... Mmmh, delicious!"]=10,
},
[28070]={ -- Brann Bronzebeard
  ["Well now, I'm surprised to see other adventurers in a place such as this!$B$BNow that you're here, ye can help me get to the Tribunal. If my research theories about these halls is correct, information pertainin' to the creation o' the entire dwarven race lies within."]=1,
},
[28082]={ -- High-Shaman Rakjak
  ["Frenzyheart will take land for own. Big-tongues will leave or we kill them good."]=1,
},
[28090]={ -- Crusade Recruit
  ["I can't take it anymore....$b$bThey kill you, then eat you! And that's if you're lucky!"]=1,
  ["You gotta help me get outta here, $r!$b$bI don't wanna become like them!"]=2,
  ["I haven't been able to eat or sleep since I got here.$b$bI'm just not cut out for the Crusade...."]=3,
  ["<sob> My uncle served in the Argent Dawn.$b$bHow was he able to face these foul things?"]=4,
  ["Every time I close my eyes I see the scourge surrounding me!$b$bI gotta get outta here...."]=5,
  ["I'm going to die here... I just know it."]=6,
  ["Get out of here while you can, $c!$b$bThere's no way we can win...."]=7,
},
[28099]={ -- Corporal Maga
  ["This is a fine mess."]=1,
},
[28106]={ -- Shaman Jakjek
  ["Kartak comes for big-tongue meat. Frenzyheart make sure plenty is ready."]=1,
},
[28107]={ -- Lightningcaller Soo-met
  ["Puppy-men been attacking us for days now. Great Lightning Stone is still safe though.$B$BSoo-holu come to help us like many times before... puppy-men not stand a chance."]=1,
},
[28113]={ -- Mosswalker Victim
  ["The mosswalker looks severely injured."]=1,
},
[28114]={ -- Mistcaller Soo-gan
  ["What I not have in height I make up for in magics. I take care of Great Mist Stone good... most of time anyway.$B$BDumb puppy-men."]=1,
},
[28121]={ -- Jaloot
  ["Hi! How you? We're good... yup, good good. Hi!"]=1,
  ["Ever trip over own feet? We have. Kind of hurt. No do it, not fun. Nope."]=2,
  ["Hello! You're pretty strong and nice and stuff. I like you. Lets stay friends, okay?"]=3,
  ["Want us to help with something? What we help with? We good at helping."]=4,
},
[28122]={ -- Moodle
  ["What are you looking at?"]=1,
  ["Is there a reason we're still standing here?"]=2,
  ["I assume you want something."]=3,
},
[28126]={ -- Don Carlos
  ["Don't mind me. I'm just an old man, waiting on an old... friend."]=1,
},
[28133]={ -- Crusader Jonathan
  ["BOOM!$b$bThat's the last thing I remember..."]=1,
},
[28136]={ -- Crusader Jonathan
  ["Hurry, $g brother : sister;. I'm leaking here...."]=1,
},
[28138]={ -- Elder Harkek
  ["Frenzyheart can be vicious, but we good people. You see if you stay long, we friends with smart and strong just fine.$B$BWe just don't like dumb."]=1,
},
[28141]={ -- Crusader Lamoof
  ["<sigh>...$b$bA little help here, perhaps?"]=1,
},
[28142]={ -- Crusader Lamoof
  ["<sigh>... Do you think we could move out, $c?$b$bI'm losing fluid fast!"]=1,
},
[28143]={ -- Crusader Josephine
  ["Ohhh, the pain is... overwhelming...."]=1,
},
[28148]={ -- Crusader Josephine
  ["Hurry, $r.$b$bTime is running out for me."]=1,
},
[28160]={ -- Archmage Pentarus
  ["Welcome to Dalaran, $c."]=1,
},
[28175]={ -- Crusade Commander Korfax
  ["This is a fine mess we've gotten ourselves into. We're overdue to join up with our forces in Icecrown and now we're entangled in this debacle, stuck between the Scourge and the Drakkari.$B$BI told the highlord it was a mistake to come here.$B$BSee what you can do to help out there."]=1,
},
[28176]={ -- Rimblat Earthshatter
  ["Can you hear it, $c? The elements cry out that this land is almost dead. The Drakkari are stealing the power of their gods by killing them just to defend themselves against the Scourge.$B$BThey are short-sighted and will be their own undoing in the end."]=1,
},
[28177]={ -- Rayne
  ["After the Plaguelands and the Battle for Light's Hope Chapel, I didn't think that we would witness anything more horrible.$B$BI was wrong."]=1,
},
[28178]={ -- Avenger Metz
  ["I'm far too busy to be playing 'guess the smell' with you, $r. State your business or get out of my sight!"]=1,
},
[28204]={ -- Apprentice Pestlepot
  ["What are you looking down at?$B$BI'll have you know that the Pestlepots are a storied family with a long tradition of pestling.$B$BYes, that's a word!$B$BThere are no finer alchemists in all of Azeroth, or anywhere else for that matter, I can assure you!$B$BI may carry the title of apprentice at the moment, but my skill is second to none! One must endure such humilities though to get places in life.$B$BOf course, maybe you're just here to help me?$B$B<The diminuitive gnome grins arrogantly.>"]=1,
},
[28205]={ -- Alchemist Finklestein
  ["Greetings, $r.$b$bI'm afraid you must excuse me as I'm terribly busy at the moment."]=1,
  ["Time is of the essence here, adventurer. Are you prepared to be tested?"]=2,
  ["Hurry, $c!$b$bPut the ingredients directly in the pot. Time is of the essence!"]=3,
},
[28209]={ -- Mizli Crankwheel
  ["Listen, you tell Schweitzer and Roitau that we've got everything under control here. They don't gotta... what? They didn't send you? Then what are you wasting my time for? I've got work to do!"]=1,
},
[28210]={ -- Ognip Blastbolt
  ["Hey, can't you see I'm busy here? You wanna watch the show? The band plays every night at eight."]=1,
},
[28216]={ -- Zepik the Gorloc Hunter
  ["It nice having a good hunting partner."]=1,
},
[28217]={ -- Injured Rainspeaker Oracle
  ["<The Injured Rainspeaker Oracle groans in pain.>"]=1,
},
[28277]={ -- Harry's Bomber
  ["<The engine rumbles loudly.>"]=1,
},
[28283]={ -- Sergeant Moonshard
  ["The last thing that we needed was for the crazy Drakkari trolls to shoot down a Scourge necropolis in our backyard.$B$BHow did they manage to do that?!"]=1,
},
[28284]={ -- Specialist Cogwheel
  ["Ugh, I should never have volunteered to be a specialist. They always ask us to do the impossible!"]=1,
},
[28298]={ -- Captive Crocolisk
  ["<The captive crocolisk lets out a low growl as you approach.>"]=1,
},
[28309]={ -- Sub-Lieutenant Jax
  ["Excellent day for a foray into the field wouldn't you say, $g sir : ma'am;?"]=1,
},
[28315]={ -- Shaman Vekjik
  ["Vekjik no want to be bothered."]=1,
  ["Disgusting big-tongue friend, you no belong here. Go from Frenzyheart land or I call magic stuffs to kill you!"]=2,
},
[28347]={ -- Miles Sidney
  ["Speak quietly and with great care, the wrong word in these parts could get your throat cut. Now, what is it you need from me?"]=1,
},
[28374]={ -- Zootfizzle
  ["This outpost is a cog-free zone. Persons employing cogs in the construction of mechanical devices will be subject to unrelenting mockery."]=1,
},
[28375]={ -- Glrglrglr
  ["Let me out of here, $r!"]=1,
},
[28376]={ -- Dorian Drakestalker
  ["Have you ever seen drakes like the ones around here? Makes for perfect hunting."]=1,
},
[28377]={ -- Prince Valanar
  ["The Scarlet Crusade will serve a new master - in death..."]=1,
},
[28401]={ -- Har'koa
  ["I am forever in your debt, adventurer."]=1,
},
[28406]={ -- Death Knight Initiate
  ["Are you challenging me, $g brother:sister;?"]=1,
},
[28471]={ -- Lady Alistra
  ["It is through the power of the unholy that we command death itself!"]=1,
},
[28472]={ -- Lord Thorval
  ["The blood is life... And as easily as the ebb and flow of blood is controlled, so too is the life of our enemies."]=1,
},
[28474]={ -- Amal'thazad
  ["We are what the cold wind carries. The icy chill of despair... The cold embrace of death..."]=1,
},
[28479]={ -- Witch Doctor Khufu
  ["It saddens all of us to see the Drakkari destroying themselves this way.$B$BThe power that they gain from killing the natural gods of the land is transitory.$B$BWhat is gained in the short run will be lost to them for all eternity."]=1,
},
[28480]={ -- Element-Tamer Dagoda
  ["Zim'Torga is able to provide us with a certain level of protection, but she has been greatly weakened by the presence of the Scourge and the actions of the Drakkari.$B$BIt falls to me and Ahunae to see to the rest of our defenses."]=1,
},
[28484]={ -- Scalper Ahunae
  ["Ahunae's axe will be the end of the Drakkari.$B$BYou be takin' care of any that get past my axe!"]=1,
},
[28500]={ -- Master Siegesmith Corvus
  ["What is it that you need from Corvus?"]=1,
},
[28503]={ -- Overlord Drakuru
  ["Soon, adventurer!$b$bSoon ya be tastin' true power. Soon ya be rewarded for your dedication and service."]=1,
  ["Ya be on da path, mortal....$b$bEndure, and ya be gettin' great power!"]=2,
  ["Another supplicant seeking the favors of da Lich King?$b$bOnly da worthy be obtainin' da dark gifts...."]=3,
  ["adventurer! I've been awaiting your return. What be takin' ya so long, mon?$b$bIt be time to complete da conversion of da Blightbloods.$b$bJoin me and witness the creation of our army!"]=4,
},
[28518]={ -- Stefan Vadu
  ["None know the Scourge better than we death knights.$b$bBelieve me, $r, there's nothing more effective than fighting fire with fire...."]=1,
  ["Take it easy on old Nass. He's not as young and resilient as he once was."]=2,
},
[28527]={ -- Chronicler To'kini
  ["Though my compatriots would have you take an active role in what is transpiring in Zul'Drak, we Zandalari are primarily here to witness what is occurring and to chronicle the end of an empire."]=1,
},
[28532]={ -- Bloodrose Datura
  ["Move along. Nothing to see here."]=1,
  ["<Bloodrose eyes you curiously.>$b$bI cannot help but wonder what makes you worthy of such attention.$b$bNo offense...."]=2,
},
[28561]={ -- Spirit of Rhunok
  ["The Drakkari are keeping my body close to death up in the altar building. They cannot see my spirit though.$B$BWe must work together to prevent them from getting my power."]=1,
},
[28566]={ -- "Tipsy" McManus
  ["Everything is set up and ready to go."]=1,
},
[28571]={ -- Foreman Wick
  ["You think after doing such good work on Stormwind Harbor I'd get a bit of slack from this dwarf...$B$BI just want to get this statue up the ramp and back in place as fast as possible. But she's got a complaint every step of the way. Her solution to every problem is to blow it up. It feels like I'm working with a gnome or a goblin. But at least they'd be sober.$B$BLook at our work crew, no discipline. You know why? Because she undermines me!$B$BA bad attitude, a lazy crew... This isn't going to be a quick fix at all."]=1,
},
[28572]={ -- Mason Goldgild
  ["That statue's provin' ta be quite the pain. I thought we could lift it up an' outta the water with a crane an' some well timed explosives. But Wick thought we'd be safer an' do less damage by rolling it up this ramp.$B$BNow look at it... We've got it angled all wrong. An' once we get it to the top, then what?$B$BI've gotta bad feeling we're gonna to be here a long time. A real long time..."]=1,
},
[28589]={ -- Gristlegut
  ["Awww... look at da purty lil' gool.$b$bJump, lil' gool! Jump!$b$bHa, ha, ha.... Attsa guud lil' gool."]=1,
},
[28604]={ -- Adventurous Dwarf
  ["Looks like you had the same idea I did. Hunting for fruit, are you?"]=1,
},
[28615]={ -- Baneflight
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[28618]={ -- Danica Saint
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[28621]={ -- Grayson Ironwing
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[28623]={ -- Gurric
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[28624]={ -- Maaka
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[28650]={ -- Nayura
  ["From this dock, The Bravery travels back and forth between Stormwind and Rut'theran Village."]=1,
},
[28653]={ -- Salanar the Horseman
  ["We will take everything from them, death knight."]=1,
},
[28687]={ -- Amisi Azuregaze
  ["Welcome to the Legerdemain Lounge, $c. I do hope you'll enjoy your stay."]=1,
},
[28690]={ -- Tassia Whisperglen
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[28699]={ -- Charles Worth
  ["Good day to you!"]=1,
  ["Since you are a tailor of some skill, I can tell you that I know some special recipes. I know recipes for both the Wispcloak and the Deathchill Cloak."]=2,
},
[28701]={ -- Timothy Jones
  ["What can I do for you?"]=1,
  ["As The Light as my witness, jewels are my business!$b$bWhat can I help you with?"]=2,
},
[28703]={ -- Linzy Blackbolt
  ["Welcome to our shop. We have everything you need... if you need alchemy supplies."]=1,
},
[28705]={ -- Katherine Lee
  ["Welcome to my kitchen! We prepare some of the finest food in Dalaran here."]=1,
},
[28708]={ -- Kizi Copperclip
  ["Welcome, friend, to the barbershop! Come for a cut? A coloring? Something else, perhaps?$B$BWe can groom facial hair, perform piercings, ink night elf tattoos, and even reshape draenei horns and tendrils!$B$BHave a seat and we'll get right to work. You're only a few coins away from a new, more attractive you..."]=1,
  ["Welcome, friend, to the barbershop! Come for a cut? A coloring? Something else, perhaps?$B$BWe can groom facial hair, perform piercings, reshape tusks and horns, and even modify undead features!$B$BHave a seat and we'll get right to work. You're only a few coins away from a new, more attractive you..."]=2,
},
[28742]={ -- Marcia Chase
  ["Hello there! Care to buy some fishing supplies, or perhaps take a lesson or two?"]=1,
},
[28746]={ -- Pilot Vic
  ["Nice day for flying, isn't it?"]=1,
  ["I know an ace when I see one. Thanks again for saving my life!"]=2,
},
[28760]={ -- Hargus the Filthy
  ["Come to buy from Hargus, you have?"]=1,
},
[28771]={ -- Colvin Norrington
  ["I hope the archmage appreciates what I've gone through to uphold Hemet's end of the bargain."]=1,
},
[28774]={ -- Andrew Matthews
  ["Welcome to Dalaran's Guild Registry offices. How may I help you?"]=1,
},
[28776]={ -- Elizabeth Ross
  ["Looking for a tabard?"]=1,
},
[28790]={ -- Fala Softhoof
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[28791]={ -- Marissa Everwatch
  ["Welcome to my inn, weary traveler. What can I do for you?"]=1,
},
[28888]={ -- Captured Drakkari Chieftain
  ["Lemme outta here, mon!"]=1,
  ["You're no Scourge. What you doin' here, mon?"]=2,
  ["Why da Scourge let you walk around in here, mon?"]=3,
  ["I think you be lost, mon...."]=4,
  ["You Scourge not welcome in Zul'Drak!"]=5,
  ["Zul'Drak belongs to da Drakkari, mon. Always will!"]=6,
  ["You Scourge gunna fail here, mon."]=7,
  ["Our people gunna kill every last one o' you Scourge!"]=8,
  ["Get away from me, nasty Scourge!"]=9,
},
[28908]={ -- Salanar the Horseman
  ["Look at what you have done, death knight! You have brought glory to the Scourge!"]=1,
},
[28910]={ -- Baron Rivendare
  ["Crusaders...$B$B<Rivendare shakes his head.>$B$BI am convinced that they are a unique lot amongst the humans. My theory is that they lack higher brain function, unable to logically assess a situation and calculate an outcome. One has only to make mention of the Light to get them frothing and battle ready - at which point they will rush headlong into any engagement with complete disregard for their own well being."]=1,
},
[28914]={ -- Orbaz Bloodbane
  ["We are the chosen ones, adventurer. Death knights of the Scourge, sent to sow the seeds of the master's destruction."]=1,
},
[28919]={ -- Noth the Plaguebringer
  ["It might look like an ordinary pumpkin patch now, but once the plague cauldron is placed it will become a source of disease, rot and plague!"]=1,
  ["It's only a matter of time before the plague overtakes New Avalon."]=2,
},
[28943]={ -- Fineous
  ["Fineous has what you need, friend."]=1,
},
[28956]={ -- Warcaster Fanoraithe
  ["Greetings, mage. Shall I provide you with further insight into the world of magic?"]=1,
  ["Well met, $c. My advice to you is this: As you travel the world, be wary of magic for it will burn the untrained."]=2,
},
[28958]={ -- Jessa Weaver
  ["Greetings, mage. Shall I provide you with further insight into the world of magic?"]=1,
  ["Well met, $c. My advice to you is this: As you travel the world, be wary of magic for it will burn the untrained."]=2,
},
[29006]={ -- Oracle Soo-nee
  ["You have time? Soo-nee teach you good song!"]=1,
},
[29043]={ -- Rejek
  ["One day, Rejek be mighty warrior."]=1,
},
[29093]={ -- Ian Drake
  ["Greetings, $c. I trust that you bring me good news concerning the Worldwide Invitational event? If you are, then surely that means you were given a secret code to tell me. In return for your code I will give you a gift, Tyrael's Hilt.$B$BJust whisper it in my ear when you are ready."]=1,
},
[29095]={ -- Edward Cairn
  ["Greetings, $c. I trust that you bring me good news concerning the Worldwide Invitational event? If you are, then surely that means you were given a secret code to tell me. In return for your code I will give you a gift, Tyrael's Hilt.$B$BJust whisper it in my ear when you are ready."]=1,
},
[29137]={ -- Sergeant Riannah
  ["Look sharp, $r.$b$bIt's life or death out here!"]=1,
},
