[29146]={ -- Vekgar
  ["Hope you take it to big-tongues good. It about time they go away."]=1,
},
[29149]={ -- Oracle Soo-dow
  ["Great battle still going on at Sparktouched Haven.$B$BMaybe you find time to help sometime?"]=1,
},
[29154]={ -- Thargold Ironwing
  ["Greetings, $c! Stormwind Harbor is quite a sight to behold. It's even better seen from the air. How would you like a bird's eye view of the harbor?"]=1,
},
[29156]={ -- Archmage Celindra
  ["I do not believe you possess the mental acuity to grasp the nature of portal magic.$B$BHowever, you can use the crystal behind me to teleport to the ruins below Dalaran in Crystalsong Forest."]=1,
  ["As a mage, you are one of a select group that can conjure a portal to transport you back to this very place. I can teach you if you are ready.$B$BAnd remember that you can always use the crystal behind me to teleport down to the ruins beneath Dalaran in Crystalsong Forest."]=2,
},
[29173]={ -- Highlord Darion Mograine
  ["Here is where I sacrificed everything to free my father. Now I come to destroy it..."]=1,
  ["Here is where I sacrificied everything to free my father. Now I come to destroy it..."]=2,
},
[29194]={ -- Amal'thazad
  ["We are what the cold wind carries. The icy chill of despair... The cold embrace of death..."]=1,
},
[29195]={ -- Lady Alistra
  ["It is through the power of the unholy that we command death itself!"]=1,
},
[29196]={ -- Lord Thorval
  ["Dual Specialization allows you to keep two active Class Specialization, Talent, and Glyph sets and easily switch between them. You also will have separate glyph panes and action bars for each set. Switching between the two sets cannot be done while in combat and will consume your available resources."]=1,
},
[29244]={ -- Jesse Masters
  ["Our storehouses have been depleted. I have nothing to sell until we can get more supplies."]=1,
  ["Because you've managed to replenish some of our supplies I can get back to cooking. Now, what can I do for you?"]=2,
},
[29250]={ -- Tim Street
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[29259]={ -- Spirit Healer
  ["It is not yet your time. I shall aid your journey back to the realm of the living... for a price."]=1,
},
[29287]={ -- Captain Paul Carver
  ["The Assurance has somehow become inundated with bugs and we are unable to set sail to Northrend."]=1,
  ["We were all set to sail into Northrend, but we've noticed a severe number of pests aboard our ship."]=2,
  ["Before we can set sail to Northrend, we've got to eliminate our pest problem aboard the Assurance."]=3,
},
[29319]={ -- Icepaw Bear
  ["The icepaw bear lays here tranquilized."]=1,
},
[29343]={ -- Baron Sliver
  ["We must strike at Jotunheim continuously. Never give them a chance to catch their breath, never a chance to sleep, and never accept surrender!$B$BTirion Fordring with all the might of Ashbringer and the Argent Crusade behind him cannot hope to accomplish what you are doing!$B$BNow, be quick about your business, adventurer. There is too much occurring for idle chit-chat."]=1,
},
[29344]={ -- Lord-Commander Arete
  ["Yes, the Lich King will fall to our might. We will have our final revenge.$B$BBut first, we will see to it that the plague known as the Scarlet Onslaught comes to an end once and for all!"]=1,
},
[29384]={ -- Captive Mechagnome
  ["This unit is busy. Please inquire later."]=1,
  ["Go back to work before the overseer sees us."]=2,
},
[29396]={ -- Setaal Darkmender
  ["Consider all of the suffering that the Scarlets have caused over the years. The torture, the zealotry, the murder.$B$BI won't allow that to continue. Will you?"]=1,
},
[29428]={ -- Ricket
  ["Hello, peach - good to have your company!"]=1,
},
[29430]={ -- Tore Rumblewrench
  ["Hello, peach - good to have your company!"]=1,
},
[29434]={ -- Injured Goblin Miner
  ["Poison... my insides are churning..."]=1,
  ["Let me know when you're ready. I'd prefer sooner than later... what with the slowly dying from poison and all."]=2,
},
[29473]={ -- Gretchen Fizzlespark
  ["Men -- can't live with them, can't live without them. Well, you can... but it's just really boring."]=1,
},
[29478]={ -- Jepetto Joybuzz
  ["Welcome to the Wonderworks!$B$BPlease take your time and browse the shop. We have wonderful toys for people young and old!"]=1,
},
[29480]={ -- Grimwing
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[29481]={ -- Lok'lira the Crone
  ["These mines are a dreadful place. Fortunately, I don't plan on being here long."]=1,
},
[29532]={ -- Ajay Green
  ["Welcome to the Cantrips and Crows Tavern, $r.$B$BWatch your back while you're here, hmmm? Narisa doesn't like scrubbing blood off the floor."]=1,
},
[29551]={ -- Brunnhildar Bearhandler
  ["The Hyldsmeet is sacred. Whoever earns victory is assured a lifetime next to Thorim."]=1,
},
[29579]={ -- Brann Bronzebeard
  ["<Brann looks at you expectantly.>"]=1,
  ["Imagine all the wisdom and knowledge locked away within Ulduar. The very secrets of life could be held there!"]=2,
},
[29583]={ -- Pan'ya
  ["Welcome to my inn, weary traveler. What can I do for you?"]=1,
},
[29592]={ -- Brijana
  ["Icefang has carried me through countless battles.$b$bDon't let her lack of armor fool you. She's the toughest bear I know."]=1,
  ["Do not tarry here, wench!$b$bThere's fighting to be done!"]=2,
  ["We fight for the glory of Brunnhildar!"]=3,
  ["Icefang shows great courage for entering the battlefield unarmored.$b$bPerhaps her example could instill some courage in you, adventurer."]=4,
},
[29611]={ -- King Varian Wrynn
  ["Too long have I been gone, fighting my way across Azeroth to rediscover my past and reclaim my throne. With all the challenges that have tested the Alliance in my absence, it warms my heart to see heroes such as yourself defending our coalition."]=1,
  ["The only reason that you still live is because of my curiosity."]=2,
  ["Twilight's Hammer has infiltrated my city. Left unchecked, they'll rot it to the core. Before we besiege their stronghold in the Highlands, I must be certain that Stormwind is safe from their machinations.$B$BI need more feet on the ground, reliable eyes and ears throughout the city. An experienced $c like yourself would be invaluable.$B$BAre you prepared to help Stormwind's cause?"]=3,
  ["I trust you and my son are getting along? Anduin is anything but shy."]=4,
  ["When Stormwind is secure, we will take this fight to the Highlands."]=5,
  ["What WAS that thing?"]=6,
},
[29631]={ -- Awilo Lon'gomba
  ["What be happening?$B$BYou here to eat, mon? Or maybe to learn cooking from the best, eh?"]=1,
},
[29647]={ -- Gymer
  ["With my freedom comes the vengeance of storm!"]=1,
  ["Listen to what I have to tell you about our enemy before we start. You don't want to be unprepared while we're out smashing Scourge in the field."]=2,
},
[29650]={ -- Archaeologist Andorin
  ["Welcome to the Storm Peaks, $r."]=1,
},
[29657]={ -- High Arcanist Savor
  ["You stand before a master of the Arcane. One would be unwise to challenge me. Many corpses have been left ablaze in my wake."]=1,
},
[29658]={ -- Chelsea Reese
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[29660]={ -- Grand Marauder Sai
  ["My life and spirit has been filled with memories of the insufferable Horde. Times of sorrow, desperation, and sacrifice have come to pass. The rage of battle could never leave my heart!"]=1,
},
[29665]={ -- Pazik "The Pick" Prylock
  ["How is a locksmith supposed to make a living in a world with no locked doors?"]=1,
},
[29667]={ -- Warsong Gulch Portal
  ["This is a portal to the Warsong Gulch battleground."]=1,
},
[29668]={ -- Arathi Basin Portal
  ["This is a portal to the Arathi Basin battleground."]=1,
},
[29669]={ -- Alterac Valley Portal
  ["This is a portal to the Alterac Valley battleground."]=1,
},
[29670]={ -- Eye of the Storm Portal
  ["This is a portal to the Eye of the Storm battleground."]=1,
},
[29671]={ -- Strand of the Ancients Portal
  ["You are not yet strong enough to do battle in the Strand of the Ancients. Return when you have gained more experience."]=1,
  ["We cannot allow the Horde to turn the hidden secrets of the Strand of the Ancients against us. Will you join our brave soldiers there?"]=2,
},
[29672]={ -- Warsong Gulch Portal
  ["This is a portal to the Warsong Gulch battleground."]=1,
},
[29673]={ -- Arathi Basin Portal
  ["This is a portal to the Arathi Basin battleground."]=1,
},
[29674]={ -- Alterac Valley Portal
  ["This is a portal to the Alterac Valley battleground."]=1,
},
[29675]={ -- Eye of the Storm Portal
  ["This is a portal to the Eye of the Storm battleground."]=1,
},
[29676]={ -- Strand of the Ancients Portal
  ["You are not yet strong enough to do battle in the Strand of the Ancients. Return when you have gained more experience."]=1,
},
[29687]={ -- Crusader Lord Lantinga
  ["Look around and let the devastation sink in, $c. Every last troll that lived here is either dead or has fled to the upper levels.$B$BIt gets worse.$B$BIn an act of desperation, the living Drakkari trolls sacrificed their own animal gods so that they could drink from the blood of the gods and gain untold power. While they succeeded in keeping the Scourge at bay with their newfound strength, the results were catastrophic. The ancient empire of Zul'Drak lies in ruin as proof."]=1,
},
[29688]={ -- Engineer Reed
  ["Gerk, Burr, Dargath: all gone... It's just MacKellar and I left out here. I hope you've brought some good news."]=1,
},
[29689]={ -- Crusader MacKellar
  ["We're in over our heads, $r! Watch your back!"]=1,
},
[29690]={ -- Chief Rageclaw
  ["Please to be quiet! Pups asleeping!"]=1,
},
[29712]={ -- Stormwind Harbor Guard
  ["What do you need directions to?"]=1,
},
[29725]={ -- Benik Boltshear
  ["How is a locksmith supposed to make a living in a world with no locked doors?"]=1,
},
[29727]={ -- Glorthal Stiffbeard
  ["Pleased to meet you, $c."]=1,
},
[29728]={ -- Walter Soref
  ["How is a locksmith supposed to make a living in a world with no locked doors?"]=1,
},
[29732]={ -- Fjorlin Frostbrow
  ["Where there are frostborn, there are eagles. They've been our allies for longer than I've walked the land... and I'm not exactly young anymore, $G laddy:lass;."]=1,
},
[29740]={ -- Craga Ironsting
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[29743]={ -- Lagnus
  ["The mountains are rich with history... don't forget to stop and take it all in, $c."]=1,
},
[29744]={ -- Rork Sharpchin
  ["Treasure huntin' and some hearty ale - doesn't get no better than this, $G lad:lass;."]=1,
},
[29778]={ -- Scout Nisstina
  ["When it comes to treasure, never be lookin' sideways at lootin' someone else's junk. Stolen goods be much sweeter, ya? But free is free, no matta how it got that way!"]=1,
  ["I always be up for a nice three-finger discount. Stealin' be all in the wrist... and when that fails ya, then ya stick somethin' sharp in between the ribs, and that's all in the wrist too.$B$BSkilled hands be worth more than a steady paycheck, ya heard?"]=2,
  ["I don't be worryin' 'bout no Lich Kings. Seen a lotta big-shots come and go, dey always messin' somethin' up. It ain't long aftah that when a posse rolls on through and sends dem quick on dey way to da history books. Dis one ain't no different."]=3,
},
[29795]={ -- Koltira Deathweaver
  ["You're wasting time. Go kill the minions of the Lich King, $c!"]=1,
},
[29796]={ -- Gretta the Arbiter
  ["We serve Thorim, sister."]=1,
},
[29799]={ -- Thassarian
  ["How fare your efforts against the Lich King, $c?"]=1,
  ["It is good to see you again, adventurer. How could I ever forget the $g man : woman; who saved my sister's life?"]=2,
},
[29801]={ -- Bouldercrag the Rockshaper
  ["You are welcome here, as a friend and ally of the earthen."]=1,
},
[29804]={ -- Baron Sliver
  ["Do keep out of sight, will you? I'm trying to pretend that I'm still under the Lich King's control!"]=1,
},
[29811]={ -- Frostborn Scout
  ["<The Frostborn Scout attempts to rise to his feet as you approach, but stumbles back to the ground, clenching an obviously painful wound in his side.>"]=1,
},
[29839]={ -- Astrid Bjornrittar
  ["Bears are beautiful creatures. Wild, strong and fierce in battle... much like us, sister."]=1,
},
[29904]={ -- Smilin' Slirk Brassknob
  ["Come in, come in. Just don't sit too close to the stove. It hasn't exploded yet today, but just to be safe I think you should sit elsewhere."]=1,
},
[29906]={ -- Heksi
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[29926]={ -- Gunda Boldhammer
  ["Fill yer tankard and pull up a chair. We've stories to tell and kegs to empty."]=1,
},
[29937]={ -- Moteha Windborn
  ["Boktar thinks this crash an unfortunate event, but I believe we're intended to learn something from it."]=1,
},
[29944]={ -- Peon Gakra
  ["If we are to make these new lands ours then we must have places to rest our battle weary bodies. Lay your axe by the fire and share the stories of your mighty battles."]=1,
},
[29948]={ -- Boarmaster Bragh
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[29959]={ -- Andurg Slatechest
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[29963]={ -- Magorn
  ["Welcome to my inn, weary traveler. What can I do for you?"]=1,
},
[29967]={ -- Udoho Icerunner
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[29971]={ -- Wabada Whiteflower
  ["As the wind on the plains, you are always welcome here."]=1,
},
[29975]={ -- Lok'lira the Crone
  ["Look at them... all they care about is outdoing each other."]=1,
},
[29997]={ -- Iva the Vengeful
  ["Our way is sacred. We will choose death before we abandon Thorim and join the likes of the Lich King."]=1,
},
[30002]={ -- Duke Lankral
  ["The Ebon Blade is indebted to you for your help in taking The Shadow Vault. We are lucky to have you.$B$BWhile the Alliance and the Horde fight each other, doing the Lich King's job for him, we will stay focused on the task at hand.$B$BWhere the Argent Crusade might falter and think twice about how best to crush the enemy, we will have no such moral difficulties.$B$BYou shall be our instrument of vengeance, adventurer."]=1,
},
[30005]={ -- Lodge-Matron Embla
  ["Come, Battle-Sister.$B$BFeast, sleep, so that you may fight with all your strength!"]=1,
},
[30007]={ -- Gurgthock
  ["You look like you could make us some money. How about a spin inside the Amphitheater of Anguish, pal?"]=1,
  ["You're the champion now, buddy! Do you think you have what it takes to defend your title?"]=2,
},
[30008]={ -- Kari the Beastmaster
  ["Well met, Battle-Sister. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
},
[30012]={ -- Victorious Challenger
  ["I will tear you limb from limb."]=1,
  ["You don't look so tough."]=2,
  ["You think you have what it takes?"]=3,
},
[30039]={ -- Asgari
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[30051]={ -- Librarian Tiare
  ["How can I help you, child?"]=1,
},
[30056]={ -- Vaelen the Flayed
  ["If there's nothing else that you can do, kill these things!"]=1,
  ["I can take care of myself, adventurer."]=2,
},
[30074]={ -- The Leaper
  ["Mrfrrmrfrmrrr!$B$B<The geist clears his throat.>$B$BYes?"]=1,
},
[30081]={ -- Efrem the Faithful
  ["What are YOU doing here?$B$BJust make sure that you stay out of my way. I didn't leave the Scarlet Onslaught to be distracted by the likes of you!"]=1,
},
[30086]={ -- Sigrid Iceborn
  ["Do not bother me, pest. I am studying the inept fighting of these so-called combatants.$B$BI will best them all, and then I will be elevated to serve the Lich King."]=1,
},
[30104]={ -- Adamman the Trader
  ["I had it all, once. Fame, fortune, a full set of the very best gladiator's gear... and then I threw it all away.$B$BOnce the Cartel caught me rigging fights... trading wins... it was all over.$B$BNow I've got nothing but these rags and a bad liver."]=1,
},
[30105]={ -- King Jokkum
  ["You are permitted to visit our stronghold, little $r.$b$bDo not bring us dishonor!"]=1,
},
[30152]={ -- Bruor Ironbane
  ["The hammers of the earthen stand united behind Bouldercrag. We will oppose Loken's minions to the end."]=1,
},
[30154]={ -- Agnetta Tyrsdottar
  ["This puny green pup was of no use at the mines. No matter, he'll make for suitable warmup for battle."]=1,
},
[30162]={ -- Tinky Wickwhistle
  ["Are you here to prove yourself to the Lich King as well?$B$BIt's kind of archaic, don't you think? Having to fight and survive?"]=1,
  ["Hey, I recognize you! I guess I have you to thanks for me being here. That teleport accident was the best thing that ever happened to me.$B$BIf you find yourself back in Borean Tundra, let my goody two-shoes nerd of a duplicate know that I've moved up in the world quite a bit!"]=2,
},
[30180]={ -- Onu'zun
  ["Onu'zun here to challenge the vrykul and work himself up in the ranks.$B$BThen when Onu'zun fight in Valhalas and win, Onu'zun gonna be workin' for the Lich King!"]=1,
},
[30190]={ -- Attendant Tock
  ["Greetings, adventurer. This is the workshop of Keeper Mimir."]=1,
},
[30217]={ -- Steven Allen
  ["Who are you?$B$BGo away... I'm exhausted from working so hard on the Harbor Road. It's time to drink some dwarven ale, have a good cry, and take a nap."]=1,
},
[30227]={ -- Penumbrius
  ["We discovered these proto-drakes at the Bronze Dragonshrine in the Dragonblight. We knew at once that they were kin - our blood from ages past.$B$BMy apologies, $c. You are probably confused. I am Penumbrius of the bronze dragonflight. I have taken this form out of convenience. It is much easier to communicate and live amongst mortals while in the mortal guise.$B$BHow can I help you?"]=1,
},
[30231]={ -- Radulf Leder
  ["I am sorry $c, but you need to be more powerful before I can allow you to enter Arathi Basin."]=1,
  ["Arathi Basin has been overrun by The Defilers. Will you help us, adventurer?"]=2,
},
[30232]={ -- The Bone Witch
  ["Once, I had a home in the lush woods of Quel'Thalas. Once, I had a family, a husband... children. Once, I was alive and one with the world. The Lich King took all of that away from me in the blink of an eye.$B$BThough I have not the power to strike at him directly, I will pay him back threefold!"]=1,
},
[30247]={ -- Blood Guard Lorga
  ["We've lost a few good people up here already. I'm beginning to doubt that this place is worth our attention."]=1,
},
[30295]={ -- Thorim
  ["For too long I tolerated my brother. It is time to set things right. It is time to destroy him and his followers."]=1,
},
[30304]={ -- Imhadria
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[30322]={ -- Earthen Jormungar Handler
  ["Your jormungar can only move if you've submerged beneath the snow, but it cannot attack while submerged. Once your jormungar emerges, it can use its powerful acid attack to wear through the armor of the Iron Colossus. Be ready to submerge to escape from the Iron Colossus's most devastating attacks."]=1,
},
[30344]={ -- High Captain Justin Bartlett
  ["Lives depend on the actions we take here. Be quick with what you have to say, $c."]=1,
  ["Do you bring news of battle, $r?"]=2,
  ["The best war is a swift war. The same can be said of conversation. What say you $r?"]=3,
},
[30345]={ -- Chief Engineer Boltwrench
  ["Got somethin' that needs tightening, $r?"]=1,
},
[30348]={ -- Elder Sardis
  ["Now is the time when the year is new and the moon shines bright.$B$BIt is our time... when the ancients awake."]=1,
},
[30357]={ -- Elder Beldak
  ["Now is the time when the year is new and the moon shines bright.$B$BIt is our time... when the ancients awake."]=1,
},
