},
[30596]={ -- The Ebon Watcher
  ["What I do for the Argent Crusade now should only be viewed as fulfillment of an obligation. A payment, if you will. The Highlord freed me from the grasp of the Lich King and laid before us all the path to salvation. With that said, it must be understood that our methods differ - greatly. I and the Knights of the Ebon Blade will help the Argent Crusade lay their foundations within Icecrown and then we will part ways. The payment made in full.$B$BA different destiny awaits us."]=1,
  ["There is no question that these crusaders are the source of great discomfort, $g brother:sister;. But what is sacrifice without pain? You were with me at Light's Hope Chapel. You saw many great sacrifices made. We are here now to settle a debt to the Highlord. Payment in full for his sacrifice.$B$BOnce the Argent Crusade has established their foothold inside the walls of Icecrown, we will depart. A different destiny awaits us."]=2,
},
[30611]={ -- Greela "The Grunt" Crankchain
  ["What are you looking for?"]=1,
},
[30630]={ -- Archdruid Lilliandra
  ["It is always a pleasure to meet heroes such as yourself in this forsaken land. Is there some form of assistance that I can offer you?"]=1,
},
[30631]={ -- Darkrider Arly
  ["The Fleshwerks is the heart of the Scourge's ghoul, abomination, and flesh giant production. If we can take it out, the Lich King will be greatly weakened."]=1,
},
[30658]={ -- Lieutenant Sinclari
  ["Is your entire party of adventurers ready to continue? I'll fire off a discharge from this activation crystal to cover the retreat of my guards."]=1,
},
[30671]={ -- Tol'mar
  ["Dis be a dark day in troll history, mon."]=1,
},
[30676]={ -- Chronicler Bah'Kini
  ["It be my duty to record these tragic events for the good of generations to come."]=1,
},
[30677]={ -- Highlord Tirion Fordring
  ["We mustn't lose our focus. The dangers inherent in getting lost in the moment could put us in peril. Alas, the soldiers need a respite from this madness.$B$BBask in the victory, adventurer. If not for you we might have lost the Vanguard."]=1,
},
[30708]={ -- Crusader Olakin Sainrith
  ["The Scourge must be stopped at any cost. We cannot permit them to field the army they're constructing here."]=1,
},
[30718]={ -- Slumbering Mjordin
  ["The vrykul rests peacefully in his magical slumbering."]=1,
},
[30726]={ -- Archivist Betha
  ["Welcome to Dalaran, traveler.$B$BIs there something I might help you find?"]=1,
},
[30824]={ -- Sky-Reaver Korm Blackscar
  ["Make it quick, $c."]=1,
},
[30825]={ -- Chief Engineer Copperclaw
  ["The secret to goblin engineering has nothing to do with keeping things from exploding. It has everything to do with directing the explosions exactly where you want them."]=1,
},
[30871]={ -- Brigg Smallshanks
  ["<hic>$b$bIt be lonely in here without me mateys, $g lad:lass;."]=1,
  ["Yarr! Someone be needin' ta show these bloaks what fer!$b$b<hic>"]=2,
  ["It be time ta kick some arse an' drink double-rum!$b$bAn' I almost be outta double-rum...."]=3,
},
[30944]={ -- Vereth the Cunning
  ["Arthas's weakness is his pride. That weakness only grows as his power does. The Ebon Blade will have its chance to strike at the once-prince - of that I have no doubt."]=1,
},
[30946]={ -- Keritose Bloodblade
  ["I can hardly believe the Cult was so careless as to leave these behind."]=1,
},
[30997]={ -- Chromie
  ["Great job! Arthas is safely on his way to Northrend!"]=1,
},
[31036]={ -- Commander Zanneth
  ["Hail, friend! Have you come to serve the sons of Azeroth in battle?"]=1,
},
[31044]={ -- Highlord Tirion Fordring
  ["The taking of Crusaders' Pinnacle is only the first step in a long and dangerous journey. There is much left to do before we are able to assault Icecrown Citadel.$B$BIt can only be possible with help from you and others like you, hero."]=1,
},
[31051]={ -- Sorceress Kaylana
  ["How may I help you?"]=1,
},
[31078]={ -- Dreadwind
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[31081]={ -- Officer Van Rossem
  ["The Skybreaker patrols Icecrown. You will find no finer ship in all of the realms."]=1,
},
[31084]={ -- Highlord Darion Mograine
  ["<Highlord Darion Mograine nods.>"]=1,
},
[31085]={ -- Sky-Reaver Klum
  ["Orgrim's Hammer is ready to strike in Icecrown. You will find no finer vessel."]=1,
},
[31091]={ -- Commander Dardosh
  ["Lok'tar! Have you come to serve the Horde in battle?"]=1,
},
[31101]={ -- Hoodoo Master Fu'jin
  ["How may I help you?"]=1,
},
[31109]={ -- Senior Demolitionist Legoso
  ["It's a mighty good day, is it not? I do hope we see a few fireworks before this day is through."]=1,
},
[31111]={ -- Night Elf Mohawk
  ["There are some who do not believe in the legendary Night Elf Mohawks.$B$BI pity the fools."]=1,
  ["Well met, fellow Mohawk $GBrother:Sister;."]=2,
  ["The blood trolls are amassing their forces for another attack upon me and my children.$b$bThis time, it is I who will do the killing!$b$bAre you ready?"]=3,
},
[31115]={ -- Quartermaster Vaskess
  ["Whatever you're going to ask for, do it quickly."]=1,
},
[31135]={ -- Geirrvif
  ["You have not yet proven yourself worthy enough to issue a challenge within Valhalas, adventurer.$B$BReturn when you have earned a name for yourself."]=1,
  ["Many have fallen within Valhalas and their corpses are a testament to the strength of our ways.$B$BWill your bones litter this place of honor and battle as well, adventurer?"]=2,
  ["You must defeat Prince Sandoval. It is your only hope for survival, $c."]=3,
  ["Champion adventurer, it is good to see you again.$B$BHave you returned to Valhalas to assist a friend with their challenges?"]=4,
},
[31136]={ -- High Warlord Uro
  ["Only a fool would mock the appearance of my battle-garb.$B$BThis raiment of well-worn steel is from an ancient place of learning!"]=1,
},
[31154]={ -- Gjonner the Merciless
  ["I should kill you where you stand, $r!$B$BGet on with your inane prattling and then begone!"]=1,
},
[31210]={ -- Arthas (1)
  ["Gather your senses quickly, we must press on."]=1,
},
[31238]={ -- Hira Snowdawn
  ["Nice to see you again, adventurer."]=1,
},
[31247]={ -- Roxi Ramrocket
  ["Just because something isn't broke doesn't mean you can't fix it. You lookin' for something, sweety?"]=1,
},
[31259]={ -- Absalan the Pious
  ["The time of judgment is nigh. In your heart, you know justice is the only true path."]=1,
},
[31261]={ -- Brother Keltan
  ["The time of judgment is nigh. In your heart, you know justice is the only true path."]=1,
},
[31273]={ -- Dying Berserker
  ["Uhnhh.... Don't... bother with me.$b$bI am... finished..."]=1,
},
[31304]={ -- Dying Soldier
  ["Uhnhh.... It is too late for me, $g brother:sister;.$b$bI am... finished..."]=1,
  ["Wait, $g brother:m'lady;....$b$bOne last thing..."]=2,
  ["Don't think, $c.$b$bJust... do it...."]=3,
  ["Tell my family...$b$bMy last thoughts were of them..."]=4,
  ["Send me on my way... I beg you..."]=5,
  ["Do it, $c...Then... avenge me!"]=6,
  ["Please, $r...$b$bLeave nothing for the Scourge to raise!"]=7,
},
[31306]={ -- Margrave Dhakar
  ["The Fleshwerks will never again produce soldiers for the Lich King's armies."]=1,
},
[31333]={ -- Alexstrasza the Life-Binder
  ["Only time will tell..."]=1,
},
[31397]={ -- Saronite Mine Slave
  ["The voices are talking to me."]=1,
  ["You have to get out of here before it gets to you, too!"]=2,
  ["It's all around us. It's in my head!"]=3,
  ["The saronite... there's something in it!"]=4,
  ["There's something here. It's in the rocks and the earth!"]=5,
  ["I have to get out of here! Can you get me free?"]=6,
  ["Can you hear it speaking in your mind?"]=7,
},
[31439]={ -- Archmage Timear
  ["I foresee that you will speak with Archmage Lan'dalock, adventurer."]=1,
},
[31557]={ -- Uda the Beast
  ["You! COME! Drink, feast, rest for the next battle.$B$BBut do not fight! Or I will feed you to my wolves."]=1,
},
[31648]={ -- Karen No
  ["The air battle rages close, adventurer. Both we and the Horde send bombers into the Bombardment and the Valley of Lost Hope. Will you enter the fray?"]=1,
},
[31720]={ -- Crewman Shubbscoop
  ["What? I'm busy here."]=1,
  ["On duty. GO. AWAY."]=2,
},
[31723]={ -- Crewman Barrowswizzle
  ["What? I'm busy here."]=1,
  ["On duty. GO. AWAY."]=2,
},
[31724]={ -- Crewman Paltertop
  ["What? I'm busy here."]=1,
  ["On duty. GO. AWAY."]=2,
},
[31737]={ -- Skybreaker Squad Leader
  ["My men are ready. Let's draw some Vrykul blood!"]=1,
},
[31776]={ -- Frazzle Geargrinder
  ["Oh my gosh! Keep your voice down, adventurer! What? Are you trying to get us killed?!$B$BOf course I know who you are! Who in the Alliance doesn't know the name, adventurer?!$B$BSay, what do you think of my jumpbot? She's based off of the mechagnome design. Sleek and aerodynamic!"]=1,
},
[31781]={ -- Blast Thunderbomb
  ["Whoa, whoa, whoa! Keep it down, adventurer. Keep it down!$B$B<Blast looks around.>$B$BWe don't want those frosty vrykul noticing us, now do we?$B$BWhat do you think of my jumpbot? I based it off of the mechagnome. Pretty slick, huh?"]=1,
},
[31808]={ -- Ground Commander Koup
  ["We don't have any easy path before us. If you've got a strong arm on you, stick around until one of my squads is ready to ascend to Ymirheim. They could use all the help they can get."]=1,
},
[31810]={ -- Brann Bronzebeard
  ["<Brann looks at you expectantly.>"]=1,
},
[31823]={ -- Wing Commander Vipore (2)
  ["I can't believe it... I was doing a routine recon mission over the central DMZ when all hell broke loose. I saw the Horde Wing Commander, Mulverick, take out both Ichman and Slidore! Anger took hold of me and I broke from my wing man and drove that show-off, Mulverick, down. Unfortunately, he clipped my gryphon before he crashed, forcing me down as well. I ended up captured by these savages.$B$BI have to get back to base! Help!"]=1,
},
[31841]={ -- Taunka Spirit Guide
  ["How I can guide your path, young one?"]=1,
},
[31842]={ -- Dwarven Spirit Guide
  ["How I can guide your path, young one?"]=1,
},
[31848]={ -- Zidormi
  ["This portal leads to the Caverns of Time, deep beneath the earth in far-off Tanaris.$B$BI possess the power to send you there, should you so desire."]=1,
},
[31923]={ -- Arch Druid Renferal (2)
  ["My faith guides my actions, $r. I know that Ivus will come."]=1,
},
[31960]={ -- Corporal Noreg Stormpike (2)
  ["adventurer, it's good to see veterans like you in the field! I'm sorry to report that our supplies are currently too low to launch any large ground assaults against the Horde.$B$BSpeak with our quartermaster; he has supply missions available."]=1,
},
[31961]={ -- Corporal Teeka Bloodsnarl (2)
  ["Come to learn, eh? Well I just might have some work for you, scrub."]=1,
},
[31965]={ -- Druid of the Grove (2)
  ["We have been sent here from Darnassus to aid the Stormpike in their time of need."]=1,
  ["The Archdruid believes that Ivus the Forest Lord will come once he is made aware of the destructive forces within this valley."]=2,
  ["It is not for us to judge these atrocities. Ivus will pass judgment once he arrives."]=3,
},
[31979]={ -- Frostwolf Envoy (2)
  ["You need to be a stronger $c before you can help us in Alterac Valley."]=1,
  ["Hail, $c. There is a great need and even greater honor and renown to be had in Alterac Valley at this time. Will you join our fight against the Stormpike Guard?"]=2,
  ["Strength and honor, $c. We need eager soldiers like you in Alterac Valley; the territory of the Frostwolves must be defended! Will you return to Azeroth and lend your aid?"]=3,
},
[31991]={ -- Frostwolf Stable Master (2)
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[32032]={ -- Lieutenant Haggerdin (2)
  ["Hail, $r! I am Lieutenant Haggerdin, officer in charge of recruitment for the Stormpike Guard.$B$BAs you gain prestige and notoriety among the Stormpike, return to me and I shall see about upgrading your insignia. Also, should you ever lose your insignia, I am able to supply a replacement."]=1,
},
[32076]={ -- Sergeant Durgen Stormpike (2)
  ["<Sergeant Stormpike salutes.>$B$BName, rank, and serial number, soldier! That's the only bit of information you'll ever give those dirty Frostwolf dogs!"]=1,
},
[32080]={ -- Smith Regzar (2)
  ["Our units are upgraded to Seasoned, but I don't have enough supplies to upgrade them to Veteran."]=1,
},
[32092]={ -- Stormpike Emissary (2)
  ["adventurer, the Stormpike Guard is in need of your aid in the battle against the Frostwolf Clan in Alterac Valley, now more than ever. The opportunities for honor and repute are greater than ever as well! Will you join the battle?"]=1,
},
[32099]={ -- Stormpike Quartermaster (2)
  ["They say an army travels on its stomach, and that's the truth. For any offensive to succeed, your troops have to be well-fed and well supplied."]=1,
},
[32105]={ -- Stormpike Stable Master (2)
  ["The indigenous rams of Alterac are vital to the functionality of our cavalry!"]=1,
},
[32169]={ -- Arcanist Braedin
  ["Greetings, $c.$B$BThe Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress. When the battle is about to begin, talk to me to enter the battle.$B$B"]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c.$B$BThe Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the battle has begun. Hurry to Wintergrasp and support our forces!"]=2,
  ["Greetings, $c.$B$BThe Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the battle has begun! Hurry to Wintergrasp and support our forces!"]=3,
  ["Greetings, $c.$B$BThe Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress. When the battle is about to begin, talk to me to enter the battle.$B$B"]=4,
  ["Greetings, $c.$B$BThe Horde currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the next battle starts soon. Get ready to head to Wintergrasp and support our forces!$B$BThe next battle begins in $4354k."]=5,
  ["Greetings, $c.$B$BThe Alliance currently control Wintergrasp Fortress, but the next battle starts soon. Get ready to head to Wintergrasp and support our forces!$B$BThe next battle begins in $4354k."]=6,
},
