},
[32836]={ -- Noblegarden Vendor
  ["Well met, friend. Enjoying Noblegarden, I hope? Why not join in the fun?"]=1,
},
[32837]={ -- Noblegarden Merchant
  ["Well met, friend. Enjoying Noblegarden, I hope? Why not join in the fun?"]=1,
},
[32911]={ -- Gershala Nightwhisper
  ["<Gershala rolls onto his side to look at you as you approach and you see a hopeful smile creep onto his face.>"]=1,
},
[32963]={ -- Lieutenant Morra Starbreeze
  ["I shouldn't have expected these filthy trolls to stay peaceful forever. There's no place for trust with any sympathizers of the Horde."]=1,
},
[32978]={ -- Tharnariun Treetender
  ["Greetings $R, I am Tharnariun Treetender."]=1,
  ["There are many dangers facing us, but we cannot find ourselves neglecting nature, lest it neglect us in our time of need. We've learned this lesson before."]=2,
},
[32979]={ -- Gorbold Steelhand
  ["A treasure hunter's life is a treacherous one. Don't be foolin' yerself."]=1,
},
[32987]={ -- Corvine Moonrise
  ["On my flight south from Darnassus to seek out Malfurion Stormrage, I came across these injured refugees from the Ruins of Auberdine.$B$BTheir cause is just and I am helping to heal them, but their injuries are numerous, and it will take time.$B$BI trust that you will be willing to lend them your aid as well."]=1,
},
[33001]={ -- Thundris Windweaver
  ["Thundris Windweaver's corpse lays sprawled out here, the apparent victim of the Twilight's Hammer's machinations."]=1,
},
[33031]={ -- Sebastian Bower
  ["I know, I know... 'fishing in a sewer?' But you'd be surprised by what you can catch down here. I've even heard stories of sharks, if you can believe it."]=1,
},
[33033]={ -- Sentinel Elissa Starbreeze
  ["The sentinel's body rests here, the apparent victim of the elemental onslaught that has overtaken the town."]=1,
},
[33037]={ -- Caylais Moonfeather
  ["Far too powerful for these elementals, Caylais and her hippogryphs must have been struck down by something else."]=1,
},
[33072]={ -- Onu
  ["Hum, hrm. A powerful reagent for one so young. You will kill many foes in the name of your Alliance, but it is important to remember that in the great cycle, birth is as powerful as death.$B$B<Onu slowly reaches up to his head and withdraws an inconspicuous acorn. He lowers his arm to you with unhurried calm.>$B$BThis is extremely potent.$B$B...I apologize, I did not wish that to sound like a boast."]=1,
},
[33091]={ -- Malfurion Stormrage
  ["Standing in the way of nature is heresy. Even when nature's force is a destructive one.$B$BThe forces that would destroy Darkshore are not natural, however. I will not let this land be torn asunder."]=1,
},
[33093]={ -- Cerellean Whiteclaw
  ["<As you approach, you hear Cerellean gasp for breath. He looks to stand a chance if rescued soon.>"]=1,
},
[33095]={ -- Shaldyn
  ["<A whisper escapes Shaldyn's throat as you approach.> Help... please."]=1,
},
[33178]={ -- Huntress Sandrya Moonfall
  ["It was folly for them to think us weak amidst recent events. There is no more hope for these trolls - we will end this today."]=1,
},
[33187]={ -- Sentinel Shyela
  ["The forest is crawling with Horde, $c. Be mindful of your surroundings!"]=1,
},
[33210]={ -- Expedition Commander
  ["Welcome, champions! All of our attempts at bringing her down have failed. We could use a hand in bringing her down with these harpoon guns."]=1,
},
[33213]={ -- Hodir
  ["Mortals, I am indebted to you for freeing me from the terrible corruption that besets this place. Though I have not yet recovered fully, I can help you battle Yogg-Saron. I can grant you and your friends the Fortitude of Frost, increasing your damage and reducing damage taken from enemy attacks. Should one of you be about to fall in battle, I can freeze you in a block of ice, protecting you from all damage for a short time. Know that this ability taxes my power, and I must rest after using it."]=1,
},
[33223]={ -- Captain Joseph Holley
  ["Welcome to the tournament, adventurer."]=1,
},
[33224]={ -- Lake Frog
  ["Take it with my gratitude, $c."]=1,
},
[33225]={ -- Marshal Jacob Alerius
  ["Glory to Stormwind and King Wrynn!"]=1,
},
[33235]={ -- Brann Bronzebeard
  ["There are secrets contained within these halls that are beyond our wildest dreams."]=1,
},
[33238]={ -- Argent Squire
  ["What may I do for you, $GSir:Dame;?"]=1,
},
[33239]={ -- Argent Gruntling
  ["Something I can do for you, Boss?"]=1,
},
[33241]={ -- Freya
  ["Mortals, I am indebted to you for freeing me from the terrible corruption that besets this place. Though I have not yet recovered fully, I can help you battle Yogg-Saron. I can grant you and your friends the Resilience of Nature, increasing your damage and increasing healing taken from spells and effects. In addition, I can conjure Sanity Wells that will allow you to recover your Sanity when your grip on reality falters."]=1,
},
[33242]={ -- Thorim
  ["Mortals, I am indebted to you for freeing me from the terrible corruption that besets this place. Though I have not yet recovered fully, I can help you battle Yogg-Saron. I can grant you and your friends the Fury of the Storm, increasing your damage and maximum health. Should you be faced with evil so malevolent that it cannot be destroyed, I can channel all my power into a final Titanic Storm that will destroy even Immortals."]=1,
},
[33244]={ -- Mimiron
  ["Mortals, I am indebted to you for freeing me from the terrible corruption that besets this place. Though I have not yet recovered fully, I can help you battle Yogg-Saron. I can grant you and your friends the Speed of Invention, increasing your damage and movement speed. In addition, I can destabilize the matrices of certain Saronite based life-forms, reducing their attack and casting speeds."]=1,
},
[33260]={ -- Sentinel Aluwyn
  ["It's an honor to have a hero like you among us, adventurer."]=1,
},
[33285]={ -- Sen'jin Valiant
  ["Are you sure you are ready to fight a valiant?"]=1,
  ["It would be unwise to assume that fighting a valiant would be a simple task. Are you sure you are ready?"]=2,
  ["Are you sure you are ready to fight me?"]=3,
  ["You've already bested one of our riders today, so I cannot accept your challenge."]=4,
},
