[33579]={ -- Brann Bronzebeard
  ["It's a good thing you guys showed up! The Iron Dwarves have pushed us back to this location, and we're barely managing to hold the line here. Even worse, they've begun to power up their magical defenses. If we don't attack soon, they'll be able to annihilate us in the blink of an eye! We've managed to rebuild several siege machines, demolishers and motorcycles from the Alliance and Horde expeditions that were here before us. However, all of our pilots died in the last assault. You must take the vehicles and storm the gates of Ulduar! Please, adventurer! You're our last hope!"]=1,
},
[33592]={ -- Jaelyne Evensong
  ["We of Darnassus look forward to competing in the tournament."]=1,
},
[33593]={ -- Colosos
  ["We have come to compete for honor, renown, and the right to fight the Scourge alongside the brothers of the Argent Crusade."]=1,
},
[33624]={ -- Archmage Pentarus
  ["My, my, I never thought I would have the chance to see Ulduar myself. Why, when Brann asked me to help fund this expedition, how could I refuse?!"]=1,
},
[33625]={ -- Arcanist Taelis
  ["The Silver Covenant welcomes you to the tournament. The Argent Crusade has asked us to register and train those interested in competing."]=1,
},
[33629]={ -- Weslex Quickwrench
  ["I never thought we'd escape from that steamy jungle! Now I'm the lead engineer of this expedition."]=1,
},
[33630]={ -- Aelthin
  ["I can instruct you in alchemy. Interested?"]=1,
},
[33631]={ -- Barien
