  ["Are you sure you are ready to fight a champion?"]=1,
  ["It would be unwise to assume that fighting a champion would be a simple task. Are you sure you are ready?"]=2,
  ["Are you sure you are ready to fight me?"]=3,
  ["You've already bested one of our riders today, so I cannot accept your challenge."]=4,
},
[33759]={ -- Eadric the Pure
  ["It is an honor to represent the Argent Crusade in this tournament."]=1,
},
[33788]={ -- Fhyron Shadesong
  ["The wind fiercely cuts across this bluff, and most life has long since fled this corner of Icecrown. However, all it takes is a bit of coaxing for it to return, and that is why I walk these grounds. One day these trees will tower over us all."]=1,
},
[33817]={ -- Justicar Mariel Trueheart
  ["On behalf of the Argent Crusade, I welcome you to the Argent Tournament."]=1,
},
[33854]={ -- Thomas Partridge
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[33956]={ -- Prospector Doren
  ["It's a real honor to be able to aid Brann in exploring ancient Ulduar."]=1,
},
[33970]={ -- Caris Sunlance
  ["Welcome to my inn, weary traveler. What can I do for you?"]=1,
},
[33971]={ -- Jarin Dawnglow
  ["Welcome to my inn, weary traveler. What can I do for you?"]=1,
},
[33972]={ -- Rugan Steelbelly
  ["Well then! A mounted Charge is about more than just kickin' yer mount ta full speed an' hollerin' yer lungs out... though that IS the fun part, heh! But the Charge Target will teach ye the finer points.$B$BA good Charge is all about distance and timing. Ye can't be TOO close, or ye won't get enough speed. But ye can't be too far away either or yer mount will tire! As for timin'...$B$BYe'll want ta make sure the Charge Target doesn't have a layer o' Defend up before ye rush in. If it does, use yer Shield Breaker ta make it vulnerable, and THEN Charge in!$B$BSame goes for the real thing: Try ta drop yer opponent defenses before ye Charge!"]=1,
},
[33973]={ -- Jeran Lockwood
  ["Well met, $c.$B$BI train Aspirants in the art of mounted close combat."]=1,
  ["You must be riding a tournament mount before I can instruct you.$B$BEquip a lance and find a tournament mount outside your faction's pavilion."]=2,
},
[33974]={ -- Valis Windchaser
  ["Well. Another $c, come to learn the ways of the Shield-Breaker...?"]=1,
  ["You must be riding a tournament mount before I can instruct you.$B$BEquip a lance and find a tournament mount outside your faction's pavilion."]=2,
},
[33996]={ -- William Saldean
  ["I was here visiting relatives when Lordaeron fell, and then... well. I suppose I won't ever be returning to Westfall, now.$B$BSometimes I wonder if my family is still alive. More often, though, I wonder why I no longer care."]=1,
},
[34102]={ -- Argent Confessor Paletress
  ["Welcome to our little chapel of the Light. Please, take a seat. Enjoy a respite from the world's ills."]=1,
},
[34103]={ -- Keynira Owlwing
  ["Shhhh - Please don't give away my position when I'm out in the field. Mathas needs to know what's happening out here."]=1,
},
[34122]={ -- Commander Grimfang
  ["Zoram'gar will be a new bastion of power against our enemies under my watch.$B$BGlory to the Horde!"]=1,
},
[34205]={ -- Gary
  ["How do you do? I'm Gary, and I assume Gorbold sent you. If you're here to help, the plan's pretty simple. I've rigged up some decoy bots. We prance the little fellows in near the murlocs and activate their countdown. They'll pulse light and sound to attract the murlocs, and after several seconds, they'll explode, taking the murlocs with them. If we get enough of these in there, we should be able to make our way to the ships' holds again. With less casualties this time hopefully. That part's not for you though, just get to blowing those little fish men up!"]=1,
},
[34210]={ -- Squire Artie
  ["Are you here for the confessor's sermon? Good luck findin' a place to sit..."]=1,
},
[34244]={ -- Jean Pierre Poulain
  ["The Argent Tournament has begun in the northern reaches of Icecrown, $c. If you've yet to find your way there, I can pay your way.$B$BThe more we have participating in the melee, the stronger we'll be when we strike against the Lich King."]=1,
},
[34249]={ -- Sentinel Huntress
  ["Need some help finding your way? I know this place like the back of my hand."]=1,
  ["It saddens me to see the furbolg all corrupted so readily. These used to be our friends."]=2,
  ["This place is infested... we'll need to make our way out of here with the relics as quickly as possible."]=3,
  ["I haven't seen any of the sleeping druids. They must have been taken from here already."]=4,
  ["We should have seen this coming. The corruption has been spreading for quite some time."]=5,
  ["If the furbolg could be this far gone, what does that say for the rest of Teldrassil?"]=6,
  ["There has to be a way to stop this corruption before it consumes us all."]=7,
  ["Damn you, Fandral! What have you gotten us into with this cursed 'World Tree?'"]=8,
},
[34254]={ -- Expedition Commander (1)
  ["Welcome, champions! All of our attempts at bringing her down have failed. We could use a hand in bringing her down with these harpoon guns."]=1,
},
[34289]={ -- The Vortex
  ["Our brother has lost his way. He scorches the ground, he vaporizes the water, and devours too much air.$B$BHelp us to bring him back into balance and harmony."]=1,
},
[34292]={ -- Arctanus
  ["Let us see if we can freeze the enemy where they stand, little $r."]=1,
},
[34301]={ -- Kathrena Winterwisp
  ["While the elements are doing their best to tear Darkshore asunder, I've been struggling to protect the remaining wildlife.$B$BCan I count on your help, $c?"]=1,
  ["I appreciate your help defending the wildlife here. Hopefully we're not too late."]=2,
  ["Thank you for your help, adventurer! These woods may never be safe from the evils that once dwelled here, but I feel better knowing that heroes like you are helping me keep watch."]=3,
},
[34303]={ -- Dagrun Ragehammer
  ["Don't just stand around, $r...$b$bThere's work to be done!"]=1,
},
[34320]={ -- Venomhide Hatchling
  ["<The hatchling looks at you as if trying to determine whether or not you're its mother.>"]=1,
},
[34340]={ -- Archaeologist Groff
  ["This dig here is compromised - the Explorers' League wants us to grab whatever's left of value and clear out. Easily said, not so easily done."]=1,
},
[34342]={ -- Jr. Archaeologist Ferd
  ["Remtravel has been a hero to the archaeology world for nearly 40 years. If he could only remember them, oh, the stories he would tell..."]=1,
},
[34343]={ -- Prospector Remtravel
  ["Abandon the dig? Ridiculous! In my long industrious career, I've never abandoned a site. Not intentionally. Misplaced a few, maybe. Who are you again? What are we doing here?"]=1,
},
[34354]={ -- Huntress Jalin
  ["Your aid is required, adventurer. Help us stop the brutish Horde!"]=1,
},
[34365]={ -- Orphan Matron Aria
  ["The Lich King's cruel reign has inflicted great suffering on all of Northrend's inhabitants, particularly the children. If you are a friend to the Oracles or Frenzyheart Tribe of Sholazar, perhaps you might consider caring for an orphan for a week."]=1,
},
[34383]={ -- Catrina
  ["Can you feel it?$B$BThe spirit world draws close during the Day of the Dead. This is why we decorate the graves of our dearly departed with flowers and candles and offerings: To welcome them back, even if only for a time.$B$BSo come! Dance with me! Let us cherish and honor those we have lost in their ghostly presence, so that they might eat and drink and smile and know that they are loved."]=1,
},
[34392]={ -- Orseus
  ["I have been assisting the flight masters to round up the Hippogryphs that fled their post when the land tore itself apart. Even now our birds remain squeamish."]=1,
},
[34402]={ -- Balren of the Claw
  ["We must not allow an inch to our enemy. If they strike in Darkshore we will fight them back just as if they had attacked Darnassus itself."]=1,
},
[34403]={ -- Felros
  ["Elune guide us, $c."]=1,
},
[34435]={ -- Cheerful Human Spirit
  ["It's good to visit with friends and family again, celebrating and sharing stories of old."]=1,
},
[34476]={ -- Cheerful Forsaken Spirit
  ["It's good to visit with friends and family again, celebrating and sharing stories of old."]=1,
},
[34477]={ -- Cheerful Orc Spirit
  ["It's good to visit with friends and family again, celebrating and sharing stories of old."]=1,
},
[34478]={ -- Cheerful Dwarf Spirit
  ["It's good to visit with friends and family again, celebrating and sharing stories of old."]=1,
},
[34479]={ -- Cheerful Night Elf Spirit
  ["It's good to visit with friends and family again, celebrating and sharing stories of old."]=1,
},
[34480]={ -- Cheerful Tauren Spirit
  ["It's good to visit with friends and family again, celebrating and sharing stories of old."]=1,
},
[34481]={ -- Cheerful Gnome Spirit
  ["It's good to visit with friends and family again, celebrating and sharing stories of old."]=1,
},
[34482]={ -- Cheerful Troll Spirit
  ["It's good to visit with friends and family again, celebrating and sharing stories of old."]=1,
},
[34483]={ -- Cheerful Blood Elf Spirit
  ["It's good to visit with friends and family again, celebrating and sharing stories of old."]=1,
},
[34484]={ -- Cheerful Draenei Spirit
  ["It's good to visit with friends and family again, celebrating and sharing stories of old."]=1,
},
[34526]={ -- Aponi Brightmane
  ["This is awful! I shouldn't be sitting here, useless, when there's so much to be done! If only my arm hadn't gotten injured up in Northrend... No use dwelling on it, though! Tahu will have me patched up and cured eventually, and we'll still help around here in the meantime. Just because we're not at the front doesn't mean we can't help out somehow."]=1,
},
[34528]={ -- Tahu Sagewind
  ["Surely you've been a student once in your life, $c. You learned from an instructor, and you gained respect for them in some way, yes? Maybe not as a person, but at the least, as one who knew more than you and was willing to teach you. If not, use your imagination...$b$bWhat would you do if you came to realize your instructor may not know as much as you thought, and that you may have found a better path?"]=1,
},
[34608]={ -- Big Baobob
  ["Good day to you, $r."]=1,
  ["The savior of the forest! Were it not for your actions, Astranaar and then the rest of Ashenvale surely would have fallen to the Burning Legion.$B$BI hope that this day finds you well, adventurer!"]=2,
},
[34653]={ -- Bountiful Table Hostess
  ["Welcome! Have you come to join us for a Pilgrim's Bounty feast? Please, have a seat at a Bountiful Table.$B$BTry everything! I'm certain you'll find something to your liking."]=1,
},
[34654]={ -- Bountiful Feast Hostess
  ["Welcome! Have you come to join us for a Pilgrim's Bounty feast? Please, have a seat at a Bountiful Table.$B$BTry everything! I'm certain you'll find something to your liking."]=1,
},
[34668]={ -- Sassy Hardwrench
  ["Hey there, boss. I trust that you're enjoying your new promotion?$B$BWe all think that you're the one who's going to finally be able to replace that stinky ol' Gallywix and take the title of Trade $g Prince : Princess;. But you didn't hear that from me!$B$BWe have a lot to do and very little time. Hope you're ready!"]=1,
},
[34673]={ -- Bamm Megabomb
  ["adventurer? $G Sir : Ma'am;, you're not a hunter, you're a $c."]=1,
},
[34689]={ -- Fizz Lighter
  ["Hey there, $g Mr. : Ms.; adventurer. I can't train you in the ways of magic, but all of this finger-waggling means that I can give a mean neck massage."]=1,
},
[34692]={ -- Sister Goldskimmer
  ["You don't have to be a priest to tithe. Your coin is just as welcome, $g sir : ma'am;."]=1,
},
[34693]={ -- Slinky Sharpshiv
  ["You can see me? How can you see me, boss?$B$BI'm going to have to work on that."]=1,
},
[34695]={ -- Maxx Avalanche
  ["You're doing a great job, $g Mr. : Ms.; adventurer. Keep up the good work."]=1,
  ["I see such a bright future for you, my $g boy : girl;! What shall I teach you today?"]=2,
},
[34696]={ -- Evol Fingers
  ["What? adventurer, you're not a warlock.$B$BThere's nothing that I can teach a $c like you, $g sir : ma'am;."]=1,
},
[34697]={ -- Warrior-Matic NX-01
  ["Warrior-Matic NX-01 is currently offline."]=1,
  ["Warrior-Matic NX-01 online.$B$BPlease insert coins for training."]=2,
},
[34708]={ -- Caitrin Ironkettle
  ["Hello, adventurer. If you're looking for cooking training, you've come to the right place. I usually get lots of new students when Pilgrim's Bounty rolls around."]=1,
},
[34710]={ -- Ellen Moore
  ["Hello, adventurer. If you're looking for cooking training, you've come to the right place. I usually get lots of new students when Pilgrim's Bounty rolls around."]=1,
