[35642]={ -- Jeeves
  ["Good day, $gsir:madam;! How may I be of assistance?"]=1,
},
[35646]={ -- Wormhole
  ["This tear in the fabric of time and space looks ominous. Different scenes flash by at terrifying speed. A very brave person might try to jump through at the right time..."]=1,
},
[35650]={ -- Sassy Hardwrench
  ["Marooned! Blasted to bits by the Alliance and stranded on some island in the middle of who-knows-where?!$B$BBusiness as usual, right, adventurer?"]=1,
},
[35661]={ -- Cenarion Embassador Thunk
  ["Greetings, $c.$b$bLook around you. Have you stopped to ponder what all of this means?"]=1,
},
[35758]={ -- Bamm Megabomb
  ["These monkeys are a real pain!"]=1,
},
[35766]={ -- Barrett Ramsey
  ["That warlock certainly didn't summon a Doomguard! Your next challenge will find you fighting knights of the Argent Crusade. Think you're up for the challenge?"]=1,
  ["That fight was savage and brutal. I haven't seen a grand melee like that in many years! Amazing!"]=2,
},
[35769]={ -- Foreman Dampwick
  ["Kaja'mite... you know, the stuff that legend holds helped the entire goblin race to evolve into the ultimate masters of alchemy and engineering?!$B$BIt's the stuff that helped us to overthrow our jungle troll oppressors, to take control of Kezan -- may she rest in peace -- and is the most valuable ore in all of existence!$B$BHey, you don't think that it's having any effect on those monkeys do you?"]=1,
},
[35770]={ -- Barrett Ramsey
  ["You better believe it! You're going to face two of Arthas' most powerful Val'kyr lieutenants!"]=1,
  ["Well I hope you improve quickly!"]=2,
},
[35771]={ -- Barrett Ramsey
  ["The praise is well deserved. Tirion will want to praise you himself, shortly. Hey, have you noticed it getting a bit cold all of a sudden?"]=1,
},
[35778]={ -- Evol Fingers
  ["I can't offer you any training, adventurer, but I sure could use your help against these damn monkeys!"]=1,
},
[35780]={ -- Fizz Lighter
  ["Somehow I doubt that you want training from me, adventurer. I'm not sure those fingers can handle a firebolt."]=1,
},
[35786]={ -- Maxx Avalanche
  ["Can you believe these monkeys, adventurer?"]=1,
},
[35805]={ -- Sister Goldskimmer
  ["We're... er, I mean the Light, is going to need a lot of gold, now more than ever.$B$BSpeaking of which, do you need any training?"]=1,
},
[35806]={ -- Slinky Sharpshiv
  ["I'm surprised that a $c like you could even see me, adventurer. I'm stealth on a stick!"]=1,
},
[35807]={ -- Warrior-Matic NX-01
  ["Warrior-Matic NX-01 is currently offline."]=1,
},
[35870]={ -- Sister Almyra
  ["The Light is with you, $c. No harm will come to you today."]=1,
},
[35871]={ -- Loren the Fence
  ["I swear this wasn't my fault. Why are you looking at me like that?"]=1,
},
[35872]={ -- Myriam Spellwaker
  ["I'd have a hard time teaching you. It takes years of mental preparation to become attuned to the powers of the arcane."]=1,
},
[35893]={ -- Kilag Gorefang
  ["I think that we might have angered them."]=1,
  ["I'm leaving for the next rendezvous point in a few seconds."]=2,
},
[35909]={ -- Barrett Ramsey
  ["Those beasts are amazing specimens. You should feel no shame at being bested by them."]=1,
  ["Welcome, champion! Have you gathered your forces in preparation for the challenges of the Trial of the Grand Crusader? Only the most powerful and accomplished of combatants are able to participate in these trials. To participate in these trials, you must have completed the normal Trial of the Crusader."]=2,
},
[36034]={ -- Karnum Marshweaver
  ["Greetings, friend.$b$bEnjoying the glade, I trust?"]=1,
},
[36056]={ -- Khan Leh'Prah
  ["I have been shown the future, $r.$b$bCentaur lands will be forever corrupted if we fail to act quickly."]=1,
},
[36060]={ -- Botanist Ferrah
  ["Look around you, $c!$b$bIsn't it all just beautiful?"]=1,
},
[36095]={ -- Highlord Tirion Fordring
  ["Now that you have completed the Trial of the Crusader, you should consider returning to take part in the Trial of the Grand Crusader. Only the strongest adventurers can hope to complete the Trial, but you will be rewarded well for your efforts."]=1,
},
[36097]={ -- Argent Mage
  ["Congratulations, please take the portal to Dalaran when you're ready!"]=1,
},
[36115]={ -- Aggra
  ["Do you see the gyrochoppa on the far side of the beach, adventurer?!"]=1,
},
[36117]={ -- Kilag Gorefang
  ["Get the keys and then get to that gyrochoppa!"]=1,
},
[36140]={ -- Prince Liam Greymane
  ["I failed to defend my people in Gilneas City. It seems the fates have given me a second chance, adventurer. I will not fail again!"]=1,
},
[36180]={ -- Ace
  ["adventurer, sit on down. The fire's warm and the monkeys don't seem to like it."]=1,
  ["Who would've thought we'd wind up here after everything we've been through?"]=2,
  ["Hey, look guys, it's adventurer!"]=3,
  ["Looks like we're in a pretty tight jam. Think you can get us out of here?"]=4,
},
[36184]={ -- Izzy
  ["Oh, adventurer, we're marooned!"]=1,
  ["I miss Kezan. Will we ever see Bilgewater Port again, adventurer?"]=2,
  ["Sit with me a while. We can roast crabs over the fire and sing songs."]=3,
  ["I put this all on you, but what are you doing to get us off of this island?"]=4,
},
[36186]={ -- Gobber
  ["<Gobber grunts.>$B$BMe banker now!"]=1,
},
[36213]={ -- Undercity Guardian
  ["What are you looking for?"]=1,
},
[36273]={ -- Bragor Bloodfist
  ["Varimathras? No, he hasn't reported in for some time. No doubt he's off on an errand of importance for his queen."]=1,
},
[36290]={ -- Lord Godfrey
  ["No hard feelings, adventurer. You might be a feral killing machine, but it looks like you're with us for now."]=1,
},
[36296]={ -- Apothecary Hummel
  ["Due to the, ah, 'misunderstanding' in Dragonblight, we've had to relocate our facilities to this decrepit mess of a castle.$B$BStill, we've now plenty of space and time to work on various new and lovely... products..."]=1,
},
[36329]={ -- Thargad
  ["How yeh doin', $glad:lass;?"]=1,
},
[36378]={ -- Dumti
  ["How may I help you?"]=1,
},
[36398]={ -- Khan Leh'Prah
  ["Steady yourself, friend...$b$bThese next hours shall determine the fate of our clans."]=1,
},
[36403]={ -- Trade Prince Gallywix
  ["<The trade prince lowers his voice to barely a whisper.>$B$BDon't think for a moment that I've forgotten how much I despise you, adventurer, rescue or not.$B$BDon't worry your $g simple : pretty; head. I'll get my revenge soon enough, mark my words!$B$BYou'll fare far worse than being my slave. There'll be no escape for you this time."]=1,
},
[36417]={ -- Kilag Gorefang
  ["We owe you a debt that will be hard to repay, adventurer."]=1,
},
[36418]={ -- Aggra
  ["Thank you for freeing Thrall, adventurer. He's been missed.$B$B<Aggra looks over at the Warchief.>"]=1,
},
[36428]={ -- Ace
  ["Hey, $g bro : lady;. Rocket ride! Yeah!"]=1,
},
[36451]={ -- Prince Liam Greymane
  ["I failed to defend my people in Gilneas City. It seems the fates have given me a second chance, adventurer. I will not fail again!"]=1,
},
[36452]={ -- Gwen Armstead
  ["It really is good to see you again, adventurer. Fur and all."]=1,
},
[36456]={ -- Sebastian Hayward
  ["My brothers and I can reach northern Gilneas by boat in a matter of days. As soon as we finish the repairs, that is."]=1,
},
[36463]={ -- Gobber
  ["<Gobber grunts.>$B$BMe banker now!"]=1,
},
[36471]={ -- Foreman Dampwick
  ["This Town-In-A-Box is a remarkable feat of engineering!"]=1,
},
[36479]={ -- Archmage Mordent Evenshade
  ["I suppose I should not be surprised at this cold reception. We have long been in hiding, and the separation from our brethren was necessary.$b$bThat time, however, is done. Whether the residents of this young tree come to accept us or not, the Highborne are returning to light, and we will not turn our backs on what we are."]=1,
},
[36496]={ -- Grimy Greasefingers
  ["Hey there, adventurer. I know, it's not much, but the trade prince's wreck is home for now."]=1,
},
[36517]={ -- Aleric Hawkins
  ["While Varimathras is, uh... away, I've been assigned to assist Captain Bragor in his duties."]=1,
},
[36518]={ -- Bamm Megabomb
  ["Out of the frying pan and into the fire, eh adventurer?"]=1,
},
[36519]={ -- Evol Fingers
  ["I've been patient up to this point, but if they don't get that rocket sling working soon, I'm going to shadow bolt someone!"]=1,
},
[36520]={ -- Fizz Lighter
  ["I saw Dampwick ride across on that thing. I'd rather use a Slow Fall spell, but I don't know that one yet."]=1,
},
[36521]={ -- Maxx Avalanche
  ["Good job, adventurer! Isn't this all very exciting? I wonder what the next island will be like?"]=1,
},
[36523]={ -- Sister Goldskimmer
  ["Sounds like you've had quite the adventure, adventurer. There must have been plenty of moolah on those Alliance creeps.$B$BWant to purchase some training?"]=1,
},
[36524]={ -- Slinky Sharpshiv
  ["Hey there, adventurer. I for one am glad to be away from those damned monkeys!"]=1,
},
[36525]={ -- Warrior-Matic NX-01
  ["Warrior-Matic NX-01 is currently offline."]=1,
},
[36615]={ -- Doc Zapnozzle
  ["adventurer, my $g boy : girl;!$B$BWant me to teach you any of my thermal palms healing techniques?$B$BNo? How about bandages? Do you want to learn about bandages?"]=1,
},
[36631]={ -- Myriam Spellwaker
  ["I'd have a hard time teaching you. It takes years of mental preparation to become attuned to the powers of the arcane."]=1,
},
[36632]={ -- Sister Almyra
  ["The Light is with you, $c. No harm will come to you today."]=1,
},
[36648]={ -- Baine Bloodhoof
  ["Greetings young one, and welcome to Thunder Bluff. You'll find safe refuge from the burdens of the world here. All denizens of the Horde are welcome here.$B$BThe spirits of the present and past come alive here in this sacred place, my friend. Honor them, and in doing so honor yourself."]=1,
},
[36669]={ -- Arcanist Tybalin
  ["Never trust the Sunreavers. They are hard at work undermining us in the eyes of our Argent Crusade allies."]=1,
},
[36670]={ -- Magister Hathorel
  ["What is your business here, $c?"]=1,
},
[36695]={ -- Samantha Buckley
  ["Can I provide you with anything, adventurer?"]=1,
},
[36717]={ -- Gerard Walthorn
  ["Can I interest you in a new weapon, $c?"]=1,
},
[36779]={ -- Marie Allen
  ["Can I provide you with anything, adventurer?"]=1,
},
[36856]={ -- Shandy Glossgleam
  ["Are you surprised to see me here? Everyone needs clean laundry, and what better way to do it than with your own water elemental?$B$BSimply bring your laundry, pay a nominal fee, and before you know it, everything will be fresh and clean!"]=1,
},
[36915]={ -- Erunak Stonespeaker
  ["Brace yourself, $r.$b$bThe naga could attack again any moment."]=1,
  ["This region is one of the epicenters of the cataclysm that threatens to rend our world.$b$bIf we manage to survive, we must try to discover its cause."]=2,
  ["The attacks on these ships, they are clearly not random.$b$bWe must discover the motives of the naga here."]=3,
},
[36939]={ -- High Overlord Saurfang
  ["I have heard tale of my boy being here. That he's now a powerful death knight in service of the Lich King. If this is true, then it must be me that ends the bloodline.$B$BMy charge now is to command Orgrim's Hammer to the top of Icecrown Citadel and destroy all Scourge that get in our way. We leave when you and your allies are ready."]=1,
},
[36948]={ -- Muradin Bronzebeard
  ["The old wounds still linger, $g lad:lass;. I can feel 'em in me bones, even now. Aye, I got a score to settle with Arthas and ye can believe I'm gonna give that boy the beatin' I shoulda given 'im when he was a wee lad. Always knew there was something wrong with 'im.$B$BTell me when yer crew is ready and we'll lift off for the top o' the citadel.$B$BArthas won't be expectin' this!"]=1,
},
[36955]={ -- Lady Jaina Proudmoore
  ["I cannot hold him for long, we must leave at once!"]=1,
},
[36990]={ -- Lady Sylvanas Windrunner
  ["I will delay here until more reinforcements arrive, but you must keep moving. Arthas will soon realize that we're here."]=1,
},
[36993]={ -- Lady Jaina Proudmoore
  ["I will delay here until more reinforcements arrive, but you have to keep moving.$B$BWe won't have much time until Arthas realizes we're here."]=1,
},
[37065]={ -- Prince Liam Greymane
  ["I failed to defend my people in Gilneas City. It seems the fates have given me a second chance, adventurer. I will not fail again!"]=1,
},
[37106]={ -- Coach Crosscheck
  ["No team's ever come back from this far behind!"]=1,
  ["I got a very bad feeling about this, adventurer. I think the smart play now is to get yourself off of the island any way that you can.$B$BI'm going see if I can get into the Trade Prince's Town-In-A-Box."]=2,
},
[37115]={ -- Teo Hammerstorm
  ["The elements are fickle and best left out of untrained hands. My apologies, but I have no need for yours."]=1,
},
[37119]={ -- Highlord Tirion Fordring
  ["This is our final stand. What happens here will echo through the ages. Regardless of outcome, they will know that we fought with honor. That we fought for the freedom and safety of our people.$B$BRemember, hero, fear is your greatest enemy in these befouled halls. Steel your heart and your soul will shine brighter than a thousand suns. The enemy will falter at the sight of you. They will fall as the light of righteousness envelops them!"]=1,
},
[37120]={ -- Highlord Darion Mograine
  ["Ready yourself, $c.$b$bThe time has come for the Lich King's reign to come to an end."]=1,
  ["Where we go from here is unknown, hero. What we do know is that none of this would have been possible without your aid.$B$BThe Knights of the Ebon Blade salute you."]=2,
},
[37121]={ -- Teegli Merrowith
  ["Greetings. Have you come to master matters magical?"]=1,
},
[37135]={ -- Nura Pathfinder
  ["What brings you all the way out here?"]=1,
},
[37167]={ -- Stonetalon Prisoner
  ["Do not look at me, tauren. I have disgraced the Horde. I am done."]=1,
  ["We grunts were ordered to charge once more - into a wall of pikes - I could not do it, druid. My weapon slid from my hands and my legs did not move. I am dishonored."]=2,
  ["My commander was butchered before my eyes - my brothers dead all around me - I could not fight on. I am so ashamed, druid. I did not avenge them."]=3,
  ["No orc should ever flee from battle as I did. Leave me to my disgrace. Would that I would die in this tower, but I dread learning what my ancestors think of my cowardice."]=4,
},
[37172]={ -- Detective Snap Snagglebolt
  ["Something stinks around here, and I'm telling ya, it ain't love."]=1,
},
[37184]={ -- Zafod Boombox
  ["Lost your Rocket Pack? Have you checked your bags?"]=1,
  ["Why you're just the $c I was looking for! I'm testing a new rocket-powered flying device, and I need your help! Just take one of these harnesses and put it on under your armor. Hit the button on the side, and BOOM, off you go. Don't go trying to steal my work though. Each of these babies is fitted with a Transponster 8000 linked to the one in my hand. If you get too far from me the Transponster will shut down the main rocket and you'll be unable to lift off until you return. Now where did I put those liability forms?"]=2,
},
[37187]={ -- High Overlord Saurfang
  ["Brave soldier of the Horde, I salute you! We would have surely been destroyed by the Alliance gunship had it not been for you and your allies.$B$BTake a moment to rest before we begin our assault upon the upper reaches of the citadel."]=1,
},
[37200]={ -- Muradin Bronzebeard
  ["'Twas a fierce battle, adventurer! Take a moment to rest and gather yer forces. Who knows what lies beyond that door?$B$BLet me know when yer ready and we'll begin our ascent into the upper reaches of the citadel."]=1,
},
[37221]={ -- Lady Jaina Proudmoore
  ["Frostmourne: the blade that destroyed our kingdom..."]=1,
},
[37223]={ -- Lady Sylvanas Windrunner
  ["Standing this close to the blade that ended my life... The pain... It is renewed."]=1,
},
[37279]={ -- Corporal Teeka Bloodsnarl (3)
  ["Come to learn, eh? Well I just might have some work for you, scrub."]=1,
},
[37298]={ -- Frostwolf Envoy (3)
  ["You need to be a stronger $c before you can help us in Alterac Valley."]=1,
  ["Hail, $c. There is a great need and even greater honor and renown to be had in Alterac Valley at this time. Will you join our fight against the Stormpike Guard?"]=2,
  ["Strength and honor, $c. We need eager soldiers like you in Alterac Valley; the territory of the Frostwolves must be defended! Will you return to Azeroth and lend your aid?"]=3,
},
[37310]={ -- Frostwolf Stable Master (3)
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[37352]={ -- Lieutenant Haggerdin (3)
  ["Hail, $r! I am Lieutenant Haggerdin, officer in charge of recruitment for the Stormpike Guard.$B$BAs you gain prestige and notoriety among the Stormpike, return to me and I shall see about upgrading your insignia. Also, should you ever lose your insignia, I am able to supply a replacement."]=1,
},
[37397]={ -- Sergeant Durgen Stormpike (3)
  ["<Sergeant Stormpike salutes.>$B$BName, rank, and serial number, soldier! That's the only bit of information you'll ever give those dirty Frostwolf dogs!"]=1,
},
[37413]={ -- Stormpike Emissary (3)
  ["adventurer, the Stormpike Guard is in need of your aid in the battle against the Frostwolf Clan in Alterac Valley, now more than ever. The opportunities for honor and repute are greater than ever as well! Will you join the battle?"]=1,
},
[37426]={ -- Stormpike Stable Master (3)
  ["The indigenous rams of Alterac are vital to the functionality of our cavalry!"]=1,
},
[37523]={ -- Warden of the Sunwell
  ["Only those who have the ranger-general's approval may enter the Sunwell Plateau."]=1,
  ["I will escort you into the Sunwell when you're ready."]=2,
},
[37552]={ -- Thalorien Dawnseeker's Remains
  ["These appear to be the remains of Thalorien Dawnseeker, the last wielder of Quel'Delar."]=1,
},
[37554]={ -- Lady Sylvanas Windrunner
  ["I cannot hold him for long, we must leave at once!"]=1,
},
[37570]={ -- Naralex
  ["Whitereach Post is something of an unintended stop for me, to put it mildly. My clients are counting on me to deliver my wares and I'm starting to wonder if I'm going to make it in time with all the delays involved."]=1,
  ["This is it. I can sense that this was once the site of great tragedy; mortal suffering still echoes through it. No doubt this is what the horrors beyond have seized onto.$B$BTo fully seal this intrusion into our world, I must first fully open it. I will need your strength to hold back whatever may attempt to come through.$B$BAre you prepared?"]=2,
  ["As Druids, we are tasked with protecting the balance of nature. My life's work has gone against this. In my folly, I have sewn chaos, and this deviant crop must be reaped before it spreads further."]=3,
  ["I will stay here and watch over the land as it heals. Do keep an eye out for any stragglers from here..."]=4,
  ["The scar is sealed! Thank Cenarius..."]=5,
},
[37580]={ -- Martin Victus
  ["We will follow your lead, heroes. The Scourgelord will die this eve."]=1,
},
[37581]={ -- Gorkun Ironskull
  ["We will follow your lead, heroes. The Scourgelord will die this eve."]=1,
},
[37589]={ -- Stefan Vadu
  ["The Lich King is near, adventurer. His voice taunts me...$b$bLet us silence him at last!"]=1,
},
[37591]={ -- Martin Victus
  ["We'll make use of these supplies to get everyone ready for a fight.$B$BContinue on. We'll meet you ahead."]=1,
},
[37592]={ -- Gorkun Ironskull
  ["We'll make use of these supplies to get everyone ready for a fight.$B$BContinue on. We'll meet you ahead."]=1,
},
[37596]={ -- Lady Sylvanas Windrunner
  ["We have no time to waste, $c. Why do you delay here?"]=1,
},
[37597]={ -- Lady Jaina Proudmoore
  ["We do not have much time, hero. What do you need?"]=1,
},
[37606]={ -- Martin Victus (1)
  ["We'll make use of these supplies to get everyone ready for a fight.$B$BContinue on. We'll meet you ahead."]=1,
},
[37607]={ -- Gorkun Ironskull (1)
  ["We'll make use of these supplies to get everyone ready for a fight.$B$BContinue on. We'll meet you ahead."]=1,
},
[37614]={ -- Martin Victus (1)
  ["We will follow your lead, heroes. The Scourgelord will die this eve."]=1,
},
[37618]={ -- Gorkun Ironskull (1)
  ["We will follow your lead, heroes. The Scourgelord will die this eve."]=1,
},
[37633]={ -- Lady Sylvanas Windrunner (1)
  ["We have no time to waste, $c. Why do you delay here?"]=1,
},
[37671]={ -- Crown Supply Guard
  ["No snooping around, friend.$B$BIf you're looking to buy Crown holiday goods, you'll have to do it at the Lovely Merchant in the city."]=1,
  ["Don't you have some packages to move?"]=2,
},
[37675]={ -- Public Relations Agent
  ["Yo! I'm here representing the Crown Chemical Company.$B$BYou looking for a gift? A job? Maybe a little something for yourself? Well, you've come to the right place, friend.$B$BIf I don't have what you need, our mascot Kwee or the Lovely Merchant beside me will."]=1,
},
[37679]={ -- Warlord Bloodhilt
  ["Make this quick, $c. The Warchief personally sent me to evaluate our progress in the Barrens, and when I get here I find our towns aflame and Alliance dogs running amok."]=1,
},
[37688]={ -- Crusader Grimtong
  ["Greetings, hero. I craft and sell Ymirjar Lord's armor for warriors."]=1,
},
[37696]={ -- Crusader Halford
  ["Greetings, hero. I craft and sell Lightsworn armor for paladins."]=1,
},
[37708]={ -- Izzy
  ["It looks like this is the end, but I'll be brave if you will, adventurer."]=1,
},
[37709]={ -- Ace
  ["Hey, $g man : lady;, are we gonna get through this okay?"]=1,
},
[37710]={ -- Gobber
  ["<Gobber acts tough, but you can tell that deep down, he's scared.>"]=1,
},
[37715]={ -- Snivel Rustrocket
  ["Hey, pal, I don't know who you are or why you've been following me around, but I'm about to board a ship and I want to be left alone, got it?"]=1,
  ["I told you what I know, now shove off!"]=2,
},
[37724]={ -- Seer Ravenfeather
  ["The Light protect you, $c."]=1,
},
[37737]={ -- Sunwalker Helaku
  ["May the Sun's light protect you, $c."]=1,
},
[37742]={ -- Drugan Deepdraught
  ["Truly an amazing sword, don't you think? That's no weapon of dwarven make, no, it's far more ancient than that.$B$BThese Sunreaver and Silver Covenant representatives seem intent on getting to the bottom of the mystery. I'm already working on a report for Brann."]=1,
},
[37812]={ -- Mahka
  ["Greetings, $c. We shaman have gathered here at Firestone Point to watch over the land and tend to its wounds."]=1,
},
[37835]={ -- Dorn Redearth
  ["We do our best here to heal the broken earth. It was difficult enough before we started getting raided at night."]=1,
},
[37887]={ -- Kwee Q. Peddlefeet
  ["Did you know about our 'Charitable Charms' program?$B$BOfficial Crown event mascots like myself are authorized to distribute Lovely Charm Collector's Kits.$B$BYou can then use the Lovely Charms you gather to create Lovely Charm Bracelets for friends and loved ones, or turn them in to Lovely Merchants for Love Tokens!$B$BOne popular activity is making bracelets for the emissary of your favorite leaders to let them know they're appreciated and adored..."]=1,
},
[37888]={ -- Frax Bucketdrop
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[37904]={ -- Brazie Getz
  ["Whatever you need, Brazie Getz! Get it?$B$BAnd I'm not just talkin' about the 'legal' stuff, either. WHATEVER YOU NEED, PAL! Anything..."]=1,
},
[37987]={ -- Tegashi
  ["People tink raptors wild and vicious, but little else. In truth, they be loyal and cunnin' in ways ya hardly know."]=1,
},
[37997]={ -- Yili
  ["Greetings, hero. I craft and sell Shadowblade armor for rogues."]=1,
},
[37998]={ -- Talan Moonstrike
  ["Greetings, hero. I craft and sell Ahn'kahar Blood Hunter armor for hunters."]=1,
},
[37999]={ -- Alana Moonstrike
  ["Greetings, hero. I craft and sell Freya's Lasherweave armor for druids."]=1,
},
[38017]={ -- Kalecgos
  ["Greetings, $r. I sense some confusion at my presence here. The others harbor suspicion as well, and I cannot blame them, after what my brethren have put them through.$B$BMuch has happened since the events at the Sunwell, little of it good. And so it falls to me to pick up the pieces, and attempt to salvage the pride of my flight. There is much to say, and more to do, but know this: Not all in the Blue Dragonflight blame the mortal races of Azeroth for the troubles that have befallen the world.$B$BSome of us have more sense than that."]=1,
},
[38037]={ -- Nortet
  ["Take care of ya weapons an' they'll take care of ya back."]=1,
  ["We can't help ya 'ere, mon."]=2,
},
[38039]={ -- Kwee Q. Peddlefeet
  ["Did you know about our 'Charitable Charms' program?$B$BOfficial Crown event mascots like myself are authorized to distribute Lovely Charm Collector's Kits.$B$BYou can then use the Lovely Charms you gather to create Lovely Charm Bracelets for friends and loved ones, or turn them in to Lovely Merchants for Love Tokens!$B$BOne popular activity is making bracelets for the emissary of your favorite leaders to let them know they're appreciated and adored..."]=1,
},
[38040]={ -- Kwee Q. Peddlefeet
  ["Did you know about our 'Charitable Charms' program?$B$BOfficial Crown event mascots like myself are authorized to distribute Lovely Charm Collector's Kits.$B$BYou can then use the Lovely Charms you gather to create Lovely Charm Bracelets for friends and loved ones, or turn them in to Lovely Merchants for Love Tokens!$B$BOne popular activity is making bracelets for the emissary of your favorite leaders to let them know they're appreciated and adored..."]=1,
},
[38041]={ -- Kwee Q. Peddlefeet
  ["Did you know about our 'Charitable Charms' program?$B$BOfficial Crown event mascots like myself are authorized to distribute Lovely Charm Collector's Kits.$B$BYou can then use the Lovely Charms you gather to create Lovely Charm Bracelets for friends and loved ones, or turn them in to Lovely Merchants for Love Tokens!$B$BOne popular activity is making bracelets for the emissary of your favorite leaders to let them know they're appreciated and adored..."]=1,
