[38044]={ -- Kwee Q. Peddlefeet
  ["Did you know about our 'Charitable Charms' program?$B$BOfficial Crown event mascots like myself are authorized to distribute Lovely Charm Collector's Kits.$B$BYou can then use the Lovely Charms you gather to create Lovely Charm Bracelets for friends and loved ones, or turn them in to Lovely Merchants for Love Tokens!$B$BOne popular activity is making bracelets for the emissary of your favorite leaders to let them know they're appreciated and adored..."]=1,
},
[38045]={ -- Kwee Q. Peddlefeet
  ["Did you know about our 'Charitable Charms' program?$B$BOfficial Crown event mascots like myself are authorized to distribute Lovely Charm Collector's Kits.$B$BYou can then use the Lovely Charms you gather to create Lovely Charm Bracelets for friends and loved ones, or turn them in to Lovely Merchants for Love Tokens!$B$BOne popular activity is making bracelets for the emissary of your favorite leaders to let them know they're appreciated and adored..."]=1,
},
[38054]={ -- Scott the Merciful
  ["Greetings, hero. I craft and sell Crimson Acolyte armor for priests."]=1,
},
[38065]={ -- Crown Supply Sentry
  ["No snooping around, friend.$B$BIf you're looking to buy Crown holiday goods, you'll have to do it at the Lovely Merchant in the city."]=1,
  ["Don't you have some packages to move?"]=2,
},
[38066]={ -- Inspector Snip Snagglebolt
  ["Something stinks around here, and I'm telling ya, it ain't love."]=1,
},
[38120]={ -- Hobart Grapplehammer
  ["My genius cannot be contained within a box!$B$BWait, this isn't Azshara?! What is this place? That's a dormant volcano!$B$BI have half a mind to go join the Trade Prince! The other half of my mind is considering the possible weaponization of the clucker eggs!"]=1,
},
[38122]={ -- Bamm Megabomb
  ["Just like old times, eh, adventurer?"]=1,
},
[38124]={ -- Assistant Greely
  ["When we were packed into the Town-In-A-Box, they told us we'd be deployed somewhere in Azshara. Is this Azshara?$B$BI ask you: who prepares a Town-In-A-Box and doesn't supply it with enough food to live on?! One measly Poultryizer?!$B$BWe all know how the 'Micro' Mechachicken worked out."]=1,
},
[38156]={ -- High Overlord Saurfang (1)
  ["I have heard tale of my boy being here. That he's now a powerful death knight in service of the Lich King. If this is true, then it must be me that ends the bloodline.$B$BMy charge now is to command Orgrim's Hammer to the top of Icecrown Citadel and destroy all Scourge that get in our way. We leave when you and your allies are ready."]=1,
},
[38157]={ -- Muradin Bronzebeard (1)
  ["The old wounds still linger, $g lad:lass;. I can feel 'em in me bones, even now. Aye, I got a score to settle with Arthas and ye can believe I'm gonna give that boy the beatin' I shoulda given 'im when he was a wee lad. Always knew there was something wrong with 'im.$B$BTell me when yer crew is ready and we'll lift off for the top o' the citadel.$B$BArthas won't be expectin' this!"]=1,
},
[38182]={ -- Niby the Almighty
  ["Greetings, hero. I craft and sell Dark Coven armor for warlocks."]=1,
},
[38208]={ -- Investigator Fezzen Brasstacks
  ["Finally, the backup I've been waiting for! I prepared the paperwork that Snagglebolt requested. All that remains is for someone to serve it."]=1,
},
[38225]={ -- Vol'jin
  ["She has returned. Tha revenge of the Darkspear finally comes to pass dis day.$B$BLet me know when ya ready, adventurer. We'll not let her slip away again."]=1,
},
[38242]={ -- Nekali
  ["We can't help ya 'ere, mon."]=1,
  ["The elements chaotic and wild. Only through learnin' can we keep in touch wit' them and keep them controlled."]=2,
},
[38243]={ -- Zen'tabra
  ["We can't help ya 'ere, mon."]=1,
  ["Nature will guide ya when all else fails."]=2,
},
[38244]={ -- Legati
  ["We can't help ya 'ere, mon."]=1,
  ["Strike swiftly an' fade away. You'll know ya beginin' ta master ya skills when people know ya deeds, but never heard of you."]=2,
},
[38245]={ -- Tunari
  ["We can't help ya 'ere, mon."]=1,
  ["In tha chaos of battle, it's tha balance of light and shadow that leads us ta victory."]=2,
},
[38246]={ -- Soratha
  ["We can't help ya 'ere, mon."]=1,
  ["Wit' practice, ya'll find that magic can be much stronga than any weapon."]=2,
},
[38247]={ -- Ortezza
  ["We can't help ya 'ere, mon."]=1,
  ["Trust in ya bow. It'll be there for ya when ya need it most."]=2,
},
[38283]={ -- Malfus Grimfrost
  ["Greetings, hero. I craft and sell Bloodmage armor for magi."]=1,
},
[38293]={ -- Junior Inspector
  ["Something stinks, and for once it's not my socks."]=1,
},
[38295]={ -- Junior Detective
  ["Something stinks, and for once it's not my socks."]=1,
},
[38314]={ -- Muyoh
  ["I have a few ideas on how to help heal the overgrowth, $c.$B$BUnfortunately, Naralex is so upset, he refuses to take any more chances."]=1,
},
[38316]={ -- Ormus the Penitent
  ["A self-inflicted wound, friend. I could not bear to look upon a world where I'd committed so many horrors under the Lich King's grasp.$B$BIt was my first step towards redemption, and if my sins are unforgivable, then I will attempt to atone for them for the rest of my life."]=1,
},
[38378]={ -- Commander Walpole
  ["Hail, $c! Just up ahead you'll find Honor's Stand, the Alliance's only link between Stonetalon and the coast.$B$BThe road's a treacherous one, though. I speak from experience."]=1,
},
[38381]={ -- Brett "Coins" McQuid
  ["I'm glad you're out here with us, adventurer. It's not easy getting stuff from naga!"]=1,
},
[38387]={ -- Sassy Hardwrench
  ["You gotta do something about these pygmies, adventurer!"]=1,
},
[38432]={ -- Megs Dreadshredder
  ["I came over here to see if we could open up trade with these naga. Their reply wasn't very nice."]=1,
},
[38437]={ -- Vanira
  ["An ancient score is settled today."]=1,
},
[38441]={ -- Ace
  ["Heya, adventurer. I'm sure glad that you're here. This is turning into a mess."]=1,
},
[38442]={ -- Morakki
  ["I've never been more proud ta be a Darkspear. Vol'jin leads us ta glory."]=1,
},
[38465]={ -- Myriam Spellwaker
  ["I'd have a hard time teaching you. It takes years of mental preparation to become attuned to the powers of the arcane."]=1,
},
[38501]={ -- Alchemist Adrianna
  ["After countless failures of our agents to secure workable samples of Scourge blight for analysis, I've come up to the front lines myself to oversee the efforts. Like they say, if you want a job done right...."]=1,
},
[38502]={ -- Nablya
  ["Do you understand now, adventurer?"]=1,
  ["Un'Goro Crater serves a very specific purpose, adventurer. It is now time for you to learn that purpose."]=2,
},
[38514]={ -- Fizz Lighter
  ["What can I do for you, adventurer?"]=1,
},
[38532]={ -- Marin Noggenfogger
  ["On behalf of the illustrious and still neutral Steamwheedle Cartel, I hope you enjoy your stay.$B$BRemember, everyone is welcome in Gadgetzan! Everyone except pirates."]=1,
},
[38535]={ -- Kelsey Steelspark
  ["Why hello there, fellow member of the Alliance!$B$BAs an official representative of Gadgetzan, I'm here to make sure we poor scattered gnomes can peacefully co-exist with the Steamwheedle goblins here in Gadgetzan! We may even be open to tolerating the presence of their new Horde goblin friends.$B$BI'm sure we can all come to an agreeable decision with your help!"]=1,
},
[38553]={ -- Krennan Aranas
  ["The time to take back Gilneas City is at hand."]=1,
},
[38606]={ -- Lady Jaina Proudmoore
  ["He's truly gone, isn't he?$b$bI... I can feel it."]=1,
  ["Was there truly no way to save him?$b$bI fear I shall always wonder."]=2,
},
[38611]={ -- Lorna Crowley
  ["This isn't over, adventurer. Not by a long shot."]=1,
},
[38637]={ -- High Overlord Saurfang (2)
  ["I have heard tale of my boy being here. That he's now a powerful death knight in service of the Lich King. If this is true, then it must be me that ends the bloodline.$B$BMy charge now is to command Orgrim's Hammer to the top of Icecrown Citadel and destroy all Scourge that get in our way. We leave when you and your allies are ready."]=1,
},
[38638]={ -- High Overlord Saurfang (3)
  ["I have heard tale of my boy being here. That he's now a powerful death knight in service of the Lich King. If this is true, then it must be me that ends the bloodline.$B$BMy charge now is to command Orgrim's Hammer to the top of Icecrown Citadel and destroy all Scourge that get in our way. We leave when you and your allies are ready."]=1,
},
[38639]={ -- Muradin Bronzebeard (2)
  ["The old wounds still linger, $g lad:lass;. I can feel 'em in me bones, even now. Aye, I got a score to settle with Arthas and ye can believe I'm gonna give that boy the beatin' I shoulda given 'im when he was a wee lad. Always knew there was something wrong with 'im.$B$BTell me when yer crew is ready and we'll lift off for the top o' the citadel.$B$BArthas won't be expectin' this!"]=1,
},
[38640]={ -- Muradin Bronzebeard (3)
  ["The old wounds still linger, $g lad:lass;. I can feel 'em in me bones, even now. Aye, I got a score to settle with Arthas and ye can believe I'm gonna give that boy the beatin' I shoulda given 'im when he was a wee lad. Always knew there was something wrong with 'im.$B$BTell me when yer crew is ready and we'll lift off for the top o' the citadel.$B$BArthas won't be expectin' this!"]=1,
},
[38647]={ -- Izzy
  ["adventurer, you gotta get in there and save our people!"]=1,
},
[38706]={ -- Zeke Bootscuff
  ["I'm not here on vacation, pal. Noggenfogger sent me down here with a mission: Find out how to turn a profit on these silithid, or wipe 'em clean.$B$BIf a $r like you wants to do some favors for the Steamwheedle Cartel, I could use a hand."]=1,
},
[38714]={ -- Carmen Ibanozzle
  ["Hey, come on in out of the sun.$B$BCan I get you a drink? Not like I have anything else to do around here."]=1,
},
[38717]={ -- Alchemist Adrianna (1)
  ["After countless failures of our agents to secure workable samples of Scourge blight for analysis, I've come up to the front lines myself to oversee the efforts. Like they say, if you want a job done right...."]=1,
},
[38738]={ -- Coach Crosscheck
  ["Get your head in the game, adventurer!"]=1,
},
[38745]={ -- Kezan Citizen
  ["You did it! We're saved!"]=1,
  ["Are we really finally going to Azshara? Is there a volcano there, too?"]=2,
  ["How can I ever thank you, adventurer?"]=3,
  ["I'd keep my eyes and ears open if I were you. There's a rumor going around that you caused both Mount Kajaro and the Lost Isles volcanoes to explode.$B$BCrazy, I know. But people will gossip about anything and love to tear down their heroes, especially if there's a chance for profit and promotion."]=4,
  ["Let's leave dock before the volcano destroys us all!"]=5,
  ["Ready to go when you are, $g sir : ma'am;!"]=6,
  ["I don't know. I think I'm going to miss this place. We had some pretty good times here."]=7,
  ["I have an idea... this time let's not wander through a naval battle between the Alliance and the Horde.$B$BI'm just saying."]=8,
},
[38746]={ -- Gobber
  ["<Gobber grunts.>$B$BMe banker now!"]=1,
},
[38764]={ -- Lord Hewell
  ["It is not the time to turn against one another, adventurer."]=1,
},
[38783]={ -- Marie Allen
  ["Can I provide you with anything, adventurer?"]=1,
},
[38794]={ -- Myriam Spellwaker
  ["I'd have a hard time teaching you. It takes years of mental preparation to become attuned to the powers of the arcane."]=1,
},
[38795]={ -- Sister Almyra
  ["The Light is with you, $c. No harm will come to you today."]=1,
},
[38796]={ -- Loren the Fence
  ["I swear this wasn't my fault. Why are you looking at me like that?"]=1,
},
[38840]={ -- Jedebia
  ["Greetings, hero. I craft and sell Frost Witch armor for shaman."]=1,
},
[38853]={ -- Marie Allen
  ["Can I provide you with anything, adventurer?"]=1,
},
[38856]={ -- Dunemaul "Emissary"
  ["Me help goblin lady make friend with ogres."]=1,
},
[38895]={ -- Lilian Voss
  ["Get away from me, you abomination!"]=1,
  ["The undead are a taint upon Azeroth! Every one of you creatures deserves to be destroyed!"]=2,
},
[38910]={ -- Lilian Voss
  ["Get away from me, you monster! Don't look at me! I'm hideous!"]=1,
},
[38911]={ -- Xavier the Huntsman
  ["Be gone, $c. I have no need of you in my hunt."]=1,
},
[38927]={ -- Mazoga
  ["So, you wanna find de fabled swords of de Sandfury, eh?$B$BYa be ready ta kill for Sul'thraze? Spill de blood across de sands? In search of treasure, of power?$B$BIf ya are...welcome to de desert, mon."]=1,
},
[38935]={ -- Thrall
  ["Your friends were all taken prisoner by Trade Prince Gallywix while the volcano was exploding.$B$BWe are going to have to deal with the Alliance quickly if we're to rescue them and get off of this island."]=1,
},
[38966]={ -- Vol'jin
  ["I will see ta it personally dat the Darkspear rise as a power in their own right."]=1,
},
[38977]={ -- Apothecary Jerrod
  ["What is it I can do for you?"]=1,
},
[38986]={ -- Ambassador Gaines
  ["adventurer! How can I help you, old friend?"]=1,
  ["Just between you and me, I worry that the good General here doesn't have the stomach to do what needs to be done.$B$BThis is the Horde we're dealing with. History shows there can never be peace.$B$BOur goal should be ... annihilation."]=2,
},
[38989]={ -- Jornun
  ["Ya want to join the attack on the naga?"]=1,
},
[38995]={ -- Highlord Tirion Fordring
  ["Long have I waited for this day, hero. Are you and your allies prepared to bring the Lich King to justice? We charge on your command!"]=1,
},
[38999]={ -- Lilian Voss
  ["First of all, I don't need to be rescued. Second of all, I'd never allow myself to be rescued by an abomination like you!"]=1,
},
[39034]={ -- Dr. Dealwell
  ["Get out of my way, $r. Can't you see that we're in the middle of a battle!"]=1,
},
[39062]={ -- Darkspear Jailor
  ["This ain't much of a big challenge, mon, but we gotta know ya can handle the pit before we can take ya in."]=1,
},
[39063]={ -- Chawg
  ["Everything has been leading to this, adventurer. You must not fail, or all is lost and we will die with this island."]=1,
},
[39065]={ -- Aggra
  ["The blood of the fallen cries out for justice."]=1,
},
[39084]={ -- Mizzy Pistonhammer
  ["Our equipment is really taking a beating out here!"]=1,
  ["Sure, it's got bugs to work out. But the microtank is a marvel of engineering.$B$Bit uses one quarter the materials of a full-sized siege engine, and it can be mass-produced by anyone! ...with really tiny hands!"]=2,
},
[39100]={ -- Dedlow Wormwood
  ["Be gone, $c. I have no need of you in my hunt."]=1,
},
[39116]={ -- Apolos
  ["Be gone, $c. I have no need of you in my hunt."]=1,
},
[39117]={ -- Shadow Priestess Malia
  ["Can I help you with something?"]=1,
  ["Are you ready to begin the procedure?"]=2,
},
[39178]={ -- Driz Plunkbow
  ["I've heard about this Nesingwary guy, out of Stranglethorn Vale, hunting all sorts of beasts for sport.$B$BFor SPORT. What a complete idiot, right? Think of all the profit he's letting rot in the field!"]=1,
},
[39206]={ -- Acrypha
  ["For too long we have ignored the secrets of the Arcane.$B$BSadly, they will remain a secret to you."]=1,
},
[39226]={ -- Farseer Gadra
  ["Tha elements be crying out in rage. It ain't no coincidence dat da naga are here. Dey be wantin' someting."]=1,
},
[39271]={ -- High Tinker Mekkatorque
  ["Operation: Gnomeregan is divided into a number of phases:$B$BFirst, we must retake the air tower. This will allow our planes give us air support as we move towards Gnomeregan's main entrance.$B$BIn addition, a cache of mechanized Battle Suits was discovered in one of the nearby buildings. Once we have those suits, our assault on the entrance should be unstoppable.$B$BThen, we go straight for Thermaplugg in the heart of Gnomeregan!"]=1,
},
[39275]={ -- Gnomeregan Medic
  ["I'm only here in case someone faints. The new recruits get a little excited and occasionally overexert themselves. ...well, that, and sometimes one of the new mechano-tank prototypes explode. Whoops!"]=1,
},
[39371]={ -- King Varian Wrynn
  ["The continued sacrifice of the Ashen Verdict and heroes such as yourself bring us all closer to final victory. Now I have come to Icecrown Citadel to lend aid to those who fight against the Scourge. Together we will end the tyranny of the Lich King!"]=1,
},
[39372]={ -- Garrosh Hellscream
  ["With the Warsong Offensive here in Icecrown Citadel, victory is within our grasp! The death of the Lich King will bring glory to the Horde!"]=1,
},
[39396]={ -- 'Thunderflash'
  ["Looks just powerful enough to carry one gnome. Maybe two."]=1,
},
[39407]={ -- Ysondre
  ["The strands of life have been severed.$B$BThe dreamers must be avenged."]=1,
},
[39413]={ -- Instructor Mylva
  ["The Twilight's Hammer is more than an organization to me. It's a family.$B$BAs such, I take great care in making sure no unworthy candidates make it past the training phase."]=1,
},
[39427]={ -- Jadi Falaryn
  ["Are you here to help, $c? This valley serves as a natural chokepoint. If we can strangle this supply line, we buy our companions at the World Tree time to mount a counter-attack."]=1,
  ["I don't understand where these supplies are coming from. Somehow Twilight's Hammer has found a way to assault the entire mountain at once..."]=2,
},
[39432]={ -- Takrik Ragehowl
  ["The tenacity of the wolf ancient is the stuff of legend.$B$BLearn from his example, $c, and victory is all but certain."]=1,
},
[39433]={ -- Ian Duran
  ["Goldrinn's tenacity is the stuff of legend.$B$BWarriors from all walks visit this shrine in hopes of tapping into that kind of battle prowess."]=1,
},
[39434]={ -- Rio Duran
  ["adventurer, the Twilight slaves you and others have been rescuing from Wolf's Run are wandering into camp, but they can't tell me who they are and they speak in riddles and gibberish.$B$BI thought Twilight's Hammer kept the slaves in line the old fashioned way - you know, whips and chains - but it's clear that there's some brainwashing at work..."]=1,
  ["Thanks for your help, adventurer."]=2,
},
[39435]={ -- Royce Duskwhisper
  ["Of all the ancients, Goldrinn is the most magnificent. His fury, his resolve... you would do well to emulate."]=1,
},
[39442]={ -- Condenna the Pitiless
  ["The Twilight's Hammer is a major power to be reckoned with. Thanks to us, Deathwing is free. Thanks to us, Old Gods have risen from the bowels of the earth. Thanks to us... Hyjal burns.$B$BWhat do you think you have to offer us?"]=1,
},
[39605]={ -- Garrosh Hellscream
  ["Victory or death, $c!"]=1,
},
[39615]={ -- Trade Prince Gallywix
  ["I'm not talking to you right now. If I were you, I wouldn't count on getting a raise this year, adventurer."]=1,
},
[39640]={ -- Kristoff Manheim
  ["Hello, $c. I imagine you have a lot of questions.$B$BSuffice it to say that Royce Duskwhisper sent me into the middle of an ogre cave for some 'Eye of Twilight' jib-job, and it hasn't gone well.$B$BIf I ever get my hands on that lanky, heartless, mealy-mouthed little night elf...$B$B<Kristoff wriggles helplessly as he dangles in the air, his face reddening.>"]=1,
  ["Well? Are you going to help me down?"]=2,
},
[39644]={ -- Twilight Servitor
  ["Thoth'al amun Ree'thael vormos! Vormos! Vormos!"]=1,
  ["Al'tha, Al'tha bormaz. Ni bormaz ta'thall? It comes, it walks in flames, $r!"]=2,
  ["The shadow sees. Bo'al lal arwi C'toth. The end comes, cloaked in silent fire."]=3,
  ["Mar'kowa tallol ye'tarin, it knows, it knows."]=4,
  ["Fear broils forth from the heart of the infinite. Don't make me look! I've seen more than I can stand!"]=5,
  ["We are nothing. Tulall par'okoth. Far'al, ka'kar. The void devours."]=6,
  ["<The Twilight Servitor gurgles at you, white spittle foaming and bubbling from his mouth.>"]=7,
  ["H'thon, the column of darkness stretching beyond sight. H'thon marwol qualar: the infinite grasp of night."]=8,
},
[39653]={ -- Silvia
  ["Lady Shandris is counting on me. I will not fail her."]=1,
},
[39654]={ -- Vol'jin
  ["We'd be gettin' ready to take back da Echo Isles. Zalazane has been workin' his voodoo magic for some time, convincing folks dat he be dead and performing ancient dark rituals.$B$BHe knows we'd be coming, so we have ta make sure we be prepared."]=1,
},
[39660]={ -- Spirit Healer
  ["It is not yet your time. I shall aid your journey back to the realm of the living... for a price."]=1,
},
[39667]={ -- Adarrah
  ["Please, $r.$b$bI don't know how much longer I can make it here..."]=1,
},
[39669]={ -- Captain Samir
  ["I need to find a safe place soon.$b$bOl' Mack's not doin' so well."]=1,
},
[39718]={ -- Doktor Professor Ironpants
  ["Are you here to train in Archaeology?"]=1,
},
[39725]={ -- Adella
  ["Securing this area for the Sentinels will be the final part of our defense of Feralas."]=1,
},
[39857]={ -- Malfurion Stormrage
  ["The forces we are up against here go beyond the Twilight's Hammer, Ragnaros or even Deathwing. We must succeed here if our world is going to survive at all."]=1,
},
[39869]={ -- Windspeaker Tamila
  ["The odds appear to be against us, but we cannot falter, adventurer. We are all that stands between the enemy's hordes and Nordrassil."]=1,
},
[39875]={ -- Earthmender Duarn
  ["I'd appreciate if someone started to take my work seriously. Just because I'm not wrestling sharks or tying eels in knots doesn't mean this isn't important."]=1,
},
[39876]={ -- Felora Firewreath
  ["I'd imagined my first adventure into the ocean as more peaceful and enlightening. Becoming one with nature perhaps?$B$BThere is very little natural about this place. The elements all around us scream for vengeance."]=1,
},
[39878]={ -- Caretaker Movra
  ["Welcome, friend. We have little to offer by way of supplies, but I will assist you however I can."]=1,
},
[39881]={ -- Wavespeaker Valoren
  ["In my youth, my family did not approve of my interest in shamanism. Brash and foolish as I was, I ran away from them and practiced on my own. Upon returning to my home one day, I found my parents gone. My home destroyed. They never found who did it. I've spent my life striving to extend my shamanistic visions to see into the past - to find out what happened to my family and who is responsible. I've come a great way. I've learned to focus in on impactful events in the recent past, but I have much further to go if I ever hope to glimpse something that occurred so long ago."]=1,
},
[39882]={ -- The Great Sambino
  ["And miss out on wearing my awesome custom-made helmet? Not a chance."]=1,
},
[39883]={ -- Adarrah
  ["Thank you, $c.$b$bI nearly died out there."]=1,
  ["I salvaged what I could from the nearby wreckage, but I can only stay down for so long..."]=2,
},
[39884]={ -- Captain Samir
  ["Have you honed your skills enough to learn what I have to teach?"]=1,
},
[39887]={ -- Captain Taylor
  ["This was a good man, $r. We'd served together through many battles...$b$bThese beasts have a debt to pay!"]=1,
  ["You've done well, $c.$b$bMy men and I are now prepared to face the enemy."]=2,
},
[39908]={ -- Brann Bronzebeard
  ["Great, ye found yer way here!$b$bNo time to waste. Ye ready?"]=1,
},
[39927]={ -- Laina Nightsky
  ["Our prayers to Aessina go unanswered. The burning minions of Ragnaros have driven us to the brink. If they are not stopped here, the World Tree will be little more than a stump amidst the conflagration!"]=1,
},
[39928]={ -- Matoclaw
  ["Welcome, $c.$B$BHyjal burns and the world I've spent my life protecting is on the brink of oblivion.$B$BTell me: Have you ever heard of Tyrus Blackhorn?"]=1,
},
[39932]={ -- Keeper Taldros
  ["I'm glad you are here, friend!$B$BThe fires have driven the wildlife to seek shelter in this grove. They can run no farther. We must protect the survivors!"]=1,
},
[39933]={ -- Tyrus Blackhorn
  ["$R. Have you been sent to speak with me? How long has it been since the master's demise on these very slopes?"]=1,
  ["You have talent, adventurer. But mercy makes you weak."]=2,
},
[40027]={ -- Fizzle Brassbolts
  ["I tell ya this guy's driving me nuts! Does anyone truly believe that a goblin could help run anything so magnificent as this speedbarge?$B$BAll they know how to do is blow stuff up and half of the time, they take themselves out doing even that!"]=1,
},
[40032]={ -- Telaron Windflight
  ["We are here to preserve these lands for our people."]=1,
},
[40035]={ -- Erina Willowborn
  ["The druids and sentinels prefer to keep separate company, but we have always worked well together.$B$BNever mistake privacy for aversion."]=1,
},
[40036]={ -- Karonas
  ["Are you prepared for war, $r?"]=1,
},
[40078]={ -- Handler Tessina
  ["A lot of work goes into training and caring for our animals, but it's all worth it.$B$BI could always use a bit of extra help, though."]=1,
},
[40105]={ -- Erunak Stonespeaker
  ["Here, we are even more exposed than before, $r.$b$bWe must find safe shelter soon!"]=1,
  ["We must find your allies and discover the naga motives in this region.$b$bBut first, we must find a more secure location."]=2,
  ["I feel that we are just scratching the surface of the naga presence here.$b$bI have never seen them so organized and disciplined before."]=3,
},
[40132]={ -- Vestia Moonspear
  ["I was once a priestess, but I've always been a scholar. The chance to learn from the Highborne seemed more valuable than practicing strict ignorance.$B$BWhat's more most of the apprentices here are youths who came of age during the third war. They need guidance, wisdom...$B$BI only wish those who used to call me friend understood."]=1,
},
[40184]={ -- Vanira
  ["I be one of da first to answer Vol'jin's call to arms. Will you be joinin' us?"]=1,
},
[40204]={ -- Handler Marnlek
  ["If ya need a bat, ya come to da right place. I be handlin' all de bats for de scouts."]=1,
},
[40221]={ -- Toshe Chaosrender
  ["These are definitely the ones that raided our boats, but I don't see any of our missing people. Where did they take them?"]=1,
},
[40226]={ -- Pratt McGrubben
  ["Greetings $c -- if you're looking for leather goods and leatherworking supplies, you've come to the right semi-retired Paladin."]=1,
  ["I swear... if Quint tries to plant one more fishing grub on me, I'm going to hack down his tree with my not-so-rusty sword."]=2,
},
[40289]={ -- Ysera
  ["<Though Ysera's physical form stands in front of you, her consciousness appears to shift between this world and another.>"]=1,
},
[40352]={ -- Witch Doctor Hez'tok
  ["May de spirits guide ya, $c."]=1,
},
[40358]={ -- Dyslix Silvergrub
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[40369]={ -- Falfindel Waywarder
  ["$C, the cataclysm has crumbled the mountains and the South Sea has rushed in to drown Thousand Needles.$B$BWe need your help, now!"]=1,
},
[40391]={ -- Vol'jin
  ["Zalazane's time be runnin' out. De Echo Isles will belong to de Darkspear Tribe again!"]=1,
},
[40405]={ -- Kieupid
  ["You've come for training in order to pass it on to your pets?"]=1,
  ["Ah friend, I only help hunters and their pets."]=2,
},
[40409]={ -- Gromm'ko
  ["My raptor can take on ANYTHING and ANYONE!"]=1,
},
[40413]={ -- Alenjon Sunblade
  ["You are not yet seasoned enough to enter a battleground, $c. Return when you have gained more experience."]=1,
  ["Are you ready to fight for the Horde, $c?"]=2,
},
[40435]={ -- Headless Ghost
  ["Please... help... The Headless Horseman... must be stopped... He has slain so many... and yet rides out for more victims with every rising moon!"]=1,
},
[40436]={ -- Earthen Ring Pathfinder
  ["The Frost Lord, Ahune, must be stopped. Even now he is taking form, summoned from his elemental prison by the mad cultists of the Twilight's Hammer. If he's allowed to enter our world completely, he'll bury us beneath an eternal winter."]=1,
},
[40438]={ -- Steamwheedle Shyster
  ["Someone's got to stop the Crown Chemical Co. I'd bet my gold-plated Nether-Rocket they're cooking up the next big plague on the chocolate-crazed citizenry's coin... If only I could find someone to serve their apothecaries with court papers! Then we could put an end to it... and maybe seize all their assets, while we're at it!"]=1,
},
[40441]={ -- Battered Brewmaster
  ["I'm tellin' you, that Coren Direbrew's a madman. It's not MY fault he didn't get invited to compete at Brewfest! But that didn't stop him and all his Dark Iron cronies from roughin' up my employees and drinking all my brew. Someone's got to put an end to this!"]=1,
},
[40443]={ -- Earthen Ring Scout
  ["The Frost Lord, Ahune, must be stopped. Even now he is taking form, summoned from his elemental prison by the mad cultists of the Twilight's Hammer. If he's allowed to enter our world completely, he'll bury us beneath an eternal winter."]=1,
},
[40475]={ -- Jinky Twizzlefixxit
  ["Fizzle & Pozzik's Speedbarge my sweet patootie! I built this thing! Not them, not Razzeric!$B$BIt should be called Jinky's Speedbarge!"]=1,
},
[40478]={ -- Elgin Clickspring
  ["It's my job to ensure that this whole assault runs like clockwork.$B$BHigh Tinker Mekkatorque is out in the field now, but he's scheduled to come back to get some more troops any time now. $B$BHe's never late, so just stick around and he'll be here."]=1,
  ["Hurry! You should talk to Mekkatorque! If we don't start the assault soon, we're going to be late.$B$BAnd my boss HATES it when we're late!"]=2,
},
[40489]={ -- Karr'gonn
  ["Yeah? What's the matter?"]=1,
},
[40492]={ -- Zild'jian
  ["Vol'jin be waitin for ya. You should talk wit him now, my arms are gettin' tired.$B$BDis echo isle attack betta be startin' soon."]=1,
  ["De Echo Isles attack be startin' soon!$B$BSit back and relax, dis song will be over in anotha $5071W minutes and then we'd be going."]=2,
  ["Vol'jin told me ta keep hittin' da drum till he gets back. If ya be waitin' for him, he'd be back soon to take back da Isles.$B$BJust wait here and enjoy da music!"]=3,
},
[40552]={ -- Leora
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[40553]={ -- Fidelio
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[40554]={ -- Rizzle Brassbolts
  ["If you ask me, I think my brother should do something about all of these goblins! It's said that one of them set off the Cataclysm with a footbomb!$B$BWe need to get rid of all of them before it's really too late!"]=1,
},
[40572]={ -- Haughty Modiste
  ["Do not waste my time. What is it you want?"]=1,
  ["Can you not see that I am busy here?"]=2,
  ["Yes? What do you want?"]=3,
},
[40580]={ -- Gus Rustflutter
  ["You gotta help me! My poor, poor Chelsea..."]=1,
},
[40589]={ -- Dirge Quikcleave
  ["We may have been suffering a drought but there's no shortage of meat! Care to browse my goods?"]=1,
},
[40639]={ -- Engineer Hexascrub
  ["Amazing materials down here. Amazing! Substitutes for everything. Substitutes for substitutes. Everything's possible!"]=1,
},
[40643]={ -- Admiral Dvorek
  ["You can teach a soldier how to kill, but you can't teach him to want to kill. That is one thing we don't have to worry about down here. Every single one of my boys can't wait to take a piece out of those naga for what they did to us, and I can't say I feel much different.$B$BWe need to find a way to make contact with the surface, but before that, I want to make a bit of 'contact' with these naga. We have some brothers to avenge."]=1,
},
[40644]={ -- Levia Dreamwaker
  ["This was one of the royal cities of the elves in the days when Azshara was queen. In this city lie the keys to lore long lost and artifacts of unimaginable historical value."]=1,
},
[40664]={ -- Recovering Soldier
  ["Thank you, $r.$b$bYou saved me from certain death."]=1,
  ["Did you see the size of that thing!?"]=2,
  ["I owe you, $c.$b$bThought I was a gonner."]=3,
  ["How are we going to get out of here?"]=4,
  ["If it's my time to die, I'm going to go down swinging!"]=5,
  ["It's just a matter of time before the naga find us here.$b$bWhat will we fight them with?"]=6,
  ["It's a good thing the captain made it through. He'll know how to get us out of this mess."]=7,
},
[40680]={ -- Stormwind Soldier
  ["Bring on the naga! I'm hungry for battle!"]=1,
  ["At least now we have a fighting chance, thanks to you."]=2,
  ["I may fall, but I'll take a dozen of those beasts with me!"]=3,
  ["The naga must pay for what they've done here!"]=4,
},
[40712]={ -- Mazoga's Spirit
  ["We be meetin' again so soon..."]=1,
},
[40792]={ -- Neptulon
  ["That vile beast has been driven off, but my precious waters have been tainted! I must cleanse them at once.$b$bIf you insist on lingering here, prepare to defend yourself."]=1,
},
[40809]={ -- Tak
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[40832]={ -- Daisy
  ["Hi there, $g handsome : gorgeous;. Welcome to the Speedbarge Bar.$B$BWhat'll it be?"]=1,
},
[40834]={ -- Jordan Olafson
  ["Someone else from beyond the portal! I hope you're ready for a fight, $c."]=1,
  ["We're behind enemy lines, adventurer. We've got to do as much damage as we can!"]=2,
  ["If we allow Twilight's Hammer to open up portals like these all over Azeroth, no army in the world can save the planet. We've got to shut this tunnel network down!"]=3,
  ["Pyrendius is slain! Our work here is done.$B$BJust step through the flamegate to return to Mount Hyjal, $c. I'll make sure the gate is taken care of."]=4,
},
[40843]={ -- Sebelia
  ["Greetings, $c. I hope you find your accomodations suitable, even in this time of war."]=1,
},
[40851]={ -- Swift Seahorse
  ["The seahorse floats patiently."]=1,
},
[40896]={ -- Lord Fallowmere
  ["Stonetalon has always had its fill of problems, adventurer, but never has the land and its people suffered so badly. The Horde will destroy us all if left unchecked."]=1,
},
[40898]={ -- Alithia Fallowmere
  ["Your body looks worn and your spirit weary. Rest yourself beneath our roof and allow Elune to guide your dreams."]=1,
},
[40913]={ -- Handler Jesana
  ["A lot of work goes into training and caring for our animals, but it's all worth it.$B$BI could always use a bit of extra help, though."]=1,
},
[40919]={ -- Wavespeaker Tulra
  ["In my youth, my family did not approve of my interest in shamanism. Brash and foolish as I was, I ran away from them and practiced on my own. Upon returning to my home one day, I found my parents gone. My home destroyed. They never found who did it. I've spent my life striving to extend my shamanistic visions to see into the past - to find out what happened to my family and who is responsible. I've come a great way. I've learned to focus in on impactful events in the recent past, but I have much further to go if I ever hope to glimpse something that occurred so long ago."]=1,
},
[40920]={ -- Elendri Goldenbrow
  ["This was one of the royal cities of the elves in the days when Azshara was queen. In this city lie the keys to lore long lost and artifacts of unimaginable historical value."]=1,
},
[40950]={ -- Captain Tharran
  ["The Catacylsm has created chaos in Dun Morogh. The troggs have come to the surface in numbers we haven't seen before, driving our traditional enemies, the Frostmane trolls, ever closer to our settlements.$B$BIronforge has dispatched my mountaineer company to help deal with the problems."]=1,
},
[40968]={ -- Andoril
  ["Your body looks worn and your spirit weary. Rest yourself beneath our roof and allow Elune to guide your dreams."]=1,
},
[40991]={ -- Mountaineer Dunstan
  ["Watch yerself down here, $c. These wendigos are savage fighters."]=1,
},
[40994]={ -- Mountaineer Lewin
  ["I've seen enough of this cave for a lifetime. I can't wait to get back to Kharanos."]=1,
},
[40997]={ -- Skylord Omnuron
  ["Welcome, $c! Welcome to the Shrine of Aviana, a haven for all creatures of the sky.$B$BAviana may no longer be with us, but her heart and her ferocity live on in all winged creatures.$B$BSpeak with Choluna down below if you are curious about Aviana's story."]=1,
},
[41003]={ -- Morthis Whisperwing
  ["Welcome to the Shrine of Aviana, $c. Here we sit atop the world and touch the sky."]=1,
},
[41006]={ -- Thisalee Crow
  ["We Druids of the Talon aren't cut out for front-line duty. We're aerial spies, infiltrators...$B$BBut occasionally I like to get my talons dirty."]=1,
},
[41053]={ -- Ryan Mills
  ["Ryan's the name, trading's the game! What'll ya have?"]=1,
},
[41056]={ -- Mountaineer Valgrum
  ["These wendigos are an annoyance, sure, but the real fight is with those Frostmane refugees."]=1,
},
[41086]={ -- Forba Slabchisel
  ["So help me, if I can get a single one of these lazy sods on his gorram feet, I'm puttin' him to work beating the others black and blue!$B$BWe've got WORK to do here!"]=1,
},
[41128]={ -- Dunlor Marblebeard
  ["It may not be quite comfy out here, but it's still Khaz Modan, so it's still our home."]=1,
},
[41140]={ -- Burok
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[41190]={ -- Crazzle Sprysprocket
  ["I used to be a simple ticket redeemer at the racetrack. Well, no more racetrack, so no more job.$B$BI'm trying my hand at negotiations now. Could you help me get things going here? They have oil!"]=1,
},
[41214]={ -- Slick Dropdip
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[41229]={ -- Force Commander Valen
  ["We didn't bring the war to the Horde, the Horde brought the war to us."]=1,
},
[41265]={ -- Salt-Flop
  ["Village... gone. Family gone. Naga take... everything."]=1,
},
[41274]={ -- Chief Explorer Jansun
  ["Gear all banged up, eh?"]=1,
},
[41275]={ -- Explorer Tabby Triloc
  ["Need to do some shopping?"]=1,
},
[41281]={ -- Injured Assault Volunteer
  ["<The injured soldier's pained groans are somewhat distorted by the water.>"]=1,
  ["<The injured soldier appears to still be breathing. Thankfully, his bubble remains intact.>"]=2,
  ["<There is a a painful looking gash along the soldier's side.>"]=3,
  ["<It looks as if this solider might be feigning to throw off naga suspicion. It likely saved his life.>"]=4,
},
[41286]={ -- Lyanath
  ["Be careful in the vale, adventurer. Enemies abound!"]=1,
},
[41297]={ -- Karl Boran
  ["It's been hard on all of us, but we're getting by.$B$BYou've just gotta roll up your sleeves and do what needs to be done."]=1,
},
[41307]={ -- First Mate Snellig
  ["The souls of the Third Fleet are cursed to roam this shore, for eternity, $r. The Eye of Paleth lay claim to our lives, and trapped us in the mire forevermore."]=1,
},
[41308]={ -- Aviana
  ["I am the mistress of the skies, and they who threaten my children shall suffer."]=1,
},
[41340]={ -- Private Pollard
  ["Our soldiers... they're all captives now."]=1,
  ["Many of us tried to escape the naga.$b$bI am the only one who succeeded..."]=2,
  ["I don't know why, but those monsters are going out of their way to keep our men alive..."]=3,
},
[41341]={ -- Erunak Stonespeaker
  ["We appear to be dealing with something far bigger than any in the Earthen Ring had suspected."]=1,
  ["There is a great concentration of naga just outside of this cavern.$b$bWe were fortunate to reach this place unnoticed."]=2,
},
[41354]={ -- Neptool
  ["We lived under the same waves, breathed the same water, and worshipped the same god. Why, then, would the naga turn against us?"]=1,
},
[41392]={ -- Quentin
  ["A small group of us, druids and sentinels, have come to aid the tauren of Freewind Post with our common enemy: the Grimtotem Clan."]=1,
},
[41411]={ -- Prospector Whelgar
  ["Just when I thought we'd gotten a break by getting away from those raptors, things get even worse around here.$B$BNo use bellyaching though. We're gonna face this like proper dwarves!"]=1,
},
[41412]={ -- Ormer Ironbraid
  ["Don't even ask about the raptors. Just don't."]=1,
},
[41413]={ -- Merrin Rockweaver
  ["Welcome to our home away from home, $c. I wish we had a bit more hospitality to offer."]=1,
},
[41415]={ -- Shilah Slabchisel
  ["No matter what's going on elsewhere, Ironforge hasn't forgotten this land, nor any of Khaz Modan."]=1,
},
[41441]={ -- Scout Mistress Yvonia
  ["Mathias Shaw himself appointed me to assist the night elves."]=1,
},
[41455]={ -- Overseer Idra'kess
  ["I'd not expected the city to be taken so quickly. It seems we'll have much time to prepare for the invasion."]=1,
},
[41487]={ -- Hierophant Malyk
  ["I've tried explaining to Salsbury time and time again that there is no possible way that I could transform him into a worgen. He refuses to listen and has instead convinced himself that if he gains my trust I will let him in on the secret.$B$BGnomes are very strange."]=1,
},
[41488]={ -- Sentinel Mistress Geleneth
  ["A dark force grips Stonetalon Peak."]=1,
},
[41490]={ -- Donald Dealright
  ["How may I help you?"]=1,
},
[41491]={ -- Valos Shadowrest
  ["Your body looks worn and your spirit weary. Rest yourself beneath our roof and allow Elune to guide your dreams."]=1,
},
[41492]={ -- Captain Irontree
  ["This old inn isn't much to look at anymore, but it makes for a great stronghold."]=1,
},
[41498]={ -- Garunda Mountainpeak
  ["I cannot fathom the origin or purpose of this place.$B$BThese corridors are used for troop movements, yes, but they're also littered with charred and tortured corpses, some partially devoured, most simply crushed and beaten.$B$BWe are in the Firelands, but I feel as though we've crossed the threshold into hell."]=1,
},
[41503]={ -- Rethiel the Greenwarden
  ["The land suffers... it cries for mercy, $r, it cries for mercy."]=1,
},
[41504]={ -- Tortolla
  ["<The ancient's eyes are vast and deep.>$B$B<The creature speaks slowly, in a language you do not understand. Chills run up your spine. You're overwhelmed with feelings of terror and confusion.>"]=1,
  ["<The ancient's enormous dark eyes peer at you distrustfully.>"]=2,
  ["<The ancient turns to gaze at you with eyes larger than your entire head. Peering into them is like falling into a deep blue ocean.>"]=3,
  ["<The enormous ancient remains wary of you, but speaks to you as an ally.>"]=4,
},
[41531]={ -- Earthmender Duarn
  ["This creature... she is quite old, and very wise. We stand to learn a great deal about Vashj'ir and the naga, if we can only speak with Nespirah."]=1,
},
[41535]={ -- Engineer Hexascrub
  ["Amazing materials down here. Amazing! Substitutes for everything. Substitutes for substitutes. Everything's possible!"]=1,
},
[41540]={ -- Captain Taylor
  ["We've killed dozens of naga to get this far, but they still keep coming. What will it take to escape this wretched cavern?"]=1,
},
[41541]={ -- Admiral Dvorek
  ["I don't care if I die inside this husk, adventurer. I'll pay these naga back for every one of my fellow soldiers they've killed or enslaved!$b$bThe others can worry about escape. I'll worry about doling out punishment to these snakes."]=1,
},
[41618]={ -- Erunak Stonespeaker
  ["Brace yourself, $r.$b$bThe naga could attack again any moment."]=1,
  ["This region is one of the epicenters of the cataclysm that threatens to rend our world.$b$bIf we manage to survive, we must try to discover its cause."]=2,
  ["The attacks on these ships, they are clearly not random.$b$bWe must discover the motives of the naga here."]=3,
},
[41640]={ -- Wavespeaker Valoren
  ["These depths truly are a nightmare.$B$BAlthough, the battle that is about to be joined down in the breach below will make this look like kittens and rainbows."]=1,
},
[41665]={ -- Jorlan Trueblade
  ["There is a battle brewing at the Abyssal Breach. I hope that the reinforcements that arrived with the Pincer X2 will be enough."]=1,
},
[41666]={ -- Engineer Hexascrub
  ["This place isn't quite as cool as the ruins, and the air in here is a bit humid if I do say so myself, but it does have a comfy, home feel to it.$B$BDon't you think?"]=1,
},
[41667]={ -- Lieutenant "Foxy" Topper
  ["You ask me, I think we let the soup and gravy take care of this ready and write.$B$BIt's bird lime to kick and prance ourselves out of here before we're all brown bread.$B$BCatch my meaning, love?"]=1,
},
[41784]={ -- Injured Assault Volunteer
  ["<The injured soldier's pained groans are somewhat distorted by the water.>"]=1,
  ["<The injured soldier appears to still be breathing. Thankfully, his bubble remains intact.>"]=2,
  ["<There is a a painful looking gash along the soldier's side.>"]=3,
  ["<It looks as if this solider might be feigning to throw off naga suspicion. It likely saved his life.>"]=4,
},
[41786]={ -- Sergeant Bahrum
  ["I don't suppose you brought another squad with you, did you? We've got our hands full out here."]=1,
},
[41802]={ -- Wavespeaker Valoren
  ["Why are they doing this? For pearls? For war? This ancient, Nespirah, is far more powerful than the naga understand. If they're able to turn her towards their will... the damage they could cause would be tremendous."]=1,
},
[41813]={ -- Wavespeaker Tulra
  ["I don't like the feel of this place, adventurer. Naga sorceresses and slavedrivers aside... all I can sense inside this cavern is pain. The ancient one is trying to cry out, but it cannot speak."]=1,
},
[41871]={ -- Earthwatcher Komo
  ["The Earthwatchers won't allow faction squabbling to jeopardize the Earthen Ring's work here. Those who break the peace will be dealt with... harshly."]=1,
},
[41878]={ -- Earthwatcher Faldor
  ["The Wildhammers have always embraced shamanism, aye, but to find ourselves beneath the sea as part of the Earthen Ring? It would've taken more than a few tankards for me to believe that one, a year ago."]=1,
},
[41903]={ -- Tender Aru
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[41980]={ -- Fathom-Caller Azrajar
  ["Battlemaiden, you honor me with your presence. Is it time for the ritual to commence?"]=1,
},
[42071]={ -- Lady Sira'kess
  ["The summoning incantations have been prepared, but we were depending on the Crucible of Nazsharin to draw power for our spell. The artifact must be recovered."]=1,
},
[42072]={ -- Fathom-Lord Zin'jatar
  ["The city has been routed. The Azsh'ir cry your name as a victory call. You've earned much respect this day."]=1,
},
[42130]={ -- Gor'mul
  ["Our people were held as prisoners, as slaves, in this very camp by the humans. I was locked in these cages; I saw my brothers held in these stocks, hung in these gallows.$B$BI saw Orgrim Doomhammer, leader of us all, stabbed in the back. His blood stained black the earth we stand on.$B$BAnd look at us now. This is our legacy: Hammerfall, where we lost everything, and then took it back with our own hands."]=1,
},
[42197]={ -- L'ghorek
  ["<L'ghorek's voice booms inside your mind.>$B$BI AM ALMOST... DEAD. YOU MUST HELP... STOP... THE TWILIGHT'S HAMMER.$B$BTHEY DRAIN... MY ENERGY TO... CREATE... THEIR ASCENDANTS. THEY ARE A... GRAVE THREAT IN... THE IMMINENT WAR... VERSUS... NEPTULON."]=1,
},
[42288]={ -- Robby Flay
  ["Cooking for the King is an honor, not a job. Do you have time to help me on some errands?"]=1,
},
[42299]={ -- Watcher Grimeo
  ["I was just taking a rest. Eternal watch is not as easy as it sounds, $r."]=1,
},
[42317]={ -- High Tinker Mekkatorque
  ["Operation: Gnomeregan was a success. Sure, that dastardly Thermaplugg had an unforeseen trick up his sleeve, but we have him on the run! It's only a matter of time before Gnomeregan is cleaned up and in our hands again!"]=1,
},
[42331]={ -- Bipsi Frostflinger
  ["Greetings, adventurer. I can offer you training in the way of the mage."]=1,
},
[42366]={ -- Kelsey Steelspark
  ["I'm sorry, I can't offer you training. You'll have to find someone more familiar with your skills."]=1,
},
[42383]={ -- Transient
  ["I ain't tellin' you nothin'!"]=1,
  ["Oh the big hero has arrived. I'm saved! Yea, right..."]=2,
  ["You wanna talk? Pay up."]=3,
},
[42384]={ -- Homeless Stormwind Citizen
  ["I ain't tellin' you nothin'!"]=1,
  ["Oh the big hero has arrived. I'm saved! Yea, right..."]=2,
  ["You wanna talk? Pay up."]=3,
},
[42386]={ -- Homeless Stormwind Citizen
  ["I ain't tellin' you nothin'!"]=1,
  ["Oh the big hero has arrived. I'm saved! Yea, right..."]=2,
  ["You wanna talk? Pay up."]=3,
},
[42391]={ -- West Plains Drifter
  ["I ain't tellin' you nothin'!"]=1,
  ["Oh the big hero has arrived. I'm saved! Yea, right..."]=2,
  ["You wanna talk? Pay up."]=3,
},
[42465]={ -- Therazane
  ["Deathwing's taint shall be wiped from Deepholm, and his Twilight cultists with it."]=1,
  ["<The Stonemother stares down at you. Through you. As if she's peering into your soul.>$B$BMy daughter, Theradras, sequestered herself deep within the Crystal Caverns of Terramok to grieve for her lost love, Zaetar. There, heartless, stoneless beings invaded and slaughtered her amidst her mourning.$B$BIf I had any reason to trust a creature afflicted by the curse of flesh, it was stripped from me that day. And yet in your arrogance, you persist.$B$BOne day, you will outlive your usefulness."]=2,
},
[42466]={ -- Terrath the Steady
  ["When the Earthwarder began to recover, he became ill content with the quiet. With the peace. It was not long before he turned the stone dragons upon us.$B$BWith Deathwing gone, they are without purpose again. We can remind them of our strength. Bring them back to the Earthmother."]=1,
},
[42467]={ -- Diamant the Patient
  ["Among the Twilight cult are magics that threaten us greatly.$B$BWe have every desire to wipe their existence from our home.$B$BWe are divided, and so we cannot.$B$BAnd so I watch...$B$BAnd wait..."]=1,
},
[42469]={ -- Kor the Immovable
  ["Deepholm was a slow, quiet place. Always alive. Steadily moving. Never rushed. In this time, I strived to become one with the earth, and to a large degree, I succeeded.$B$BLater, the Earthwarder returned, injured. He did not upset the balance at first. He'd stayed here before, and we knew of him. The shift did not truly begin until the Twilight cult joined him."]=1,
},
[42472]={ -- Gorsik the Tumultuous
  ["My brothers are strong, but my brothers are passive.$B$BChange does not occur without movement, contention, and violence. Our enemies live this, whether they fully realize it or not. The passive nature of my brothers makes them weak and vulnerable to these new enemies.$B$BNot I. I have no fear of change. I will tear at the ground and move the mountains. I embrace change."]=1,
},
[42473]={ -- Grimy Greasefingers
  ["How can I keep a clean inn with all of this going on? Are you going to take care of this pygmy problem?"]=1,
},
[42497]={ -- Mama Celeste
  ["I hope you weren't looking for something to eat, $c."]=1,
},
[42506]={ -- Marogg
  ["Feeding a Horde army is no easy task. I have lots to do, do you have time to help?"]=1,
},
[42553]={ -- Engineer Grindspark
  ["Have you seen my latest invention? It's going to be a hit... if it doesn't explode."]=1,
},
[42573]={ -- Earthcaller Yevaa
  ["We must do whatever it takes to recombine the fragments of the World Pillar.$B$BBut first, we must regain all of them."]=1,
},
[42574]={ -- Initiate Goldmine
  ["Oh sure, she said, it'll be a simple trip out into the wastes."]=1,
},
[42612]={ -- Malcom Fendelson
  ["Even here, among the surf and sun, I can feel the darkness that lurks in these lands.$B$BIt's fascinating, don't you think?"]=1,
},
[42613]={ -- Elder Torntusk
  ["We are proud to call ourselves the last tribe of Forest Trolls to serve the Horde.$B$BIn time, we will overcome the other tribes, and the dwarves, and the Hinterlands will be ours."]=1,
},
[42618]={ -- Voldreka
  ["We can't help ya 'ere, mon."]=1,
  ["Wit' practice, ya'll find that the dark arts can be much stronga than any weapon."]=2,
},
[42622]={ -- Eliza Darkgrin
  ["The trolls here are quite accepting of my kind. After all, they spoke to the dead for centuries before the Forsaken even existed.$B$BIt's good for business."]=1,
},
[42624]={ -- Kotonga
  ["Jintha'alor gonna be ours, mon. The vilebranch be weak, nasty traitors, undeservin' of the favor of the loa."]=1,
},
[42642]={ -- Primal Torntusk
  ["Prepare for war! We will no longer tolerate the Vilebranch!"]=1,
},
[42684]={ -- Stormcaller Mylra
  ["There's more to this than we know, adventurer. I can guarantee you that much."]=1,
},
[42708]={ -- Kharmarn Palegrip
  ["Kharmarn Palegrip, of Kharmarn's Mountain Movers, at your service."]=1,
  ["If you need a mountain moved, I can do that. I can make 'em for you, too."]=2,
  ["This isn't the biggest job I've done, not even close. This cataclysm may just be the best thing that ever happened to us!"]=3,
},
[42730]={ -- Earthcaller Torunscar
  ["Dere be nothin' chaotic about dis attack. Da elementals and giants be organizin' against us. It be seemin' dat somehow we've earned da ire of Therazane, da Stonemother herself."]=1,
},
[42849]={ -- High Tinker Mekkatorque
