},
[44802]={ -- Prospector Brewer
  ["Call me Twin. That's what Mowi calls me.$B$BNo, we don' look alike. Are ye blind? She's a gnome fer the Light's sake! We act alike. 'specially when we're fightin'.$B$BAs fer my name... have ya na heard o' the storied Wildhammer Brewers? Care fer a pint?"]=1,
},
[44806]={ -- Fargo Flintlocke
  ["Pack yer bags, adventurer! We're off to the Twilight Highlands. You ready?"]=1,
},
[44825]={ -- Bat Handler Maggotbreath
  ["What do you want? Can't you see I have bat droppings to clean up?"]=1,
},
[44860]={ -- Harrison Jones
  ["Just look at this place!$b$bIt's an archaeologist's dream..."]=1,
},
[44863]={ -- Zen'Kiki
  ["'Ey, mon! You come to help Zen'Kiki out?"]=1,
  ["Thanks for helpin' me out, mon! No more shapeshifts for me... I'm gonna work on my healing!"]=2,
},
[44866]={ -- Auctioneer Drezmit
  ["Feel free to browse the items up for bid. I can help you place an item up for auction too."]=1,
},
[44869]={ -- Marvon Rivetseeker
  ["MORE Ghaz'ridian? Why would you think I would want any MORE of those infernal things? I'm stuck with about nine thousand, and they're not selling! Why did I ever think anyone would want a statue of an overgrown snake? Pah!"]=1,
  ["I saw the Wastewander and their leader, Caliph Scorpidsting, heading south of here. Watch out, they look like they've toughened up some!"]=2,
  ["I saw the biggest bug you've ever seen wandering around one of those Silithid hives. Or maybe it was both of them. I think the heat's getting to me...do you see that sand kitten over there?"]=3,
  ["I don't know much about dragons, but a big, scary one showed up one day just over yonder, near the entrance to the Caverns of Time. He kept yelling something about...what was it...the end of time as we know it? I wasn't really paying much attention."]=4,
  ["An old friend of mine named Frokle was supposed to be heading in to Gadgetzan, but him and the rest of the Bilgewater crew manning the ship never arrived. I've heard rumors of a crazy goblin that hangs out near a downed flying machine in the far south, could it be...?"]=5,
  ["I found a broken-down cart amongst the dunes when I was checking out the potential profitibility of Centipaar Silithid Snacks (patent pending). I thought to myself, 'hey, free cart!' That is, until the biggest basilisk you've ever seen showed up, and I had to leave the whole thing behind!"]=6,
  ["Have you seen those huge dirt mounds moving around beneath the dunes? They belong to a species of tunneling worm the likes of which Azeroth has never seen! I'm sure that battling one would be a great learning experience for a seasoned adventurer such as yourself."]=7,
  ["When the Cataclysm happened, the links bounding elementals across Azeroth weakened significantly. One such elemental, Aquementas, is no longer imprisoned. I hear he's causing some major problems for the Southsea gang!"]=8,
},
[44877]={ -- Grunt Soran
  ["Guarding the bank and treasures of the Horde is far more satisfying than dispensing coins and trade goods from inside a cage of iron.$B$BI would not exchange places with one of those quill-pushing goblins for a moment."]=1,
},
[44878]={ -- Grunt Karus
  ["Guarding the bank and treasures of the Horde is far more satisfying than dispensing coins and trade goods from inside a cage of iron.$B$BI would not exchange places with one of those quill-pushing goblins for a moment."]=1,
},
[44916]={ -- Admiral Hatchet
  ["I'll burn this place to the ground before I am shamed in the eyes of Hellscream!"]=1,
},
[44929]={ -- Tran'rek
  ["How may I help you?"]=1,
},
[44969]={ -- Furgus Warpwood
  ["Greetings, young one, it is good to see a noble soul again.$B$BDire Maul, formerly Eldre'thalas, is corrupt to its very core. I have watched my brethren fall to the forces of darkness and chaos. Many would have this place razed to the ground to end its horrors forever.$B$BBut Dire Maul is worth saving, mortal. Help me, and perhaps together we can unleash the vast power lost here for the forces of good, as they once were so long ago."]=1,
},
[44971]={ -- "Ambassador" Dagg'thol
  ["Da Gordok no like Dagg'thol, so he kill them. Da stupid trees and goat men no like Dagg'thol, so he want kill them too.$B$BPuny $r like Dagg'thol and help him take dis place for Master? Or does Dagg'thol need kill you too?$B$BStupid tree keep staring at Ambassador Dagg'thol..."]=1,
},
[44973]={ -- Ruberick
  ["Stone troggs... the vermin of the deeps."]=1,
},
[44975]={ -- Old Umbehto
  ["You be here ta learn fishin', mon? Or maybe ta buy some tings for it?"]=1,
},
[44978]={ -- Sesebi
  ["Dark is de jungle, but fertile is its soil.$B$BMay de spirits of de earth watch over ya, $c."]=1,
},
[44983]={ -- Stormwind Traveling Merchant
  ["I'm completely out of supplies and the road is blocked by orcs, just my luck!"]=1,
},
[44991]={ -- Estulan
  ["I care far too deeply about redeeming Eldre'thalas to deal with any other matter. War, strife, allegiances, none of it matters until this city is safe."]=1,
},
[45015]={ -- Darkspear Headhunter
  ["You take a wrong turn, mon? Heh heh heh. What can I be helpin' ya find?"]=1,
  ["Don't see many a' your kind 'round here, mon. What can I be helpin' ya find?"]=2,
  ["You be a LONG way from home, mon. Heh heh heh. What can I be helpin' ya find?"]=3,
},
[45019]={ -- Berserker Zanga
  ["Take it easy, mon. I only train da warriors."]=1,
},
[45023]={ -- Huntress Kuzari
  ["Hey mon, you be needin' to head on over to da $c trainer."]=1,
},
[45029]={ -- Witch Doctor Umbu
  ["May da spirits protect you mon."]=1,
},
[45043]={ -- Peak Grindstone
  ["We've got to get out of here!"]=1,
},
[45068]={ -- Alliance Spirit Guide
  ["How I can guide your path, young one?"]=1,
},
[45069]={ -- Alliance Spirit Guide
  ["How I can guide your path, young one?"]=1,
},
[45070]={ -- Alliance Spirit Guide
  ["How I can guide your path, young one?"]=1,
},
[45071]={ -- Alliance Spirit Guide
  ["How I can guide your path, young one?"]=1,
},
[45072]={ -- Alliance Spirit Guide
  ["How I can guide your path, young one?"]=1,
},
[45073]={ -- Alliance Spirit Guide
  ["How I can guide your path, young one?"]=1,
},
[45074]={ -- Horde Spirit Guide
  ["How I can guide your path, young one?"]=1,
},
[45075]={ -- Horde Spirit Guide
  ["How I can guide your path, young one?"]=1,
},
[45076]={ -- Horde Spirit Guide
  ["How I can guide your path, young one?"]=1,
},
[45077]={ -- Horde Spirit Guide
  ["How I can guide your path, young one?"]=1,
},
[45078]={ -- Horde Spirit Guide
  ["How I can guide your path, young one?"]=1,
},
[45079]={ -- Horde Spirit Guide
  ["How I can guide your path, young one?"]=1,
},
[45086]={ -- Sijambi
  ["Come in, mon... forget yer cares for a while!$B$BRest de body, rest de soul."]=1,
},
[45095]={ -- Night-Stalker Ku'nanji
  ["Nothin' ta see here, mon. Be on yer way, why don'cha?"]=1,
},
[45107]={ -- Eva Sarkhoff
  ["Hello young $g Master:Mistress;. I am Eva Sarkhoff and this is my husband, Lucien. It is a pleasure to make your acquaintance."]=1,
},
[45137]={ -- Shadow-Walker Zuru
  ["You be watchin' yerself, $c. Respect our ways, or a curse be on you and yours."]=1,
  ["I do what me can to train you in the priestly ways, if that what you be here for."]=2,
},
[45138]={ -- Unjari Feltongue
  ["De secrets I have ta share would blast your soul apart, $c.$B$BTrust me: You be wantin' ta talk ta someone else about trainin'."]=1,
},
[45139]={ -- Zirazi the Star-Gazer
  ["Sorry, $c.$B$BI ain't believin' ya got de right mind for graspin' de nature of portal magic."]=1,
  ["Hey der, mon.$B$BIf ya be ready, I can teach ya how ta be conjurin' up a portal back ta dis place..."]=2,
},
[45148]={ -- Morris Vant
  ["Good day, $g brave: fair; $c. How can I be of service?"]=1,
},
[45149]={ -- Outfitter Mendelev
  ["Can I help you?"]=1,
},
[45151]={ -- High Cleric Alphus
  ["May the Light watch over you, child. And how may I help you this fine day?"]=1,
},
[45152]={ -- Magus Bisp
  ["W-what are you doing up here, $r? Can't you see you're interfering with OFFICIAL ARGENT CRUSADE BUSINESS!?"]=1,
},
[45167]={ -- Kurdran Wildhammer
  ["I've been placed in command of Alliance joint operations in the Twilight Highlands.$B$BThe independent Wildhammer clans still dot this countryside. If we can unite them under the Alliance banner, nothing can stop us! But enemies close in on all sides. I hope you're ready for a fight, $c."]=1,
},
[45168]={ -- Fargo Flintlocke
  ["This here terrain is terrible! Spongy ground, all lumpy-like with stumps and stones. Like angry oatmeal. The mud'll practically swallow a steam tank whole.$B$BOur gear's all mired in the muck, getting thumped by the Horde!"]=1,
},
[45169]={ -- Lieutenant Emry
  ["You will own this peninsula, $c.$B$BYou will be a weapon.$B$BYou will be a minister of death, praying for war."]=1,
},
[45170]={ -- Simon Chandler
  ["The fleet was mostly intact as it limped into harbor after our engagement with the Horde. We weighed anchor in the shadow of Highbank here to regroup.$B$BThen the naga came.$B$BScaly, glistening hands clambering up the anchor chains... dragging men, screaming, into the depths...$B$BThese are cursed shores, adventurer. Cursed."]=1,
  ["Slaughter them, $c! Destroy as many naga as you can to honor those that fell."]=2,
},
[45172]={ -- Thordun Hammerblow
  ["Poor Lightning. She's gonna need some time to recouperate."]=1,
  ["Well then. Ready to fly?"]=2,
},
[45173]={ -- Talaa
  ["We have pledged to open an elemental gateway from Stormwind to the Highlands, but interference from the Bastion of Twilight hampers our efforts.$B$BWhat madness are they engaged in over there?"]=1,
  ["The portal has been opened! Thanks to your efforts, we can now quickly travel from Stormwind to Twilight Highlands."]=2,
},
[45180]={ -- Harrison Jones
  ["I've been meaning to investigate this site.$b$bNo time like the present!"]=1,
},
[45200]={ -- Crusade Commander Eligor Dawnbringer
  ["The Brotherhood of the Light transcends the ability of any other group to eradicate affronts to the Light. We will take any actions necessary to rid the world of foul beasts like these undead. Nothing will stand in our way.$B$BAre you with us, or against us?"]=1,
},
[45206]={ -- Crusade Commander Korfax
  ["There are no emotions. There are no morals. There are no zealots.$B$BThere is only the Brotherhood.$B$BHere, in the very chapel where Uther the Lightbringer joined the Order of the Silver Hand, I, Korfax, Champion of the Light, will inspire fear into the fearless.$B$BNothing will curb my fury - not the Scarlet Crusade, not the Argent Dawn, not my brothers, not even you."]=1,
},
[45211]={ -- Fiznak
  ["I can't see a thing with this mask on, but I'm not about to tell HER that."]=1,
},
[45226]={ -- Naraat the Earthspeaker
  ["I've heard much about you, adventurer. The world needs people like you now more than ever."]=1,
},
[45244]={ -- Farseer Krogar
  ["Hail, adventurer. We're in need of your assistance."]=1,
},
[45286]={ -- KTC Train-a-Tron Deluxe
  ["I can teach you the basics of any gathering or production profession, but that's all. To learn more than an apprentice's skills, you'll need to visit a specialist dedicated to only one profession. You can learn up to two professions: Two gathering, two production, or one of each. Secondary skills like Archaeology, Cooking, and Fishing don't count towards your two professions; you can learn as many of those as you like."]=1,
},
[45296]={ -- Harrison Jones
  ["The hieroglyphs on your tablets indicate that there's a way to get this mechanism working again.$b$bWe just need to figure out how..."]=1,
},
[45298]={ -- Mule Driver Ironshod
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[45300]={ -- Caretaker Nuunwa
  ["You may rest here, if you like. The Temple of Earth is under our care, now."]=1,
},
[45328]={ -- Packmaster Stonebruiser
  ["Never underestimate the power of proper supply management. The warriors may win the battles, but it's the supplies that win the war."]=1,
},
[45329]={ -- Crusade Commander Eligor Dawnbringer
  ["The Brotherhood of the Light transcends the ability of any other group to eradicate affronts to the Light. We will take any actions necessary to rid the world of foul beasts like these undead. Nothing will stand in our way.$B$BAre you with us, or against us?"]=1,
},
[45331]={ -- Master Craftsman Wilhelm
  ["Weapons...armor...these are the keys to victory. Any warrior, no matter how strong, is essentially defenseless without them.$B$BI have crafted many a legend in my day, $r. You will find nothing like them in all of Azeroth. They are the key to my brethren's success."]=1,
},
[45332]={ -- Earthcaller Torunscar
  ["Da Twilight's Hammer have been assaultin' our rings all over da highlands, and dey've taken many for demselves in da process. Dis be our last and we have no intention of givin' it up, no matter what kind of horrors dey be summonin' from the earth to assault us."]=1,
},
[45337]={ -- Tyelis
  ["The Light gives us the strength and magic to triumph."]=1,
  ["I have no time for a sermon now, $c. Seek your knowledge elsewhere."]=2,
},
[45347]={ -- Brother Silverhallow
  ["Sorry, friend. You'll have to seek training elsewhere."]=1,
},
[45400]={ -- Fiona's Caravan
  ["Inside the caravan are boxes of vendor supplies, along with the personal belongings of Fiona and her companions."]=1,
},
[45407]={ -- Ibdil the Mender
  ["That which has broken, I mend.$B$BSo much has been broken in recent time. So very much."]=1,
},
[45408]={ -- D'lom the Collector
  ["That which falls, I collect.$B$BOf late, there have been many things to gather."]=1,
},
[45417]={ -- Fiona
  ["Where are those lunkheads?"]=1,
  ["Looks like they found their way back home. I'm relieved.$b$bYou came back, too! Are you interested in joining us?"]=2,
  ["I'd like to set up shop in Light's Hope Chapel someday. I'm not much of a fighter, but that doesn't mean I can't help the cause."]=3,
  ["The boys and I have only traveled together for a little while, but I already can't imagine life without either one of them."]=4,
  ["I hope you've made yourself welcome to the items inside my caravan. If we're not using them, you might as well borrow them."]=5,
  ["Why would he run off like that?!"]=6,
  ["Promise me you'll find him, adventurer."]=7,
  ["<Fiona is rather upset. She doesn't seem to be in the mood to talk.>"]=8,
  ["Good to see you again, adventurer!"]=9,
  ["Hey, adventurer! You here to visit, or did you want to buy something?"]=10,
  ["Well, well... look who's here!"]=11,
},
[45432]={ -- Initiate Goldmine
  ["Once you go shaman, you don't go back.$B$BI completely underestimated the usefulness of fire elementals. Easy to discipline too: just add water."]=1,
},
[45451]={ -- Argus Highbeacon
  ["It's good to have traveling companions. The road gets lonely out here."]=1,
},
[45496]={ -- Commander Hickley
  ["I cannot promise that your rest will be peaceful, $c. These orcs do not know when to quit."]=1,
  ["A drunk orc is a sight to see. An army of drunk orcs is a sight I wish to never see again."]=2,
  ["If my mother had told me there would be days like this I would not have believed her."]=3,
},
[45498]={ -- "Salty" Rocka
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[45500]={ -- Urk Gagbaz
  ["How may I help you?"]=1,
},
[45514]={ -- Wavespeaker Valoren
  ["Do you need to return to Vashj'ir?"]=1,
},
[45528]={ -- Calen
  ["Deathwing has returned. He's seized Grim Batol and much of the highlands, and I feel near powerless to stop him.$B$BSoon, our queen shall arrive, and together we shall put the once Earthwarder in his place."]=1,
},
[45559]={ -- Nivi Weavewell
  ["Aren't the patterns beautiful? Each one speaks with its own voice."]=1,
},
[45563]={ -- Tinza Silvermug
  ["Indeed. I stand before you in a form that you can comprehend, mortal. Surely, you could not bear to stand in the presence of the dragon known as Vaelastrasz.$B$B<Vaelan laughs.>$B$BShall I continue?"]=1,
  ["You and your coin are -always- welcome here."]=2,
},
[45669]={ -- Cassius the White
  ["We must stop Cho'gall from creating his ultimate weapon at all costs, even if that means sacrificing ourselves."]=1,
},
[45709]={ -- Bruiser Janx
  ["You lookin' for trainin'? No can do. I ain't your guy."]=1,
},
[45713]={ -- Dankin Farsnipe
  ["Be warned, mortal, it is exceptionally rare that one of the lesser clans in this citadel would hold such an item. Your search could take decades. I recommend you destroy these beasts without impunity."]=1,
},
[45714]={ -- Conjurer Mixli
  ["Hey, it ain't MY fault ya didn't learn proper spellcraft. Go pester a $c trainer, yeah?"]=1,
},
[45717]={ -- Vish the Sneak
  ["What? I look like a $c to you?$B$BGet outta here, will ya?"]=1,
},
[45718]={ -- Environmental Engineer Linza
  ["You need somethin'?$B$BToo bad. I got nothin' for ya, $c."]=1,
},
[45720]={ -- Kazrali the Witch
  ["Look. You don't even WANNA know the sorta stuff I could teach ya.$B$BSeriously. It'd melt yer brain. Go play nice somewhere else."]=1,
},
[45772]={ -- General Ammantep
  ["Our enemies can bury entire cities under the sand. Our traditions have not prepared us for such a war."]=1,
},
[45786]={ -- Trade Baron Silversnap
  ["On behalf of the illustrious and always-neutral Steamwheedle Cartel, welcome to Bogpaddle! We're proud to be the only beachfront resort and military-grade weapons yard in the Eastern Kingdoms.$B$BYou guys may have that little war ragin' just south of here, but inside these walls, it's all fun and games. So take a load off, have some R&R and a drink or two, and keep out of trouble... or my bruisers will remind your skull what 'neutral territory' means."]=1,
},
[45789]={ -- Bezzil
  ["Yo.$B$BYou lookin' for a lost companion?"]=1,
},
[45796]={ -- Master Mathias Shaw
  ["There's an artifact, a weapon, being forged with the power of an Old God. We don't know exactly what it is, but we need to get to it before it's completed by Cho'gall.$B$BEverything else is secondary. Everyone is expendable, including you and I."]=1,
},
[45814]={ -- Orgrimmar Bruiser
  ["What are you looking for?"]=1,
},
[45822]={ -- Off-Duty Bruiser
  ["What are you looking for?"]=1,
},
[45823]={ -- High Executioner Nuzrak
  ["We will always remember Kargath Bladefist for what he once was to the Horde. He was one of the finest warriors to ever live. Even the Alliance recognizes this. The Kargath Expeditionary force was named in his honor, and I plan to ensure we live up to his name. We will drive out the Dark Iron Dwarves and claim Blackrock Mountain, and all of the surrounding areas, for the Horde as they so rightfully belong. You will be the Warchief's blade against Thaurissan. Wear that honor proudly."]=1,
},
[45827]={ -- Off-Duty Grunt
  ["What are you looking for?"]=1,
},
[45828]={ -- Argent Apothecary Judkins
  ["I don't get many visitors this deep in the Plaguewood. Abominations, mostly.$b$bCan I help you with something?"]=1,
},
[45831]={ -- Crusader Kevin Frost
  ["Don't let anybody tell you that the Scourge is defeated. Look... do they not still roam the Plaguewood? They cling to their corrupted land like a child's blanket.$b$bI have no choice but to fight. Until my last breath, I will fight them."]=1,
},
[45874]={ -- Schnottz Scout
  ["After a quick assessment, you determine that this fellow has expired within the last several hours."]=1,
},
[45904]={ -- Angus Stillmountain
  ["There's nothing more exciting than to soar through the air.$B$BWell, maybe to fight while soaring through the air, and a good tankard of ale afterward!"]=1,
},
[45966]={ -- Nevin Twistwrench
  ["There will be more time to talk once we get back to the surface safely."]=1,
},
[46006]={ -- Ginny Goodwin
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[46022]={ -- Beezil Linkspanner
  ["Oh, ahh... hello there, good traveler! What can this fine goblin do for you today?$b$bI'll assure you that I'm here in Light's Hope Chapel solely due to my hatred of the Scourge which I share with these Argent Crusaders, and definitely not because I'm running away from any sort of embarrassing zeppelin crash!$b$bI'll stop talking now, before I implicate myself any further!"]=1,
  ["Hey boss. You need someone to help drive the caravan, you just let ol' Beezil know."]=2,
},
[46076]={ -- SI:7 Squad Commander
  ["Good to see you again, adventurer. We snuck some more of us in here while you were prepping the Gates for the attack.$B$BI'll show you where we're to rendezvous with Master Shaw.$B$B<The squad leader produces a map of the Twilight Citadel and points to the spot.>$B$BLet me know when you're ready, and we'll all head up together."]=1,
},
[46077]={ -- Lord Itharius
  ["Hakkar is known by many names. Some call him the Blood God, others simply refer to him as The Soulflayer. Titles aside, he is an entity of enormous power with malicious intentions for our world.$B$BMy flight discovered this temple early on and sank it beneath the Swamp of Sorrows. Unfortunately, we only seemed to aid the Atal'ai by ensuring their efforts to summon Hakkar went on undisturbed. Many of the dragons tasked with guarding the temple have been corrupted, and the Soulflayer's presence grows with each passing day.$B$BI cannot stop them alone. Together, though, we might have enough time to stop this madness."]=1,
},
[46078]={ -- Boss Mida
  ["Relax, spend some coin... we've got everything from money changers and laundry services to exotic drinks.$B$BAnd if anyone gives you any trouble? You just let ME know, and I'll handle it.$B$BI'm Mida... the boss.$B$BOh, the renovations? Yeah, I'm always willing to help our new allies for the right price!"]=1,
},
[46082]={ -- Engineer Niff
  ["Not now, $gpal:lady;.$B$BI gotta re-tune the boss' shredder.$B$BShe don't like movin' around the city on foot like any old chump, ESPECIALLY if she's gotta go deal with the warchief."]=1,
},
[46134]={ -- High Commander Kamses
  ["We do not choose to go to war, adventurer. War comes to us.$B$BWe must do what we must to be ready."]=1,
},
[46135]={ -- High Priest Amet
  ["The visions are clouded... like these waters."]=1,
},
[46143]={ -- Flynn Dunwald
  ["I have to give these Twilight a wee bit of credit... what they lack in skill, they make up for in numbers and tenacity. They got a few good licks in during our last bout."]=1,
},
[46174]={ -- Cayden Dunwald
  ["Ya see that pass ahead dere, $glad:lass;?"]=1,
},
[46177]={ -- Keely Dunwald
  ["The Dunwald family is built tough, but they let it go to their heads. I worry that me brothers put their repuation to the test a wee bit too often."]=1,
},
[46181]={ -- Enchanter Farendin
  ["Were you looking to Reforge an item? I no longer provide such services. The ethereals of Orgrimmar's Drag will help you, though. Any of the city's guards can provide directions."]=1,
},
[46236]={ -- High Examiner Tae'thelan Bloodwatcher
  ["Greetings, my name is Tae'thelan Bloodwatcher. I have spent the better part of a lifetime training in the art of sorcery and gathering like-minded blood elves to form The Reliquary.$B$BYou see, there are ancient, powerful relics spread throughout this world that I plan to use to free my people from their addiction and unify them again as the proud, indomitable race we once were.$B$BMagic is something to be embraced and, I assure you, a force that can be utilized free of corruption with proper teaching.$B$BAs it stands, the other races of the Alliance and even the Horde mock our kind for our half-destroyed capital, still-standing statues of Sunstrider and blunder after blunder across the world.$B$BNo more."]=1,
},
[46242]={ -- Earthcaller Yevaa
  ["When we returned from Deepholm, we found that the Twilight's Hammer had established a base here and taken control of the elemental portals.$B$BPlease, adventurer, you must stop them before Cho'gall can complete whatever it is that he's up to inside the Bastion of Twilight!"]=1,
},
[46243]={ -- Initiate Goldmine
  ["What a mess! We come back from saving Deepholm and what do we find?$B$BThe Twilight's Stinkin' Hammer!$B$BGood thing you're here to straighten this all out!"]=1,
},
[46269]={ -- Mother Matterly
  ["Poor dear, you must be exhausted.$B$BThere's food and drink, if you like, and it's safe to rest here."]=1,
},
[46271]={ -- Provisioner Elda
  ["Looking for something to eat, $c?$B$BOr just a place to rest your weary bones for a while?"]=1,
},
[46274]={ -- Gaffer Coilspring
  ["This is where we gather the surivors to prepare them for decontamination. From there, it's just a short trip to the surface!"]=1,
},
[46293]={ -- Torben Zapblast
  ["Torben Zapblast, teleportation solutions engineer at your service!"]=1,
},
[46338]={ -- Budd
  ["Have you checked out my breathin' hat?$b$bNo more suckin' on clams for Budd! No sirree..."]=1,
},
[46413]={ -- Countess Verrall
  ["The Twilight's Hammer invaded these once-pristine waters, and the surrounding lands, a short time ago.$B$BThey have polluted my loch and I would have them gone so that I may purify it once more."]=1,
},
[46425]={ -- Ramkahen Prisoner
  ["Are you with the Neferset scum? Did they send you to do their dirty work? Speak!"]=1,
},
[46458]={ -- Budd
  ["It ain't all bad...$b$bI still got my breathin' hat!"]=1,
},
[46475]={ -- Anchorite Traska
  ["Ah... I do not have many visitors here.$B$BPlease, sit a while."]=1,
},
[46591]={ -- Colin Thundermar
  ["Curse the Dragonmaw!$B$BThey kill our birds, attack our families, take our land. Even as the world crashes down around us, still they assault our homes.$B$BIf your Alliance wants the help of the Wildhammer, there's only one way to win us over: Stop. The. Dragonmaw."]=1,
},
[46603]={ -- Nomarch Teneth
  ["State your business. Be brief, if possible."]=1,
},
[46612]={ -- Lieutenant Horatio Laine
  ["There's always something new to investigate."]=1,
},
[46628]={ -- Flynn Dunwald
  ["Hah! My brothers be itchin' for a fight. It was all I could do ta hold them back this long.$B$BYou in?"]=1,
  ["Like a Dunwald. I like you."]=2,
},
[46642]={ -- Innkeeper Nufa
  ["If we are to make these new lands ours then we must have places to rest our battle weary bodies. Lay your axe by the fire and share the stories of your mighty battles."]=1,
},
[46650]={ -- Eddie Flofizzle
  ["We fish, we sleep, and we explode things. What could be better than that?"]=1,
},
[46659]={ -- Gavran Goodspade
  ["How may I help you?"]=1,
},
[46660]={ -- Aidan Summerwind
  ["I was as surprised as you to find the black dragonflight asserting its will against New Kargath. Gorn is stubborn, and refuses help from anyone.$b$bEven so, High Examiner Bloodwatcher has asked me to watch from a distance, to make sure things do not become... ugly."]=1,
},
[46667]={ -- Blademaster Ronakada
  ["After the fall of the Burning Blade Clan, we blademasters swore to free ourselves and our people from demonic control.$B$BThis may be done, but my honor remains unsatisfied.$B$BI shall fight for the Horde - and train other warriors to do so - until I die gloriously in battle. This is the only path I may tread."]=1,
},
[46675]={ -- Lugrah
  ["I can instruct you in jewelcrafting. Interested?"]=1,
},
[46741]={ -- Muraga
  ["I can instruct you in herbalism. Interested?"]=1,
},
[46750]={ -- Fusion Core
  ["Keeping the fusion core stable is taxing nearly all my computational powers.$B$BLet us hope that floating-point error got worked out during my last maintenance cycle."]=1,
},
[46760]={ -- Lead Prospector Durdin
  ["Hope you brought your mining pick, pilgrim. No place better than here for digging up ancient treasure."]=1,
},
[46768]={ -- The Warden
  ["The hulking statue stands inert, untouched for centuries."]=1,
  ["Judging by its color, this must be The Warden.$b$bYou see a small indentation where your pawn might fit."]=2,
},
[46769]={ -- The Sentinel
  ["While it is clearly quite old, this statue does not appear to have crumbled at all over the centuries."]=1,
  ["This red statue looks a lot like the Sentinel's pawn that you hold.$b$bThe statue has a small indentation that matches the size of your pawn."]=2,
},
[46804]={ -- Keegan Firebeard
  ["You're certainly not local. Matters to me little though. I'll put my life on the line for anyone here as long as they pull their weight."]=1,
},
[46805]={ -- Iain Firebeard
  ["They took us unaware... attacked all of the highlands all at once, burstin' forth from the ground, swoopin' from the air. Most of the gryphon wings were scattered, and far too many good dwarves lost their lives.$B$BThere'd be little hope at all if Keegan hadn't rallied us together. I owe that man my life. At least now we have a chance."]=1,
},
[46872]={ -- Prince Nadun
  ["I am Prince Nadun of Ramkahen. The Neferset tribe has turned against the other tol'vir.$B$BHelp me escape so that I may lobby my brother, the king, to wage war against these traitors!"]=1,
},
[46891]={ -- Ghostly Goblin Celebrant
  ["It's good to visit with friends and family again, celebrating and sharing stories of old."]=1,
},
[46894]={ -- Ghostly Worgen Celebrant
  ["It's good to visit with friends and family again, celebrating and sharing stories of old."]=1,
},
[46901]={ -- Cheerful Goblin Spirit
  ["It's good to visit with friends and family again, celebrating and sharing stories of old."]=1,
},
[46908]={ -- Cheerful Worgen Spirit
  ["It's good to visit with friends and family again, celebrating and sharing stories of old."]=1,
},
[46930]={ -- Victoria Dolen
  ["Dragon's Mouth was established to give the Alliance their first real foothold here in the Badlands. Despite its position between Stormwind and Dun Morogh, the Badlands have traditionally been Horde territory.$b$bIf that's ever to change, we need to start asserting ourselves. Of course, the dragon attacks on New Kargath don't hurt our cause either."]=1,
},
[46939]={ -- Mullan Gryphon
  ["The gryphon appears to be injured. Perhaps healing or first aid could get it back on its feet."]=1,
},
[46968]={ -- Mullan Gryphon
  ["The gryphon looks at you intently, clearly smelling a familiar scent on your clothing."]=1,
},
[46978]={ -- Harrison Jones
  ["Dad always told me the big fellas hit hard, but that they're slow...$b$bI'm pretty sure dad never met this guy!"]=1,
},
[46983]={ -- Benjamin Foxworthy
  ["I cannot help you with your training. Seek out a $c trainer."]=1,
},
[47005]={ -- Adarrah
  ["It's lovely here, don't you think?$b$bA bit hot, perhaps, but it's a dry heat..."]=1,
},
[47006]={ -- Packleader Ivar Bloodfang
  ["The Bloodfang will prevail."]=1,
},
[47158]={ -- Harrison Jones
  ["The coffer is just beyond these ruins.$b$bLet's go!"]=1,
},
[47159]={ -- Commander Schnottz
  ["Eediot!$b$bAvay vizh you!$b$bCan't you see zhat I am concentratink?"]=1,
  ["So, zhis is zhe $r $c I've heard so much about, hmm?$b$bAs you know, zhere is vone obelisk zhat has yet to be activated....$b$bVhen zhe time comes to restore zhis ancient mechanism, vhill you be zhere? Vill history remember you?$b$bZhat depends on your villingness to cooperate!"]=2,
  ["How do you zhink Gobbles vould feel about you if he vere here?$b$bHmm?"]=3,
  ["After zhat ritual debacle, you owe me, $r.$b$bAnd I plan on collectink!"]=4,
},
[47176]={ -- Ambassador Laurent
  ["I'm not surprised.$b$bSo many questions, I cannot ignore...$b$bWhy all these weapons for an archaeological dig? And what is being done with the unearthed relics? Under what authority is the excavation being conducted?$b$bThe answers don't seem to be forthcoming. I'll just have to find out for myself, I suppose."]=1,
},
[47195]={ -- Slate Quicksand
  ["We must keep Therazane's forces from attacking Stonehearth.$B$BIf they do, they will steal the middle fragment of the World Pillar."]=1,
},
[47197]={ -- Flint Oremantle
  ["You've taught me what it means to have friends, adventurer."]=1,
},
[47233]={ -- Gordul
  ["The Shattered Hand will see the Horde to their former glory."]=1,
  ["I don't train your kind $c."]=2,
  ["Messengers from Ravenholdt delivered this letter to me this morning. It is addressed to you, adventurer."]=3,
},
[47240]={ -- Commander Marcus Johnson
  ["Welcome to baradin base camp. I know it does not look like much now, but with a little hard work we can whip this place into shape."]=1,
},
[47246]={ -- Ureda
  ["For too long we have ignored the secrets of the Arcane.$B$BSadly, they will remain a secret to you."]=1,
},
[47247]={ -- Marud
  ["For too long we have ignored the secrets of the Arcane.$B$BSadly, they will remain a secret to you."]=1,
},
[47248]={ -- Gija
  ["For too long we have ignored the secrets of the Arcane.$B$BSadly, they will remain a secret to you."]=1,
},
[47250]={ -- Carvo Blastbolt
  ["I'm sure I don't need to remind you to stay alert down here."]=1,
},
[47253]={ -- Rundok
  ["Sorry, $c. $B$BYour grasp of the arcane isn't strong enough to understand portal magic."]=1,
  ["You too are a student of the arcane, yes?$B$BI can teach you about portal magic, if you wish to learn."]=2,
},
[47267]={ -- Burrian Coalpart
  ["Ever heard of the Thorium Brotherhood? Sure, we might look a lot like those dwarves down in the gorge, or in Blackrock Depths, but trust me: we're not anything like them.$b$bThose scoundrels dug too deep, and now they serve a darker force: Ragnaros, the Firelord. We're happy to be more independent of will and purpose, although most of the time our purpose ends up being the prevention of whatever trouble they're causing."]=1,
},
[47293]={ -- Deathstalker Commander Belmont
  ["Nothing can stop the wrath of the Banshee Queen."]=1,
},
[47318]={ -- Mack
  ["Listen, I've been doin' a little celebratory drinkin' since our escape, and I've been thinkin'...$b$bThose little men that jumped us need to be brought to justice!$b$bIf somethin' ain't done, then every unsuspectin' explorer who sets foot in this place is gunna get sold into slavery - or worse!"]=1,
},
[47320]={ -- Kaellin Tarvane
  ["Through this portal, Tol Barad awaits."]=1,
},
[47321]={ -- Zugra Flamefist
  ["Through this portal, Tol Barad awaits."]=1,
},
[47334]={ -- Cap'n Geech
  ["Welcome to my inn, weary traveler. What can I do for you?"]=1,
},
[47346]={ -- Elynara
  ["Are you here to train in Archaeology?"]=1,
},
[47361]={ -- Doranir
  ["History? Culture? Tch. Such is the realm of scholars and scribes.$B$BWe of The Reliquary concern ourselves with... the immediate, and perhaps the future.$B$BWe discover, acquire, and amass lost artifacts, wealth, and lore so that it cannot be used against us. Power does, after all, belong in the hands of those who would use it best... wouldn't you agree?"]=1,
},
[47362]={ -- Aelnara
  ["Only the highest-ranking members of The Reliquary know where our order's Grand Vault is located.$B$BSome say it is not even upon this plane of existence..."]=1,
},
[47367]={ -- Verad
  ["Welcome to my inn, weary traveler. What can I do for you?"]=1,
},
[47368]={ -- Joran
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[47382]={ -- Adam Hossack
  ["Are you here to train in Archaeology?"]=1,
},
[47383]={ -- Brivelthwerp
  ["Time to expand my ice cream empire.$B$BTigule is going down!"]=1,
},
[47384]={ -- Lien Farner
  ["I can teach you the basics of any gathering or production profession, but that's all. To learn more than an apprentice's skills, you'll need to visit a specialist dedicated to only one profession. You can learn up to two professions: Two gathering, two production, or one of each. Secondary skills like Archaeology, Cooking, and Fishing don't count towards your two professions; you can learn as many of those as you like."]=1,
},
[47393]={ -- Mountain-Lord Rendan
  ["The Dark Irons in Blackrock have got nothin' on me. Neither do those boys up at Thorium Point.$b$bI'm independent as can be, and that's the way I like it. Of course, for the right price, I'd listen to either side..."]=1,
},
[47396]={ -- Wembil Taskwidget
  ["I can teach you the basics of any gathering or production profession, but that's all. To learn more than an apprentice's skills, you'll need to visit a specialist dedicated to only one profession. You can learn up to two professions: Two gathering, two production, or one of each. Secondary skills like Archaeology, Cooking, and Fishing don't count towards your two professions; you can learn as many of those as you like."]=1,
},
[47400]={ -- Nedric Sallow
  ["I can teach you the basics of any gathering or production profession, but that's all. To learn more than an apprentice's skills, you'll need to visit a specialist dedicated to only one profession. You can learn up to two professions: Two gathering, two production, or one of each. Secondary skills like Archaeology, Cooking, and Fishing don't count towards your two professions; you can learn as many of those as you like."]=1,
},
[47418]={ -- Runda
  ["I can teach you the basics of any gathering or production profession, but that's all. To learn more than an apprentice's skills, you'll need to visit a specialist dedicated to only one profession. You can learn up to two professions: Two gathering, two production, or one of each. Secondary skills like Archaeology, Cooking, and Fishing don't count towards your two professions; you can learn as many of those as you like."]=1,
},
[47419]={ -- Lalum Darkmane
  ["I can teach you the basics of any gathering or production profession, but that's all. To learn more than an apprentice's skills, you'll need to visit a specialist dedicated to only one profession. You can learn up to two professions: Two gathering, two production, or one of each. Secondary skills like Archaeology, Cooking, and Fishing don't count towards your two professions; you can learn as many of those as you like."]=1,
},
[47420]={ -- Iranis Shadebloom
  ["I can teach you the basics of any gathering or production profession, but that's all. To learn more than an apprentice's skills, you'll need to visit a specialist dedicated to only one profession. You can learn up to two professions: Two gathering, two production, or one of each. Secondary skills like Archaeology, Cooking, and Fishing don't count towards your two professions; you can learn as many of those as you like."]=1,
},
[47421]={ -- Saren
  ["I can teach you the basics of any gathering or production profession, but that's all. To learn more than an apprentice's skills, you'll need to visit a specialist dedicated to only one profession. You can learn up to two professions: Two gathering, two production, or one of each. Secondary skills like Archaeology, Cooking, and Fishing don't count towards your two professions; you can learn as many of those as you like."]=1,
},
[47431]={ -- Valn
  ["I can teach you the basics of any gathering or production profession, but that's all. To learn more than an apprentice's skills, you'll need to visit a specialist dedicated to only one profession. You can learn up to two professions: Two gathering, two production, or one of each. Secondary skills like Archaeology, Cooking, and Fishing don't count towards your two professions; you can learn as many of those as you like."]=1,
},
[47434]={ -- Iron Summit Guard
  ["A little busy here, $c. What d'ye want?"]=1,
  ["Can I help ye with somethin'?"]=2,
},
[47461]={ -- Prolific Writer
  ["Pardon me, friend, but I'm busier than it might appear.$b$bI've been commissioned to document the discoveries of the commander in this region, you see.$b$bThey're certain to be most profound!"]=1,
  ["I'm working on a biographical piece for Commander Schnottz, among other things.$b$bYou'll have to excuse me."]=2,
},
[47516]={ -- Prolific Writer
  ["Wh-what?! Well, I...$b$bIn this midst of such an exciting excavation, I'm not certain it would be appropriate to focus on such a thing.$b$bIt would make for a most troubling story, you know."]=1,
},
[47519]={ -- Privileged Socialite
  ["Yes.$b$bThat sounds like a good idea."]=1,
},
[47520]={ -- Pretentious Businessman
  ["Certainly not!$b$bI mean, I do have my entire fortune at risk here... and honestly, what good would a public crisis do anyone?"]=1,
},
[47568]={ -- Ian Thomas Wall
  ["Are you here to train in Archaeology?"]=1,
},
[47569]={ -- Hammon the Jaded
  ["Are you here to train in Archaeology?"]=1,
},
[47570]={ -- Diya
  ["Are you here to train in Archaeology?"]=1,
},
[47571]={ -- Belloc Brightblade
  ["Those of the Explorers' League and The Reliquary are very much alike: Archaeology is our religion, yet we have both fallen from the pure faith. Our methods have not differed as much as they pretend. We are but a shadowy reflection of them. It would take only a nudge to make them like us. To push them out of the light..."]=1,
},
[47572]={ -- Otoh Greyhide
  ["Are you here to train in Archaeology?"]=1,
},
[47573]={ -- Sirabel
  ["Are you here to train in Archaeology?"]=1,
},
[47574]={ -- Gerdra Fardelve
  ["Are you here to train in Archaeology?"]=1,
},
[47575]={ -- Boduro the Seeker
  ["Are you here to train in Archaeology?"]=1,
},
[47576]={ -- Falda Fardelve
  ["Are you here to train in Archaeology?"]=1,
},
[47577]={ -- Lindarel
  ["Are you here to train in Archaeology?"]=1,
},
[47578]={ -- Hugen Goldwise
  ["Are you here to train in Archaeology?"]=1,
},
[47579]={ -- Dariness the Learned
  ["Are you here to train in Archaeology?"]=1,
},
[47589]={ -- Enchantress Herim
  ["Were you looking to Reforge an item? I no longer provide such services. The ethereals of Orgrimmar's Drag will help you, though. Any of the city's guards can provide directions."]=1,
},
[47592]={ -- Master Mathias Shaw
  ["The dragons have bought us an opportunity to seize the gates from the Twilight's Hammer. We would do well not to waste it."]=1,
},
[47644]={ -- Darla Harris
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[47700]={ -- Menacing Emissary
  ["My advice to you is simple, $r.$b$bDo not get in the way here."]=1,
},
[47707]={ -- Budding Artist
  ["Easy for you to say.$b$bI'm not cut out for this! I need to find a way out of here!"]=1,
},
[47715]={ -- Sun Priest Asaris
  ["No. This was the work of common Wastewander bandits.$B$BIt is rumored they're joining a more regimented group to the west. Their violence is barbaric."]=1,
},
[47718]={ -- Magatha Grimtotem
  ["Perhaps you did not hear me. I said, get me free of these chains!"]=1,
},
[47764]={ -- Murog
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[47767]={ -- Korla
  ["Don't waste my time."]=1,
},
[47771]={ -- Drukma
  ["You've come for training in order to pass it on to your pets?"]=1,
  ["Ah friend, I only help hunters and their pets."]=2,
},
[47788]={ -- Guldor
  ["Don't waste my time."]=1,
},
[47875]={ -- William Henderson
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[47902]={ -- Lirastrasza
  ["We've long held out hope of redeeming the Earthwarden and his children. At some point, we must have the wisdom to realize that no amount of redemption can atone for the destruction these dragons are unleashing upon the world.$B$BAt some point, we are forced to intervene."]=1,
},
[47923]={ -- Feronas Sindweller
  ["I am here to bear witness to the memory of my master, and the truth of the past."]=1,
},
[47930]={ -- Asaq
  ["No, no Neferset movement. But I just received word that the city of Orsis is being hit by the largest sandstorm anyone has ever witnessed.$B$BI was about to send word to the king myself, but perhaps you can relay the information."]=1,
},
[47931]={ -- Denmother Ulrica
  ["A few of us here have lived in this land since the Scythe of Elune first passed through it. Most suffered through the fall of Gilneas.$B$BWe have settled in this forest to learn the ways of nature and uphold its balance. In this cursed land, our cursed people have found a new way of life."]=1,
},
[47934]={ -- Karn Cragcare
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[47940]={ -- Commander Schnottz
  ["I vill discovah who vas behind zhis cowardly act!$b$bAnd vhen I do...."]=1,
},
[47959]={ -- Prince Nadun
  ["Ramkahen will only wage war against Neferset if the High Council's vote is unanimous.$B$BThe odds are against us, but my brother needs to understand there is no reasoning with Deathwing's allies."]=1,
},
[47972]={ -- Commander Schnottz
  ["Zhis vas clearly an inside job!$b$bNovone is above suspicion!"]=1,
},
[48001]={ -- Thelaron Direneedle
  ["Ye'll not find a finer craftsman than I in all the Dark Irons!$b$bHammerin', smithin', and diggin' be damned! A needle and a thimble's all the metal I need!"]=1,
  ["What have ye brought me?"]=2,
},
[48013]={ -- Fanny Thundermar
  ["Thundermar is the last holdout of the Wildhammer. My brother's trying to keep up the fight while our little town fills up with refugees."]=1,
},
[48014]={ -- Nivvet Channelock
  ["I'm from the Highbank advance unit, trying to win over the Wildhammer here at Thundermar.$B$BI think I can help them out, but can you believe that they don't have a single tri-cyclic alternating current re-polarization device? Not a one!$B$BHow do they even get by?"]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c! I'm from the Highbank advance scouting unit, trying to win over the Wildhammer here at Thundermar.$B$BTheir gryphon riders are having a tough time bringing down Dragonmaw drake riders. I've got a plan for a contraption that will help, but I'm going to need supplies. Lots of supplies.$B$BCan you help?"]=2,
},
[48033]={ -- Stebben Oreknuckle
  ["Ye've made yer way to Chiselgrip, $g lad: lass;. Best make yerself useful."]=1,
},
[48034]={ -- Harrison Jones
  ["I've been meaning to investigate this site.$b$bNo time like the present!"]=1,
},
[48054]={ -- Sally Gearwell
  ["Welcome to my inn, weary traveler. What can I do for you?"]=1,
},
[48055]={ -- Deedee Dropbolt
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[48082]={ -- Harrison Jones
  ["Woohoo!$b$bWe'll have to do that again sometime!$b$bWell, I'm off to do some more research. I'll catch up to you when I'm ready."]=1,
},
[48093]={ -- Ivan Zypher
  ["Welcome to my inn, weary traveler. What can I do for you?"]=1,
},
[48129]={ -- Helcular
  ["In time, we will rebuild this place and restore it to its former glory - minus all of the annoying humans."]=1,
},
[48173]={ -- Colin Thundermar
  ["This is it! They're making their final assault. There's no place to run. We hold Thundermar or die with hammer in hand.$B$BFor the Wildhammer!!"]=1,
  ["D'ye hear it, adventurer? The beating of great leathery wings over the treetops... Narkrall is closing in."]=2,
},
[48186]={ -- Harrison Jones
  ["Focus, adventurer.$b$bWe have to get to the Coffer of Promise before Schnottz does!"]=1,
},
[48203]={ -- Sullah
  ["Welcome, friend, to the Oasis of Vir'sar!$b$bA paradise on Azeroth!"]=1,
},
[48215]={ -- Innkeeper Wylaria
  ["Welcome to my inn, weary traveler. What can I do for you?"]=1,
},
[48216]={ -- Hurah
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[48237]={ -- Salhet
  ["Some day I'll be able to put my skills at the service of Ramkahen."]=1,
},
[48250]={ -- Lieutenant Farnsworth
  ["The Horde have been relentless out here. Feels like we are fighting two battles at one time."]=1,
},
[48254]={ -- Sergeant Gray
  ["Seems like we never run out of things to do around here. New orders arrive every day at 3am, it's really strange."]=1,
},
[48255]={ -- Camp Coordinator Brack
  ["Lots to be done around here, $r. Are you ready to help?"]=1,
},
[48306]={ -- John J. Keeshan
  ["I won't let those damned orcs invade Redridge again!"]=1,
},
[48307]={ -- Colonel Troteman
  ["This all feels like a long shot. We've got a lot riding on this plan. Redridge's freedom, for one."]=1,
},
[48365]={ -- Kurdran Wildhammer
  ["Since the fall of Grim Batol, we Wildhammers have never truly been united. Out here in the Highlands, forgotten by the rest of the world, the different clans have all gone their separate ways.$B$BTo join them all back together isn't going to be easy."]=1,
  ["Yes adventurer, I heard the whole miserable thing from out here.$B$BI was hoping my old Wildhammer brothers could work things out among themselves, but it doesn't look like it.$B$BYou and I are going to have to get creative."]=2,
},
[48366]={ -- Russell Brower
  ["Hallo, friend!$B$BRussell's the name, and music is my business. All the great Wildhammer heroes from ages past are kept alive with song. Through the strings of my lute and the sound of my voice, our warriors gain immortality.$B$BStay a while, and listen!"]=1,
  ["My lute is all tuned up. Are we ready to compose something?"]=2,
},
[48367]={ -- Lachlan MacGraff
  ["Welcome, friend of the Wildhammer!$B$BKirthaven is the spiritual center of our people, the one place where the varied clans can come together in peace.$B$BIt's here we honor our dead heroes, before burying them with their gryphons atop Mount Thunderstrike. There they spend eternity at one with the sky."]=1,
  ["A wedding, eh? If that doesn't bring this bunch together, I'll eat my hammer!$B$BWe need to make sure this wedding is spectacular, adventurer, and we're going to need your help. There's an old Wildhammer saying... let me think... how does it go?"]=2,
},
[48368]={ -- Grundy MacGraff
  ["My father has trained me since I was a wee lad to respect the elements. Earth and fire, wind and sea - they possess great power, $c.$B$B<Grundy gets a gleam in his eye.>$B$BMore than you realize."]=1,
  ["I'm ready to start whenever you are! I'll keep the bride and groom close in case the Twilight's Hammer tries anything.$B$BAre you ready?"]=2,
},
[48431]={ -- Sullah
  ["Together, we will make history!"]=1,
  ["Soon, our sideshow will be the talk of Azeroth!"]=2,
  ["People will come from far and wide to witness the fruits of our labor, adventurer."]=3,
},
[48472]={ -- Colin Thundermar
  ["These brutes think to raid MY town when my back is turned!? They're going to get a taste of Wildhammer justice they will!"]=1,
},
[48510]={ -- Kall Worthaton
  ["I wish I could make you a deal, partner - I really do - but you'll need to be exalted with the Bilgewater Cartel, first."]=1,
},
[48528]={ -- Harrison Jones
  ["Let's keep moving. There's a lot at stake here."]=1,
},
[48564]={ -- King Phaoris
  ["Neferset City will fall!"]=1,
},
[48599]={ -- Innkeeper Teenycaugh
  ["Welcome to my inn, weary traveler. What can I do for you?"]=1,
},
[48613]={ -- Larah Firesong
  ["Greetings. I'm an undead mage trainer, and you're a mage."]=1,
  ["Well met, $c. My advice to you is this: As you travel the world, be wary of magic for it will burn the untrained."]=2,
},
[48617]={ -- Blacksmith Abasi
  ["Gerk, Burr, Dargath: all gone... It's just MacKellar and I left out here. I hope you've brought some good news."]=1,
},
[48619]={ -- Therisa Sallow
  ["I can teach you the basics of any gathering or production profession, but that's all. To learn more than an apprentice's skills, you'll need to visit a specialist dedicated to only one profession. You can learn up to two professions: Two gathering, two production, or one of each. Secondary skills like Archaeology, Cooking, and Fishing don't count towards your two professions; you can learn as many of those as you like."]=1,
