[48965]={ -- Deez Rocksnitch
  ["I specialize in two things: taking tiny things and making them blow up into huge things, and making huge things fit into itty-bitty places.$b$bWhich one do you need today?"]=1,
},
[49150]={ -- Subject Nine
  ["<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>$B$B$G Papa : Mama;...?"]=1,
  ["<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>$B$BI hunger... therefore, I am."]=2,
  ["<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>$B$BWhat does '$c' mean? Are you the goblin $g patriarch : matriarch;?"]=3,
  ["<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>$B$BThey call you adventurer. Is this your unique signifier, or is it an honorary title?"]=4,
  ["<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>$B$BGreetings. I recently emerged from an egg. You?"]=5,
  ["<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>$B$BIs it true that you cook your meat? Curious."]=6,
  ["<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>$B$BYou lack a helmet. Does this diminish your intellectual capacities?"]=7,
  ["<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>$B$BThe ends of your fingers are dull and round. Is this why you carry around other implements for use in combat?$B$BHow interesting."]=8,
},
[49204]={ -- Brann Bronzebeard
  ["Och!$b$b'Bout time ye showed up.$b$bI been expectin' ye fer days now.$b$bLeavin' an ol' dwarf ta swelter... I trained junior better than that."]=1,
},
[49230]={ -- Marshal Redpath
  ["Stand back, monster. You want to fight? Because I'll fight you. I'll fight any one of you creatures! Do you hear me?"]=1,
  ["Oh really? Fine. I don't want to join you and your Forsaken. Maybe I'll start my own Forsaken! Maybe I'll invent Forsaken with elbows!"]=2,
},
[49231]={ -- Valdred Moray
  ["What... what's going on? Who are you? What happened to me?"]=1,
  ["I... died? Yes, you're right. I died. It was an orc... he cut off my hands, and left me to die. <Valdred looks down at his hands.> These aren't my hands! THESE AREN'T MY HANDS!"]=2,
  ["<Valdred looks back down at his hands.> I suppose this is my fate then. Hah! Part of an undead army. Somehow I never considered that I might end up fighting for the Forsaken. <He looks back up at you.> What do I do now?"]=3,
},
[49386]={ -- Craw MacGraw
  ["Greetings, $c. We Wildhammer reward our friends."]=1,
},
[49396]={ -- Jez Goodgrub
  ["Hey, make sure not to walk into that smoker! The last unfortunate $r to do that didn't survive the heat.$b$bThat poor, delicious $r."]=1,
},
[49406]={ -- Yasmin
  ["Oh you poor thing, you're covered head to toe in sand! Please feel free to rest and rejuvenate yourself here at this beautiful oasis."]=1,
