},
[51639]={ -- Kador Cloudsong
  ["May the spirits be with you."]=1,
},
[51640]={ -- Lama Cloudsong
  ["May the spirits be with you."]=1,
},
[51651]={ -- Twilight Highlands Flame Keeper
  ["Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame?$b$bRemember: Our festival fires burn in every land with a Horde settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can.$b$bThe Alliance, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them."]=1,
},
[51652]={ -- Uldum Flame Keeper
  ["Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame?$b$bRemember: Our festival fires burn in every land with a Horde settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can.$b$bThe Alliance, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them."]=1,
},
[51653]={ -- Uldum Flame Warden
  ["Welcome, $c. Have you come to honor this flame?$b$bRemember: Our festival fires burn in every land with an Alliance settlement. Make time to honor each of them, if you can.$b$bThe Horde, too, burns fires of their own. You would do well to desecrate such unworthy efforts when you see them."]=1,
},
[51664]={ -- Andalar Shadevale
  ["Can you feel the evil that taints the very ground, $c? It comes from deep down within the Shadow Hold. Unchecked, it will swallow everything in its path.$B$B<The night elf coughs, revealing a bloody wound at his side.>"]=1,
  ["One of those blasted Jaedenar demons saw me! Gave me a good slash in the side. The wound isn't pretty, but I'll live.$B$BThere are more urgent matters at hand, like stopping the Shadow Council from launching a full-scale attack on our friends at Wildheart Point. I'm in no shape to fight, so you'll have to go in my place."]=2,
},
[51665]={ -- Celestine of the Harvest
  ["Welcome to the Wickerman Festival, $c!$B$BOn the observance of Hallow's End, we burn a Wickerman to represent a cleansing of the self. As the woods sigh and shed their leaves, we too must undergo a catharsis. Fears, sorrows, regrets: by throwing a branch into the blaze, you can relieve yourself of any burden you would not bear into winter.$B$BPlease, grab a branch from the bonfire and join the celebration!"]=1,
},
[51717]={ -- Resort Guest
  ["Greetings! Wonderful day, isn't it?"]=1,
  ["Have you seen the outrageous prices here?"]=2,
  ["Could you go get me a drink? I'd do it myself, but I'm working on my tan."]=3,
},
[51734]={ -- Gordon Tramsay
  ["Do you have what it takes to stay in my kitchen?"]=1,
},
[51735]={ -- Gott Weedlespan
  ["<Gott sneers contemptuously at you.>$B$BCan you possibly work any slower? I'm surrounded by useless idiots!"]=1,
},
[51934]={ -- Gretchen Fenlow
  ["Can you feel the magic in the air, $c?"]=1,
},
[51944]={ -- Resort Guest
  ["Greetings! Wonderful day, isn't it?"]=1,
  ["Have you seen the outrageous prices here?"]=2,
  ["Could you go get me a drink? I'd do it myself, but I'm working on my tan."]=3,
},
[51988]={ -- Orphan Matron Nightingale
  ["There are costs with war, $c... ones often overlooked. Those costs are the orphans - children who have lost their parents to the far-too-numerous conflicts that rage across Azeroth. Those children who have no one else to turn to often come here to live until they are old enough to fend for themselves.$B$BOne week out of the year during the Spring, the Alliance takes time to give something back to these innocents. This time is called Children's Week."]=1,
},
[51989]={ -- Orphan Matron Battlewail
  ["There are costs with war, $c... ones often overlooked. Those costs are the orphans - children who have lost their parents to the far-too-numerous conflicts that rage across Azeroth. Those children who have no one else to turn to often come here to live until they are old enough to fend for themselves.$B$BOne week out of the year during the Spring, the Horde takes time to give something back to these innocents. This time is called Children's Week."]=1,
},
[51997]={ -- Stephanie Krutsick
  ["While I miss Gilneas greatly, there's ancient ruins to explore!"]=1,
},
[52015]={ -- Captain Jake Sones
  ["Lots to be done around here, $r. Are you ready to help?"]=1,
},
[52060]={ -- Lognah
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[52134]={ -- Commander Jarod Shadowsong
  ["To stand a chance in this battle against Ragnaros, we must gather allies who will gladly brave the scorched plains of the Firelands. And before we can recruit such allies to our cause - be they druid, soldier, or simple provisioner - we will need to give them reason to join us.$b$bCarrying even a handful of these marks signifies you as a hero of our cause. Gather them in the hundreds... and you will lead armies.$b$bAre you beginning to see the plan yet?"]=1,
},
[52135]={ -- Malfurion Stormrage
  ["My heart is heavy with the burden of this war. I lead my people to their deaths. But if we cannot stand against Ragnaros now, how will we withstand Neltharion?$B$BWe must fight with everything we have, or witness the destruction of our world."]=1,
},
[52190]={ -- Twilber Torquewrench
  ["It's a difficult job keeping the steam tanks up and running by yourself, but someone has to do it."]=1,
},
[52212]={ -- Mor'shan Caravan Kodo
  ["This old draenei board has been refurbished by the Kurenai and is now used to post announcements and bounties."]=1,
},
[52285]={ -- Riftblade Maella
  ["<Naleidea Rivergleam stares at her notes, lost in thought.> Oh still here? My apologies. Feel free to browse our expedition inventory for anything you might need out there."]=1,
  ["<This book contains all the information documented on delves and delve-related things.>"]=2,
  ["Every month we get new outfits and weapons from all over. It's my job to make sure these outfits and weapons are properly displayed."]=3,
  ["Greetings. Are you seeking instruction in alchemy?"]=4,
  ["Greetings. Are you seeking instruction in enchanting?"]=5,
  ["Greetings. Are you seeking instruction in tailoring?"]=6,
  ["The forces of the Void and the Hal'hadar are relentless in their onslaught. We must remain vigilant and ready."]=7,
},
[52292]={ -- Droha
  ["Remember to always show your respect for the elements of the world."]=1,
  ["We must strive to understand the balance maintained by this world's elemental spirits."]=2,
},
[52317]={ -- Mahala Cloudsong
  ["May the spirits be with you."]=1,
},
[52319]={ -- Mala Skywatcher
  ["adventurer, how may I further your training in the eyes of the Earth Mother?"]=1,
  ["Many are the paths of the Earth Mother. May your ancestors watch over you $c."]=2,
},
[52335]={ -- Dareth
  ["If you seek training in the Old Ways, I cannot help you."]=1,
},
[52358]={ -- Craggle Wobbletop
  ["Handmade toys from all over Azeroth!"]=1,
},
[52382]={ -- Ziradormi
  ["Ahh! There you are, adventurer.$b$bI must speak with you at once."]=1,
},
[52408]={ -- Coridormi
  ["Ahh! There you are, adventurer.$b$bI must speak with you at once."]=1,
},
[52425]={ -- Tooga
  ["Shh! I'm working undercover here."]=1,
  ["What are you looking at?"]=2,
  ["I heard Tortolla was being held here, so I came over as quickly as I could.$b$bMount Hyjal is really tall."]=3,
},
[52467]={ -- Rayne Feathersong
  ["The elemental forces are relentless. I fear we'll not be able to hold this breach forever. Not without more help."]=1,
},
[52476]={ -- Keeper Krothis
  ["Never have I seen such a barren wasteland."]=1,
},
[52489]={ -- Avrilla
  ["In the nature of all things is the will to survive."]=1,
  ["What is war, but the preservation of life? Just as the seed struggles to push out of the soil, so do we fight for our own existence."]=2,
  ["Hello there! You're really growing on me."]=3,
  ["Will we win this war? Only thyme will tell."]=4,
  ["It's sweltering down here. Did someone tell them to turnip the heat?"]=5,
  ["I like you! Weed make anise pear."]=6,
  ["Some people say I'm corny, but I think I'm rather sage."]=7,
  ["Oh, it's you again! Do you think we'll be able to mustard up the forces we need?"]=8,
},
[52548]={ -- Gertrude Fenlow
  ["Hallow's End is upon us, $c. I hope you are enjoying the festivities."]=1,
},
[52586]={ -- Hanner Gembold
  ["I can instruct you in jewelcrafting. Interested?"]=1,
},
[52587]={ -- Neller Fayne
  ["I can instruct you in jewelcrafting. Interested?"]=1,
},
[52636]={ -- Tana Lentner
  ["I can instruct you in engineering. Interested?"]=1,
},
[52637]={ -- Hugo Lentner
  ["If you insert tab A into slot B then of course it's going to go BOOM! Here, let me show you what I have and then you can ask Lilliam about how to put it together so it doesn't blow up."]=1,
},
[52640]={ -- Rolf Karner
  ["I can instruct you in blacksmithing. Interested?"]=1,
},
[52642]={ -- Foreman Pernic
  ["I can instruct you in mining. Interested?"]=1,
},
[52645]={ -- Aessa Silverdew
  ["I can instruct you in jewelcrafting. Interested?"]=1,
},
[52651]={ -- Engineer Palehoof
  ["I can instruct you in engineering. Interested?"]=1,
},
[52654]={ -- Bwemba
  ["Are you here to aid da Darkspear, $c?"]=1,
  ["I be an emissary from da Darkspear trolls. Da threat we face, also be a threat to da Alliance. You willin' to help out da Darkspear, $r?"]=2,
},
[52657]={ -- Nahari Cloudchaser
  ["I can instruct you in jewelcrafting. Interested?"]=1,
},
[52658]={ -- Paku Cloudchaser
  ["How may I help you?"]=1,
},
[52669]={ -- Matoclaw
  ["Welcome, adventurer. Have you come to join the invasion of the Firelands?"]=1,
  ["While we prepare to invade the Firelands, the Firelord sends his minions to repel our attack. Our position here cannot fall. We are all that stands between them and the World Tree."]=2,
  ["We do not yet have the strength to push forward into the Firelands. First, we must rebuild our forces and supplies. Will you lend yourself to our efforts?"]=3,
  ["What happens now will affect us all. Everyone's aid is needed. We must work together to fight against the invasion."]=4,
},
[52671]={ -- Mylune
  ["Are there any teeny tiny animals in need of my aid?$B$B<Mylune's eyes glisten at the thought.>$B$BI need to hug a bunny right now!"]=1,
},
[52809]={ -- Blax Bottlerocket
  ["Handmade toys from all over Azeroth!"]=1,
},
[52824]={ -- General Taldris Moonfall
  ["adventurer, it is good to see you. Have you come to help push the front for us?"]=1,
},
[52825]={ -- Theresa Barkskin
  ["I am gathering my strength before I return to the battle. You would be wise to do the same."]=1,
},
[52924]={ -- Vol'jin
  ["Da Zandalari must be stopped. Wit' all da trolls of Azeroth at their command, dey would be a threat to all of us."]=1,
},
[52941]={ -- Bakkalzu
  ["Ya be havin' me gratitude, $c.$b$bIf there be anythin' I can be doin' for ya, just say so."]=1,
},
[52986]={ -- Dorda'en Nightweaver
  ["Yes? The Archdruid is resting.$B$BI am sure he appreciates your visit, but it is best not to disturb him."]=1,
},
[53080]={ -- Captain Irontree
  ["We are just barely holding our ground. We need every able-bodied soldier to report for duty."]=1,
},
[53081]={ -- Bwemba
  ["Are you here to aid da Darkspear, $c?"]=1,
  ["I be an emissary from da Darkspear trolls. Da threat we face, also be a threat to da Alliance. You willin' to help out da Darkspear, $r?"]=2,
},
[53352]={ -- Commander Sharp
  ["These trolls have just shown up demanding our help."]=1,
  ["I can barely understand what these trolls are trying to say."]=2,
  ["Why don't these trolls just deal with their problems on their own?"]=3,
},
[53405]={ -- Raedra Windhammer
  ["The elements are fickle and best left out of untrained hands. My apologies, but I have no need for yours."]=1,
},
[53408]={ -- Blue Drake
  ["Kalecgos has been chosen as the new aspect for the blue dragonflight.$b$bOne among you was instrumental in thwarting Arygos's betrayal to Deathwing, thereby averting a terrible crisis.$b$bWe are here to partake in the celebration of their heroic deeds."]=1,
},
[53409]={ -- "Kobold" Kerik
  ["Oh, aye. I took the wee rotter's candle. Now, what did ye need?"]=1,
},
[53410]={ -- Lissah Spellwick
  ["I consider it a great honor to assist the Lady Proudmoore in her research. She's the most powerful human mage upon Azeroth, you know! Now, was there something I might help you with?"]=1,
},
[53415]={ -- Theoden Manners
  ["Were this tower to boast TWICE as many tomes, it would still not be enough for me. My collecting and copying shall never be done. So. You have need of my assistance?"]=1,
},
[53421]={ -- Faena Woolybush
  ["He's gem-mad, he is, but I love him. Says I'm his favorite gem of them all, hee! Now then, what can I help ye with? Archaeology, is it?"]=1,
},
[53436]={ -- Eustace Tanwell
  ["Good leather in the marshes, if you've the guts for it. Lots of crocolisks. Thinkin' my brother and I'll stay a while. Somethin' I can help you with?"]=1,
},
[53519]={ -- Aggra
  ["I can only teleport us once. Make sure you are ready. Go'el waits for us at the bottom of the ocean..."]=1,
},
[53524]={ -- Cyclonas
  ["The winds are strange today. Strange indeed."]=1,
},
[53641]={ -- Allison Potts
  ["I sell only the best gear, tested and true. And the prices are set, so if you want to haggle then go find a Goblin."]=1,
},
[53652]={ -- Aggra
  ["The cycle begins again! Go'el has become living stone! We must pursue him within the caverns of Deepholm.$b$bSeeing as how the Earthen Ring just saved her kingdom, Therazane should be more than willing to help us in saving him. If not, the Stonemother will answer to me!"]=1,
},
[53738]={ -- Aggra
  ["The sooner we can get away from the Stonemother, the better. I do not trust her."]=1,
},
[53763]={ -- Candace Fenlow
  ["Powerful magic fills the air this season, $c."]=1,
},
[53764]={ -- Crina Fenlow
  ["Nothing says 'Hallow's End is here' more than a ride on a broomstick."]=1,
},
[53865]={ -- Orphan Matron Nanee
  ["The children love this holiday. Some children have gone out trick-or-treating, some have stayed behind, and some, like these, have decided to try to run a small business.$b$bTheir goal is to amass as much candy as possible, and they felt the best way was to offer treats for the hard work of others. I laughed when I first heard of their plan, $c. But now that I see how many adventurers are giving them candy for their wares, I am worried.$b$bThat is a lot of sugar. I don't think the children will ever be able to fall asleep again."]=1,
},
[53869]={ -- Orphan Matron Seacole
  ["The children love this holiday. Some children have gone out trick-or-treating, some have stayed behind, and some, like these, have decided to try to run a small business.$b$bTheir goal is to amass as much candy as possible, and they felt the best way was to offer treats for the hard work of others. I laughed when I first heard of their plan, $c. But now that I see how many adventurers are giving them candy for their wares, I am worried.$b$bThat is a lot of sugar. I don't think the children will ever be able to fall asleep again."]=1,
},
[53925]={ -- Aggra
  ["I can't believe that it's... over...$b$bGo'el is free, thanks in no small part to you, adventurer."]=1,
},
[53977]={ -- Darkcaller Yanka
  ["I am but a humble herald of the Dark Lady Sylvanas, our Banshee Queen."]=1,
},
[53991]={ -- Quincy Cutler
  ["Welcome to the Shady Lady, home of fine wines and exotic merchandise you won't find anywhere else!"]=1,
},
[54135]={ -- Master Li Fei
  ["Through the purity of the fire's spirit are we cleansed. Through the passion of its being are we driven."]=1,
},
[54232]={ -- Mrs. Gant
  ["I can teach the art of cooking. Are you looking to learn?"]=1,
},
[54312]={ -- Aggra
  ["Let me know when you are ready to travel to Uldum. We will ask Cyclonas what he knows."]=1,
},
[54313]={ -- Thrall
  ["I believe Aggra is almost here, and the other aspects have assembled.$B$BAre you ready to begin, adventurer?"]=1,
},
[54334]={ -- Darkmoon Faire Mystic Mage
  ["The Darkmoon Faire is now open!$b$bFor a small fee, I can teleport you to the fairground staging area.$b$bWould you like to go?"]=1,
},
[54345]={ -- Darkmoon Faire Greeter
  ["This set up sure is hard work."]=1,
},
[54404]={ -- Majordomo Executus
  ["The Firelord and his brethren once held sway over this entire world, mortal. As a servant of the Old Gods, he fought against the Titans for domination of this planet. The victorious Titans banished my master and his brethren to the Elemental Plane - there to remain imprisoned until the end of time."]=1,
},
[54442]={ -- Warpweaver Hashom
  ["Now is the time when the year is new and the moon shines bright.$B$BIt is our time... when the ancients awake."]=1,
  ["I have all the tools necessary to adjust the appearance of your weapons and armor. Shall we begin?"]=2,
},
[54473]={ -- Warpweaver Dushar
  ["Now is the time when the year is new and the moon shines bright.$B$BIt is our time... when the ancients awake."]=1,
  ["I have all the tools necessary to adjust the appearance of your weapons and armor. Shall we begin?"]=2,
},
[54476]={ -- Nozdormu
  ["We must not waste time, traveler."]=1,
},
[54518]={ -- Injured Carnie
  ["Setting up and maintaining the grounds is tough work..."]=1,
  ["It hurts when I move my arm."]=2,
  ["This gash just doesn't seem to be healing."]=3,
  ["That's the last time I try to set up the cannon alone..."]=4,
},
[54567]={ -- Aysa Cloudsinger
  ["The way of the Tushui is one of gaining proper perspective. Through meditation and consideration, we find our way to the most effective solution to any problem. Through practice and discipline, we hone our bodies to be the perfect implements of our will.$B$BTo live the way of the Tushui is to be respected both for tempered mind and impeccable form."]=1,
  ["<Aysa appears to be deeply lost in her excercises.>"]=2,
},
[54568]={ -- Ji Firepaw
  ["The only true crime is inaction."]=1,
},
[54605]={ -- Finlay Coolshot
  ["Looking for the old steam tonks?$b$bWell, we've got some new ones for you to enjoy.$b$bNormally, it would cost two tokens to use a tonk remote. But because of your military service, you get a discounted rate of one token.$b$bWe at the Darkmoon Faire thank you for your service."]=1,
},
[54636]={ -- Caza'rez
  ["The Blood Furnace is a testament to the dark past of my people."]=1,
},
[54648]={ -- Leeni "Smiley" Smalls
  ["I bet ya think you're tough, eh, kid? I guess I might have something for ya if ya can hold your own in the arena. Good stuff, not like Krixel's. That's so last season, ya know?$b$bOh, and have a nice day."]=1,
},
[54674]={ -- T'shu
  ["These mushrooms are unlike anything on the surface. They're said to bring great wisdom and clarity to those who eat them.$B$BI'm going to bring some back with me to Sporeggar."]=1,
},
[54692]={ -- Artificer Morphalius
  ["Nexus-Prince Haramad kept telling me that if we didn't find a way through Shaffar's ward soon that I'd be the next test subject.$B$BHe wasn't bluffing."]=1,
},
[54848]={ -- Watcher Jhang
  ["Warlord Kalithresh will fall!"]=1,
},
[54849]={ -- Naturalist Bite
  ["We must contain the disease the naga have unleashed here before it is too late!"]=1,
},
[54852]={ -- Earthbinder Rayge
  ["If you're going to get to Warlord Kalithresh, you'll need to defeat Mekgineer Steamrigger and Hydromancer Thespia so that you can get to the Main Chambers Access Panels.$B$BYou mash a few buttons on those, and the door to the main chamber will open right up!"]=1,
},
[54890]={ -- Field Commander Mahfuun
  ["The leadership of Shattrath is too slow to act, so the great people of the Lower City have taken matters in the Shadow Labyrinth into our own hands."]=1,
},
[54943]={ -- Merchant Lorvo
  ["I came to ask the famous Aysa Cloudsinger for help, but I just can't bring myself to intrude on her exercises. She's so poised, so practiced... so beautiful."]=1,
  ["Thank you for bringing my driver back, friend."]=2,
},
[54975]={ -- Aysa Cloudsinger
  ["Shu is precious to us. We need to find him, but he has the tendencies of a young child, so we must not scare him in our approach.$B$BI will meditate on where he might be, and how best to reach out to him. Be patient, my friend."]=1,
  ["Be patient with Shu. He acts as if a child, but he is quite ancient, and quite powerful."]=2,
},
[54998]={ -- Apprentice Yufi
  ["Do you seek enlightenment?"]=1,
  ["Do you wish to expand your mind and body beyond the boundaries it is currently confined to?"]=2,
  ["The Tian Monastery taught me how to focus my energies so tightly that I could tap a keg using only my pinky finger."]=3,
},
[55020]={ -- Old Man Liang
  ["Age has caught up with me it seems. I cannot move as I once could, and so I've little left to offer my once friend..."]=1,
},
[55054]={ -- General Nazgrim
  ["Prepare yourself, adventurer.$b$bWe'll be entering a target-rich environment!"]=1,
},
[55143]={ -- Sally Fizzlefury
  ["Mister Pleeb is teaching me how to be a taxidermist. Personally I think he is a little too dated and could benefit from a little gnomish 'engi-nuity.'"]=1,
},
[55285]={ -- Astrid Langstrump
  ["Lorna said a truly brave adventurer helped rescue many of the horses near her family's orchard. I offered to take care of those that made it across the sea with us. I learned how from my mother and father, Light bless them! Were you interested in a fine Gilnean steed...?"]=1,
},
[55382]={ -- Darkmoon Faire Mystic Mage
  ["The Darkmoon Faire is now open!$b$bFor a small fee, I can teleport you to the fairground staging area.$b$bWould you like to go?"]=1,
},
[55396]={ -- Darkmoon Faire Greeter
  ["Hello and welcome to the Darkmoon Faire Staging Area.$b$bThe portal here will take you to the Darkmoon Faire.$b$bBut if you have any questions before you go, I can answer them."]=1,
  ["Hello $c, and welcome to the Darkmoon Faire.$b$bThere is so much to do here at the faire that it can be a little overwhelming for our first time visitors. That's why I'm here to help.$b$bDo you have any questions?"]=2,
},
[55402]={ -- Korgol Crushskull
  ["Here you see the Darkmoon Deathmatch pit. Do you possess the power and will to best all comers and take the pit fighter's prize? Bouts begin at midnight and every three hours thereafter."]=1,
},
[55488]={ -- Corastrasza
  ["<Corastrasza steps between you and the nearby corpse, her face wrinkled with concern.>$B$BI'm sorry, adventurer. This is a private matter for the red flight to resolve.$B$BPlease see if you can help the others outside."]=1,
},
[55564]={ -- Reclaimer A'zak
  ["I envy you in a way, little $r.$B$BYou are so fortunate as to bear witness to the first steps of the rebirth of the mighty Empire of Azjol-Nerub."]=1,
},
[55596]={ -- Careless Carnie
  ["Nnn... nn nnnn... n-nl nnnr nnn... nn n nnnt... <I'll... be fine... it'll wear off... in a bit...>"]=1,
},
[55677]={ -- Kurzel
  ["The Scourge spread so rapidly, I often find myself wondering why they haven't already won this war."]=1,
},
[55684]={ -- Jordan Smith
  ["I can instruct you in blacksmithing. Interested?"]=1,
  ["I can instruct you in blacksmithing as well as supply the necessary tools.$B$BHow may I help you?"]=2,
},
[55737]={ -- Chronicler Bah'Kini
  ["It be my duty to record these tragic events for the good of generations to come."]=1,
},
[55738]={ -- Tol'mar
  ["Dis be a dark day in troll history, mon."]=1,
},
[55835]={ -- Kaldir Ironbane
  ["Enough hiding. It's time to take the fight to the iron dwarves."]=1,
},
[56027]={ -- Stormherald Eljrrin
  ["My people will stand idle no longer. The halls of Ulduar shall be cleansed!"]=1,
},
[56041]={ -- Rona Greenteeth
  ["Oh, a visitor. I don't get many visitors out here.$B$BHungry? I've cooked MANY delightful things, my dear.$B$BNo, no, not the fish. Those are for when I can't catch anything tastier, sweetling."]=1,
},
[56062]={ -- Tzu the Ironbelly
  ["I am the mighty Tzu the Ironbelly Monk, so named for my infamous belly barrage. Perhaps you have heard of me."]=1,
  ["I once did battle with the dreaded fang toothed beast that shall not be named for fear of darkening the day."]=2,
  ["Chin did not earn his title lightly. There was a fierce championship of noodle makers gathered from all four corners of the village.$b$bIt was here they battled with great ferocity over barrels of boiling water to forge only the finest noodles ever made within a days travel.$b$bGlorious I tell you!$b$bOnly Flourfury emerged victorious, crafting a noodle so astounding it shook the very foundation of my taster's bowl."]=3,
},
[56065]={ -- Inkmaster Wei
  ["Welcome to the Arboretum. May you find inspiration amongst the trees."]=1,
  ["Our lives are but a blink of reality's eye."]=2,
  ["Ours is an ancient and long lived culture.$b$bThanks to our craft, some of the memory of that culture can be preserved for future generations."]=3,
},
[56068]={ -- Steven Stagnaro
  ["Your skill exceeds mine, though I've heard that Old Man Heming in Booty Bay has copies of 'The Bass and You'. That is sure to help you increase your skill."]=1,
  ["You will need to find Nat Pagle in Dustwallow Marsh to get any better than you are currently."]=2,
  ["I can teach you fishing skills."]=3,
},
[56314]={ -- Mostrasz
  ["The Vermillion Redoubt is our base of operations here in the Twilight Highlands.$B$BFrom this perch we can supervise the assault on Grim Batol and the cleansing of the river valley below."]=1,
},
[56371]={ -- Suspicious Infiltrator
  ["<The body has been very badly burned and nearly bitten in half.>$B$B<The red dragonflight may be the guardians of all life on Azeroth, but clearly they are not to be crossed.>"]=1,
},
[56705]={ -- Singegruff
  ["When I was young I wanted to be a brewmaster. Mixing various chemicals to get the perfect drink and flavor.$b$bDuring my training though they kept telling me my drinks were too hearty.$b$bSo I went into smelting. Seemed like a logical transition at the time."]=1,
},
[56707]={ -- Chin
  ["Welcome to my noodle shack. We've got every type of noodle that should be eaten. If we don't have it, you shouldn't be eating it."]=1,
},
[56768]={ -- Dawn Watcher
  ["So, stranger, are you the wild and crazy type like the hozen?$b$bOr the quiet and thoughtful type like the jinyu?"]=1,
  ["Are you from beyond the wall?"]=2,
  ["Where did you come from?"]=3,
  ["Wow. You look... um... well... different than I would have expected. Are there more like you?"]=4,
  ["What interesting colors you are wearing. Did you weave that yourself?"]=5,
  ["Are there more like you?"]=6,
  ["Why, hello stranger. You look like a creature that has stories to tell."]=7,
  ["What a fascinating jawline you have. And such coloration. Where did you come from?"]=8,
},
[56777]={ -- Ni Gentlepaw
  ["Ah! A fan of potions? The brewmasters work their concoctions but often miss some of the finer notes to a potion or remedy."]=1,
},
[56778]={ -- Yol
  ["Whatever you do, stranger, do not ask my husband about his egg noodle recipe. It will be the longest conversation you have ever heard."]=1,
},
[56796]={ -- Angela Leifeld
  ["Are you a fellow physician? I would be glad to teach you anything that would aid your journeys."]=1,
  ["Yes my $g son : daughter;? What can I assist you with?"]=2,
  ["The esteemed Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen can train you further. He can be found in Theramore treating the wounded at the barracks."]=3,
  ["I've heard it said that Deneb Walker, holed up in Stromgarde, has a book that is sure to help improve your bandage techniques."]=4,
},
[57242]={ -- Elder Sage Wind-Yi
  ["Welcome to the Temple of the Jade Serpent. How may I help you?"]=1,
  ["Welcome to the Temple of the Jade Serpent, stranger. Our doors are open to all who seek knowledge."]=2,
},
[57405]={ -- Silkmaster Tsai
  ["Greetings stranger. I am Silkmaster Tsai. Welcome to the ancient Imperial Silk Farm.$b$bThis farm dates back to some of the earliest dynasties of Pandaria, and each generation exceeds the last in quality of silk."]=1,
},
[57619]={ -- Cheng Dawnscrive
  ["Please, sit and make yourself comfortable."]=1,
},
[57620]={ -- Whittler Dewei
  ["I can teach you the basics of any gathering or production profession, but that's all. To learn more than an apprentice's skills, you'll need to visit a specialist dedicated to only one profession. You can learn up to two professions: Two gathering, two production, or one of each. Secondary skills like Archaeology, Cooking, and Fishing don't count towards your two professions; you can learn as many of those as you like."]=1,
},
[57754]={ -- Instructor Mossthorn
  ["Shouldn't you be training, young $c?$B$BDiscipline your mind and body, and there is little that you cannot achieve."]=1,
},
[57800]={ -- Thaumaturge Rafir
  ["Our ethereal technomancy has the ability to modify an item's arcane essence in ways previously unimaginable. Speak with my associate if you are in need of our services."]=1,
},
[57801]={ -- Thaumaturge Altha
  ["Our ethereal technomancy has the ability to modify an item's arcane essence in ways previously unimaginable. Speak with my associate if you are in need of our services."]=1,
},
[57850]={ -- Teleportologist Fozlebub
  ["Hi there! Say, you weren't looking for a quick teleport to the big cannon, were you?$B$BBecause I can do that!$B$BFor a small fee, of course..."]=1,
},
[58152]={ -- Tini Smalls
  ["I bet ya think you're tough, eh, kid? I guess I might have something for ya if ya can hold your own in the arena. Good stuff, not like Krixel's. That's so last season, ya know?$b$bOh, and have a nice day."]=1,
},
[58195]={ -- Chromie
  ["I can show you the aftermath of Deathwing's destruction at the Maelstrom, if you wish."]=1,
},
[58199]={ -- Lord Itharius
  ["I can show you the aftermath of Deathwing's destruction at the Maelstrom, if you wish."]=1,
},
[58228]={ -- Instructor Skythorn
  ["A new student? Ah yes, very good. Have you spoken to Elder Anli?"]=1,
},
[58278]={ -- Tired Shushen
  ["I'm confused as to how these raiders are constantly able to assail us no matter how many of them we kill."]=1,
  ["These raiders stole the cloths off our dead, the trinkets out of our homes, and the ingots out of our forge. What sort of behavior is that?"]=2,
  ["The Crane Temple usually comes to our defense and keeps the raiders at bay. But lately they have been quiet."]=3,
  ["Greetings adventurer. The waters foretold of your arrival. Unfortunately they didn't foretell of the raiders hitting us so hard.$b$bI am Waterspeaker Tired Shushen. Welcome to Fallsong."]=4,
},
[58413]={ -- Jenova Longeye
  ["The care of a young serpent is a delicate thing."]=1,
  ["Unless you want to help me clean the nests, you had best let me get back to work."]=2,
  ["I spend half my time in the libraries and the other half caring for the hatchlings."]=3,
  ["Do you know the history of the Serpent Riders? It is quite an interesting study."]=4,
  ["Someday I hope to improve on our ancient knowledge. Much of it has been lost through the ages."]=5,
  ["Have you seen the onyx serpents? They are known to lay their eggs on Windward Isle. If you find such an egg and bring it to Elder Anli, you will be justly rewarded."]=6,
  ["Have you flown in the Sky Race? I wish you luck, if you do."]=7,
},
[58414]={ -- San Redscale
  ["Welcome to the Order of the Cloud Serpent. Only those exalted with our Order may acquire our cloud serpents."]=1,
},
[58421]={ -- Hemet Nesingwary
  ["Hey there, adventurer! It's been a while since we shared a proper hunt, now hasn't it. Let's see if time has softened yer aim."]=1,
},
[58422]={ -- Hemet Nesingwary Jr.
  ["Me pop n' I are on a genuine safari. This is a strange, new land filled with dangers around every turn, monsters pokin' out of every hole, and beasts as ol' as the dirt itself livin' life without fear.$b$bIt's huntin' season!"]=1,
  ["I canna' believe I made myself the bait for a trap. Lucky for me you an' me Pop were there."]=2,
},
[58434]={ -- Matt "Lucky" Gotcher
  ["Stand solo against a yeti with nothing but a bowie knife while wearing a loincloth and you'll earn yourself the title of 'lucky' as well."]=1,
},
[58531]={ -- Toudu Tigerclaw
  ["What is the Sky Race? Why, only the greatest test of a Serpent Rider's skill!"]=1,
},
[58564]={ -- Elder Anli
  ["You show much promise, adventurer, but you must nurture your talent with discipline."]=1,
  ["A young serpent is a delicate thing. This is the time when bad habits form. Good training makes a difference."]=2,
  ["Young serpents are much more playful than their adult counterparts."]=3,
  ["The path of the cloud serpent rider is long and arduous, but you will travel it together with your cloud serpent companion.$B$BIf you reach the end of the road together, you will have a loyal friend who will carry you to the end of your days."]=4,
  ["A long journey is best traveled one step at a time."]=5,
  ["I like to keep an eye on all of my students. I will watch your progress eagerly."]=6,
  ["The wild cloud serpents breed very rarely, and as such, each egg is extremely precious.$B$BIf we do not work to help and protect the wild cloud serpents, they may one day disappear."]=7,
  ["Of all the wild serpents, the onyx serpent is the rarest. These elusive black cloud serpents are known to lay their eggs on Windward Isle to the northeast.$B$BIf you come across any Onyx Eggs, please bring them to me. I shall reward you handsomely."]=8,
},
[58706]={ -- Gina Mudclaw
  ["Well, what's it gonna be, stranger? I've got a market to run."]=1,
  ["Looking for food and brew, stranger? We've got it right here at Halfhill Market."]=2,
  ["Well don't just stand there, stranger! You got any gossip for me?"]=3,
},
[58712]={ -- Kol Ironpaw
  ["Looking for meat? I've got plenty right here.$b$bOn my grill, I mean."]=1,
},
[58714]={ -- Mei Mei Ironpaw
  ["Did you need something?"]=1,
},
[58715]={ -- Yan Ironpaw
  ["It smells delicious, doesn't it?"]=1,
},
[58718]={ -- Merchant Greenfield
  ["My seeds grow the best veggies in the valley. Guaranteed!"]=1,
},
[59073]={ -- Mayor Bramblestaff
  ["Refugees are flooding into Binan from all throughout the steppes. I fear the yaungol have breeched the wall!"]=1,
},
[59077]={ -- Apothecary Cheng
  ["There are so many wounded..."]=1,
},
[59173]={ -- Kai Wanderbrew
  ["Brewmaster Wanderbrew, at your service.$b$bI travel the Jade Forest in search of only the finest of ingredients for my brews.$b$bUnlike the high and mighty Goldendrafts of Dawn's Blossom.$b$bThey have their big brewhouse for mass producing. Which is fine, you know, if you enjoy drinking swill."]=1,
  ["I swear I saw that little Syra Goldendraft giving my boy 'the looks'. Can't have that."]=2,
},
[59320]={ -- Steven Walker
  ["How may I help you?"]=1,
},
[59383]={ -- Old Man Misteye
  ["My sight may be gone, but I am fortunate to live in a land which rewards all of the senses."]=1,
},
[59402]={ -- Slimy Inkstain
  ["A luckydo would be wise to buy my wares. Bad fortune to those who simply walk away."]=1,
},
[59403]={ -- Whetstone
  ["Oh that's a fine piece o' metal you have der. I am quite fond of a good piece of steel."]=1,
},
[59582]={ -- Innkeeper Lei Lan
  ["Come inside, and have a seat. Get off your feet... I'm sure you've been running around all day.$b$bNow, what can I do for you?"]=1,
  ["Pretty warm out today, isn't it?"]=2,
  ["Welcome to Halfhill, neighbor."]=3,
},
[59642]={ -- Aysa Cloudsinger
  ["The way of the Tushui is one of gaining proper perspective. Through meditation and consideration, we find our way to the most effective solution to any problem. Through practice and discipline, we hone our bodies to be the perfect implements of our will.$B$BTo live the way of the Tushui is to be respected both for tempered mind and impeccable form."]=1,
},
[59959]={ -- Mokimo the Strong
  ["Keep the body strong, and the mind will follow."]=1,
},
[59967]={ -- Firetender Zab'ni
  ["Our supplies are limited in dis awful place, but I'll see what I can find..."]=1,
  ["Even amidst all dis chaos, someone's gotta tend de hearth."]=2,
},
[60714]={ -- Bilgewater Blastmasters
  ["Hahaha, sure. Right after ya, buddy."]=1,
},
[61493]={ -- Wishbone
  ["A luckydo would be wise to buy my wares. Bad fortune to those who simply walk away."]=1,
},
[61620]={ -- Yang Ironclaw
  ["Thanks for saving us! Are you ready to get this party started?"]=1,
},
[61716]={ -- Invoker Xorenth
  ["We must stop the Dark Shaman now."]=1,
  ["Did Garrosh send you?"]=2,
},
[61756]={ -- Little Elsa
  ["How may I help you?"]=1,
},
[61780]={ -- Suspicious Rock
  ["I'm just a rock. Nothing to see here."]=1,
},
[61790]={ -- Inconspicuous Crate
  ["Just an ordinary crate. Definitely no one hiding here."]=1,
},
[61962]={ -- Lorewalker Cho
  ["Who would ever guess how much knowledge was hidden behind these walls. Between the wealth of information here and the lore you have uncovered in your travels, I believe I can weave together a few tales of our forgotten past.$b$bWhich one would you like to hear?"]=1,
  ["Who would ever guess how much knowledge was hidden behind these walls. And there is so much more we can add to it.$b$bAs you explore our land, keep an eye out for objects of interest that might help us learn more of our past. Piece together enough of our history, and I may be able to share a story or two with you."]=2,
},
[62393]={ -- Ao Jian
  ["I will say, the Forsaken have... strange taste when it comes to brew. I get the feeling they're not exactly preparing it for friends, though."]=1,
},
[62462]={ -- Tseh Rah, Peacebloom Teamaster
  ["I have nothing to teach you, $c."]=1,
  ["How may I help you?"]=2,
},
[62463]={ -- Sho the Wise
  ["I have nothing to teach you, $c."]=1,
  ["How may I help you?"]=2,
},
[62874]={ -- Kali the Night Watcher
  ["Welcome to my inn, weary traveler. What can I do for you?"]=1,
},
[62913]={ -- Dave the Quick
  ["I have seen many battles, healed many allies, cleansed many souls, and many enemies have fallen victim to my command. You may feel safe inside these city walls but make no mistake, war plagues these lands like a pandemic and only the chosen few live to tell the tale."]=1,
},
[62917]={ -- Tong the Fixer
  ["Need a break from your enemies? You have come to the right place, and the right person."]=1,
},
[62978]={ -- Lao-Chin the Iron Belly
  ["Hmm... If I mix some pale with a stou... Oh, yes. Hello!"]=1,
},
[63013]={ -- Sway Dish Chef
  ["How may I help you?"]=1,
},
[63014]={ -- Marcus Jensen
  ["What do you think of my pet?"]=1,
},
[63061]={ -- Narzak
  ["What do you think of my pet?"]=1,
},
[63067]={ -- Naleen
  ["What do you think of my pet?"]=1,
},
