  ["What do you think of my pet?"]=1,
},
[63086]={ -- Matty
  ["What do you think of my pet?"]=1,
},
[63238]={ -- Xi, Friend to the Small
  ["How may I help you?"]=1,
},
[63272]={ -- Ting, Strong of Stomach
  ["I will say, the Forsaken have... strange taste when it comes to brew. I get the feeling they're not exactly preparing it for friends, though."]=1,
},
[63296]={ -- Gato
  ["I have nothing to teach you, $c."]=1,
  ["How may I help you?"]=2,
},
[63310]={ -- Zabrax
  ["How may I help you?"]=1,
},
[63327]={ -- Shoyu
  ["I have nothing to teach you, $c."]=1,
  ["How may I help you?"]=2,
},
[63331]={ -- Laoxi
  ["I have nothing to teach you, $c."]=1,
  ["How may I help you?"]=2,
},
[63332]={ -- Pao
  ["I have nothing to teach you, $c."]=1,
  ["How may I help you?"]=2,
},
[63335]={ -- Mojo Stormstout
  ["I'm just walking along, cataloging the local wildlife here in Azuremist, when suddenly... BAM! <Mojo mimicks an explosion with his hands.> I don't think I've ever heard an explosion that loud in my life!"]=1,
},
[63542]={ -- Elder Tsulan
  ["As dark as things seem, I must not give up hope. We must not be cowed by the violence of the Yaungol. You... have you come to help us?"]=1,
  ["I must admit, when times were darkest, I did not believe that we would survive. Thanks to you and your people, I am glad to have been proven wrong."]=2,
},
[63596]={ -- Audrey Burnhep
  ["What do you think of my pet?"]=1,
},
[63614]={ -- Ling of the Six Pools
  ["We fight the mantid, yaungol, and mogu. Enemies face us from all sides. I'm here to make sure there are no surprises."]=1,
},
[63626]={ -- Varzok
  ["What do you think of my pet?"]=1,
},
[63721]={ -- Nat Pagle
  ["Hello fellow angler! Have you been around these parts long? Me and my buddy 'Big Hook' here travel far and wide looking for the next big catch!$b$bWe ran into this place by accident and the locals were friendly with both their supplies and booze so we decided to stick around!"]=1,
},
[63754]={ -- Farmhand Bo
  ["You know, things are really starting to look up ever since you came around! Can't help thinking about what happened to my friends back on the farm, though..."]=1,
  ["The... the yaungol! They attacked my farm, and the nearby village, Westwind Rest... killed some of us, and the ones they didn't kill they chased off! I managed to gather some of us here. Any word on help coming from Binan?"]=2,
},
[63822]={ -- Tani
  ["I grew up on the Wandering Isle. Space was so limited there. Never room to hunt and never really any predators worth mentioning.$b$bBut here... here there are the great mushan and wolves and all sorts of predators. This is this hunter's dream come true."]=1,
  ["First time in Pandaria? Mine too. I remember the stories they would tell us of this place. So exciting!"]=2,
  ["I first met the Nesingwarys in Stranglethorn. I've been bumping in to them off and on ever since. I finally earned a place in their safari!"]=3,
},
[63825]={ -- Mr. Pleeb
  ["A hunter hunts. An artist... arts.$b$bI am here to capture the ferocity of the hunt through my art.$b$bWe are in strange lands, and few in the known world are familiar with the strange creatures of our hunt.$b$bThrough my art, I prove your success, and the success of the Nesingwarys."]=1,
},
[64041]={ -- Mifan
  ["How may I help you?"]=1,
},
[64058]={ -- Jorunga Stonehoof
  ["I can instruct you in blacksmithing. Interested?"]=1,
  ["I can instruct you in blacksmithing as well as supply the necessary tools.$B$BHow may I help you?"]=2,
},
[64085]={ -- Cullen Hammerbrow
  ["I can instruct you in blacksmithing. Interested?"]=1,
  ["I can instruct you in blacksmithing as well as supply the necessary tools.$B$BHow may I help you?"]=2,
},
[64100]={ -- Meng Chi the Fist
  ["<The scruffy old pandaren snores peacefully. A pile of assorted bottles are strewn about next to him.>"]=1,
},
[64102]={ -- Seeker Arusshi
  ["Once, jinyu ruled all of Pandaria from this place, from this seat of power.$B$BWe must learn all that we can from the histories, so that we may once again regain our ancient wisdom."]=1,
},
[64104]={ -- Watershaper Sharu
  ["When we first arrived, we found a resplendent Vale. The water of its pools were like none other that we had ever seen.$B$BBut then came the one named Garrosh Hellscream, and he left only destruction in his wake. By the time he left, the waters of the Vale were no more."]=1,
},
[64106]={ -- Erin
  ["What are you looking for?"]=1,
},
[64107]={ -- Sadi
  ["What are you looking for?"]=1,
},
[64124]={ -- Kata Arina
  ["We were fortunate enough to find the Vale after it opened its gates. We sought refuge, and have found safe haven.$B$BAre you lost? May I help you find something?"]=1,
},
[64127]={ -- Frances Lin
  ["We were fortunate enough to find the Vale after it opened its gates. We sought refuge, and have found safe haven.$B$BAre you lost? May I help you find something?"]=1,
},
[64128]={ -- Edward Hanes
  ["What are you looking for?"]=1,
},
[64144]={ -- Brewmaster Tsu
  ["We were fortunate enough to find the Vale after it opened its gates. We sought refuge, and have found safe haven.$B$BAre you lost? May I help you find something?"]=1,
},
[64145]={ -- Kavanna Gooddreg
  ["What do you need directions to?"]=1,
},
[64147]={ -- Duinn Steelbrew
  ["What do you need directions to?"]=1,
},
[64149]={ -- Matron Vi Vinh
  ["Welcome to my inn, weary traveler. What can I do for you?"]=1,
},
[64150]={ -- Master Zhang
  ["Can't you see I'm partaking in a staring contest right now?"]=1,
},
[64152]={ -- Kiang Redwhisker
  ["I'm not falling for your tricks, $r. Victory shall be mine!"]=1,
},
[64153]={ -- Coincounter Cammi
  ["What do you need directions to?"]=1,
},
[64154]={ -- Historian Jenji
  ["A historian's work is never done, you see. There's always something important happening that we will need to remember.$B$BI've written much of your legacy already, but there is still so much to learn! Surely your feats will be remembered for ages to come."]=1,
},
[64155]={ -- Historian Winterfur
  ["'And that is how the shining blade came to, and left, Pandaria, its final destination unknown.'$B$BOur people's lore is a woven quilt of rich stories. It is my job to bind the tomes so that they may last a thousand lifetimes."]=1,
},
[64156]={ -- Hans Shuffleshoe
  ["There's so much knowledge of the ancient world stored here that we're only just now discovering!"]=1,
},
[64159]={ -- Armorer Kisha
  ["See some armor you like, $r? These rare armor sets can only be obtained by proving your worth in the most challenging dungeons in Pandaria.$B$BYou must seek out these dungeons and enter them by foot. Those who pass the challenges with enough speed shall earn the regard of our master armorers, and may find a gift of rare armor awaiting them in the mail."]=1,
},
[64160]={ -- Frostflower
  ["We were fortunate enough to find the Vale after it opened its gates. We sought refuge, and have found safe haven.$B$BAre you lost? May I help you find something?"]=1,
},
[64161]={ -- Charles Etienne
  ["Your deeds of valor will be remembered."]=1,
},
[64166]={ -- Yuma Ironkettle
  ["We were fortunate enough to find the Vale after it opened its gates. We sought refuge, and have found safe haven.$B$BAre you lost? May I help you find something?"]=1,
},
[64167]={ -- Shing Lightningpaw
  ["We were fortunate enough to find the Vale after it opened its gates. We sought refuge, and have found safe haven.$B$BAre you lost? May I help you find something?"]=1,
},
[64168]={ -- Vienh Stormbrew
  ["We were fortunate enough to find the Vale after it opened its gates. We sought refuge, and have found safe haven.$B$BAre you lost? May I help you find something?"]=1,
},
[64169]={ -- Ranna
  ["What do you need directions to?"]=1,
},
[64170]={ -- Keri Reynolds
  ["What do you need directions to?"]=1,
},
[64172]={ -- Advisor Kosa
  ["Oftentimes, the silent grasshopper knows how to best avoid the boot."]=1,
  ["If you judge a fish by its ability to climb a tree, it will live its life believing it is inadequate."]=2,
  ["The early bird gets the worm, but the patient pandaren receives a hearty brew."]=3,
  ["Violence may appear to do good for a time, but the evil it does will remain forever."]=4,
  ["Only love can drive out hatred."]=5,
},
[64231]={ -- Sungshin Ironpaw
  ["Your skill in cooking is only as great as your most advanced Way."]=1,
},
[64287]={ -- Summer
  ["<The great cat barely bats an ear at you, even when you run your fingers through her thick fur.>"]=1,
},
[64291]={ -- Poolwarden Abusshi
  ["Whew! That is some strong brew!"]=1,
},
[64365]={ -- Mili Wanderbrew
  ["You want something? Mine is the bitterest of the brews. Are you worthy?"]=1,
},
[64395]={ -- Nam Ironpaw
  ["Your skill in cooking is only as great as your most advanced Way."]=1,
},
[64476]={ -- Poolwatcher Gui
  ["We live to fight another day, $r."]=1,
},
[64477]={ -- Riverwarden Tuushuu
  ["Our home is lost, but as long as we are still alive, there is still a home to be made... somewhere."]=1,
},
[64478]={ -- Aqualyte Shashin
  ["What happened in the Jade Forest was a terrible tragedy. It is my firm belief that the only way to avoid repeating our mistakes, is by learning from them.$B$BThere is much knowledge in this library. Already I have learned much about the sha."]=1,
},
[64518]={ -- Uncle Bigpocket
  ["Have I got a yak for you!"]=1,
},
[64561]={ -- Jong Ming-Yiu
  ["I thought all was lost when the yaungol attacked our home. It is cliche, but the old monks are right when they say: 'When one door shuts, another opens.'$b$bOr something like that. Wasn't too big on their teachings."]=1,
},
[64562]={ -- Talking Skull
  ["I and my family fell victim to this place what seems like ages ago.$B$BLet our fate serve as a warning to those who would meddle in necromancy.$B$BHelp me to lift the curse, $c. Destroy Darkmaster Gandling."]=1,
},
[64563]={ -- Talking Skull
  ["I and my family fell victim to this place what seems like ages ago.$B$BLet our fate serve as a warning to those who would meddle in necromancy.$B$BHelp me to lift the curse, $c. Destroy Darkmaster Gandling."]=1,
},
[64572]={ -- Sara Finkleswitch
  ["Interested in catching some rare pets?"]=1,
  ["You look like someone that might be interested in some rare pets?"]=2,
},
[64582]={ -- Gentle San
  ["Interested in catching some rare pets?"]=1,
  ["You look like someone that might be interested in some rare pets?"]=2,
},
[64588]={ -- Armorer Relna
  ["See some armor you like, $r? These rare armor sets can only be obtained by proving your worth in the most challenging dungeons in Pandaria.$B$BYou must seek out these dungeons and enter them by foot. Those who pass the challenges with enough speed shall earn the regard of our master armorers, and may find a gift of rare armor awaiting them in the mail."]=1,
},
[64605]={ -- Tan Shin Tiao
  ["How may I help you?"]=1,
},
[64691]={ -- Lorewalker Huynh
  ["Every day I archive something new, and something old. Sometimes it is an ancient scroll of wisdom. Sometimes it is a painting of the Vale an Inkmaster made.$b$bWe preserve the lore so that future generations will learn from our successes... and our failures."]=1,
},
[64738]={ -- Hooded Crusader
  ["Well met, $c. I mean you no harm.$B$BI'm here posing as one of the Scarlet Crusade because they have become irredeemably corrupt and evil.$B$BI need your help to put an end to them once and for all."]=1,
  ["I'd say that we're about halfway done, wouldn't you? Scarlet Halls down, Scarlet Monastery yet to go.$B$BDon't be surprised if I disappear -- I have to get over there quickly."]=2,
},
[64764]={ -- Hooded Crusader
  ["Well met, $c. I mean you no harm.$B$BI'm here posing as one of the Scarlet Crusade because they have become irredeemably corrupt and evil.$B$BI need your help to put an end to them once and for all."]=1,
  ["I'd say that we're about halfway done, wouldn't you? Scarlet Halls down, Scarlet Monastery yet to go.$B$BDon't be surprised if I disappear -- I have to get over there quickly."]=2,
},
[64827]={ -- Hooded Crusader
  ["Good to see you again, adventurer. For a moment, I was worried that you wouldn't come.$B$BLet's finish this, shall we? The Scarlet Crusade has proven that it's not going to put an end to itself."]=1,
},
[64882]={ -- Madam Lani
  ["Can you believe the nerve of this little grummle? This shrewd little negotiator will have me bankrupt with his prices in no time."]=1,
},
[64922]={ -- Brann Bronzebeard
  ["A new continent full of forgotten secrets! Share what you learn with the Lorewalkers here and me, and I'll let you in on some of my other projects."]=1,
},
[64929]={ -- Lamplighter Deng
  ["Whoever said they'd rather light a candle than curse the darkness...$b$bWell, they probably haven't lit as many candles as me."]=1,
},
[64975]={ -- Iron-Body Ponshu
  ["How may I help you?"]=1,
},
[65068]={ -- Old Whitenose
  ["You will find no better riding companion than our dragon turtles. Their low stance means the rider experiences no bounce or jostle, even when cornering sharply. If you are interested in purchasing one, you must prove your trust to the Tushui."]=1,
},
[65092]={ -- Smeltmaster Ashpaw
  ["Are you fascinated by the wonders of metallurgy? The artistry of smelting? The beauty of mixing metals and alloys?"]=1,
},
[65098]={ -- Mai the Jade Shaper
  ["My family has crafted jade and gems for nearly ten generations. You may be surprised at what I can teach you."]=1,
},
[65114]={ -- Len the Hammer
  ["Hammer and tongs. Hammer and tongs. All day long its hammer and tongs."]=1,
},
[65121]={ -- Clean Pelt
  ["Ah! A luckydo comes to learn? I have many skills to teach."]=1,
},
[65127]={ -- Lai the Spellpaw
  ["Just because you put magic in to an artifact does not mean it has to stay there."]=1,
},
[65129]={ -- Zen Master Lao
  ["My time with the Shado-Pan has taught me many secrets. Perhaps you have earned the right to learn some as well."]=1,
},
[65160]={ -- Blacktalon Watcher
  ["I serve his majesty, the last of his kind.$b$bIf you have a problem with me, take it up with the Prince."]=1,
},
[65186]={ -- Poisoncrafter Kil'zit
  ["I serve only the Klaxxi'va."]=1,
},
[65266]={ -- David Harrington
  ["What are you looking for?"]=1,
},
[65395]={ -- Klaxxi'va Ik
  ["<Klaxxi'va Ik regards you with a judging eye.>"]=1,
},
[65599]={ -- H.A.R.V.E.Y.
  ["Good day, adventurer. If you require my services as an auctioneer, I regret to inform you: no. Only grand master engineers possess the minimum intellectual capacity to interface with my superior functions.$b$bMore importantly, why are you still talking to me?"]=1,
  ["Hello, adventurer. My services as an auctioneer are available to those with skill in engineering. Sadly, you have none. Please leave."]=2,
},
[65908]={ -- Seer Yong
  ["Ah, the winds spoke of newcomers to our village. I feel that we will learn much from each other, so long as our minds are open and our spirits pure.$B$BPerhaps your people will be more respectful of mine than the Horde was."]=1,
  ["Explore Pandaria, but be cautious. This land holds great bounty and danger alike to the unwary."]=2,
  ["The ground beneath your feet lives and breathes. It may hold you steadily right now, but bring war and suffering here and it will respond in kind. Such is the way of nature."]=3,
},
[65923]={ -- Ju Applebloom
  ["The winds of change can bring anything, from a terrible storm to a bountiful harvest. It seems this time they have brought you.$B$BNow, I wonder, are you a storm or a harvest?"]=1,
},
[65927]={ -- Chut Sri Nu
  ["I am the sole protector of this village. My name is Chut Sri Nu.$B$BI bid you welcome, but know that my meditation has shown me that your travels here will bring great change to this land. Let us both hope that you leave Pandaria better off than you found it."]=1,
},
[65983]={ -- Soraka
  ["The esteemed Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen can train you further. He can be found in Theramore treating the wounded at the barracks."]=1,
  ["I can train you in bandaging techniques."]=2,
},
[66022]={ -- Turtlemaster Odai
  ["Have you seen our magnificent riding turtles? They only appear slow at a glance - an experienced rider may keep pace with the swiftest wolves on all of Kalimdor. Alas, they are reserved only for our most trusted allies."]=1,
},
[66190]={ -- General Nazgrim
  ["Those Alliance scum will learn what it is to anger the Horde!"]=1,
  ["We will claim this land in the name of the Horde, or die trying!"]=2,
  ["They have not even begun to see the fury of the Horde!"]=3,
  ["By the time we are done here, the Alliance will wish they had never set foot on this land."]=4,
},
[66227]={ -- Wing Hya
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[66246]={ -- Tigermaster Gai-Lin
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[66292]={ -- Sky Admiral Rogers
  ["The Skyfire has had a complete overhaul since our encounter with Deathwing! We now carry a full complement of both fixed-wing and gyro aircraft as well as a battery of 18-inch smoothbore shore bombardment cannons.$b$bThe Horde won't be able to hide from her reach. Not on land, not at sea, not in the air."]=1,
  ["I've been waiting to unleash this gunship against a worthy target. Let's spend some ammunition!"]=2,
  ["These pandaren seem like good people.$b$bThey're reluctant to get embroiled in our war, but after a few weeks of dealing with the Horde, I have no doubt they'll all come around to our side."]=3,
},
[66306]={ -- Blacktalon Agent
  ["I serve his majesty, the last of his kind.$b$bIf you have a problem with me, take it up with the Prince."]=1,
},
[66372]={ -- Merda Stronghoof
  ["This land has endured much, and yet it thrives in the wake of the worldbreaker. You will find that my pets possess similar fortitude."]=1,
},
[66386]={ -- Mishi
  ["<Mishi looks at you inquisitively.>"]=1,
},
[66409]={ -- Lorewalker Pao
  ["I accompany the Shado-Pan to chronicle their many deeds beyond the wall. It is not easy - I do not wish to lose any of my journals in the chaos of battle!$b$bIt has happened before. The Lorewalkers have been cataloging pandaren history for many ages. Their notes are scattered throughout Pandaria. I am certain that if you were to assemble them, the Lorewalkers would be most appreciative!"]=1,
},
[66412]={ -- Elena Flutterfly
  ["Wings give us the freedom to soar."]=1,
},
[66854]={ -- Initiate Chuang
  ["Welcome to the Peak of Serenity adventurer. How can I help you?"]=1,
},
[67024]={ -- Rockseeker Guo
  ["The earth has much to offer us, so long as we learn to take from it properly. I can teach you how, if you so wish."]=1,
},
[67025]={ -- Orchard Keeper Li Mei
  ["You aren't from around here. Are you interested in learning about the native plant life of Pandaria?"]=1,
},
[67026]={ -- Hao of the Stag's Horns
  ["The beasts of this land aren't like whatever it is you have in your home. Train with me so that you may know how to properly skin them."]=1,
},
[67370]={ -- Jeremy Feasel
  ["Will you challenge the best?$B$BWill you lose like the rest?$B$BOnly one way to find out. Dare you attempt it, $gsir:madame;?$B$BOnly a token for a try..."]=1,
},
[67586]={ -- Elynara
  ["Are you here to train in Archaeology?"]=1,
},
[68365]={ -- Lord Winifred Browne
  ["Who are you? I can assure you that everything here is perfectly legitimate, good $gsir:ma'am;. We are just a pair of wealthy entrepreneurs enjoying a little friendly bloodsport, without ANY gold changing hands."]=1,
  ["Quickly, my good $gsir:lady;. Who do you predict will win the next fight?"]=2,
},
[68492]={ -- "Dusty" Brandom
  ["Hey there! Need a ride? Hop on a tallstrider!"]=1,
  ["If you need a ride down, take one of these babies!"]=2,
  ["Welcome to Darkmoon Island! Feel free to ride one of these lovely beasts down to the Faire."]=3,
  ["Majestic forest striders! Free rides down to the Darkmoon Faire!"]=4,
},
[68984]={ -- Ruben Holen
  ["These Pandaren are sittin' on a treasure trove. They even got books in here about vrykul. I mean the vrykul! Come on! How could they possibly have encountered them?"]=1,
},
[68986]={ -- Li the Tamer
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[68989]={ -- Beastblast Babblesnaff
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[69322]={ -- Capps Carlin
  ["Yo. I'm Vixton Pinchwhistle, official Arena Vendor for the Steamwheedle Fighting Circuit. If you've got the rep, I've got the goods that'll make your mouth water."]=1,
},
[70398]={ -- Ben of the Booming Voice
  ["Wanna get in on a little secret? It's about where to fish today..."]=1,
  ["Are you lookin' to hear a secret about where to fish?"]=2,
},
[71336]={ -- Gleep Chatterswitch
  ["Hey hey hey! You lookin' fer some fast travel to the Barrens?"]=1,
  ["You need ta go somewhere? As long as that somewhere is Ratchet, I've got yer fast track right here!"]=2,
  ["Never had an unsatisfied customer! Try Chatterswitch Travels today!"]=3,
  ["My state of the art teleporter will take you straight to the Northern Barrens. Whaddaya say?"]=4,
},
[71526]={ -- Elizabeth Birdsong
  ["What an interesting door."]=1,
  ["I never imagined such a world."]=2,
  ["Good to see you again. Have we met?"]=3,
  ["What an odd outcome."]=4,
  ["This world is so different."]=5,
  ["I must be going, there is so much to see."]=6,
  ["The possibilities are infinite."]=7,
  ["Me? Oh, I'm not from around here."]=8,
},
[72676]={ -- Spirit Healer
  ["It is not yet your time. I shall aid your journey back to the realm of the living... for a price."]=1,
},
[73395]={ -- Yrel
  ["Arbor Glen is in trouble. We had better go see if we can help."]=1,
},
[73691]={ -- Chromie
  ["Time can be both beautiful and cruel."]=1,
},
[74343]={ -- Vindicator Tenuum
  ["The researchers here at Arkaat Outpost have been gathering pieces of our ancestors' original wreckage."]=1,
},
[74367]={ -- Koristrasza
  ["I too thought Amnennar the Coldbringer had been defeated; a grave mistake indeed. How clouded my judgment must have been to forget the true power of a lich lies in their phylactery."]=1,
},
[74888]={ -- Koristrasza
  ["You've done it! The plague preventing my access has been disrupted and we can now begin our final push to disrupt Death Speaker Blackthorn's ritual. Lead on if you are ready to begin."]=1,
},
[75146]={ -- Rangari D'kaan
  ["We are unaccustomed to having so many with us. Our rangari are trained to be self sufficient, and are used to surviving for long periods of time in the wilds.$b$bYou may find some of us prefer it that way."]=1,
  ["It is unwise to draw the attention of the genesaur and their fara. In their eyes, we are nothing more than plant food."]=2,
},
[75428]={ -- Frightened Prisoner
  ["Oh please, you must save the others before Domina sacrifices them!"]=1,
},
[75685]={ -- Razor Hill Grunt
  ["What are you looking for?"]=1,
},
[75686]={ -- Darkspear Guardian
  ["What cha be lookin' for mon?"]=1,
},
[75687]={ -- Thunder Bluff Protector
  ["Earth Mother watch over you traveler, what is it you seek?"]=1,
},
[75710]={ -- Hansel Heavyhands
  ["It'll take more than a handful o' mouthy earth beasts ta take out ol' Heavyhands!"]=1,
},
[75803]={ -- Vindicator Maraad
  ["I will stop at nothing to prevent Shattrath from falling again. Show these orcs no mercy."]=1,
},
[75804]={ -- Yrel
  ["I fear that Maraad is becoming consumed by his anger."]=1,
},
[75805]={ -- Archmage Khadgar
  ["If we are able to repel the Iron Horde from Shattrath, it will be a great blow to their strategy. If we manage to take out their Superweapon as well..."]=1,
},
[75874]={ -- Thaelin Darkanvil
  ["Almost anything can be fixed with a wrench and a good swingin' arm."]=1,
},
[76411]={ -- Farseer Drek'Thar
  ["Without you, I would still be in that jungle, or worse."]=1,
},
[76783]={ -- Jonnock Hewndawn
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[77107]={ -- Thrall
  ["Exploring my home world has proven more dangerous than I hoped."]=1,
},
[77184]={ -- Archmage Khadgar
  ["Together, we will defeat the Shadow Council."]=1,
},
[77192]={ -- Thaelin Darkanvil
  ["Cheers, commander. We found this Iron Star here just waitin' to be repaired, and Gazlowe over there has been helpin' me fix it up. It should be ready for action when you are. Khadgar said he'd meet ya down by the harbor with the others. I'm a wee bit jealous that ya get to roll over some Iron Horde in this thing."]=1,
},
[77195]={ -- Archmage Khadgar
  ["The enemy battleship is just off the coast. We will hold off Blackhand, it's up to you to disable that boat and save Shattrath!"]=1,
},
[77209]={ -- Baros Alexston
  ["At your service, commander."]=1,
  ["Have you seen Brightstone? My latest assistant is more than a handful.$b$bShe does everything to the extreme - drinking, talking, rushing from one task to another...$b$bShe is a damn fine architect though, and probably the brightest student I've ever had.$b$bI'll give her that."]=2,
  ["Lieutenant Thorn is a shining example to us all. Never have I seen such a dedicated leader.$B$BI haven't worked up the courage to speak to her, but perhaps someday, she will know my name."]=3,
  ["Tell me, commander, what do you think of Lieutenant Thorn? Whenever she's around, I get so flustered.$b$bI'm just... not really good with women. Which she is an exceptional example of. A woman, that is. Although she is also a worgen. Which I also like. Oh, that long, silky fur...$B$BSigh..."]=4,
},
[77417]={ -- Image of Archmage Khadgar
  ["Don't worry about me. They can't see this projection.$B$BEverything we do here is leading to one thing, adventurer: Gul'dan's capture."]=1,
},
[77582]={ -- Soulbinder Nyami
  ["I can't... hold it... much longer..."]=1,
},
[78288]={ -- Archmage Khadgar
  ["The threat on Draenor is one that impacts us all. I am glad that at least a few of you have agreed to work together against such great odds."]=1,
},
[78423]={ -- Archmage Khadgar
  ["<The archmage focuses intently on the portal.>$b$bLook. Their numbers are abating, however briefly. This may be our chance.$b$bAre you prepared to face whatever's on the other side of that portal?"]=1,
},
[78534]={ -- Ageilaa
  ["The Jorune Mine provides many of the crystals used to power Auchindoun and Shattrath."]=1,
},
[78538]={ -- Vindicator Doruu
  ["Our Draenei brothers and sisters of the Alliance warned us of the Blood Elves' lust for magical power. If such is the cost of their aid against the Burning Legion, I will gladly fight the demons alone."]=1,
},
[78556]={ -- Ariok
  ["What can I do to help?"]=1,
},
[78558]={ -- Archmage Khadgar
  ["Our forces are faltering, and my energy is waning, adventurer. We have precious little time left before we are overwhelmed."]=1,
},
[78559]={ -- Archmage Khadgar
  ["Our allies can only buy us so much time before the entirety of that... Iron Horde is upon our camp.$b$bWe have to keep moving."]=1,
},
[78560]={ -- Archmage Khadgar
  ["Our allies can only buy us so much time before the entirety of that... Iron Horde is upon our camp.$b$bWe have to keep moving."]=1,
},
[78564]={ -- Sergeant Crowler
  ["$GSir:Madam;, an attack on our garrison looms close. I have commissioned some items that you may find useful."]=1,
},
[78699]={ -- Ja'kana
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[78952]={ -- Coriander
  ["Please, sit and make yourself comfortable."]=1,
},
[79241]={ -- Prophet Velen
  ["A great leader sets an example for all those who follow.$b$bThey know when to speak, and when to listen.$b$bThey know when to stand and fight for their survival, and when to sacrifice it all for the greater good.$b$bAre you ready to lead, adventurer?"]=1,
},
[79242]={ -- Archmage Khadgar
  ["So, this is where we will build your garrison.$b$bHave you commanded this many troops before?$b$bI'm sure you'll do fine... I hope."]=1,
},
[79243]={ -- Baros Alexston
  ["At your service, commander."]=1,
  ["Have you seen Brightstone? My latest assistant is more than a handful.$b$bShe does everything to the extreme - drinking, talking, rushing from one task to another...$b$bShe is a damn fine architect though, and probably the brightest student I've ever had.$b$bI'll give her that."]=2,
},
[79315]={ -- Olin Umberhide
  ["Honored to be fighting by your side, adventurer."]=1,
},
[79316]={ -- Qiana Moonshadow
  ["The Shattered Hand's crimes against humanity are unforgivable, but we can't ignore their crimes against nature."]=1,
},
[79329]={ -- Miall
  ["You have a pretty good shop going on here. Much bigger then the shack I used to work at in Shattrath."]=1,
},
[79407]={ -- Bron Skyhorn
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[79451]={ -- Olin Umberhide
  ["How we survived this far is a mystery to me. You are quite the field commander."]=1,
},
[79457]={ -- Vindicator Maraad
  ["How can I be of service, commander?"]=1,
  ["Khadgar's magic is strong indeed. He managed to open a permanent portal directly to Stormwind."]=2,
  ["Everything is going according to plan, commander. How may I help you?"]=3,
},
[79470]={ -- Vindicator Maraad
  ["How can I be of service, commander?"]=1,
  ["Khadgar's magic is strong indeed. He managed to open a permanent portal directly to Stormwind."]=2,
  ["Everything is going according to plan, commander. How may I help you?"]=3,
},
[79519]={ -- Reshad
  ["Eh? A traveler? It's a dangerous time to be in Skettis, you know."]=1,
  ["Azik sent you to me for answers, and I promise you will have them.$B$BBut for now, we need to escape."]=2,
},
[79675]={ -- Lady Liadrin
  ["Their depravity sickens me.$b$bWe should wipe this Iron Horde off the map."]=1,
},
[79892]={ -- Mak'jin
  ["The fishing here is like nothing we have ever seen back home. How about helping us get this fishing operation off the ground?"]=1,
},
[79953]={ -- Lieutenant Thorn
  ["The dangers of this land are not to be underestimated.$b$b<Thorn points to her eyepatch>$b$bI bear the mark of my naivety and own this mistake."]=1,
  ["In Pandaria I did not make a habit of asking for 'help' on missions. Perhaps that is why we haven't met before?"]=2,
  ["My blood runs rose red. This heart beats for Gilneas."]=3,
  ["Commander, I was just wondering. Has Baros mentioned me by any chance? What? Oh... no reason.$b$b<Thorn blushes>"]=4,
},
[79970]={ -- Vindicator Dalu
  ["There is only one way you may prove your worth to me, stranger.$B$BCombat."]=1,
},
[79977]={ -- Soulbinder Halaari
  ["You want to lay eyes upon Auchindoun?$B$BProve your worth to me in combat."]=1,
},
[80159]={ -- Arsenio Zerep
  ["It's so hard to find good ingredients around here."]=1,
},
[80221]={ -- Libby Wrenchwrecker
  ["So you're the new commander, eh? I thought you'd be taller."]=1,
},
[80223]={ -- Lady Sena
  ["Commander! I trust you are prepared to have your mind blown away by my designs.$b$bI am thinking... wood! Yes, wood! Lots of it. In BOLD arrangement the way that only the orcs of the original horde could conceive.$b$bAnd spikes! Yes, spikes. We must not forget the spikes. That is how you know it is Horde."]=1,
},
[80415]={ -- Lady Liadrin
  ["Let us hope Ga'nar's fighting skills are better than his navigation skills."]=1,
},
[80432]={ -- Command Table
  ["This table lists all of your currently available missions."]=1,
},
[80628]={ -- Miall
  ["We need to be on our guard. This place is crawling with ogres."]=1,
},
[80633]={ -- Lorewalker Han
  ["Not long ago, outsiders' ships were cast upon the shores of Pandaria, bearing strife but also courage. Listen, and I will speak of how a deep shadow crept across Pandaria, and how brave heroes brought us a new dawn."]=1,
},
[80833]={ -- Beastmaster Tagh
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[80874]={ -- Thaelin Darkanvil
  ["Them plant people are tryin' to mulch me!"]=1,
},
[81013]={ -- Rangari Rajess
  ["One thing we learned early from the Laughing Skull: podlings hate fire."]=1,
},
[81018]={ -- Rangari Kolaan
  ["Those foul creatures poison their spears. I keep an antidote but it will take time for my head to clear enough for me to move."]=1,
},
[81020]={ -- Rangari Jonaa
  ["We fought as well as we could. But in the end, too many of my friends were lost."]=1,
},
[81074]={ -- Rangari Rajess
  ["Even the skies can be dangerous in Gorgrond. Be on your guard."]=1,
},
[81103]={ -- Dungar Longdrink
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[81152]={ -- Scout Valdez
  ["I'm the fastest courier in the army. Do you need a report delivered?"]=1,
},
[81348]={ -- Rachelle Black
  ["<Rachelle gives you a polite nod.>$B$BGreetings."]=1,
  ["<Rachelle looks at her tools.>$B$BThere's much work to do."]=2,
  ["<Rachelle shrugs.>$B$BI'm not much for words."]=3,
  ["What can I do for you?"]=4,
},
[81441]={ -- Shelly Hamby
  ["Where did Pippers go? Little guys keeps stealing my supplies.$b$bOops! I meant to check in with Baros, we have just been really busy.$b$bThis forest is almost out of wood... I need to get a logging operation together. I'll send a full report to Baros as soon as possible."]=1,
},
[81492]={ -- Bodrick Grey
  ["The battle is heating up. We must push forward!"]=1,
  ["This is our chance to send the Iron Horde scattering. Steel yourself. We must hold the front line!"]=2,
},
[81590]={ -- Yrel
  ["This jungle is beautiful. I have never seen a place like this before.$b$bOf course, Kaalya keeps insisting that is why 'the jungle will kill you.'"]=1,
},
[81600]={ -- Burrian Coalpart
  ["We were lookin' for something to help fight goren and I got separated.$b$bThen these botani lads showed up and just started feeding me berries, mead, honey.$b$bI swear I've gained twenty pounds at least since I got here."]=1,
},
[81659]={ -- Razzlebeard
  ["This dwarf appears to have gained a lot of weight prior to his death."]=1,
},
[81674]={ -- Nisha
  ["<Nisha bobs her head at you, affection showing in her glowing blue eyes.>"]=1,
},
[81675]={ -- Nori Sootstash
  ["A stunned look of surprise is frozen on the dead face of this dwarf."]=1,
},
[81676]={ -- Lera Ashtoes
  ["Engorged seeds and roots within the pool are digging into the corpse of Lera, feeding on the remains."]=1,
},
[81723]={ -- Birchus
  ["When a champion like Dionor falls, a Death Bloom will grow from his husk. I was to collect this Bloom and perform a sacred rite here to release his life force back to the overgrowth.$b$bAs I was about to do this I was set upon by fur-covered two legs and they took the Bloom first. We tried to follow but they raised barriers and used fire to drive us back.$b$bSo now I stand vigil over my failure until we are all ground into the tortured soil by our great enemy..."]=1,
},
[81751]={ -- Hansel Heavyhands
  ["Dunna ask how we found that artifact. It's not what ya'd call a 'happy' story."]=1,
},
[81830]={ -- Dakaari
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[81912]={ -- Foreman Zipfizzle
  ["Sir, commander, sir!$b$bOn Maraad's orders I rounded up a bunch of lackeys - erm - quality skilled labor. Say the word and we'll get this caravan to Elodor and secure some food."]=1,
},
[82302]={ -- Birchus
  ["I beg of you, $c, use the Heart for its true purpose! The favor of Dionor will be quite tremendous indeed!"]=1,
},
[82476]={ -- Khaano
  ["The miasma here coats everything! We should not stay long..."]=1,
},
[82477]={ -- Khaano
  ["It is so hazy here, I can barely see... and its so loud. I wish everyone would be quiet!"]=1,
},
[82564]={ -- Archmage Nakada
  ["Don't yell at your students; Instead, speak very softly but firmly when disciplining them. It forces them to listen more carefully and frankly it's a lot scarier than yelling."]=1,
  ["Few truly understand how fragile the fabric of this world is.$b$bWhy, a poorly designed spell could bring our entire reality to a screeching halt."]=2,
  ["Firebolts, ice blocks, arcane blasts, all of these are simple manifestations of arcana.$b$bThey are safe spells, proven time and again to be both stable and effective.$b$bNow, if you really want to blow up the universe, well... some things are best kept for the advanced class."]=3,
  ["Before one can truly understand the artistry of weaving a spell, one must first ask themselves how many bunnies can you see?$b$bWhen you understand the meaning of this question, the foundation of the universe will become more clear."]=4,
  ["If your spell fails to land, make sure the arcana you are trying to wield has enough power to manifest at its destination."]=5,
  ["This week we are discussing ley lines... again. Their practicality when it comes to magical understanding cannot be understated."]=6,
  ["Never underestimate the ingenuity and mischief that can be caused by a child who has mastered Invsibility."]=7,
  ["Ah, a $c. Would you like to participate in today's lecture?$b$bI am in need of a volunteer."]=8,
},
[82622]={ -- Killga
  ["I can instruct you in leatherworking. Interested?"]=1,
},
[82776]={ -- Deedree
  ["Please, sit and make yourself comfortable."]=1,
},
[82851]={ -- Thrall
  ["Azeroth has been invaded by a vicious enemy that seems bent on world domination.$b$bWe must act quickly if we are to put a stop to the chaos that is unfolding around us."]=1,
},
[83491]={ -- Eileese Shadowsong
  ["More supplies commander? Our soldiers could always use them."]=1,
},
[84038]={ -- Lieutenant Thorn
  ["The dangers of this land are not to be underestimated.$b$b<Thorn points to her eyepatch>$b$bI bear the mark of my naivety and own this mistake."]=1,
  ["In Pandaria I did not make a habit of asking for 'help' on missions. Perhaps that is why we haven't met before?"]=2,
  ["My blood runs rose red. This heart beats for Gilneas."]=3,
  ["Commander, I was just wondering. Has Baros mentioned me by any chance? What? Oh... no reason.$b$b<Thorn blushes>"]=4,
},
[84455]={ -- Assistant Brightstone
  ["Baros is looking for me?$b$bI've been right here with my crew the whole time... Poor guy is so busy he's losing it.$b$bAlright, break time is over."]=1,
  ["Haha, Who'd thought an apprenticeship'd plop me here? It's quite exciting!"]=2,
  ["Psst, do ye think Alexston and Thorn would make a cute couple? HEEHEE!"]=3,
  ["Hey Commander, ye ever catch a game of Battle Ball? GO FORGERS!"]=4,
  ["That Thorn needs to throw back a pint n' lighten up! Er um... Commander!"]=5,
},
[84766]={ -- Glirin
  ["A $c? Oh, are you a sight for sore eyes.$b$bWe didn't expect to hit anything when digging through the ground like we were."]=1,
},
[84776]={ -- Aerun
  ["Thank you for helping my people through this dark time. We hope to return the favor someday."]=1,
},
[85426]={ -- Altauur
  ["It is good you are here, there is more trouble than even I can handle."]=1,
},
[85431]={ -- Altauur
  ["These saberon are playing with magic they don't understand! They are sure to enrage the magnaron."]=1,
},
[85432]={ -- Altauur
  ["A Laughing Skull orc does grim work here. We should finish our task quickly before they return.$b$bThis one is particularly brutal..."]=1,
},
[85436]={ -- Altauur
  ["I hope this all works out..."]=1,
},
[85519]={ -- Christoph VonFeasel
  ["Look at my horse, isn't it magnificent? My partner over there doesn't even HAVE a horse. Turn your face from them, now, and look back at me. Still on a horse! Aren't you amazed? And look at how great my hat is!"]=1,
},
[85546]={ -- Ziggie Sparks
  ["Welcome! We've got a special delivery of 'Firebird'-class fireworks ready to strap to your back and send you soaring in search of rings and glory!"]=1,
},
[85619]={ -- Yrel
  ["I'm glad you made it here safely. Are you ready?"]=1,
},
[85825]={ -- Nuraa
  ["Your skill exceeds mine, though I've heard that Old Man Heming in Booty Bay has copies of 'The Bass and You'. That is sure to help you increase your skill."]=1,
  ["You will need to find Nat Pagle in Dustwallow Marsh to get any better than you are currently."]=2,
  ["I can teach you fishing skills."]=3,
},
[85840]={ -- Torgg Flexington
  ["How may I help you?"]=1,
},
[85914]={ -- Bil Sparktonic
  ["Looking for a way to impress your friends? Maybe catch the eye of a lass you bumped into at the inn? Well, you're in luck, my friend. Feast your eyes on Bil Sparktonic's fantastical incantations! For a low, low price, you too can enchant the world and make it glow! My assistant, Bob, can also help you with recipes for the latest and greatest enchantments from Draenor!"]=1,
},
[85917]={ -- Aimee Goldforge
  ["That Swann may not have been born a dwarf, but the heat of the forge runs through her veins. I could not ask for a finer apprentice."]=1,
},
[85923]={ -- Rangari Laandon
  ["In my days with the rangari, I have learned many nuances of skinning the varied beasts of Draenor. Now that I am in Stormshield, however, I find it is much more enjoyable to pass these teachings onto others, than to toil in the fields with the skinning knife. Wouldn't you agree?"]=1,
},
[85926]={ -- Austin Windmill
  ["I am not a fighter myself, but I feel like even the most battle-minded of us should step away from time to time to enjoy some peace and quiet. For me, there's no better way to do so then with a fishing rod in your hand and the gentle sounds of the ocean. What do you think, $C?"]=1,
},
[85932]={ -- Vindicator Nuurem
  ["Welcome, commander. I carry the finest weapons, armor, and house decor in all of Ashran.$b$bLet me know if there is anything I can help you with."]=1,
},
[85961]={ -- Warpweaver Shal
  ["Now is the time when the year is new and the moon shines bright.$B$BIt is our time... when the ancients awake."]=1,
  ["I have all the tools necessary to adjust the appearance of your weapons and armor. Shall we begin?"]=2,
},
[85963]={ -- Orville Manfred
  ["People always wonder how a Worgen becomes a stablehand, but the truth is, I've been doing this long before I got afflicted. Just leave your pets with ol' Orville and I'll take good care of them. And before you ask, yes, I promise I won't eat them."]=1,
},
[85968]={ -- Trader Yula
  ["Please, sit and make yourself comfortable."]=1,
},
[86006]={ -- Anthony Allain
  ["The herbs and fungus found on Draenor can be used to concoct all manner of pestilence. I believe our next plague will be the best yet!"]=1,
},
[86012]={ -- Han Leaprocket
  ["Once I get this thing working we'll be able to clear-cut this island in no time flat. Lasers, baby!"]=1,
},
[86014]={ -- Murg Stonecrack
  ["Murg used to be a peon just like these orcs, but I got to be the best stone cracker out there! Now, they give Murg the name 'Stonecrack' and lets me boss around these little guys. It's the best job, I tell ya!"]=1,
},
[86033]={ -- Reena Cogscrap
  ["These Reliquary guys look like they mean business. To me, that sounds very bad for business."]=1,
},
[86043]={ -- Rangari Jonaa
  ["Commander, I have no interest in lumber or the collection of wood.$b$bSee me when you have completed your tasks with the Iron Horde, and perhaps after you have gained more experience in combat.$b$bWith a bit of coin I could have this lumber yard removed and replaced with a sparring arena you would be proud of."]=1,
},
[86048]={ -- Mazdon Bizratchet
  ["I can instruct you in blacksmithing. Interested?"]=1,
  ["I can instruct you in blacksmithing as well as supply the necessary tools.$B$BHow may I help you?"]=2,
},
[86049]={ -- Ilalu
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[86084]={ -- Delvar Ironfist
  ["Me grandpa Gygax trained me when I was just a lad. Ye won't be finding a better warrior in these parts. I can promise ye that."]=1,
},
[86175]={ -- Bregg Coppercast
  ["Are you sure you want to buy th'gear I've got for sale? Crunchpaw has th' best stuff these days. B'tween the two of us, I heard she didn't get her nickname from fightin' the Horde. Don't tell her I said that. Actually, I'd prefer y'din't even mention that we spoke. I'm not on her good side right now."]=1,
},
[86182]={ -- Talon Guard Teth
  ["The appearance of the Order of the Awakened vexes many of the Outcasts. Though they claim their intentions are pure, their kind has wronged us so many times before. We hope they are true to their words, but for now we will wait and see."]=1,
},
[86318]={ -- Zarjhin
  ["Boss-mon! Ya here too? Phew... I was startin' ta tink I made da bad call. Let's win dis war for da Horde!"]=1,
},
[86387]={ -- Dawn-Seeker Rilak
  ["I greet you, $C. We are the Order of the Awakened, and we represent the best interests of the arakkoa people. I am certain that you have witnessed the horrors brought upon the arakkoa and others by the Adherents of Rukhmar. We wish to reverse this damage and bring about a peaceful new era for our society. To do this, however, we require the knowledge of the Apexis. If you wish to assist us, we will trade valuable items for any Apexis relics you happen upon. What say you, $C?"]=1,
},
[86413]={ -- Stormshield Guard
  ["What do you need directions to?"]=1,
},
[86432]={ -- Belosh
  ["Miss Chi-Yuan possesses a talent in inscription which I can only hope to one day achieve. If you wish to be trained on the subject, there is no finer instructor than she."]=1,
},
[86440]={ -- Barney Fizzlestop
  ["The local draenei have been indispensable allies in our fight here in Ashran. So long as we keep a steady stream of supplies from the mainland, our victory is assured!"]=1,
},
[86441]={ -- Prelate Soshia
  ["Your cause on Ashran is just, and the draenei will assist in any way we can."]=1,
},
[87022]={ -- Bob
  ["Welcome to Sparktonic's Enchantments, offering the lowest prices on enchanting in Stormshield. Care to browse our recipes?"]=1,
},
[87048]={ -- Katherine Joplin
  ["The reagents of Draenor are as wondrous as they are mysterious. For a price, I can teach you to harness their potential."]=1,
},
[87049]={ -- Steven Cochrane
  ["I am quite busy, as you can no doubt see. Are you going to buy something?"]=1,
},
[87052]={ -- Artificer Harlaan
  ["I sell designs for the techniques used to harness the power of Draenor's crystals. If you are skilled enough, you may benefit greatly from this knowledge."]=1,
},
[87057]={ -- Leara Moonsilk
  ["Ready to turn those raggedy old leathers into something worth wearing?"]=1,
},
[87062]={ -- Royce Bigbeard
  ["Do you have what it takes to shape the metals of Draenor to your bidding? If you do, then my plans may be of use to you."]=1,
},
[87063]={ -- Joao Calhandro
  ["I can reveal to you the greatest secrets of Inscription if you have the proper skill."]=1,
},
[87065]={ -- Sean Catchpole
  ["I have for sale a collection of plans for the most wondrous creations of your imagination! Care to take a look?"]=1,
},
[87243]={ -- Zaalendor
  ["A model with skill such as mine does not come without dedication. I have spent a lifetime perfecting my signature poses."]=1,
},
[87274]={ -- Mustazaar
  ["Many adventurers have come to Ashran of late. Some seek their own personal fortune, while others come to aid the Alliance in their plight against the Horde. What adventure do you seek here, friend?"]=1,
},
[87391]={ -- Fate-Twister Seress
  ["The differences that have set the Arakkoa apart for years seem so trivial today. We have squandered the might of our people on fear and mistrust of one another when we should have been looking beyond the safety of Skyreach. There is nothing to be done about the past, but know that there are some who wish for our people to be more than a footnote to what Gul'dan has wrought. I will help you, $c. We must all help one another now, or this world is doomed."]=1,
},
[87548]={ -- Kaevan Highwit
  ["The draenei crystalsmiths closely guard the secrets to harnessing the latent power of the gems of Draenor. I, however, have managed to access these secrets and can share them with a talented jewelcrafter. For a price, of course."]=1,
},
[87707]={ -- Windhunter
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[88115]={ -- Prince Farondis
  ["You want to speak with me?"]=1,
  ["You must excuse my attendants. Their brusqueness is not directed at you... it is toward me."]=2,
  ["Azsuna was once a center of elven civilization. My people flourished. Now, they are damned.$b$bMost cannot bear to look at me.$b$bThey are the scars of my past. The marks of my shame."]=3,
  ["This is too difficult. I cannot look my people in the eye and explain my actions.$b$bI should return to the solitude of my palace. At least my guards are content to ignore me."]=4,
  ["Our work is nearly done.$b$bI must thank you for including me in your adventure, adventurer. I may have assisted you in finding the Tidestone itself, but I feel you have done so much more for me and my people."]=5,
},
[88155]={ -- Challenger Savina
  ["Greetings, $r.$B$BI can see from your demeanor that you are no ordinary adventurer.$B$BDraenor is a harsh world and many dangerous enemies lurk in both palaces and crypts. They aim to bring terrible destruction to this land using devastating weapons and magic. Securing these places and their treasures would mean excellent rewards for you and your companions.$B$BHowever, do not tread idly into these places, for other adventurers are nipping at your heels and only a race against time will prove your skills to be unmatched!$B$BAre you up for the new challenge Draenor has to offer?"]=1,
},
[88161]={ -- Challenger Sunforge
  ["Greetings, $r.$B$BI can see from your demeanor that you are no ordinary adventurer.$B$BDraenor is a harsh world and many dangerous enemies lurk in both palaces and crypts. They aim to bring terrible destruction to this land using devastating weapons and magic. Securing these places and their treasures would mean excellent rewards for you and your companions.$B$BHowever, do not tread idly into these places, for other adventurers are nipping at your heels and only a race against time will prove your skills to be unmatched!$B$BAre you up for the new challenge Draenor has to offer?"]=1,
},
[88184]={ -- Arlysea Silveroak
  ["If this artifact that Harrison is seeking is as powerful as he seems to think, I hope it remains undiscovered. Regardless of intentions, the wielding of great power often comes with drastic consequences."]=1,
},
[88206]={ -- Zidormi
  ["War does not simply visit these lands, it lives here. The violence thrives in past, present, and future..."]=1,
},
[88254]={ -- Julia Watkins
  ["I do not believe you possess the mental acuity to grasp the nature of portal magic."]=1,
  ["As a mage, you are one of a select group that can conjure a portal to transport you back to this very place. I can teach you if you are ready."]=2,
},
[88255]={ -- Samaeli Roseblade
  ["I do not believe you possess the mental acuity to grasp the nature of portal magic."]=1,
  ["As a mage, you are one of a select group that can conjure a portal to transport you back to this very place. I can teach you if you are ready."]=2,
},
[88501]={ -- Maldur Goldmantle
  ["I'm sorry $Gladdie:lass;, but I can't give you access to the vault.|n|nThis is where Dr Jones is keepin' his artifacts secure. Even though the Explorers' League is allowing adventurers to store their gear in the extra space, the vault stays off limits."]=1,
},
[88706]={ -- Murgul
  ["Sorry, but my services are only of use to warlocks."]=1,
  ["Weary of one of your demonic charges? Hoping for one with a more pleasing name? For a price, I can assist you in the obliteration of a current minion so that you may summon an entirely new one..."]=2,
},
[88873]={ -- Okuna Longtusk
  ["We need to concentrate on getting weapons to give to the other prisoners and setting you up as Sternfathom's champion pit fighter. Then, we can go kill Prince Oceanus."]=1,
},
[88908]={ -- Boss Whalebelly
  ["What's a puny $r like you doing in here? Oh, we're going to have a good time making chum of you."]=1,
},
[88916]={ -- Boss Whalebelly
  ["I'm on to you and your little friend over there. You think you can muscle in on what I've got going on here? Never going to happen. Let me assure you that by the end of the day, you'll be groveling on the arena floor with my boot to your neck, $r."]=1,
},
[89174]={ -- Laluu
  ["We practitioners of the arcane and elemental ways follow a never ending path of discovery. Is that why you seek my counsel? You wish further training?"]=1,
  ["By the Naaru, you are no mage! If you are looking for training, you must seek out a $c trainer."]=2,
},
[89362]={ -- Kayn Sunfury
  ["Greetings, $c. The Burning Legion have taken Faronaar. I have a plan to contain and crush them before they overrun all of Azsuna. We could use your assistance in doing so."]=1,
  ["adventurer, it is good that you are here. The matron mother has been providing our forces with transport from the Fel Hammer as we attempt to shore up our defenses here. The Burning Legion have taken Faronaar across the isthmus. I have a plan to contain and crush them before they overrun all of Azsuna. I could use your help in leading the Illidari to victory."]=2,
  ["$g Milord:Milady; adventurer. We are most grateful that you have come to lead us to victory against the Burning Legion."]=3,
},
[89398]={ -- Allari the Souleater
  ["Hello, $c. I trust that you are here to aid the Illidari in destroying the Burning Legion?"]=1,
  ["Hello, adventurer. With you here to lead us, the Legion on Faronaar will fall in short order."]=2,
},
[89639]={ -- Belath Dawnblade
  ["My apologies, adventurer. I was injured when I first came here to scout the Legion forces on Faronaar. Is there anything else that I can do for you?"]=1,
},
[89640]={ -- Falara Nightsong
  ["The Illidari are the first and last defense against the Burning Legion."]=1,
  ["adventurer, how goes the fight? Do you need supplies or anything repaired?"]=2,
},
[89830]={ -- Brew Vendor
  ["I'm sorry, our brews are exclusive to members of the 'Brew of the Month Club.'"]=1,
},
[89975]={ -- Senegos
  ["<The great dragon pulls in ragged breaths. He is in pain.>"]=1,
},
[89978]={ -- Projection of Senegos
  ["<Before you stands... not Senegos himself, but a magical projection of him. He appears strong, confident, and cheerful. This is not the decaying dragon you saw languishing in a pool.>"]=1,
},
[90247]={ -- Battlelord Gaardoun
  ["I await your orders, $g sir:ma'am;."]=1,
},
[90317]={ -- Jace Darkweaver
  ["$g Milord:Milady; adventurer. We are most grateful that you have come to lead us to victory against the Burning Legion."]=1,
},
[90749]={ -- Sky Admiral Rogers
  ["We had the Forsaken fleet right where we wanted them - trapped in that bay like fish in a barrel.$B$BThere was no time to wait for reinforcements.$B$BWe had one shot, so I gave the order.$B$BI have no regrets."]=1,
  ["Our crew will rendezvous with the Alliance navy and continue hunting Sylvanas.$B$BYou, however, have bigger fish to fry."]=2,
},
[91166]={ -- Daglop
  ["I, Daglop the Mercifel, Daglop the Magnivalent, Daglop the Wondevil, have come to make a deal!"]=1,
},
[91419]={ -- Mr. Shackle
  ["Don't think of us as smugglers. Instead, refer to us as professional salvors. We are salvage experts. We specialize in flotsam, jetsam, lagan, derelicts, and, of course, exotic archaeological recovery. Oh, and by the way, you might want to steer clear of the temple area to the south. I have my men investigating some salvage opportunities and I wouldn't want you to be confused for a competitor."]=1,
},
[91457]={ -- Gentle Rosh
  ["Little $r adventurer is friend to Gentle Rosh. You stay?"]=1,
},
[91463]={ -- Grace the Green
  ["Thanks again for saving my hide from those sea giants, adventurer."]=1,
},
[92183]={ -- Alard Schmied
  ["How may I help you?"]=1,
},
[92184]={ -- Imindril Spearsong
  ["Welcome to Tanks for Everything. We have the finest in all your blacksmithing and mining needs."]=1,
},
[92194]={ -- Timofey Oshenko
  ["How may I help you?"]=1,
},
[92195]={ -- Professor Pallin
  ["Welcome to the Scribes' Sacellum!"]=1,
},
[92218]={ -- Thrymjaris
  ["Speak with me when you have finished your business here, so we might leave this place."]=1,
},
[92242]={ -- Barm Stonebreaker
  ["Welcome to the Ironhorn Enclave."]=1,
},
[92243]={ -- Muirn Ironhorn
  ["How may I help you?"]=1,
},
[92264]={ -- Felsmith Nal'ryssa
  ["Keep your eyes on the skies. The infernals could start falling again at any moment."]=1,
},
[92265]={ -- Urael
  ["What is it you seek?"]=1,
},
[92456]={ -- Linzy Blackbolt
  ["Welcome to our shop. We have everything you need... if you need alchemy supplies."]=1,
},
[92458]={ -- Deucus Valdera
  ["What, good $gsir:madam;, can I do to assist you today?"]=1,
},
[92464]={ -- Kuhuine Tenderstride
  ["The flora of this land vary wildly from those of my home. Some of them seem more animal than plant."]=1,
  ["The flowers have much to teach, if you are willing to listen."]=2,
  ["Walk with a light hoof. The grass still breathes beneath you."]=3,
},
[92783]={ -- Elothir
  ["What has become of our precious Shaladrassil... our beloved Cenarius?$b$bI have failed them."]=1,
  ["<Elothir's form is unresponsive. The Nightmare has taken hold.>"]=2,
  ["<Elothir's inert form stares blankly into the distance.>"]=3,
  ["<Elothir appears completely unaware of his surroundings.>"]=4,
},
[92931]={ -- Mishka
  ["Be careful out there!"]=1,
},
[92980]={ -- Kayn Sunfury
  ["I am suspicious of Altruis's motivations, but for now, we have the same goal - getting out of this prison."]=1,
},
[92986]={ -- Altruis the Sufferer
  ["In the end, I could not follow Illidan's ways. He was falling to the demonic taint, and becoming more like his sworn enemies."]=1,
},
[93011]={ -- Kayn Sunfury
  ["Eons ago, Sargeras created Mardum to imprison demons. He also created the Sargerite Keystone to lock them away. But when the Titan decided to burn all of creation, he shattered Mardum, sending its fragments hurtling throughout the Twisting Nether. Thus was born the Burning Legion. Sargeras safeguarded his keystone on this particular fragment. It's a 'skeleton key', allowing access to any Legion world. It's also the key to Lord Illidan's plan for the Legion's destruction."]=1,
},
[93127]={ -- Kayn Sunfury
  ["adventurer, we must take the fight to the Legion here in the volcano. They must be destroyed before we fly up to the Brood Queen's command ship, the Fel Hammer. Then, we'll kill her, take the Sargerite Keystone, and return to the Black Temple to slay the invaders. No small feat, but I think we'll manage."]=1,
},
[93189]={ -- Mama Diggs
  ["I can instruct you in mining. Interested?"]=1,
},
[93231]={ -- Vydhar
  ["Many seasons have I slumbered. It is good to smell the Runewood air again."]=1,
  ["I feel footsteps... but they are not familiar... Stranger... you must help..."]=2,
},
[93437]={ -- Highlord Darion Mograine
  ["The time of apocalypse is upon us once again, adventurer.$b$bWill you rise to the occasion?"]=1,
},
[93456]={ -- Thassarian
  ["When you took your first unholy breath it was in the musty halls of Acherus.$b$bIt is here where we must set aside our differences and work as a united Knights of the Ebon Blade if we are to defeat the Demons."]=1,
},
[93466]={ -- Seska Seafang
  ["Thanks for the help, $g handsome:beautiful;."]=1,
},
[93520]={ -- Didi the Wrench
  ["If you got some springs loose, I can probably show you how to fix 'em up!"]=1,
},
[93522]={ -- Diane Cannings
  ["Hello! Are you interested in learning how to craft leather wares?"]=1,
},
[93523]={ -- Namha Moonwater
  ["Welcome to Legendary Leathers. How may I help you?"]=1,
},
[93524]={ -- Lalla Brightweave
  ["How may I help you?"]=1,
},
[93527]={ -- Timothy Jones
  ["As The Light as my witness, jewels are my business!$b$bWhat can I help you with?"]=1,
},
[93531]={ -- Enchanter Nalthanis
  ["How may I help you?"]=1,
},
[93534]={ -- Katherine Lee
  ["Welcome to my kitchen! We prepare some of the finest food in Dalaran here."]=1,
},
[93536]={ -- Awilo Lon'gomba
  ["What be happening?$B$BYou here to eat, mon? Or maybe to learn cooking from the best, eh?"]=1,
},
[93538]={ -- Dariness the Learned
  ["Welcome to Fragments of the Past!$b$bAre you interested in learning about Archaeology?"]=1,
},
[93539]={ -- Hobart Grapplehammer
  ["I notice you're not wearing any earrings. Could I interest you in pair of bolt-action carbine hoops? They're not very rusty!"]=1,
  ["This Oshenko fella' is always using 'screwdrivers' on his screws. Hasn't he ever heard of a hammer?"]=2,
  ["Hmm... you didn't see any nuclear bombs on your way in, did you? No? Alright, I'll keep looking."]=3,
  ["I haven't exploded anybody yet today. It's a good day!"]=4,
},
[93542]={ -- Tanithria
  ["How may I help you?"]=1,
},
[93568]={ -- Siouxsie the Banshee
  ["Azeroth has never before faced the full might of the Burning Legion, but with courage and diligence the Ebon Blade will be victorious."]=1,
},
[93691]={ -- Ronos Ironhorn
  ["Welcome to Ironhorn Enclave."]=1,
},
[93693]={ -- Lady S'theno
  ["I see you, adventurer. What is the plan?"]=1,
},
[93759]={ -- Jace Darkweaver
  ["I'm glad that you're here, adventurer. Now, let's be about our business."]=1,
},
[93960]={ -- Commander Lorna Crowley
  ["Sylvanas will pay for her crimes..."]=1,
},
[93967]={ -- Lyndras
  ["Those damned leyweavers had no right to throw me out. No right at all, I say."]=1,
},
[94393]={ -- Statue
  ["Before you stands a statue depicting the leader of the Shieldmaidens in Skold-Ashil. Her features look familiar..."]=1,
},
[94398]={ -- Fleet Command Table
  ["Greetings and salutations, hero! I have the latest news from both continents and points beyond for your consideration."]=1,
},
[94410]={ -- Allari the Souleater
  ["I am using the Scythe of Souls to interrogate these demons, but they do not know anything about the location of the Sargerite Keystone. They just keep repeating their loyalty to some queen. Cyana and Jace have moved ahead. Unfortunately, I think Cyana got herself captured trying to help some of our other demon hunters. There is something not quite right with her..."]=1,
},
[94435]={ -- Matron Mother Malevolence
  ["Yes? How might I help you, adventurer?"]=1,
},
[95193]={ -- Highlord Darion Mograine
  ["The time of apocalypse is upon us once again, adventurer.$b$bWill you rise to the occasion?"]=1,
},
[95791]={ -- Falara Nightsong
  ["The Illidari are the first and last defense against the Burning Legion."]=1,
  ["adventurer, how goes the fight? Do you need supplies or anything repaired?"]=2,
},
[95844]={ -- Marcia Chase
  ["Seen Nat around lately?"]=1,
  ["Keep some bait on your hook and some fish in your belly.$b$bTake care not to mix those two up."]=2,
  ["Fishing in a fountain may not be glamorous... but at least it's not fishing in a sewer."]=3,
},
[95889]={ -- Commander Lorna Crowley
  ["Genn is resting.$B$BWe should focus on making contact with the fleet and getting to a fortified position."]=1,
},
[96258]={ -- Yotnar
  ["You have shown yourself as a challenger truly worthy of the trials. It was an honor to test you."]=1,
},
[96362]={ -- Izzy Hollyfizzle
  ["How about makin' this place a little more festive, Commander?"]=1,
  ["All this fighting must wear on you. How about a party?"]=2,
  ["Don't you just love holidays? I know I do!"]=3,
},
[96368]={ -- Emmara Marie
  ["What is it? Precision requires focus, you know."]=1,
},
[96420]={ -- Cyana Nightglaive
  ["I don't know about you, but I'm willing to do whatever it takes to survive. What we need is more power!"]=1,
},
[96436]={ -- Jace Darkweaver
  ["adventurer, I believe there is something very powerful in this cave. But, because of the immense fel energy that permeates Mardum, I cannot be certain. My vision is clouded. If there is something in there, we can't afford to ignore it. Your mastery of spectral sight is greater than any, save Lord Illidan. Will you turn your spectral sight on the cave and confirm my suspicions?"]=1,
},
[96465]={ -- Vethir
  ["Your aid to the Thorignir will not go unrewarded, outsider. $B$BIf you truly wish the blessing of our brood, then help us to rid this scourge from our home."]=1,
  ["When you have finished your business here, speak to me and I will fly you to the summit. $B$BOnce we leave, we may not return."]=2,
},
[96470]={ -- Jana Winterhoof
  ["There is harmony in precision, $r."]=1,
},
[96474]={ -- Tryks Pourtrue
  ["Don't know what ya heard, but my numbers are exact. EXACT, I tell ya!"]=1,
},
[96485]={ -- Myshalla Streambreeze
  ["We're doing important work here in Feralas."]=1,
},
[96490]={ -- Krimple Proxmeasure
  ["Krimple's the name, precision's my game!"]=1,
},
[96507]={ -- Tassia Whisperglen
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[96652]={ -- Mannethrel Darkstar
  ["Maybe it's best that I stay here in the foothold. I still haven't recovered from my wounds when I was held prisoner down below. This world is overflowing with demonic energy. It's making it harder for me to contain my own fel power."]=1,
},
[96653]={ -- Izal Whitemoon
  ["adventurer, I have captured a few felbats. They will be ready when you decide to fly up to that Legion command ship."]=1,
},
[96655]={ -- Allari the Souleater
  ["Our primary goal here is to get the Sargerite Keystone. We need to finish up down here and get up onto Tyranna's floating command center."]=1,
},
[96665]={ -- Kayn Sunfury
  ["I am suspicious of Altruis's motivations, but for now, we have the same goal - getting out of this prison."]=1,
},
[96666]={ -- Kayn Sunfury
  ["I am suspicious of Altruis's motivations, but for now, we have the same goal - getting out of this prison."]=1,
},
[96675]={ -- Allari the Souleater
  ["There are many who opposed him, but Illidan was right all along. We are the weapons that will bring down the Burning Legion."]=1,
},
[96786]={ -- Archmage Celindra
  ["I do not believe you possess the mental acuity to grasp the nature of portal magic."]=1,
  ["As a mage, you are one of a select group that can conjure a portal to transport you back to this very place. I can teach you if you are ready."]=2,
},
[96813]={ -- Aludane Whitecloud
  ["Are you ready to fly? You'll have our fastest mount."]=1,
},
[96827]={ -- Adorean Lew
  ["Welcome to Dalaran, traveler.$B$BIs there something I might help you find?"]=1,
},
[97004]={ -- "Red" Jack Findle
  ["If you can pay, I can supply."]=1,
},
[97061]={ -- Thrymjaris
  ["Before we proceed, I would like to bestow upon you a gift of the Thorignir. Raise your weapon, outsider, and brace yourself. This may prove uncomfortable for your kind."]=1,
},
[97303]={ -- Kayn Sunfury
  ["We have accomplished the impossible. I must admit, I had my doubts about your leadership, adventurer. But no more. Let's get back and put an end to the attack on the Black Temple. Lord Illidan awaits."]=1,
},
[97359]={ -- Raethan
  ["Khadgar and his 'council' may rule the roost above, but down here? My men and I run the show.$b$bI don't want to see any funny business while you're in my sewer, $r. That is, of course, unless you could convince me to look the other way..."]=1,
},
[97361]={ -- Oxana Demonslay
  ["I have precious little time to waste. Speak or leave."]=1,
},
[97529]={ -- The Amazing Zanzo
  ["Greetings, mage. Shall I provide you with further insight into the world of magic?"]=1,
  ["Well met, $c. My advice to you is this: As you travel the world, be wary of magic for it will burn the untrained."]=2,
},
[97643]={ -- Kor'vas Bloodthorn
  ["For years we were shunned, banished to the darkest depths of the world by the Wardens. Now, we must rise to the hardest challenge our world has ever faced. Now, we must defend Azeroth against its greatest enemies."]=1,
},
[97644]={ -- Kor'vas Bloodthorn
  ["They are behaving like children.$B$BStill, I knew this was coming. They might as well work out their differences now."]=1,
},
[97736]={ -- Baric Stormrunner
  ["What is it you seek, $c?"]=1,
},
[97766]={ -- Francis Serbacon
  ["Can you believe there's a dwarf out there taking credit for my work? Have you ever heard of something so disrespectful?"]=1,
},
[97806]={ -- Falara Nightsong
  ["It was difficult, but I've managed to gather some weapons and supplies. What do you need?"]=1,
},
[98017]={ -- Guron Twaintail
  ["You walk among the spirits of an ancient land, $r."]=1,
},
[98026]={ -- Baric Stormrunner
  ["What is it you seek, $c?"]=1,
},
[98148]={ -- Nassar
  ["You seem like the type that just wants a fight. If you're interested, the Horde needs more troops."]=1,
},
[98222]={ -- Ryno Bloomfield
  ["Quiet! I'm listening to the plants."]=1,
},
[98223]={ -- Dani Earthtouch
  ["Do I know you? What are you doing here?"]=1,
},
[98224]={ -- Lohor
  ["As a druid, the overgrowth in this area concerns me. As an herbalist, however, I couldn't be happier."]=1,
},
[98229]={ -- Kayn Sunfury
  ["We must eliminate the Legion threat on this ridge so that you can bring the rest of our forces in from the Black Temple."]=1,
},
[98721]={ -- Seymour
  ["Have you honed your skills enough to learn what I have to teach?"]=1,
},
[98791]={ -- Glielle
  ["Have you honed your skills enough to learn what I have to teach?"]=1,
},
[98931]={ -- Thanid Glowergold
  ["Don't ye dare say I look like me brother. I'm clearly taller!"]=1,
},
[98948]={ -- Hrul Sharphoof
  ["I carry on our traditions until one comes that can take my place."]=1,
},
[98964]={ -- Celea
  ["I may be cursed, but I can still teach others what I knew when I was alive."]=1,
},
[99045]={ -- Kor'vas Bloodthorn
  ["If it weren't for the Black Temple being under attack, I wouldn't mind staying here longer. There are so many demons to kill."]=1,
},
[99624]={ -- Navarrogg
  ["I owe you a great debt, adventurer. Thank you once again."]=1,
},
[99867]={ -- Warpweaver Tuviss
  ["Now is the time when the year is new and the moon shines bright.$B$BIt is our time... when the ancients awake."]=1,
  ["I have all the tools necessary to adjust the appearance of your weapons and armor. Shall we begin?"]=2,
},
[99903]={ -- Sprig Hashhoof
  ["I can instruct you in herbalism. Interested?"]=1,
  ["I can instruct you in herbalism as well as offer helpful supplies.$B$BHow may I help you?"]=2,
},
[99914]={ -- Ashtongue Mystic
  ["<The broken mystic barely clings to life.> I am as good as dead. Do... what must... be done."]=1,
  ["<The corpse of the Ashtongue Mystic lies here bereft of its soul, which has powered the Legion Gateway.>"]=2,
},
[99915]={ -- Sevis Brightflame
  ["The brood queen must have done something to this gateway. Not even the souls of several mo'arg were enough to unlock it. The soul of a demon hunter, however, would do the trick. You have a choice to make, adventurer... ... One of us must die."]=1,
},
[99917]={ -- Sevis Brightflame
  ["He was brave and proved himself worthy. We should all be so lucky to make the ultimate sacrifice in Lord Illidan's name."]=1,
  ["This Ashtongue mystic will willingly sacrifice his soul for the cause if you're the one to do it."]=2,
},
[99986]={ -- Apata Highmountain
  ["You have come, just as Emmarel said you would."]=1,
},
[100171]={ -- Courier Larkspur
  ["I'm grateful Lady Shadewarden found you, adventurer. We have a chance to strike a major blow against the Legion!"]=1,
},
[100323]={ -- Revil Kost
  ["So you hunt the Dark Riders as well? Long have I searched for a way to rid Duskwood of their curse, but now it seems I have become the hunted. Though we share a common enemy, the sins you bear prevent me from aiding your cause. The Light is not well served by taking power from one evil only to bestow it upon another."]=1,
},
[100429]={ -- Anduin Wrynn
  ["Welcome back to Stormwind, adventurer. I'm relieved you survived the Broken Shore.$b$bWe could not afford to lose you!"]=1,
  ["I don't have time for pleasantries, demon hunter.$b$bAs I told the other Illidari, I have much to contemplate.$b$bI must prepare our armies to take on the Legion, even as some of my allies cry out for vengeance against the Horde."]=2,
},
[100448]={ -- General Bret Hughes
  ["Are you ready for your combat training?"]=1,
},
[100482]={ -- Senegos
  ["<The great dragon pulls in ragged breaths. He is in pain.>"]=1,
},
[100652]={ -- Malfurion Stormrage
  ["The Thicket is a dangerous place, would you like me to transport you out?"]=1,
},
[100810]={ -- Grif Wildheart
  ["So that lass Emmarel Shadewarden sent you my way? Seems she's good as her word, that one.$b$bDon't know a thing about this Unseen Path she's part of, but I'm willin' to hear her out."]=1,
},
[101314]={ -- Alonsus Faol
  ["I have been watching your exploits, and I think you the right hero for the job!"]=1,
},
[101441]={ -- Duke Lankral
  ["We did not start this war, but we will end it."]=1,
},
[101492]={ -- Ms. Xiulan
  ["We have the most exotic of wares from across the world.$b$bWhat is it you're looking for?"]=1,
},
[101759]={ -- Kiatke
  ["Oh, when did you get here, $c?"]=1,
},
[102193]={ -- Filgo Scrapbottom
  ["How may I help you?"]=1,
},
[102195]={ -- Fargo Flintlocke
  ["Howdy! What can I do fer ya?"]=1,
},
[102196]={ -- Fargo Flintlocke
  ["Hobart's not gonna be too 'appy to 'ear about 'is gunpack. How 'ave ye been, $glad:lass;?"]=1,
},
[102197]={ -- Fargo Flintlocke
  ["Good ta see yeh again, $glad:lass;! These elves need all tha 'elp we can give 'em!"]=1,
},
[102198]={ -- Fargo Flintlocke
  ["Those murlocs be up ta no good, oh aye. I know this 'cause I can smell somethin' fishy."]=1,
},
[102278]={ -- Lieutenant Sinclari
  ["Reinforcements, finally! The prison guards can't hold out against this invasion for much longer! You'll have to relieve my men and try to hold out for as long as you can. There's still some power in the defense system available. Use the activation crystals located around the prison to trigger a discharge if the situation worsens."]=1,
},
[102343]={ -- Calia
  ["Hello there! You were not followed, were you?"]=1,
},
[102420]={ -- Revil Kost
  ["If we wish to complete our goals, it is clear we must work together, $c. Let us not waste any more time."]=1,
},
[102478]={ -- Emmarel Shadewarden
  ["I am pleased you have arrived."]=1,
  ["I have been watching your exploits, and I think you the right hero for the job!"]=2,
},
[102700]={ -- Meryl Felstorm
  ["We must make haste to the Violet Hold! Kathra'nathir must not be allowed access to the Forge of the Guardian!"]=1,
  ["The dreadlord Kathra'natir is defeated, but only for now. If we wish to save Azeroth from his evil, we must reform the Tirisgarde. Then we can hunt him down in the Twisting Nether before he has a chance to share his secrets with the Burning Legion."]=2,
},
[103055]={ -- Kir'altius
  ["What is it you seek: wisdom, or power? Both perhaps?"]=1,
  ["You tread on hallowed ground, outsider. I trust you would not do so without purpose."]=2,
  ["You come to our crucible, where our most honored mages have been tested for millennia. Why are you here?"]=3,
},
[103133]={ -- Naralex
  ["<Naralex sits quietly with his eyes shut.>"]=1,
},
[103136]={ -- Zen'tabra
  ["Ya be needin' something?"]=1,
},
[103485]={ -- Lessah Moonwater
  ["Hello adventurer, I am Lessah. Are you as interested as I am in learning about the Highmountain tauren?"]=1,
},
[103614]={ -- Muffinus Chromebrew
  ["Sorry $g pal:lady;, I can't help ya. Find a $c trainer. I only teach hunters!"]=1,
},
[103733]={ -- Luron
  ["I hope someday to become as great as Lessah has become and make her proud."]=1,
},
[103760]={ -- Ariana Fireheart
  ["The Illidari are prepared to serve."]=1,
},
[104091]={ -- Kirin Tor Guardian
  ["Welcome to Dalaran, traveler.$B$BIs there something I might help you find?"]=1,
},
[104824]={ -- Ernest Carlisle
  ["Those undead invaders put up quite a fight, but Marl and I won't let the farm be taken."]=1,
},
[105085]={ -- Spiritwalker Graysky
  ["Walking in the memories of spirits can sometimes be dangerous, but it is a responsibility we Spiritwalkers must accept."]=1,
},
[105160]={ -- Fel Orb
  ["Fel magic surges around within the orb almost... invitingly. The depths of fel magic are beyond you."]=1,
},
[105317]={ -- Warlord Zakgra
  ["Are you ready for your combat training?"]=1,
},
[105729]={ -- Signal Lantern
  ["This lantern appears to have been slightly modified. It must be the one you need to use to send a signal."]=1,
},
[105769]={ -- Brother Larry
  ["My beasts have been blessed by the Light to enhance their speed and agility. You'll not find a swifter ride."]=1,
},
[105945]={ -- Sevis Brightflame
  ["Thank you again for giving me the honor of sacrificing my life for the cause. Now you know that I'd willingly give everything to further Lord Illidan's plan. The Burning Legion must be destroyed at any cost. I owe you everything, adventurer. Now, you complete what we started, gain the Sargerite Keystone, and return triumphant to the Black Temple. Lord Illidan awaits."]=1,
},
[106468]={ -- Ly'leth Lunastre
  ["It should fool the gibbering, wine-soaked guests, but a keen eye could see through it. Should the illusion falter, the guards will quickly descend upon you."]=1,
},
[106649]={ -- Baron Scaldius
  ["How may I serve?"]=1,
},
[106655]={ -- Arcanomancer Vridiel
  ["Any lout with a hammer and tongs can bang steel. It takes a master craftsman to weave the very essence of the arcane into one's creations, to forge weapons of cunning as well as brute strength."]=1,
},
[106914]={ -- Tehd Shoemaker
  ["Now I know you may be asking yourself why a demon hunter and a warlock are so far out here away from the action.$b$bBut while you are asking yourself that, also ask yourself to be quiet and mind your own business."]=1,
},
[106915]={ -- Marius Felbane
  ["My dealings with this... warlock... are a means to an end.$b$bI wish to learn from this creature, to study it. And if need be, to slay it before it does more harm than good to this world."]=1,
},
[107196]={ -- Bishop Arthur
  ["Have you come to supplicate yourself before the Light? Or perhaps you have come here to train in the holy arts?$b$bIf you are here to speak with Archbishop Benedictus or Bishop Farthing, they have both gone on missions."]=1,
},
[107486]={ -- Chatty Rumormonger
  ["I heard the spy enjoys the cool air and is not wearing long sleeves tonight."]=1,
  ["I heard the spy wears short sleeves to keep their arms unencumbered."]=2,
  ["A friend of mine said she saw the outfit the spy was wearing. It did not have long sleeves."]=3,
  ["Someone told me the spy hates wearing long sleeves."]=4,
},
[107554]={ -- Thassarian
  ["The world will cry out in anger against us, but the air that fills their lungs will have been bought with the price of our souls."]=1,
},
[107574]={ -- Anduin Wrynn
  ["Welcome to Stormwind, $c."]=1,
  ["<Anduin sizes you up.>$B$Badventurer, is it? A few of your triumphs have been the talk of the court.$B$BWhat was it like to serve in Northrend? Have you seen the World Tree? Are the stories about Vashj'ir true? I have so many questions!"]=2,
},
[107622]={ -- Glutonia
  ["Our bank is so secure you'll have trouble getting your own things out! Ha ha!"]=1,
},
[107934]={ -- Recruiter Lee
  ["Stormwind appreciates your service!"]=1,
},
[108393]={ -- Sister Lilith
  ["The Forest lives and breathes as one."]=1,
},
[108527]={ -- Loramus Thalipedes
  ["Core Customization Console online. Insert an Automa Core to customize it."]=1,
},
[108628]={ -- Armond Thaco
  ["<The mage darts his eyes back and forth shiftily.>$b$bIs there anything I can do for you, $c? I have... matters... to attend to."]=1,
},
[108722]={ -- Ramall Trueoak
  ["How about a duel?"]=1,
  ["I could use a good fight."]=2,
  ["Show me what you've got!"]=3,
  ["Feel like showing me a few pointers?"]=4,
  ["I admire your skill in battle. How about a quick match?"]=5,
  ["Feel like training with me?"]=6,
},
