[108825]={ -- Conjurer Margoss
  ["Interested in some magic fishing? Sounds cool right?"]=1,
},
[108925]={ -- Lord Adder
  ["You! $C! Have you been inside the Violet Hold?$b$bThese imbecile guards keep waving me away. Do they not know who I am?"]=1,
},
[109028]={ -- Horkus
  ["I am ogre. Totally ogre. Definitely not... NOT ogre."]=1,
},
[109300]={ -- Sentry
  ["The sentry hums with arcane energies as indecipherable elfish runes dance faintly across the surface of its lens. There is one talon that glows faintly."]=1,
  ["A second talon flashes intermittently; but the sentry is otherwise inactive. It is as though it waits for some outside input."]=2,
},
[109334]={ -- Okuna Longtusk
  ["We really did it. We took out Oceanus! Now we're free."]=1,
},
[109412]={ -- Lorcan Flintedge
  ["Aye, another mission where we might not be makin' it back. Brought me private stash this time, though. Ye want a sip?"]=1,
},
[109788]={ -- Duke Lankral
  ["We did not start this war, but we will end it."]=1,
},
[109912]={ -- Captive Wyrmtongue
  ["Yes, yes! Come closer, friend!$B$BI see you has nice things! What does friend need? Perhaps some trinkets do you well?"]=1,
},
[110642]={ -- Fizzi Liverzapper
  ["How may I help you?"]=1,
},
[110677]={ -- Image of Khadgar
  ["Champions, you've done it! I sense Gul'dan's ritual growing in power, we must hurry. I can teleport you back to the Nighthold. Are you prepared?"]=1,
},
[112323]={ -- Amurra Thistledew
  ["Welcome to The Gnarled Branch, adventurer."]=1,
},
[112565]={ -- Armored Wind Rider
  ["<The wind rider's wings flap in anticipation of the coming battle>"]=1,
},
[112958]={ -- Soulare of Andorhal
  ["You really are fond of conversing with me, aren't you?"]=1,
  ["If only I could be so utterly luminescent!"]=2,
  ["Let us engage in joyous collaboration!"]=3,
  ["We are surrounded by strange beings, in a strange land..."]=4,
  ["No need to hide your reaction. I get that look all the time!"]=5,
  ["I am Soulare of Andorhal, disciple of the Light."]=6,
  ["Oh, my greetings to you. I will remain here, to contemplate the sun."]=7,
},
[113986]={ -- Archmage Khadgar
  ["I will summon the spirit of Alodi, the first Guardian of Tirisfal. Let me know when you would like me to begin."]=1,
  ["Give us time to prepare, adventurer.$b$bProtect the city from the Legion, or use your map to find an invasion to stop.$b$bWhen the time is right to begin, I will call for you."]=2,
  ["The Legion bears down on us. We have but moments to spare. The shockwave of arcane energies we are about to unleash should prove powerful enough to send them back to their cursed dimension for a time, giving us time to catch our breath and begin the search for the Pillars of Creation. Are you ready?"]=3,
},
[114339]={ -- Barnes
  ["Don't worry, you'll be fine. You look like a natural!"]=1,
},
[114665]={ -- Sergeant Wilson
  ["You seem like the type that just wants a fight. If you're interested, the Alliance needs more troops."]=1,
},
[115906]={ -- Archmage Kesalon
  ["Be sure to pass through the energy orbs to recharge the dash ability I've given you. Oh and uh..."]=1,
},
[116302]={ -- Archmage Khadgar
  ["Our war against the Legion has exacted a heavy price. Many brave heroes lost their lives in this campaign. Those sacrifices must not be in vain. Let us seize our chance for victory!"]=1,
},
[116573]={ -- R.L Cooper
  ["The damn spiders, the endlessly screeching bats, and those blasted demon beasts have all taken residence in the Servant's Quarters. At least the big ones seem to have cleared out."]=1,
},
[116662]={ -- Suramar Portal
  ["The portal shimmers with images of the spire."]=1,
},
[116667]={ -- Suramar Portal
  ["The portal shimmers with images of the spire."]=1,
},
[117134]={ -- Tehd Shoemaker
  ["Look, these portals are not going to hijack themselves. I need time to do this right or you will just end up in a Legion melting pot or the gut of a Pit Lord. Do you want to teleport into the gut of a Pit Lord? Oh sure, at first it seems like a clever, unexpected attack. But then you get digested in fel juices and wonder where your great plan went. Leave me to my work."]=1,
},
[117873]={ -- Illidan Stormrage
  ["Now is the time when the year is new and the moon shines bright.$B$BIt is our time... when the ancients awake."]=1,
  ["Gul'dan has been vanquished, but his master Kil'jaeden poses an even greater threat. The Deceiver will stop at nothing to destroy our world. We must make any sacrifice necessary to end his reign."]=2,
},
[118828]={ -- Mistweaver Xia
  ["Oh, when did you get here, $c?"]=1,
},
[118904]={ -- Harold G. Goldsprocket
  ["There certainly is a great deal of carnage in the fighting ring today. Moreso than usual, I'd say. I think I got hit with a tooth."]=1,
},
[118905]={ -- Huntress Duskrunner
  ["Of all the wondrous places within Darnassus, which would you have me direct you to?"]=1,
},
[119676]={ -- Lasan Skyhorn
  ["I suggest we be quick. The skies are swarming with those foul beasts. Our opportunity to strike at the heart of the Legion presents itself. We must bring the battle to the frontlines."]=1,
},
[119886]={ -- Excavator Karla
  ["So many treasures, just waiting for me to grab!"]=1,
},
[120076]={ -- Treasure Master Iks'reeged
  ["The stars of this time are bent on new paths, beacons of hope and strength for the coming ages."]=1,
  ["You again? You can't have my treasure!"]=2,
  ["Are you ever going to let me go?"]=3,
  ["I was spawned into this wretched existence eons ago within the deepest realms of the nether."]=4,
  ["Being eternally suspended in a prison set by a fatuous goblin? It's a blast..."]=5,
  ["If you come near me, I'll bite your hand off."]=6,
  ["Arrrg! What have you done?! Shackled to this realm forever? I cannot imagine a worse fate!"]=7,
},
[120118]={ -- Heidirk the Scalekeeper
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[120169]={ -- Princess Talanji
  ["My father once ruled with an iron fist, and none would dare break his laws. But he was also just, helping those in need, so his subjects loved him for it.$b$bNow? Now de iron fist is forgotten. Dose he trusts pour poison in his ear as dey plot and scheme.$b$bI do not know what dey are planning, but I know our people cannot afford to wait and see."]=1,
  ["It sounds like not all of de Zanchuli Council are happy you are here. Dis is going to be interesting."]=2,
},
[120170]={ -- Nathanos Blightcaller
  ["So the King named you Speaker for the Horde? Good. My diplomacy skills mostly involve arrows."]=1,
},
[120173]={ -- Zen'tabra
  ["The loa be powerful here. I can feel the presence of me own loa, Gonk, stalking behind every tree and bush.$b$bGonk be near. It will be a fine thing to see him in person."]=1,
},
[120183]={ -- Commander Chambers
  ["The stars of this time are bent on new paths, beacons of hope and strength for the coming ages."]=1,
  ["Wanna know the key to beating the Legion? Buildings, mate. Buildings and more buildings. Crikey!"]=2,
},
[120456]={ -- Keeper Raynae
  ["I seek to cleanse the waters here."]=1,
},
[120590]={ -- Lady Jaina Proudmoore
  ["Are you prepared for the journey to Kul Tiras?"]=1,
},
[120788]={ -- Genn Greymane
  ["I suppose it was too much to hope they had forgiven Jaina. Her uncertain fate is troubling, but we must remain focused on the mission. We must bring Kul Tiras into the Alliance. If Katherine Proudmoore is unwilling to hear us out, these sympathizers are our best hope."]=1,
},
[120791]={ -- Zul the Prophet
  ["De moment I saw your face in Stormwind, I knew de time of de prophecy was upon us.$b$bDe spirits show me many things, and in dese visions, I have seen your face at de head of many great events to come.$b$bThings are in motion, $c. Soon, you and I will shake de very fabric of dis world."]=1,
},
[120898]={ -- Warmage Kath'leen
  ["$ct, see something you like?"]=1,
},
[120928]={ -- Jay Maguire
  ["Baby, baby, baby! This is the illest, realest, deadest band you've ever seen! They will melt your face, figuratively and literally! Before I met these guys, I was alive and had all my skin! Now I'm dead and filthy rich! Catch Blight Boar here, every hour on the half hour!"]=1,
},
[121210]={ -- Nathanos Blightcaller
  ["Elder Obsidian wanders near the Sepulcher in Silverpine Forest."]=1,
  ["For now, I will let you and Rokhan decide the best course of action as he knows these people better than I.$b$bBesides, these trolls are prejudiced against those like myself that refuse to stay dead. I do not want their short-sighted views on life to get in the way of us gaining their fleet.$b$bWe must not fail. Sylvanas must have her fleet."]=2,
},
[121235]={ -- Taelia
  ["Everything here changed when Daelin Proudmoore was defeated.$B$BJaina must have had her reasons... right?"]=1,
  ["I grew up hearing tales of the great kingdom of Lordaeron.$B$BAnd tales of its fall.$B$BThe Scourge took my mother, my father, and my homeland before I was even old enough to understand."]=2,
  ["There's an old saying here in Kul Tiras.$B$BWhen something goes wrong, old sailors will shrug it off and proclaim: 'You cannot change the winds.'$B$BI hate that saying."]=3,
  ["Cyrus has raised me since I was a child. He taught me how to fight, how to ride, how to sail.$B$BBy the time I entered the guard I was already better trained than some of my instructors.$B$BThey didn't appreciate that."]=4,
  ["Is it true that one can travel from Stormwind to Ironforge by some kind of underground tunnel?$B$BThat sounds incredible! I'd love to see it some day."]=5,
},
[121241]={ -- Princess Talanji
  ["You'll find Elder Starglade outside the gates to Zul'Gurub in Stranglethorn Vale."]=1,
  ["We must be wary. Nobody comes back from Nazmir."]=2,
},
[121252]={ -- Ripa the Wind Ripper
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[121599]={ -- King Rastakhan
  ["Zul's treachery cuts deeper than I realized. With his rebellion, he practically depleted my army. Those still loyal to me are dying on the battlefield behind me to these invading, endless swarms of blood trolls. I should have listened to Talanji."]=1,
},
[121706]={ -- Beastlord L'kala
  ["Welcome to Warbeast Kraal, adventurer. I have heard of your Horde, and I know you are here to strike a bargain with ol' Rastakhan. We will see if you are useful. Maybe den we will send kind words up de steps of Dazar, hm?"]=1,
},
[121828]={ -- Zabar
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[122095]={ -- Skycaller Faeb
  ["If you travel to Cenarion Hold in Silithus, you will find Elder Bladesing."]=1,
},
[122110]={ -- Falconer Notley
  ["A fine specimen, isn't he? The House Waycrest has long been known as experts in the arts of falconry. Unfortunately, most of our best birds have fallen under the curse of the coven. Winston here is one of only a handful of Waycrest falcons not under their spell. It is truly a sad state of affairs."]=1,
},
[122112]={ -- Ensign Yorrick
  ["Something wicked stirs in the woods, mainlander. At night, the ancient Drust monument at its heart glows with unholy power. If I were you, I would give that place a wide berth in your travels."]=1,
},
[122115]={ -- Ensign Mace
  ["What is it, mainlander? In case you can't tell, I'm a little busy here."]=1,
},
[122134]={ -- Makkaw
  ["Elder Bluewolf is trapped within the battle for Wintergrasp."]=1,
  ["Please, make yourself at home."]=2,
  ["Welcome to the Moonkin Festival!"]=3,
},
[122191]={ -- Du'ba
  ["I don't think we can afford to pass an opportunity to ingratiate ourselves with the red flight. With the battles ahead, having them as allies would be invaluable."]=1,
  ["Although I be dead, da creatures still be coming at my call. You want ride?"]=2,
},
[122234]={ -- Bloodsail Deckhand
  ["Elder Brightspear can be found wandering amongst the ruins of Kel'Theril in Winterspring."]=1,
  ["Where you been? There's more grog to drink!"]=2,
  ["When you're a Bloodsail, every day is Pirates' Day!"]=3,
  ["I'm a mighty pirate!"]=4,
  ["Welcome to the parrrty!"]=5,
  ["Dread Crew... More like Dead Crew, am I right?"]=6,
  ["Haven't I seen you below deck before? Or maybe it's just the grog talkin..."]=7,
  ["Ya like treasure, landlubber? Too bad! It's all ours!"]=8,
  ["You look familiar... Didn't I ransack your coastal villa once? Ha, yeah! I'm sure it was you! Your servants all ran screaming into the vineyards, right? And then we burnt the whole place to the ground? Good times."]=9,
},
[122241]={ -- Astralaire
  ["Elder Chogan'gada can be found in Utgarde Pinnacle."]=1,
  ["Can you feel the rhythm?"]=2,
  ["Move to the beat!"]=3,
},
[122243]={ -- Bloodsail Deckhand
  ["Elder Brightspear can be found wandering amongst the ruins of Kel'Theril in Winterspring."]=1,
  ["Where you been? There's more grog to drink!"]=2,
  ["When you're a Bloodsail, every day is Pirates' Day!"]=3,
  ["I'm a mighty pirate!"]=4,
  ["Welcome to the parrrty!"]=5,
  ["Dread Crew... More like Dead Crew, am I right?"]=6,
  ["Haven't I seen you below deck before? Or maybe it's just the grog talkin..."]=7,
  ["Ya like treasure, landlubber? Too bad! It's all ours!"]=8,
  ["You look familiar... Didn't I ransack your coastal villa once? Ha, yeah! I'm sure it was you! Your servants all ran screaming into the vineyards, right? And then we burnt the whole place to the ground? Good times."]=9,
},
[122254]={ -- Quartermaster Rowley
  ["Elder Fargal looks over Frosthold in Storm Peaks."]=1,
  ["You haven't lived until you've sang shanties at sunrise in the salty mists of the sea."]=2,
},
[122257]={ -- Gunner Pops
  ["Elder Farwhisper can be found wandering the streets of Stratholme."]=1,
  ["I haven't trained at any of the famous academies, but I've sacked all of 'em!"]=2,
},
[122258]={ -- Cook Lastwind
  ["Elder Goldwell spends his time in the village of Kharanos in Dun Morogh."]=1,
  ["When the Bloodsail raided my family's fishing boat, they didn't just kill everyone I've ever loved. They rescued me from a mundane life severely lacking in treasure and grog! A pirate's life for me!"]=2,
},
[122279]={ -- Bloodsail Pony Plunderer
  ["I last saw Elder Meadowrun at the Weeping Cave in the Western Plaguelands."]=1,
  ["Don't judge me. Not on Pirates' Day!"]=2,
  ["Where be ye ocean steed, matey?"]=3,
  ["Avast! Stop poking me inflatable or I be keelhaulin' ya!"]=4,
  ["They were all out of the red ones."]=5,
  ["Does this make me look fearsome?"]=6,
  ["Look at this landlubber without a sea pony! Ha!"]=7,
  ["Push me towards Booty Bay so I can shout more profanities at 'em!"]=8,
  ["I've never felt so free!"]=9,
},
[122281]={ -- Bloodsail Pony Plunderer
  ["I last saw Elder Meadowrun at the Weeping Cave in the Western Plaguelands."]=1,
  ["Don't judge me. Not on Pirates' Day!"]=2,
  ["Where be ye ocean steed, matey?"]=3,
  ["Avast! Stop poking me inflatable or I be keelhaulin' ya!"]=4,
  ["They were all out of the red ones."]=5,
  ["Does this make me look fearsome?"]=6,
  ["Look at this landlubber without a sea pony! Ha!"]=7,
  ["Push me towards Booty Bay so I can shout more profanities at 'em!"]=8,
  ["I've never felt so free!"]=9,
},
[122370]={ -- Cyrus Crestfall
  ["I have fewer days ahead now than behind. I'll not spend them watching Kul Tiras fall apart."]=1,
  ["When Daelin asked me to leave his guard and raise this child of the Eastern Kingdoms, I struggled to understand why. Why thrust this burden on me? Why deny me the honor of fighting by his side? I thought maybe I had done something to lose his faith. Over the years, I have come to realize that the opposite was true. He wanted Taelia to grow up strong of arm and noble of heart - and he had faith that I could make that happen."]=2,
  ["You must be the Alliance emissary. I'm glad Flynn and Taelia were able to get you out of that damn prison. I am Sir Cyrus Crestfall. On behalf of the Proudmoore Admiralty, I welcome you to Kul Tiras. <Cyrus extends his massive hand warmly.>"]=3,
},
[122583]={ -- Meerah
  ["It's never safe to travel these dunes alone."]=1,
  ["Dolly and Dot are strong and dependable. They'll get us where we need to go."]=2,
  ["Dolly and Dot have built up quite an appetite. Pulling a cartload of trolls isn't easy work!"]=3,
},
[122660]={ -- Clookle
  ["I think Elder Splitrock has traveled to Maraudon in Desolace."]=1,
  ["Kill the one responsible for all of this!"]=2,
  ["Thank you for saving me."]=3,
},
[122661]={ -- General Jakra'zet
  ["I don't care what deal ya think to barter from da King and his daughter. Know that ya not welcome in Zuldazar.$b$bAnd while da Princess may have a lot of authority, she not be queen yet.$b$bUntil then, da real power of Zuldazar lay with me and da Zanchuli Council."]=1,
},
[122688]={ -- Bwonsamdi
  ["Would you like to head back down, $c?$B$BI can see to it that one of these drakes sees you safely to where you need to go."]=1,
  ["What ya be askin' of Ol' Bwonsamdi?"]=2,
},
[122689]={ -- Paku'ai Rokota
  ["Where are you going?"]=1,
},
[122694]={ -- Secott the Goldsmith
  ["What has de loa brought me today?"]=1,
},
[122695]={ -- Seshuli
  ["Welcome to my shop, $c.$b$bAre you interested in my wares, or would you like to learn how to cut dem yourself?"]=1,
},
[122698]={ -- Xanjo
  ["Hey dere, $gbruddah:sistah;, you lookin' to be makin' some sweet tings outta leather?$b$bWell den, look no furder. I be de best trainer in all dese parts."]=1,
},
[122699]={ -- Rana the Cutta
  ["I can instruct you in skinning. Interested?"]=1,
},
[122700]={ -- Pin'jin the Patient
  ["Welcome to my shop, $r. Might I interest you in some of de finest cloth you'll ever see?$b$bOr do you wish to learn how to turn dis cloth into powerful equipment?"]=1,
},
[122701]={ -- Examiner Alerinda
  ["Welcome, adventurer. The Zandalari have allowed me to use this room to study their ancient artifacts as well as those of their enemy.$b$bHave you come to browse, or would you like to learn about these relics as well?"]=1,
},
[122702]={ -- Enchantress Quinni
  ["I can instruct you in enchanting. Interested?"]=1,
},
[122703]={ -- Clever Kumali
  ["Hello dere, $c. Are you interested in learnin' some alchemy?$b$bI'm de best trainer in all de land."]=1,
},
[122704]={ -- Jahden Fla
  ["De flora of de jungle can be worse than de fauna, if you are not careful."]=1,
},
[123052]={ -- Kimbul
  ["As I was saying, I held onto that scepter shard for a good five-hundred years and it was nothing but trouble. It attracted all kinds of attention - the wrong kind of attention. I want to be left alone to my studies not babysit some would be hero's ticket to glory. So... I gave it to the fish."]=1,
  ["You are the first mortal to enter my temple in many years. It is good to once again have followers among the living."]=2,
},
[123120]={ -- Bloodsail Drunk
  ["I tend these creatures of Gormok as he cannot. I do not fully agree with this slaughter, but at the least he will have his chance to fight."]=1,
  ["It's Pirates' Day, and that means it's time to party! When ya get bored with this Dread Crew snoozefest, head south to the beach... Where REAL pirates celebrate. Me mighty Bloodsail Buccaneers be down there. Tell 'em ol' Whiskers sent ya, and maybe they'll let me back in..."]=2,
},
[123335]={ -- Wardruid Loti
  ["Through the valleys and peaks of Mount Hyjal, across the shifting sands of Silithus, against the Legion's dread armies - we have fought. We are the nameless, faceless, sons and daughters of the Alliance. By the Light and by the might of the Alliance, the first strike belongs to us and the last strike is all that our enemies see.$B$BWe are 7th Legion."]=1,
  ["When I get my claws into Yazma and her spider cult... oh, dere will be blood."]=2,
},
[123394]={ -- "Bad News" Brin
  ["Take off yer shoes, grab a grog, and share a joke with me!"]=1,
},
[123395]={ -- High Priestess Ishanah
  ["Please, sit and make yourself comfortable."]=1,
},
[123500]={ -- Mr. Pleeb
  ["A hunter hunts. An artist... arts.$b$bI am here to capture the ferocity of the hunt through my art.$b$bWe are in strange lands, and few in the known world are familiar with the strange creatures of our hunt.$b$bThrough my art, I prove your success, and the success of the Nesingwarys."]=1,
},
[123667]={ -- Grand Lector Enaara
  ["You are going to love this story, $r. See, here is the thing. As soon as Malygos charged me with protecting the scepter shard, I knew I was in for an eternity of headache and pain.$B$BAll I want to do is study these magic rich shorelines and take in what artifacts might remain from the Sundering. You know, there was once a thriving Highborne civilization here! You don't have to tell me that there is going to be some solid magical items around here, $r. I can smell it!"]=1,
  ["This place is cursed. Let us shed a little Light on these poor souls."]=2,
},
[124107]={ -- Narishi
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[124312]={ -- High Exarch Turalyon
  ["Our fight against the Burning Legion continues."]=1,
  ["It is nice to see new, friendly faces. It has been so long since I have seen another $Gman:woman; from Azeroth!"]=2,
  ["The Army of the Light will not rest until we have destroyed the Burning Legion."]=3,
  ["It is a joy beyond words to look up in the sky and see Azeroth once more. Home, so close that I feel like I can reach up and touch it.$b$bBut within the grasp of the Legion. We must stop them before we can plan on returning."]=4,
  ["I have seen you taking an interest in our warframes, champion. They are truly fearsome instruments of war, capable of dealing and withstanding much damage. They are even capable of flight, although we need to keep a low profile to avoid attracting the attention of the Legion."]=5,
},
[124417]={ -- Cyril White
  ["I cannot begin to thank you enough for what you did for our town, mainlander. Fallhaven is truly in your debt."]=1,
},
[124468]={ -- Randall Redmond
  ["If you aren't moving forward, then you're falling behind. That's what I always say!"]=1,
  ["I see great things on the horizon, for you and me both."]=2,
},
[124637]={ -- Krag'wa the Huge
  ["There are some who do not believe in the legendary Night Elf Mohawks.$B$BI pity the fools."]=1,
  ["Well met, fellow Mohawk $GBrother:Sister;."]=2,
  ["The blood trolls are amassing their forces for another attack upon me and my children.$b$bThis time, it is I who will do the killing!$b$bAre you ready?"]=3,
},
[124774]={ -- Shoak
  ["Urgh... if you're not here to eat me... get out of here, save yourself! Those mawfiends will be here... any minute... to get their 'food'."]=1,
},
[124786]={ -- Thomas Staughton
  ["We're just humble sausage makers! Why would anyone want to hurt us?"]=1,
},
[124933]={ -- Kajosh
  ["This isn't the first time Shoak has gotten himself lost. He better be in really big trouble for all this effort we're doing."]=1,
  ["Shoak got in over his head... again! I can't believe that idiot got captured by the blood trolls."]=2,
  ["Hmph, maybe Shoak will realize that this isn't a place for exploring, it's a place for leaving!"]=3,
},
[125024]={ -- Kajosh
  ["This isn't the first time Shoak has gotten himself lost. He better be in really big trouble for all this effort we're doing."]=1,
  ["Shoak got in over his head... again! I can't believe that idiot got captured by the blood trolls."]=2,
  ["Hmph, maybe Shoak will realize that this isn't a place for exploring, it's a place for leaving!"]=3,
},
[125244]={ -- Newt's Emergency Rocket
  ["Illidan's grasp over my tribe is strong, adventurer. It shall all be over soon, one way or another.$B$BAre you ready, adventurer? My people's future depends on us."]=1,
  ["Newt claims this rocket makes a safe one way vehicle. The flimsy construction suggests otherwise."]=2,
},
[125380]={ -- Lucille Waycrest
  ["What is it, $c?"]=1,
  ["I am sorry you seem to have been put in the middle of this. These really are good people, but times have been trying of late."]=2,
  ["You've arrived at a strange time, mainlander. What is your business here?"]=3,
},
[125394]={ -- Constable Henry Framer
  ["What is your business here, $c?"]=1,
  ["This stalling will not help you. We will find out the truth behind Miss Waycrest soon enough!"]=2,
},
[125457]={ -- Rebecca Hale
  ["In all my years in these hills, I've never seen monsters like those!"]=1,
},
[125466]={ -- Spiritwalker Graysky
  ["Walking in the memories of spirits can sometimes be dangerous, but it is a responsibility we Spiritwalkers must accept."]=1,
},
[125720]={ -- Lightforged Beacon
  ["The Vindicaar awaits your orders, adventurer. Where do we take the fight next?"]=1,
},
[126005]={ -- Orphan Toe
  ["You new? Who you be?$b$bMista Nice not gonna be happy dat you not come see him first. You better come with me."]=1,
},
[126022]={ -- Anchorite Lysara
  ["The esteemed Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen can train you further. He can be found in Theramore treating the wounded at the barracks."]=1,
  ["I can train you in bandaging techniques."]=2,
},
[126080]={ -- Shinga Deathwalker
  ["Dese undead are an affront to Bwonsamdi. We can't rest until we make dis right."]=1,
},
[126210]={ -- Caretaker Allen
  ["I take care of the dead.$b$b<Allen shrugs.>$b$b It's a living."]=1,
},
[126235]={ -- Meerah
  ["It's never safe to travel these dunes alone."]=1,
  ["Dolly and Dot are strong and dependable. They'll get us where we need to go."]=2,
  ["Dolly and Dot have built up quite an appetite. Pulling a cartload of trolls isn't easy work!"]=3,
},
[126289]={ -- Chadwick Paxton
  ["Care to give me a hand? Well, specifically, my leg, my hands are just fine."]=1,
},
[126310]={ -- Evelyn Pare
  ["Ever since these nightmarish creatures started pouring out of the mines, our village has gone to shambles. I hope you have better luck finding the source of this mess than we did."]=1,
  ["We appreciate your help, $c. The situation was looking pretty grim before you arrived."]=2,
  ["We haven't been able to get into the mine since that energy started pouring out of it. That wicker construct you've got control of might be our only hope."]=3,
  ["You're back! Please tell me you put that Matron in the ground."]=4,
  ["The people of Fletcher's Hollow owe you a great debt, $c. You go and tend to Miss Waycrest. We'll clean up the remnants of this coven."]=5,
},
[126330]={ -- Rakle the Wretched
  ["What? What do you want?"]=1,
},
[126332]={ -- Aysa Cloudsinger
  ["I'm more than happy to help the Alliance find new allies. My first steps into Stormwind were quite daunting, but now I consider it a home."]=1,
},
[126334]={ -- Jani
  ["Greetin's, richmon. And what ya be bringin' ta da Shrine of Scavengers today?"]=1,
},
[126346]={ -- Chadwick Paxton
  ["I do believe it's time to show these sethrak the meaning of pain."]=1,
},
[126376]={ -- Ingrid Bellix
  ["'Don't experiment with shadow magic,' they told me.$B$B'It'll doom all of Azeroth if you keep delving into this,' they warned me.$B$B'Give me back my arm, you can't use it as a component!' he screamed, as I pulled his arm off.$B$BOh, sorry, just reminiscing!"]=1,
},
[126389]={ -- Artificer Shela'na
  ["Greetings."]=1,
},
[126390]={ -- Thelbus Wimblenod
  ["This place is full of magic and mystery."]=1,
},
[126696]={ -- Jorak
  ["I will die in these dunes... and I will deserve it."]=1,
  ["Grozztok deserved his fate. I hope you let him suffer."]=2,
},
[126707]={ -- Bwonsamdi
  ["Da rite of binding be old, old mojo. Old as da world itself. With dis mojo, when ya kill something, Bwonsamdi gets their soul. If ya accept dis rite, we got a deal.$b$bYa ready? I be ready."]=1,
},
[126713]={ -- Sur'jan
  ["I need your help... something bad is coming, and I can't kill it alone!"]=1,
  ["I take care of de balance of nature. Quiet, Sur'jan, of course I care about de balance of nature... sort of. $gHe:She; doesn't need to know dat."]=2,
},
[126738]={ -- Wendy
  ["<It is generally good advice to let sleeping dogs lie.>"]=1,
},
[126773]={ -- Locus-Walker
  ["Fascinating. I sensed that change was destined to find Alleria Windrunner, but I did not anticipate that her kin would undergo a similar transformation. The implications are many. These events have given me much to ponder."]=1,
},
[126814]={ -- Ranah
  ["The flora within this gulch are struggling to survive, just like the rest of us."]=1,
},
[127015]={ -- Thaddeus "Gramps" Rifthold
  ["My grandson is always getting into trouble, but this is something else!"]=1,
},
[127112]={ -- Forgemaster Zak'aal
  ["Impressed wit me dual-hamma technique? It be taking a lot of practice to swing da hammas dis way.$b$bWhatcha be needin' anyway, $gbrudda:sista;?"]=1,
},
[127151]={ -- Toraan the Revered
  ["Argus will never belong to the Legion so long as we stand."]=1,
},
[127216]={ -- Zardrax the Empowerer
  ["Join me and be saved from de destruction of Zuldazar!"]=1,
},
[127377]={ -- Pa'ku
  ["There is a new power in my house. Step forward, adventurer of the Horde, so that I might see you for who you are.$b$bA $r who is a $c, and a champion no less.$b$bMy hexlord tells me you desire my boon, but I require something from you first, as I do with all of those who would deal with me.$b$BI require a leap of faith..."]=1,
},
[127391]={ -- Bloodseeker Jo'chunga
  ["Dis will be a whole lot more violent without your disguise."]=1,
  ["I grew up hearing stories of de savage blood trolls. But dis is worse den anything I was told."]=2,
},
[127481]={ -- Lord Kennings
  ["Ah, look, a new face! Hopefully you're a bit more exciting than these folks."]=1,
},
[127691]={ -- Jorak
  ["De chance to leave my past behind and start again does not sound so bad. Dese trolls might not be so crazy after all."]=1,
},
[127743]={ -- Auntie Amanda Hale
  ["I'm so worried about my niece."]=1,
},
[127992]={ -- Akunda the Exalted
  ["Many seek shelter at our temple, but only those who are worthy are allowed within."]=1,
  ["You have lived your life without meaning up until now. What you have done and who you have been must be forgotten. Speak your true name for all to hear!"]=2,
},
[127999]={ -- Wardrummer Saljo
  ["Ma'da! What I be doin' for ya?"]=1,
  ["Ay, Ma'da! I be waitin' here, just like I be told ta do."]=2,
},
[128106]={ -- Zidormi
  ["This land has gone through many hardships in the past but the final story of this grand temple has yet to be revealed. $B$BIf you wish to relive days gone by, I can allow you to visit the past for a short time."]=1,
},
[128150]={ -- Toko
  ["Do not believe the lies of this peddler of pedantic putrescence. He sold me several manuscripts, all of which turned out to be preposterous lies. If he thinks I will leave before I get my refund, he has another thing coming. Trolls don't live 'that' long, after all."]=1,
},
[128169]={ -- Magni Bronzebeard
  ["Are ye ready, adventurer?"]=1,
},
[128334]={ -- Sejiju
  ["De loa welcomes all to his temple."]=1,
  ["You are always welcome here."]=2,
  ["Akunda gives us a chance to start anew."]=3,
  ["Let Akunda lift the burden that weighs heavy on your heart."]=4,
  ["Do you know Akunda?"]=5,
},
[128467]={ -- Elijah Eggleton
  ["We really appreciate you saving our skins, $c. All that curse-battling must have left you famished, though. Care for some sausages?"]=1,
},
[128607]={ -- Zidormi
  ["Silithus has ever been a magnet for ancient, malevolent powers. I could open a timeway to reveal how the Black Empire once sprawled across these sands. Or show you wars waged between mighty armies. So much history. So much pain. But that can wait. I believe you are here for another purpose."]=1,
  ["Silithus was a sickened land before Sargeras struck, but at least there was life within the sands. Is your business in the past complete, champion?"]=2,
},
[128680]={ -- Okri Putterwrench
  ["We are under siege! Come with me to halt the monster's onslaught!"]=1,
  ["The Outriggers require many supplies to stay performing to their maximum capacity! It is my job to track and replenish the stores, as well as repair broken gadgets and gizmos!$b$b...$b$bThey break numerous gadgets and gizmos per day.$b$bThey are not the most gentle of people."]=2,
},
[128925]={ -- Deyon
  ["Queen Azshara seems rather desperate. If nothing else, we are absolutely going to ruin her day.$B$BThat just tickles my belly."]=1,
},
[129014]={ -- Hessir
  ["We must stay strong."]=1,
},
[129098]={ -- Rodrigo
  ["You like my pretty birds?"]=1,
},
[129380]={ -- Wardrummer Sheej
  ["Ma'da! What I be doin' for ya?"]=1,
  ["Ay, Ma'da! I be waitin' here, just like I be told ta do."]=2,
},
[129381]={ -- Wardrummer Gix
  ["Ma'da! What I be doin' for ya?"]=1,
},
[129491]={ -- King Rastakhan
  ["It be hard to say if Zul is a good planner or is just a good prophet. Either way, he be ahead of us at every step.$b$bHe makes to replace me with the bones of our first king, Dazar.$b$bI am one to see trolls rule the world again, but I not be one willing to pay the cost of the dark heresies that Zul has turned to."]=1,
},
[129519]={ -- Vorrik
  ["The Faithless will not take this temple."]=1,
},
[129588]={ -- Vorrik
  ["The Faithless will not take this temple."]=1,
},
[129679]={ -- Shani Ward
  ["Welcome to my Inn, weary traveler. What can I do for you?"]=1,
},
[129740]={ -- Gonk
  ["Our prey is near. The blood of Zul, Yazma, and their heretics will soon be spilled. It shall be a great hunt."]=1,
},
[129741]={ -- Pa'ku
  ["When I get my claws on Yazma and Zul, I am going to drop them on a rock!"]=1,
},
[129771]={ -- Athair
  ["<Athair regards you steadily>"]=1,
  ["<Athair regards you warmly.>"]=2,
},
[129912]={ -- Warchief's Herald
  ["Lok'tar, $c. Behind me is the Warchief's Command board containing our leader's instructions to members of the Horde. It will tell you where your skills will best serve the Horde in battle against its foes."]=1,
},
[129983]={ -- Inquisitor Cleardawn
  ["Let's get to work."]=1,
},
[129992]={ -- Dinah Wellard
  ["Welcome to my inn, weary traveler. What can I do for you?"]=1,
},
[129995]={ -- Emily Mayville
  ["<The woman is weeping. You reach out your hand to console her.>"]=1,
},
[130056]={ -- Patch
  ["You here for the A.M.O.D., yeah? Well, let's get going. The sooner we're outta here, the better. I'll be piloting this thing. You see anything bad, you just shout and I'll shoot. You ready to go?"]=1,
},
[130086]={ -- Davey "Two Eyes"
  ["Welcome to the Ring of Booty, ye Scallywags. Interested in testin' yer gumption verses this rogue's gallery?"]=1,
},
[130216]={ -- Magni Bronzebeard
  ["I can hear the cries o' the world beneath my feet. Azeroth trembles in pain! We must find a way tae ease her sufferin'..."]=1,
},
[130341]={ -- Bladeguard Kaja
  ["Elder Graymane was last seen visiting K3 in the Storm Peaks."]=1,
  ["Jakra'zet deserved his fate."]=2,
  ["I will not rest until Rakera is found."]=3,
  ["We must find de weapon before Jakra'zet can get his hands on it."]=4,
  ["What have dese cultists done to Rakera... She doesn't even remember her own name."]=5,
  ["Jakra'zet must be stopped."]=6,
},
[130342]={ -- Vulpera Slave
  ["All I need is a weapon."]=1,
  ["Just get me a weapon, friend, and I'll take care of the rest."]=2,
  ["Did Nisha send you? Whatever she's got planned, I'm in."]=3,
  ["I'll make the Faithless pay for what they've done to me."]=4,
  ["No mercy for the Faithless. Not after what they've done."]=5,
  ["Free me, $pr, and I'll help you kill the Faithless."]=6,
  ["Break these chains, friend. Vulpera were meant to be free."]=7,
  ["Give me a weapon and I'll give you ten dead Faithless."]=8,
},
[130368]={ -- Samuel D. Colton III
  ["Good day to you, $gsir:madam;. May I interest you in the fine art of lapidary?$b$bOr as its more commonly known, jewelcrafting?"]=1,
},
[130399]={ -- Zooey Inksprocket
  ["Hi there! Would um... you be interested in the history of Kul Tiras? I have several volumes on both the founding of and politics within our great nation. It's really a fascinating subject, I swear.$b$bI'm also excellent at transcribing and could train you in the ways of ink and quill!"]=1,
},
[130419]={ -- Cyril White
  ["<This man matches the description of Cyril White, the mayor of Fallhaven. Unfortunately, he is in no state to help you right now. The mayor, along with the rest of the residents of Fallhaven, appears to be under the effects of some unfamiliar magic. While still breathing, he is unable to move or respond. You'll need to find a way to break this curse if you want his help in contacting House Waycrest.>"]=1,
  ["<The mayor is unresponsive.>"]=2,
},
[130560]={ -- Maras
  ["It is good to rest once in a while. Especially after a profitable venture!"]=1,
},
[130571]={ -- Akunda the Forlorn
  ["We are all Akunda."]=1,
},
[130682]={ -- Rylai Crestfall
  ["Don't worry about the airship, I'll keep an eye out for any... unwanted guests."]=1,
},
[130844]={ -- Princess Talanji
  ["You'll find Elder Starglade outside the gates to Zul'Gurub in Stranglethorn Vale."]=1,
  ["We must be wary. Nobody comes back from Nazmir."]=2,
},
[130901]={ -- Chronicler Grazzul
  ["Welcome to my shop, adventurer. Are you looking to learn de ways of de scribe?$b$bOr perhaps further your knowledge in de arts?"]=1,
},
[130930]={ -- Zaluto
  ["I've fought many battles... but never have I seen anything like dis monster... before..."]=1,
},
[130961]={ -- Randolph Montague
  ["Safe or not, I don't want to lose all of my goods in this war!"]=1,
  ["They just started closing gates suddenly, what's going on?"]=2,
  ["Are we supposed to just abandon everything and evacuate to Orgrimmar?"]=3,
},
[130963]={ -- Naznik Sureshave
  ["Safe or not, I don't want to lose all of my goods in this war!"]=1,
  ["They just started closing gates suddenly, what's going on?"]=2,
  ["Are we supposed to just abandon everything and evacuate to Orgrimmar?"]=3,
},
[130968]={ -- Innkeeper Norman
  ["Safe or not, I don't want to lose all of my goods in this war!"]=1,
  ["They just started closing gates suddenly, what's going on?"]=2,
  ["Are we supposed to just abandon everything and evacuate to Orgrimmar?"]=3,
},
[130972]={ -- Eleanor Rusk
  ["Safe or not, I don't want to lose all of my goods in this war!"]=1,
  ["They just started closing gates suddenly, what's going on?"]=2,
  ["Are we supposed to just abandon everything and evacuate to Orgrimmar?"]=3,
},
[130973]={ -- Felicia Doan
  ["Safe or not, I don't want to lose all of my goods in this war!"]=1,
  ["They just started closing gates suddenly, what's going on?"]=2,
  ["Are we supposed to just abandon everything and evacuate to Orgrimmar?"]=3,
},
[130986]={ -- Vigilant Quoram
  ["I suppse you are wondering what I am doing here. Suffice it to say that I have been given a new prime directive. Apparently standing watch over the Conservatory was not an efficient use of my time. <Sigh> Tenure no longer means what it once did. Do you require something? As you can see, I am quite busy."]=1,
},
[130993]={ -- Captain Fareeya
  ["Always carry with you what it means to be pledged to the Light."]=1,
},
[131014]={ -- Rikal
  ["Sooner or later the tides will change. They always do."]=1,
},
[131070]={ -- King Rastakhan
  ["Rezan has too much of a head start. We will not be able to reach him before he reaches Zul."]=1,
},
[131103]={ -- Captain Joan Cleardawn
  ["What can I do for you, $c?"]=1,
},
[131111]={ -- Lieutenant Sterntide
  ["<Lieutenant Sterntide nods his head slightly in acknowledgement of your approach.>"]=1,
},
[131129]={ -- Teshyambi
  ["<The bloody, tattered remains of the escaped criminal Teshyambi are hardly recognizable. It appears to be the work of nearby raptors.>"]=1,
},
[131135]={ -- Razjuto
  ["I'm not going to Vol'dun, you hear me? I'm going to live my life back in de city!"]=1,
},
[131146]={ -- Princess Talanji
  ["Curse de cowards in Zuldazar for not stopping dis threat sooner! My father was a fool to think dis would just 'go away'. Dis will not end with us just killing Ateena. It is far worse than I ever imagined."]=1,
},
[131208]={ -- Crez
  ["Eh? What do you want? I'm ready to head home, there's nothing interesting happening here anymore."]=1,
},
[131209]={ -- Korkush
  ["Bah, Torga's dead, the blood trolls have overrun this place... the entire pilgrimage is ruined! There's no point in me staying here."]=1,
},
[131210]={ -- Yash
  ["Don't think a lot of tortollans want to hear the details of a dead and gutted loa... what am I going to tell the others now when I get back?"]=1,
},
[131213]={ -- Rokhan
  ["We almost done with dis, adventurer. Just gonna keep goin' a little further."]=1,
},
[131231]={ -- Jin'Tiki
  ["De blood magic is strong in dis place. It does not take a witch doctor to feel it in de air... it's everywhere..."]=1,
},
[131248]={ -- Samuel Williams
  ["This valley's worth saving."]=1,
},
[131253]={ -- Titan Keeper Hezrel
  ["Massive corruption detected within Nazmir. Must enact containment."]=1,
},
[131345]={ -- Alleria Windrunner
  ["The voices never stop. They push, they bully, they plead. They will not relent, not even for a moment. But you are stronger than the voices. You can glean their secrets and draw upon their strength."]=1,
  ["Remember, control demands sacrifice. Power never comes without a price. You risk losing those closest to you in order to save them. This is the bargain we have made. <Alleria looks away.>"]=2,
  ["Studying this rift has value, but we cannot neglect our duty. Azeroth must be defended. Our place is out there, fighting for our world. The power that flows through us is a weapon. And weapons must be wielded."]=3,
},
[131386]={ -- Kronah
  ["Do you smell that? I smell cabbage.$b$b<Kronah leans in and sniffs you.>$b$bNot you, but something around here. $b$bSay, how's your penmanship? Would you like a lesson? I'm a master scribe if you can believe it."]=1,
},
[131397]={ -- Miju
  ["Well you've certainly traveled far to visit me, young one.$b$bI've several novels on the history of crabs, if that's something that piques your interest?"]=1,
},
[131443]={ -- Chief Telemancer Oculeth
  ["Can you believe the Horde has never founded an official bureau of telemancy? I mean, I have no idea how its citizens traveled with any degree of safety. The thought of all those random portals tearing holes in reality without proper anchoring... Well, at any rate, I am pleased to offer a network of stabilized teleportation to the Horde. Move along, please."]=1,
},
[131448]={ -- Warren Ashton
  ["Of course! I'm not certain why you would need my help but for the saviors of my home you shall have it! You might have to wait a little bit, however. I am sure the town is in shambles."]=1,
},
[131472]={ -- Vintner Thesnala
  ["They call this swill wine? No wonder the trolls are abandoning this city."]=1,
  ["Buy me another glass of this wine so I may spit its filth onto the ground a second time."]=2,
  ["If you cannot make fine wine, you shouldn't make any wine at all."]=3,
  ["So far, I trust the Zandalari to build large, obnoxious buildings. I do NOT trust them to make wine."]=4,
  ["Have you tasted the wine here yet? You simply must. The taste is unbelievably horrendous. Bards may write songs about its legendary awful texture. Truly, an achievement in bottom-dwelling, alcohol-spoiling, death-of-the-party products."]=5,
  ["<Vintner Thesnala glares at the bartender while slowly pouring his wine onto the ground next to him.>"]=6,
  ["Forgive me, adventurer. I'd love to chat with you, but I'm afraid I'm about to be sick. Do not try the wine."]=7,
  ["What an interesting and obscure little corner of the world the Horde has led us to. I trust most of my new faction's establishments will be more elegant and clean than this one?"]=8,
},
[131502]={ -- Mixin' Mojo Kojo
  ["Always surprised me dat you Darkspears signed up with de Horde. Always were too weak to stand on your own, I guess. How's Vol'jin?"]=1,
  ["My people founded civilization at de dawn of time, and have carried de rest of you on our backs ever since. Tell me, $pr, what have your people ever done worth remembering? I can't think of a single thing."]=2,
},
[131503]={ -- Scout Jumju
  ["I like de way your Horde operates, adventurer. Strong leaders. United in purpose. Steady supply lines. You recruiting?"]=1,
},
[131506]={ -- Tahku Swampstrider
  ["The elements of Zandalar have endured much. We must stop the dark shaman who abuse their power for selfish ends."]=1,
},
[131776]={ -- Jeron Emberfall
  ["Any alliance get aboard this ship, they'll be incinerated."]=1,
},
[131840]={ -- Shuga Blastcaps
  ["Engineering is very simple once you grasp the basics."]=1,
},
[131878]={ -- Apprentice Telemancer Astrandis
  ["We are very close now, adventurer.$b$bJust say the word and I will begin the scrying.$b$bOh, I failed to mention. Our adversaries have set up camp just across the way, along the beach. I would keep a close watch on your surroundings in case we are ambushed.$b$bI trust you will defend me if we are accosted!"]=1,
},
[132005]={ -- Grayson Bell
  ["How may I help?"]=1,
},
[132173]={ -- Brother Pike
  ["We must stop this madness before it is too late."]=1,
},
[132215]={ -- Lightforged Vindicator
  ["Light be with you."]=1,
},
[132224]={ -- Durael
  ["I can assist you, $c, with any repairs your equipment may need."]=1,
},
[132228]={ -- Elric Whalgrene
  ["Welcome to my shop, $c! Could I interest you in a refreshing draught or is there something else that's piqued your interest?$b$bPotions are my specialty, but I also dabble in transmutation from time to time."]=1,
  ["Ah, a fellow alchemist! Perhaps I can interest you in some of my latest recipes.$b$bPotions are my specialty, but I also dabble in transmutation from time to time."]=2,
},
[132334]={ -- Grand Artificer Romuul
  ["The Vindicaar awaits its next voyage. As do I."]=1,
},
[132358]={ -- Enstraa
  ["Light take this table! I may never be able to use this workshop again.$B$BThe taint of those beast hides from Argus lingers, no matter how many times I scrub the surface."]=1,
},
[132382]={ -- Magister Umbric
  ["With Alleria's teaching, we can avoid the fate suffered by those on Eredath."]=1,
  ["Although broken and scattered, this rift holds many secrets. It will teach us much about the nature of the shadows."]=2,
  ["Locus-Walker is an intriguing fellow. Alleria seems to trust him... to a point. I think we can learn much from him, so long as we remain wary of his true intentions."]=3,
},
[132385]={ -- Locus Researcher
  ["Pristine void energy is soaked into this space... Magnificent."]=1,
},
[132386]={ -- Rift Warden
  ["The Voidstorm is growing. It might even consume the big island entirely."]=1,
  ["Unchecked void energies ravage the other islands. It remains too dangerous to navigate."]=2,
  ["The last people who ventured beyond this space were consumed by the shadows."]=3,
  ["The void energy released when the ethereals attacked left the other islands unstable. No one is allowed beyond this point."]=4,
},
[132616]={ -- Silvermoon Scholar
  ["We need no longer fear exile for the pursuit of knowledge."]=1,
  ["A path long denied to us is open at last."]=2,
},
[132632]={ -- Instructor Duskwalker
  ["Remain in control of your thoughts. The Void cannot sway that which is immutable."]=1,
},
[132643]={ -- Fors Aitken
  ["I don't see what all the fuss is about."]=1,
},
[132648]={ -- Veiled Riftblade
  ["Be wary of unstable void rifts and their spawn. This place is not entirely safe."]=1,
},
[132657]={ -- Atynar
  ["I offer what shelter I can in our shattered lands."]=1,
},
[132659]={ -- Veiled Riftblade
  ["Be wary of unstable void rifts and their spawn. This place is not entirely safe."]=1,
},
[132671]={ -- High Elf Wayfarer
  ["We need no longer fear exile for the pursuit of knowledge."]=1,
  ["A path long denied to us is open at last."]=2,
},
[132994]={ -- Lord Arthur Waycrest
  ["Oh, hello there. I'm afraid we haven't met, but I thank you for being here for my dear Lucy. How can I help you?"]=1,
},
[133104]={ -- Grove Cultivator Kados
  ["Incredible! The surrounding area alone houses at least forty species of plants I am unfamiliar with."]=1,
},
[133108]={ -- Hern Cragfeather
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[133114]={ -- Uros Hardhoof
  ["Come to have your equipment repaired?$B$BOr would you like some quality tools of your own?"]=1,
},
[133127]={ -- Thaluriel
  ["This workshop is a bit 'rustic' for my tastes."]=1,
  ["Non-magical devices are for mana-starved whelps, they said. Non-magical devices serve no purpose, they said. $B$BOrgrimmar practically runs on such creations!$B$BTime for me to show those palanquin-addled wretches back home the perfection of machinery!"]=2,
},
[133185]={ -- Wildswalker Nightborne
  ["This drink is green! Why is it green?"]=1,
},
[133239]={ -- Leyweaver Aurielle
  ["How may I help you?"]=1,
},
[133261]={ -- Feng Su
  ["I can teach the art of cooking. Are you looking to learn?"]=1,
},
[133322]={ -- Elya
  ["What can I do for you?"]=1,
},
[133326]={ -- Artificer Farud
  ["We have learned much from our fight against the Legion. In truth, these warframes are the culmination of many years of research.$B$BIf you wish, I can train you to craft similar devices."]=1,
},
[133332]={ -- Statiks Quikfuse
  ["These machines are fantastic! How could they operate with no anomalies or chance of failure? Oh, excuse me. Did you need something?"]=1,
},
[133338]={ -- Rokhan
  ["We got ta win dis war, mon. Da Zandalari be dependin' on us."]=1,
},
[133363]={ -- Aevedos
  ["I will admit, it took some time to grow accustomed to our transformation. At first, my usual dexterity felt... impeded.$B$BHowever, I can guarantee the techniques themselves have in no way been affected."]=1,
},
[133369]={ -- Druben Stoutarm
  ["Aye, I have a moment. What do ye want?"]=1,
},
[133392]={ -- Avatar of Sethraliss
  ["<You see the Avatar of Sethraliss before you. Though still alive, she is weak from the trolls' meddling.>"]=1,
  ["The Avatar of Sethraliss is rejuvenated thanks to the efforts of you and your allies."]=2,
},
[133394]={ -- Elestrae Dawnshard
  ["Do you need something magically enhanced, or have you come to learn?"]=1,
},
[133396]={ -- Jandros Terres
  ["I've spent enough time with clumsy fingers here that I've picked up a thing or two about treating injuries. Perhaps I can offer you some training?"]=1,
},
[133407]={ -- Ambassador Blackguard
  ["I really hated this tophat at first. What does a guy have to do for a good tricorne? But I must say... this fits real nicely on my skull."]=1,
  ["Psst... Yeah, you, $r. Hey, can you put in a bad word for me with the Warchief? I need to get fired. Being a jerk to everyone isn't working!"]=2,
  ["What do I have to do to get myself out of this job? I try to leave, some orc picks me up and plops me right back down here."]=3,
  ["Do you have any idea how much it hurts to try to crack a smile? This is ridiculous!"]=4,
  ["I used to be a famous pirate! They dig me up, hand me this tophat, then tell me I have to greet all of you newcomers with a smile on my face..."]=5,
},
[133408]={ -- Ashlee Umberleaf
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[133411]={ -- Dalia Skyblossom
  ["I can teach the art of cooking. Are you looking to learn?"]=1,
},
[133489]={ -- Ormhun Stonehammer
  ["Ho there, traveler. Are ye lost, or just lookin' for a bit o' blacksmith knowledge?$b$bI'm a bit rusty, but I still remember a thing or two."]=1,
},
[133536]={ -- Grix "Ironfists" Barlow
  ["Impressed with my technique? Heh, I would be too if I were you.$b$bSay, what do ya need? Some armor? Some weapons? A little training?"]=1,
},
[133553]={ -- Civil Technician Alena
  ["Can't you see I'm a little busy? This place is in shambles. I don't have the workforce nor the materials to get this under control."]=1,
},
[133554]={ -- Ordnance Handler Prim
  ["Grab a crate, we got to get this stuff out of here while we still have a chance."]=1,
},
[133653]={ -- Hexlord Raal
  ["Yazma and Zul never approached me about their little coup. I suspect dey knew deep down I am too much of a Zandalari for their little rebellion.$b$bAlso, I would have killed dem on de spot, so good chance dat might have been why."]=1,
},
[133840]={ -- Jani
  ["Greetin's, richmon. Have you brought something ugly and scaly to da Shrine of Scavengers?"]=1,
},
[133845]={ -- Jani
  ["Greetin's, richmon. Have you brought something ancient and tarnished to da Shrine of Scavengers?"]=1,
},
[133861]={ -- Michaela Reed
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[133974]={ -- Sister Adrianna
  ["It is rude to interrupt, outsider."]=1,
},
[133976]={ -- Brother Darrel
  ["<Darrel does not seem to acknowledge your presence.>"]=1,
},
[134008]={ -- Scroll of Flight
  ["This is my favorite part. You will like it, it tingles."]=1,
},
[134011]={ -- Scroll of Flight
  ["Slow and steady may win down here, but the skies, they're another matter."]=1,
},
[134033]={ -- Sister Celicia
  ["You're no student. You'd best have a good reason for interrupting my lesson."]=1,
},
[134067]={ -- Keeper Vorrik
  ["Lawful, just, faithful, firm - these are the words that echo the name of Vorrik. His service to Sethraliss is profound and unwavering. His wisdom and clarity of vision are without question. There is nothing that will distract Vorrik from his duty as Keeper. With his honored brothers at his back, he will maintain his eyes on the horizon. No enemy will ever get near enough to awaken our sleeping giant."]=1,
},
[134089]={ -- Keeper Korthek
  ["Korthek the Brave! Tales of strength and strategic agility are passed through camps of young warriors, and they all speak his name. When the battle is bleakest, tales of Korthek ignite the flames of battle. He is able to turn the tide single-handedly! He fights for his people with passion and ferocity! He is a beloved brother. For him, none will compare to the sethrak. We are the best. We are the wise. We are the mighty. With him at our back, no outsiders shall harm our powerful nation!"]=1,
},
[134090]={ -- Keeper Sulthis
  ["Sulthis is the most closely connected to Sethraliss. The love he bears for his loa, and for the desert, inspired him to adopt the cobra as his spirit guide. He is often regarded as the first Keeper. While his power was immense, he knew it wouldn't be enough to seal the tomb alone. He sought out others to share the responsibility. Vorrik and Korthek agreed, and thus the Keepers were formed. Sethrak travel from far, and near, to place tokens of their affection at the feet of the statues of the Keepers. These tokens embody all that Sulthis represents. The C'Thraxxi must never have another chance to destroy everything we hold dear."]=1,
},
[134095]={ -- Farmer Deal
  ["They wreck my farm and have the nerve to capture me. They're not going to walk away from this!"]=1,
  ["They failed to kill me. That was their first mistake."]=2,
  ["As soon as I get my hands on a weapon..."]=3,
},
[134120]={ -- High Overlord Saurfang
  ["You think you are here to take me back to Orgrimmar. Back to the warchief. You are mistaken."]=1,
},
[134134]={ -- Tulu
  ["We cannot survive without help from the loa."]=1,
},
[134166]={ -- Flynn Fairwind
  ["Ready to catch a ride on that ship and see where it's going?"]=1,
},
[134297]={ -- Chag
  ["Hey, you! You're a $c, right? Maybe you can help me, I'm looking for an interesting story. I just picked up this scroll from a friend, supposed to summon something strong. You up for fighting it? I want to see this thing in action."]=1,
},
[134345]={ -- Collector Kojo
  ["How may I help you?"]=1,
},
[134451]={ -- Selina Duskraven
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[134475]={ -- Akunda
  ["See to your city, hero. I will hold the Northern road from these vile sethrak."]=1,
},
[134554]={ -- Lady Sylvanas Windrunner
  ["You would ask a question of me, adventurer?"]=1,
},
[134620]={ -- Warguard Rakera
  ["Where are de defenses? Has Zuldazar grown so weak from Zul's betrayal it cannot defend itself? I had Meerah rush us to get here in time to warn de royal guards, but dere are so few left. It will fall to us to defend what remains."]=1,
},
[134642]={ -- Brother Pike
  ["I can feel it strongly here. Something dark stirs."]=1,
},
[134696]={ -- Marla Featherfoot
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[134720]={ -- Leo Shealds
  ["The Irontide is taking everyone prisoner. They're trying to stop us from finding the treasure first!"]=1,
  ["I'm the only one around here that knows math! So I'm watching the expenses, and making sure everyone's hands stay in the right pockets."]=2,
  ["This is a lot more math than I ever expected. Check back later for your share of the treasure."]=3,
},
[134749]={ -- Gregory Mussler
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[134758]={ -- Patch
  ["Yo! We got some nasty blood trolls makin' their way to Zuldazar. Lucky for us, we got a little upgrade to the A.M.O.D! Feast your eyes on the A.F.M.O.D, this baby can FLY! Death from above! Course, we had to lose the shield, this thing wouldn't fly with it. Want to take it out on a test drive? We can blast that army to bits!"]=1,
},
[134803]={ -- Warguard Rakera
  ["What has Jakra'zet done..."]=1,
  ["We will expose Jakra'zet for de traitor he is."]=2,
},
[134808]={ -- Bladeguard Kaja
  ["Elder Graymane was last seen visiting K3 in the Storm Peaks."]=1,
  ["Jakra'zet deserved his fate."]=2,
  ["I will not rest until Rakera is found."]=3,
  ["We must find de weapon before Jakra'zet can get his hands on it."]=4,
  ["What have dese cultists done to Rakera... She doesn't even remember her own name."]=5,
  ["Jakra'zet must be stopped."]=6,
},
[134831]={ -- Bladeguard Kaja
  ["I never thought I would see the streets of Zuldazar overrun by any enemy..."]=1,
},
[134834]={ -- Meerah
  ["You wouldn't believe the route we had to take to get here before the sethrak. If your friends didn't have my help they never would have made it over those mountains in time. Oh, and we brought Akunda and Kimbul. Akunda is covering our backs and I don't know where Kimbul went but he said something about 'rending the enemy' or something. All I know is that we saw a LOT of sethrak coming this way. A LOT!"]=1,
},
[134844]={ -- Wyna Breezehorn
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[134850]={ -- Chulani Cloudbreath
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[134853]={ -- Dark Ranger Allanah
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[134866]={ -- Viviana Swailes
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[134976]={ -- Krag'wa the Huge
  ["Again, the blood trolls threaten my children!$B$BCome small one, together we shall remind them what happens when they anger Krag'wa!"]=1,
},
[135033]={ -- Maokka
  ["I was standing here for a long time. Then I found this interesting box in the mud."]=1,
},
[135064]={ -- Will Melborne
  ["Looking for a ferry?"]=1,
},
[135067]={ -- Moxie Lockspinner
  ["We got problems adventurer. The Tortollan found a box, and we want it!"]=1,
},
[135075]={ -- Proudmoore Guard
  ["Please remain calm. Everything is under control."]=1,
},
[135090]={ -- Nisha
  ["The vulpera are ready. The Faithless will fear us."]=1,
},
[135099]={ -- Kiro
  ["The Faithless treat their beasts cruelly. It isn't difficult to turn them against their masters."]=1,
},
[135153]={ -- Wesley Rockhold
  ["Welcome to my inn, weary traveler. What can I do for you?"]=1,
},
[135154]={ -- Kiro
  ["It's good to see the sands haven't swallowed you yet."]=1,
},
[135172]={ -- Vorrik
  ["So much has changed since the days when Korthek and I would teach the wisdom of Sethraliss together in this place... Now the holy sites lie in ruins and Sethraliss is, at best, forgotten. More often, reviled. Korthek... What have you done to our people, old friend?"]=1,
},
[135180]={ -- Nerin Solvis
  ["Money to be made. New lands to exploit... $B$BWhat a time to be alive!"]=1,
},
[135200]={ -- Alexander Treadward
  ["Little does Lucille know that I would visit her whenever she came to Whitegrove. Her despair over what happened in this place must prevent her from seeing my spirit. I can only hope that some part of her knows I am here."]=1,
},
[135205]={ -- Nathanos Blightcaller
  ["I need not stress the importance of this mission, adventurer. The Dark Lady is depending on us to enact her will."]=1,
},
[135355]={ -- Meerah
  ["adventurer! I knew you'd come! I told them, 'adventurer cares about the vulpera and won't abandon us.' I'm here to help too! Kiro and Nisha are rescuing vulpera slaves, and I'm organizing caravans to carry them out of here. It's kind of scary, being so close to the sethrak. But I know it's the right thing to do. Nisha said so. Oh, welcome to our little hideout, by the way."]=1,
},
[135387]={ -- Scroll of Flight
  ["Slow and steady may win down here, but the skies, they're another matter."]=1,
},
[135440]={ -- Princess Talanji
  ["My father once ruled with an iron fist, and none would dare break his laws. But he was also just, helping those in need, so his subjects loved him for it.$b$bNow? Now de iron fist is forgotten. Dose he trusts pour poison in his ear as dey plot and scheme.$b$bI do not know what dey are planning, but I know our people cannot afford to wait and see."]=1,
  ["It sounds like not all of de Zanchuli Council are happy you are here. Dis is going to be interesting."]=2,
},
[135446]={ -- Vindicator Jaelaana
  ["How may I help you?"]=1,
},
[135501]={ -- Zarvik Blastwix
  ["The warchief wants to scare off the wisps, eh? I have just the thing. You wanna fly this thing? Or do you wanna drop the bombs?"]=1,
},
[135625]={ -- Vorrik
  ["We do not have time to waste. Your friends are already inside Atul'Aman..."]=1,
},
[135681]={ -- Grand Admiral Jes-Tereth
  ["This ship is yours to command, adventurer. I have the crew prepared for any eventuality."]=1,
},
[135690]={ -- Dread-Admiral Tattersail
  ["The Banshee's Wail is one of the Dark Lady's finest ships. She may not be much to look at, but she's tough and scrappy. Her captain isn't half bad, either."]=1,
},
[135793]={ -- Collector Kojo
  ["How may I help you?"]=1,
},
[135804]={ -- Hoarder Jena
  ["How may I help you?"]=1,
},
[135808]={ -- Provisioner Fray
  ["How may I help you?"]=1,
},
[135815]={ -- Quartermaster Alcorn
  ["How may I help you?"]=1,
},
[135890]={ -- King Rastakhan
  ["Zul's treachery cuts deeper than I realized. With his rebellion, he practically depleted my army. Those still loyal to me are dying on the battlefield behind me to these invading, endless swarms of blood trolls. I should have listened to Talanji."]=1,
},
[135988]={ -- Tan Lotuswind
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[136041]={ -- Emily Fairweather
  ["Welcome to Fairweather's Fine Enchantments! If you have any questions about anything mystical, please ask!"]=1,
},
[136052]={ -- "Cap'n" Byron Mehlsack
  ["Ahoy there, $g lad : lass;!$b$bWelcome to Byron & Bros. Boralan B.B.Q! Finest smoked meats this side of Ironforge!$b$bWhat can I get for ya?"]=1,
},
[136059]={ -- Layla Evenkeel
  ["Ahoy!$b$bCurious about the engineering trade?"]=1,
},
[136063]={ -- Cassandra Brennor
  ["Welcome to Kul Tiran Skins and Leathers!$b$bUgh... we really need a better name.$b$bI'm Cass, and I offer lessons in leatherworking. My partner, Cami, is a bit gruff, but you'll find no better skinner.$b$bThat said, what are you looking for?"]=1,
},
[136071]={ -- Daniel Brineweaver
  ["Well hello there! Don't you look just... aweful.$b$bDon't worry, my little crumpet. Danny has just the thing you need!"]=1,
},
[136079]={ -- Falloughue the Hospitable
  ["Fill yer tankard and pull up a chair. We've stories to tell and kegs to empty."]=1,
},
[136082]={ -- Saranklei
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[136091]={ -- Myra Cabot
  ["Mmyeah? Is there something I can help you with?"]=1,
},
[136096]={ -- Declan Senal
  ["Feel free to take a look around, but please don't touch anything.$b$bThese plants are very delicate."]=1,
},
[136102]={ -- Alan Goyle
  ["Buh! Ya startled me!$b$bSo... you here to learn to fish? 'Cause I don't really know anythin' else."]=1,
},
[136106]={ -- Jane Hudson
  ["Welcome to my shop.$b$bPlease feel free to took around. If you have any questions, I'm sure I can assist you."]=1,
},
[136148]={ -- Shadow Hunter Narez
  ["adventurer, good to be seein' ya. I be stayin' here for now ta be near Krag'wa. Me parents be tellin' me all kinds of stories about da frog loa. I be honored ta guard him from da blood trolls."]=1,
},
[136310]={ -- First Mate Jamboya
