},
[136355]={ -- Trader Haw'li
  ["I swear, if I survive dis, I promise not to swindle my customers for at least two... maybe three weeks."]=1,
},
[136356]={ -- Bri'tani
  ["Blood cultists, sethrak, mogu, and even our own Zul? I miss de simple days when we were just trying to take over de world."]=1,
},
[136358]={ -- No'ci the Scribe
  ["Blood cultists, sethrak, mogu, and even our own Zul? I miss de simple days when we were just trying to take over de world."]=1,
