[138256]={ -- Buzz Crankchug
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[138265]={ -- Skrash
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[138287]={ -- Lilian Voss
  ["In life, I was raised to hate the undead. Trained to destroy them. When I became Forsaken, I hated myself most of all. But now I see it is the Alliance that fosters this malice. The human kingdoms shun their former brothers and sisters because we remind them what's lurking beneath the facade of flesh. It's time to end their cycle of hatred. The Alliance deserves to fall."]=1,
},
[138476]={ -- Collector Kojo
  ["Welcome adventurer. Think you're sharp enough to play my matching game?"]=1,
},
[138478]={ -- Scrollsage Nola
  ["Are you ready to defend the young turtles as they make their way to sea?"]=1,
},
[138480]={ -- Toki
  ["See if you can guide Loh to safety while passing through all of the kelp along the way."]=1,
},
[138677]={ -- Rexxar
  ["It seems we have another war to fight. There is little time for chatter."]=1,
},
[138688]={ -- Centurion Kaga Warmstone
  ["My men will be avenged. I swear it."]=1,
},
[138704]={ -- Mission Command Table
  ["This table lists all of your currently available missions."]=1,
},
[138706]={ -- Mission Command Table
  ["This table lists all of your currently available missions."]=1,
},
[138708]={ -- Garona Halforcen
  ["Additional Horde forces can be requisitioned immediately. Just say the word."]=1,
  ["When fanatics doubt your loyalty, you are not long for this world. I was conscripted into this campaign. Perhaps you were, too. We must do whatever is needed--say whatever we must--to survive it. But know this. There is only one war that matters. And it is not this one."]=2,
  ["Seems I have been conscripted into service once again, to carry out yet another master's schemes. I will do what I must--say what I must--to live for another day. But sooner or later this war will end. We must be ready for what follows."]=3,
},
[138749]={ -- Rhan'ka
  ["Sandfury thugs attacked de inn! I barely escaped with dis banana... it seemed important at de time."]=1,
},
[138761]={ -- Lucille Waycrest
  ["There is a hidden path nearby we can use to return to the manor's foyer."]=1,
},
[138867]={ -- Rexxar
  ["It seems we have another war to fight. There is little time for chatter."]=1,
},
[138869]={ -- Centurion Kaga Warmstone
  ["My men will be avenged. I swear it."]=1,
},
[138876]={ -- Rexxar
  ["Our hunt in this land is just beginning."]=1,
},
[138886]={ -- Centurion Kaga Warmstone
  ["Walk with the Earthmother, adventurer."]=1,
},
[138973]={ -- Captain Rez'okun
  ["I'll keep de sails up so we can make a quick getaway. Go get dat Azerite!"]=1,
},
[139062]={ -- Lilian Voss
  ["We need to show the Kul Tirans what it means to make an enemy of the Horde."]=1,
},
[139069]={ -- First Mate Redmond
  ["If you aren't moving forward, then you're falling behind. That's what I always say!"]=1,
  ["I see great things on the horizon, for you and me both."]=2,
},
[139093]={ -- Isabella
  ["Well met, $c. My advice to you is this: As you travel the world, be wary of magic for it will burn the untrained."]=1,
},
[139098]={ -- Thomas Zelling
  ["I refuse to let my life end here from some... disease. I must live on to keep my family safe."]=1,
  ["<cough> The Horde. Here I thought I would die in peace. Well? What are you waiting for?"]=2,
},
[139101]={ -- Lilian Voss
  ["In life, I was raised to hate the undead. Trained to destroy them. When I became Forsaken, I hated myself most of all. But now I see it is the Alliance that fosters this malice. The human kingdoms shun their former brothers and sisters because we remind them what's lurking beneath the facade of flesh. It's time to end their cycle of hatred. The Alliance deserves to fall."]=1,
