  ["Those who challenge Warchief Hellscream will pay with their lives!"]=7,
},
[139504]={ -- Mag'har Warder
  ["Overlord Geya'rah is the warchief's right hand. There is no braver orc on Draenor. Nor on your world, outsider!"]=1,
  ["If you earn the overlord's trust, you will earn mine."]=2,
  ["Draenor will be free!"]=3,
  ["We bested the primals. We will bring down any foe."]=4,
  ["If I catch any of those Lightbound traitors, I will slit their throats!"]=5,
  ["You walk upon OUR world, outsider. Should you bring corruption here, your life will be forfeit."]=6,
  ["Those who challenge Warchief Hellscream will pay with their lives!"]=7,
},
[139519]={ -- Swellthrasher
  ["You need a boat? A message sent? PERHAPS SOME AID IN STABBING?"]=1,
},
[139522]={ -- Scouting Map
  ["Where should we focus our efforts?"]=1,
},
[139524]={ -- Erul Dawnbrook
  ["Oh, did you require something from me?"]=1,
},
[139561]={ -- Mukkral Blackvein
  ["The Kul Tirans will know fear!"]=1,
},
[139567]={ -- Joon Cloudgazer
  ["adventurer! What can I do for you?"]=1,
},
[139620]={ -- Desha Stormwallow
  ["Aye, how can I aid ya?"]=1,
},
[139633]={ -- King Rastakhan
  ["I feel like someone has ripped de very soul from my body."]=1,
},
[139912]={ -- Ranger Wons
  ["I've seen some strange things in these woods but nothing like this."]=1,
},
[139926]={ -- Thornspeaker Birchgrove
  ["Ancient threats are stirring in these lands. Be wary."]=1,
},
[139964]={ -- Thomas Zelling
  ["I refuse to let my life end here from some... disease. I must live on to keep my family safe."]=1,
  ["<cough> The Horde. Here I thought I would die in peace. Well? What are you waiting for?"]=2,
},
[139991]={ -- Lilian Voss
  ["Zelling is speaking with his family. Stay back, we'll see if I need to intervene."]=1,
},
[140048]={ -- Arthur Tradewind
  ["I bet between the two of us we could take these monsters out!"]=1,
  ["Glad you could make it, adventurer! Let me know when you are ready and I can take you up to Ulfar."]=2,
},
[140176]={ -- Nathanos Blightcaller
  ["The Dark Lady has an important job for you, $c. I hope that you are ready..."]=1,
},
[140258]={ -- Shandris Feathermoon
  ["<Shandris's keen eyes scan the horizon. She nods at you in acknowledgement.>"]=1,
},
[140320]={ -- Rescued Tortollan
  ["I thought I was done for back there. You have my thanks, $r. They still call your kind a $r, right?"]=1,
},
[140461]={ -- Dilbert McClint
  ["You might walk through this nearby thicket and think that spiders wouldn't like the open air and the breeze, but in that respect, spiders are just like you and me. That, and the spider webs make a pretty dead giveaway of an arachnoid presence."]=1,
},
[140484]={ -- Captain Amalia Stone
  ["I'm coming a bit more to my senses, adventurer. With Lilian's help, perhaps I can come to accept this new fate. Though I must say... the further I can get from Kul Tiras... the better."]=1,
},
[140485]={ -- Nathanos Blightcaller
  ["Katherine will stop at nothing to reclaim her son's body. We will use her emotions to our advantage, to gain the upper hand over her fleet."]=1,
  ["The Honorguard will clean up the rest of this mess. Are you quite ready?"]=2,
},
[140486]={ -- Lilian Voss
  ["We need to show the Kul Tirans what it means to make an enemy of the Horde."]=1,
},
[140487]={ -- Thomas Zelling
  ["Lilian keeps telling me that the Horde is family. Now that my real family won't accept me... Honestly, I could use the support. But in turn, Lilian has promised that my family shall be kept safe. And if I can secure that by giving my aid to the Horde? Then that's what I shall do."]=1,
  ["Let's make this quick. In and out, before we're discovered."]=2,
  ["Are you ready to go?"]=3,
},
[140498]={ -- Myara Sunsong
  ["Greetings. You seek instruction in the art of war?"]=1,
},
[140519]={ -- Shandris Feathermoon
  ["Stay hidden. Only one of us should go in. I'll stay here to make sure no one finds out what we're doing. I have a flask of invisibility that you can use to sneak in there. It should render you completely unseen... for a small amount of time. Drink from the flask, then sneak in to the ruins. Find out what the Horde are planning, then get out."]=1,
},
[140533]={ -- Munovuth Boldcleaver
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[140578]={ -- John J. Keeshan
  ["Looks like we're the bait for a group of hungry bloodsucking elves. Ready for whatever happens next?"]=1,
},
[140656]={ -- Rokhan
  ["We got ta win dis war, mon. Da Zandalari be dependin' on us."]=1,
},
[140719]={ -- Elder Brolg
  ["You shall not take our home!"]=1,
  ["Begone! You are not welcome in our den!"]=2,
},
[140720]={ -- Gren Tornfur
  ["You shall not take our home!"]=1,
  ["Begone! You are not welcome in our den!"]=2,
},
[140721]={ -- Elder Brownpaw
  ["You shall not take our home!"]=1,
  ["Begone! You are not welcome in our den!"]=2,
},
[140939]={ -- Drasha Windspear
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[140947]={ -- Garn Blackwolf
  ["Mok'rah, adventurer! The outpost is yours to command."]=1,
},
[140960]={ -- Yuwija
  ["Rest for de weary, food for de hungry."]=1,
},
[141010]={ -- Hobart Grapplehammer
  ["If you need a ride out to those ships, I'm your guy!"]=1,
},
[141063]={ -- Mag'har Outrider
  ["Overlord Geya'rah is the warchief's right hand. There is no braver orc on Draenor. Nor on your world, outsider!"]=1,
  ["If you earn the overlord's trust, you will earn mine."]=2,
  ["Draenor will be free!"]=3,
  ["We bested the primals. We will bring down any foe."]=4,
  ["If I catch any of those Lightbound traitors, I will slit their throats!"]=5,
  ["You walk upon OUR world, outsider. Should you bring corruption here, your life will be forfeit."]=6,
  ["Those who challenge Warchief Hellscream will pay with their lives!"]=7,
},
[141086]={ -- Untainted Spirit Guide
  ["The spirits, they can guide you through here."]=1,
},
[141159]={ -- Ulfar
  ["It has been a long time since a mainlander step foot in my grove. Do you wish to learn from the Thornspeakers, or have you come to lay claim to this land, as your kind are so fond of doing?"]=1,
  ["I recognize the power you have brought to me. I felt it in my bark and in my bones before you crested the rise. This is old magic. It has been twisted, warped. We must act quickly if we are to remain untouched by it."]=2,
},
[141238]={ -- Rovash the One Eyed
  ["Need repairs? De tools are old, but I still get some use out of dem."]=1,
},
[141488]={ -- Zidormi
  ["Tirisfal... a place of beauty and darkness. A land fraught with regret... and graves. Your kind has fought to claim it time and time again. Do you wish to see it as it was prior to the latest war?"]=1,
},
[141489]={ -- Zidormi
  ["From these shores, you may gaze upon Teldrassil. Once a cradle of life, it is now a ruin of ash and fire. Even the World Trees must bow to the cycle of life. Everything born will die. No one understands this better than the Bronze Dragonflight. Would you like to see the tree as it once was?"]=1,
},
[141584]={ -- Zurvan
  ["You already hold the most seals that you can. Use the seals you have before bothering me for more."]=1,
  ["I offer various ways to purchase a Seal of Wartorn Fate. What do you prefer to give up for the opportunity to twist fate?"]=2,
  ["You already purchased your seals for the week. Stop wasting my time. I should have more available next week."]=3,
  ["Do you ever wish to retry your fate? Perhaps, for a special armor piece, a weapon or a trinket of great power? For a price, I will provide you a seal that twists fate and grants an extra result at a past chance. Once you possess a seal, it will activate after defeating powerful foes in difficult dungeons and raids. Soon, I will be able to provide Seals of Wartorn Fate for Gold, War Resources or Marks of Honor. I have none to offer to you at this time."]=4,
},
[141622]={ -- Lorraine Hood
  ["The wagon flipped over. It was terrifying! I was headed back to town to get help, but got scared."]=1,
},
[141645]={ -- Hobart Grapplehammer
  ["Oh, hey $c. What's shakin'?"]=1,
  ["Aha! Our diver's here! Your timing's perfect. I just finished patching up the last hole in the air hose. I got a few diver's safety rules for you before we go. You payin' attention?"]=2,
  ["You're back. Ready to go down again?"]=3,
},
[141649]={ -- Zidormi
  ["This land is rich with history. I really must show you what it was like when the Empire of Arathor stood at its zenith. Hmm. But I suppose that will have to wait. Is your business in the past complete, champion?"]=1,
  ["War rages in these lands, repeating patterns set down long ago. The ways of time are ever cyclical. Apologies. I sometimes forget that your people are so... linear. How may I help you?"]=2,
},
[141651]={ -- Dread-Admiral Tattersail
  ["The Banshee's Wail is one of the Dark Lady's finest ships. She may not be much to look at, but she's tough and scrappy. Her captain isn't half bad, either."]=1,
},
[141654]={ -- Lilian Voss
  ["We need to show the Kul Tirans what it means to make an enemy of the Horde."]=1,
},
[141670]={ -- Drowned Sailor
  ["|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\ACHIEVEMENT_PVP_A_02.BLP:64|t Corporal Jameson Keefe"]=1,
},
[141672]={ -- Drowned Sailor
  ["|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\ACHIEVEMENT_PVP_A_08.BLP:64|t Knight-Captain Ellis R. Ladimore Captain of the Fathomdasher"]=1,
},
[141673]={ -- Drowned Sailor
  ["|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\ACHIEVEMENT_PVP_A_10.BLP:64|t Lieutenant Commander Andrew Avrinn Captain of the Songswallow"]=1,
},
[141674]={ -- Drowned Sailor
  ["|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\ACHIEVEMENT_PVP_A_11.BLP:64|t Commander Priscilla Hawes Captain of the Gale's Reprieve"]=1,
},
[141686]={ -- Drowned Sailor
  ["|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\ACHIEVEMENT_PVP_A_12.BLP:64|t Marshal M. Valentine Captain of the Pride of Tiragarde Marshal of the Third Kul Tiran Fleet"]=1,
},
[141687]={ -- Drowned Sailor
  ["|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_helm_crown_C_01_gold.blp:64|t Derek Proudmoore Crown Prince of Kul Tiras"]=1,
},
[141795]={ -- Drowned Sailor
  ["|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\ACHIEVEMENT_PVP_A_09.BLP:64|t Knight-Champion Dirk Longfellow Captain of the Drustvaria"]=1,
},
[141822]={ -- Drowned Sailor
  ["|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\ACHIEVEMENT_PVP_A_07.BLP:64|t Knight-Lieutenant Samuel Robertson"]=1,
},
[141823]={ -- Drowned Sailor
  ["|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\ACHIEVEMENT_PVP_A_03.BLP:64|t Sergeant Evan Morris"]=1,
},
[141900]={ -- Niana Moontear
  ["Unfortunately, the ship is currently under repairs. Its unwavering service record may have been tarnished; however, I am here to provide you with other means to reach your destination. A simple portal may not match the thrill of having the wind flow through your hair on the high seas, but you will be able to continue on with your business unimpeded. Please, use this portal whenever you feel the need. I am at your service."]=1,
},
[141902]={ -- Perrin Moontear
  ["Unfortunately, the ship is currently under repairs. Its unwavering service record may have been tarnished; however, I am here to provide you with other means to reach your destination. A simple portal may not match the thrill of having the wind flow through your hair on the high seas, but you will be able to continue on with your business unimpeded. Please, use this portal whenever you feel the need. I am at your service."]=1,
},
[141903]={ -- Eranril Moontear
  ["Unfortunately, the ship is currently under repairs. Its unwavering service record may have been tarnished; however, I am here to provide you with other means to reach your destination. A simple portal may not match the thrill of having the wind flow through your hair on the high seas, but you will be able to continue on with your business unimpeded. Please, use this portal whenever you feel the need. I am at your service."]=1,
},
[141904]={ -- Rauen Moontear
  ["Unfortunately, the ship is currently under repairs. Its unwavering service record may have been tarnished; however, I am here to provide you with other means to reach your destination. A simple portal may not match the thrill of having the wind flow through your hair on the high seas, but you will be able to continue on with your business unimpeded. Please, use this portal whenever you feel the need. I am at your service."]=1,
},
[141936]={ -- Hanul Swiftgale
  ["How may I help you?"]=1,
},
[142063]={ -- Tezran
  ["You already hold the most seals that you can. Use the seals you have before bothering me for more."]=1,
  ["I offer various ways to purchase a Seal of Wartorn Fate. What do you prefer to give up for the opportunity to twist fate?"]=2,
  ["You already purchased your seals for the week. Stop wasting my time. I should have more available next week."]=3,
  ["Do you ever wish to retry your fate? Perhaps, for a special armor piece, a weapon or a trinket of great power? For a price, I will provide you a seal that twists fate and grants an extra result at a past chance. Once you possess a seal, it will activate after defeating powerful foes in difficult dungeons and raids. Soon, I will be able to provide Seals of Wartorn Fate for Gold, War Resources or Marks of Honor. I have none to offer to you at this time."]=4,
},
[142066]={ -- Razzi the Shaper
  ["Greetings, $r. You have something you wish reforged? The power of Azerite is limitless. Lucky for you, my prices are not."]=1,
},
[142068]={ -- Warpweaver Ezil
  ["Now is the time when the year is new and the moon shines bright.$B$BIt is our time... when the ancients awake."]=1,
  ["I have all the tools necessary to adjust the appearance of your weapons and armor. Shall we begin?"]=2,
},
[142073]={ -- Leila Stafford
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[142095]={ -- Henrick Wyther
  ["How may I help you?"]=1,
},
[142109]={ -- Overlord Geya'rah
  ["Draenor must be free from the grip of fanatics and tyrants."]=1,
  ["Grommash Hellscream has led us well. I respect him as much as I did my father. But if I ever see his traitor son again... <Geya'rah spits on the ground.> ...I will end him."]=2,
  ["As a child, draenei scholars taught me to read and write. I liked them. Respected them. Then the naaru came, and fanaticism took hold. The draenei were reborn--no, they have a different word for it--re-forged in their precious Light. Their belief blinds them, binds them to masters who seek to control the universe as surely as the Legion did. Draenei... eredar... so willing to bend the knee. So prone to corruption."]=3,
},
[142275]={ -- Grommash Hellscream
  ["You have traveled far, $c. You may find our world to be even more savage now then it was when your people last set eyes upon it."]=1,
  ["The Mag'har will bend to no one. Not even those we once called friends."]=2,
  ["Heroes from your world once freed me from a demon's grip in Hellfire Citadel. Were you among them? <Grommash peers at you.> If so, I owe you a great debt. Perhaps the spirits will show me a way to repay it."]=3,
},
[142288]={ -- Neva
  ["This outpost is perilously close to the city, but it is well-hidden and it gives us a perfect view of the Golden Throne. Our spies will be able to keep close tabs on the movements of King Rastakhan and the Horde from here."]=1,
},
[142310]={ -- High Overlord Saurfang
  ["I am he that watches they. I am the fist of retribution. That which does quell the recalcitrant. Dare you defy the Warchief? Dare you face my merciless judgment?"]=1,
},
[142360]={ -- Fellyia Wildsong
  ["It's a good thing we made it here when we did. Thorgen wouldn't have survived here long without reinforcements... despite what the dwarf may say otherwise."]=1,
},
[142414]={ -- Wavesinger Rekan
  ["It's a good day for a voyage! Where would you like to go?"]=1,
  ["Where are you heading, mon?"]=2,
  ["Any day you get to be on de ocean is a good day, my friend! Where to?"]=3,
},
[142426]={ -- Lema Strongstout
  ["Fill yer tankard and pull up a chair. We've stories to tell and kegs to empty."]=1,
},
[142427]={ -- Thorgen Grimwatt
  ["I was on a supply run when I hit engine troubles. I made an emergency landin' at this very spot and waited days for help t' arrive.$b$bHave ye ever survived in a swamp by eatin' twigs n' moss? I have!"]=1,
},
[142478]={ -- Noella Davenport
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[142555]={ -- Hilda Hammerfast
  ["We'll be keepin' a keen eye on the movements o' the sethrak below. You can count on us!"]=1,
},
[142561]={ -- Jessamine Blakemore
  ["Welcome to my inn, weary traveler. What can I do for you?"]=1,
},
[142581]={ -- Chemist's Notes
  ["'After finally discovering a suitable base, we have successfully produced a stable compound.$B$BIn this state it can be stored, transported, or introduced into the mixing process to infuse a terribly potent black powder!$B$BI am so confident in its stability that initial samples were sent to Boralus suspended inside a necklace.$B$BAs we run the cauldrons day and night mixing powder, work also continues on prototyping further applications. Our most promising so far is a pistol, which we hope will make another suitable gift for our esteemed Lady Chairman.'$B$B<The disorganized notes go on to detail various projects and aspirations.>"]=1,
},
[142609]={ -- Handyman Gareth
  ["The tidesages, they've all gone mad!"]=1,
  ["If I'm totally honest, I never really trusted them. I mean, have you seen their banners?"]=2,
  ["You'd be surprised how many repairs I've had to do around here. With all the magic the tidesages use, you'd think they would use waterproof materials."]=3,
},
[142612]={ -- Kate Banks
  ["The Relentless docks here routinely to get folks back to the mainland. If you're looking to go to Stormwind, she's your ship. She'll land in the city harbor."]=1,
},
[142634]={ -- Sister Alison
  ["We have some cots if you'd like to rest. It's not much, but it's what we've got."]=1,
  ["My brothers and sisters have gone too far. It is up to us to right this wrong."]=2,
  ["I managed to snag a few boxes of provisions before I left. You're welcome to some of them. You'll need your strength!"]=3,
},
[142641]={ -- Aron Kyleson
  ["This dock now serves as the landing spot for The Relentless. She's been chartered by the Alliance as the main transportation for diplomats between Stormwind and Kul Tiras. The ship will take you straight to the Boralus Harbor."]=1,
},
[142651]={ -- Lucille Waycrest
  ["Though these days have been marked by loss, we continue onward."]=1,
},
[142656]={ -- Kalendormu
  ["Are you enjoying the festivities?"]=1,
},
[142752]={ -- Andegel
  ["These Kul Tirans have interesting beer! It is much more flavorful than what I have found on the mainland. They are truly dedicated to their craft!"]=1,
},
[142818]={ -- Moj'ito
  ["I swear, if I survive dis, I promise not to swindle my customers for at least two... maybe three weeks."]=1,
},
[142943]={ -- Mith'aka
  ["Headin' ta Zandalar? Dat's where da ship dat dock here be goin', mon."]=1,
},
[142958]={ -- Captain Dam'en
  ["Don't worry, this be one of the fastest ships in Zandalar. We get you to your destination."]=1,
},
[143172]={ -- Yvera Dawnwing
  ["Greetings, $c. Do you wish to return to Boralus?"]=1,
},
[143318]={ -- Foreman Tully
  ["adventurer, was it? Tully. <Foreman Tully extends a calloused hand.> This is Galson's Lode. Normally I'd have my laborers in there gathering ore for the war effort, but since the last Horde attack, we've been forced out. Tell Brewston that we could use some military support out here. We're ready to work, but we won't be getting into that mine without a fight."]=1,
},
[143321]={ -- Lumbering Leo
  ["Welcome to Highlands Mill, the source of all of Stromgarde's lumber. Well, at least this is USUALLY where we get our lumber from. Since the last Horde attack, we've been forced out and nature seems to have reclaimed our mill. Not to worry. Once we get a few footmen out here we'll have the old mill up and working again."]=1,
},
[143334]={ -- Daria Smithson
  ["Need help getting back to Boralus?"]=1,
},
[143422]={ -- Darnassian Citizen
  ["Get out of here, it's too late..."]=1,
  ["Put it out! Someone! Anyone!"]=2,
  ["Why is this happening?!"]=3,
},
[143536]={ -- High Warlord Volrath
  ["Tremblade thinks she can outsmart us with her band of Alliance fools. Her arrogance will be her downfall."]=1,
},
[143548]={ -- Erika Jones
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[143555]={ -- Xander Silberman
  ["Do you need something?"]=1,
},
[143556]={ -- Horde Vanguard Spectator
  ["I suppose dueling can be a good way to sharpen your combat skills... For me? The Alliance make great target dummies."]=1,
},
[143891]={ -- Magister Umbric
  ["My people have been training. Mastering our abilities. <Umbric narrows his eyes.> The whispers speak of many possibilities. We will be ready for whatever comes."]=1,
},
[143896]={ -- Outrigger Engineer
  ["Alright! Ready when you are!"]=1,
},
[144095]={ -- Master Mathias Shaw
  ["My agents have secured this area. That said, it's always prudent to keep our voices low."]=1,
},
[144119]={ -- Kasea Angerforge
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. I can assist you in recovering lost companions."]=2,
},
[144126]={ -- Guzzling Patron
  ["It's all guns and flames until someone loses and dies."]=1,
  ["My father told me there'd be days like this, where a stranger would talk to me and I'd have to restrain myself from killing $ghim:her;."]=2,
  ["Have you tried that Thunderbrew Lager? It's good stuff!"]=3,
  ["I have duty in an hour, but until then... bottom's up!"]=4,
},
[144127]={ -- Grim Patron
  ["Ragnaros will reign supreme!"]=1,
  ["Have a drink, $c. It might be your last!"]=2,
  ["If it weren't for the Grim Guzzler, I'd spend my free time pulling the wings off dragon whelps."]=3,
  ["If it weren't for the Grim Guzzler, I'd probably spend my free time pulling the wings off dragon whelps."]=4,
  ["The water elementals are at war with the fire elementals, which sort of means they're at war with us. One of their leaders, Hydraxis, is mustering agents for his cause..."]=5,
  ["I heard that a noble among the water elementals, Hydraxis, wages war with the servants of fire. Let's hope he loses!"]=6,
  ["The Waterlord Hydraxis hides off in Azshara, on an island in the Bay of Storms. What kind of threat can the fool muster from there?"]=7,
  ["If Hydraxis recruits more in his war, then it might shift the balance of power..."]=8,
},
[144128]={ -- Dark Iron Brewer
  ["Oh... I'm feeling groggy..."]=1,
  ["Don't bother me, $c! I have two whole cauldrons of bubbling brew here and I must ensure they taste just right! If they don't, then Master Coren Direbrew will flay and boil me!"]=2,
  ["This is getting good! It really warms the stomach! And adventurer, I have to say, you're a sharp dressing $gfellow:lass;!"]=3,
  ["Yes $gsir:ma'am;, this is quite a drink! Quite a drink indeed!"]=4,
  ["Let's sing a song! Brew, brawl, brew, brawl! A Dark Iron's life for me! Hah hah! adventurer, I like you!"]=5,
  ["Now where was I? I, yeah... So I said to her, 'But I need you! I need you!' And she just laughed and slithered away! It's the honest truth, adventurer. Naga can be so cruel!"]=6,
  ["This is good stuff! But it's a little weak. I think I'll add a little more garlic breath to it..."]=7,
  ["This is good stuff! But I think it's a little flat. Let's round it out with a few squishy basilisk eyeballs..."]=8,
  ["Not bad, not bad... But it's missing spice! How about adding scorpid venom? Yes! That'll fix it right up!"]=9,
  ["It's shaping up! But it needs more kick. Yep, you guessed it... Let's wash yesterday's socks in the cauldron... Mmmh, delicious!"]=10,
},
[144129]={ -- Plugger Spazzring
  ["Welcome! If you need a place to rest, I can solve that problem."]=1,
},
[144130]={ -- Mistress Nagmara
  ["Welcome to the Grim Guzzler!"]=1,
  ["Be sure to try our Dark Iron Ale. I hear the dwarves around here can't get enough of it."]=2,
  ["My master, Plugger Spazzring, is a good boss. And he makes a lot of money. His pockets are bursting!"]=3,
  ["Thanks again, adventurer. Rocknot and I are really hitting it off!"]=4,
