  ["Guard your mind. N'Zoth's influence is insidious in its subtlety."]=1,
},
[156228]={ -- Kyrian Aspirant
  ["How are you passing the time, friend?"]=1,
  ["Though Bastion is a shadow of its former glory, it is still the most beautiful place I have ever been. If I had to pick a place to wait for eternity, this would be it."]=2,
  ["There is nothing to be done. No amount of meditation or training will bring me closer to ascension. Not right now, anyway. <He sighs deeply.>"]=3,
  ["Where did your training leave off? I was on the precipice of completing the Rite of Loyalty when things began to unravel. I was so close to ascension... so close."]=4,
  ["I just want to start the Five Rites."]=5,
  ["How long has it been since things were normal? Time passes so strangely here."]=6,
  ["I have so much to learn, and this delay is only prolonging that journey. I fear I will never ascend."]=7,
  ["How long have YOU been waiting?"]=8,
},
[156295]={ -- Courier Rokalai
  ["You're something. Don't know what, but something. What do you want?"]=1,
},
[156663]={ -- Warpweaver Ta'oren
  ["Now is the time when the year is new and the moon shines bright.$B$BIt is our time... when the ancients awake."]=1,
