[156735]={ -- Groomer Ta'visage
  ["Welcome, friend, to the barbershop! Come for a cut? A coloring? Something else, perhaps?$B$BWe can groom facial hair, perform piercings, ink night elf tattoos, and even reshape draenei horns and tendrils!$B$BHave a seat and we'll get right to work. You're only a few coins away from a new, more attractive you..."]=1,
  ["Welcome, friend, to the barbershop! Come for a cut? A coloring? Something else, perhaps?$B$BWe can groom facial hair, perform piercings, reshape tusks and horns, and even modify undead features!$B$BHave a seat and we'll get right to work. You're only a few coins away from a new, more attractive you..."]=2,
},
[156768]={ -- Overseer Ta'readon
  ["Welcome to our bazaar, my friend. We are here to serve."]=1,
},
[156769]={ -- Keeper Ta'hult
  ["Ah, welcome friend, did you know that the passage to Tazavesh is open once again? Tread lightly there, they are not so friendly to outsiders. They do have many things to trade, though. Valuable things, glittering things. I have acquired some of their goods. Have you ever seen a baubleworm? They grow gems from their hides that glow with an inner light, but fade and crack when the creature dies. Very rare, very valuable. I ask only that you trade me some of your world's most precious, sentimental goods. We have our eye on a few things in particular..."]=1,
},
[156791]={ -- Keeper Ta'saran
  ["Looking to purchase something special?"]=1,
},
[156800]={ -- Quartermaster Richter
  ["How may I be of service?"]=1,
  ["What can I do for you?"]=2,
},
[156859]={ -- Henry Garrick
  ["The ogres and their allies are trying to sacrifice the rest of my expedition for some necrotic ritual. We won't let that happen."]=1,
},
[156886]={ -- Meredy Huntswell
  ["I got plenty o' ideas on how te deal with these ogres. Let's see which ones don't accidentally blow up the island..."]=1,
},
[156943]={ -- Meredy Huntswell
  ["This will be fun, I promise! Just a little forbidden void magic mixed together with druidic components and BAM! I bet ye'll make a fine ogre."]=1,
},
[157540]={ -- Wing Guard Alamar
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
