},
[158579]={ -- Corporal Teeka Bloodsnarl
  ["Come to learn, eh? Well I just might have some work for you, scrub."]=1,
},
[158653]={ -- Prince Renathal
  ["Sinfall. This is where Denathrius sired his first Court of Harvesters, ages upon ages ago. Here he forged the medallions so that we each may share a piece of his power and carry out his will. There was symmetry to him exiling me to the Maw in this place. He believed he was ending me where he created me. Now we shall use this place to turn the tide against the Master of Revendreth and undo his very grip upon this realm he created."]=1,
},
[158659]={ -- Herculon
  ["<The centurion appears to be depleted of anima.>"]=1,
},
[159127]={ -- Rheus
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[159238]={ -- Atticus
