},
[160921]={ -- Aspiring Soul
  ["First is the Rite of Purity, then the Rite of Courage, then the Rite of... Wait, I have it. Loyalty? No, that cannot be right..."]=1,
},
[161063]={ -- Aspirant Defender
  ["I appreciate your patience. Please know we are doing all we can."]=1,
},
[161265]={ -- Jrokgar
  ["What you want? You no see Jrokgar stand here in peace? Jrokgar no want deal with dark magic. Only want things to throw! Hmm... you look good to throw. Jrokgar throw you back?"]=1,
},
[161298]={ -- Nourman
  ["What bring ye to Nourman's door?"]=1,
},
[161666]={ -- Austin Huxworth
  ["Greetings, $c. I can help stable your pets or assist you in recovering lost companions."]=1,
},
[161678]={ -- Mama Tomalin
  ["I have food, drink and specialty items to support your efforts. What can I do for you?"]=1,
},
[161709]={ -- Highlord Darion Mograine
  ["This is an important moment. Make the knights proud, adventurer."]=1,
},
[162666]={ -- Pathscribe Roh-Avonavi
  ["Welcome. Which path may I assist you with?"]=1,
},
[162804]={ -- Ve'nari
  ["Oh, you've returned. How fortuitous."]=1,
  ["Please tell me you have something interesting to discuss, Maw Walker."]=2,
  ["You were not followed, were you?"]=3,
},
[163007]={ -- Curly
  ["Horses are my favorite mounts. There's no heart in mechanostriders, I can't talk to them."]=1,
},
[164100]={ -- Emissary Ba'silk
  ["Maw Walker. How may I be of service to one of your kind? I trust my kin have found ways to make your stay here more comfortable. Like you, this is a temporary home for us. It seems our own purposes intersect here."]=1,
},
[164173]={ -- Fatescribe Roh-Tahl
  ["The Purpose? Everything around you... all that you see... happens through the Purpose. The Purpose is the guiding principle of all the Arbiter's attendants. It is the reason we are summoned into existence to serve the Eternal City. To serve her. Just as Oribos is the heart of the Shadowlands, so the Purpose keeps the realms of Death in balance. The Purpose guides us, it shows us the path. All beings in the endless cycle serve the Purpose--even those who do so unknowingly or unwillingly. The Purpose is everlasting. It has intention. We all serve the Purpose. Even you."]=1,
},
[164596]={ -- Attendant Caretaker
  ["Welcome, Maw Walker. This portal will take you up to the Ring of Transference, the transport level of Oribos."]=1,
},
[164686]={ -- Caretaker Kah-Sar
  ["We do, but we do not. Forgive me for the cryptic nature of the reply. We record, but we may not recall. Only the Purpose may reveal whether the threads of a soul will rejoin the tapestry of an individual existence."]=1,
},
[164939]={ -- Signilda Hardforge
  ["There are three specializations available to Warriors: Arms, Fury and Protection. Arms Warriors are battle-hardened weapon masters who use mobility and overpowering attacks to devastate opponents in battle. Fury Warriors are furious berserkers who unleash flurries of attacks to carve their enemies to pieces. Protection Warriors are stalwart protectors who use shields to put themselves between the enemy and their allies."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. Have you come to learn about combat specializations?"]=2,
  ["Greetings, $c. If you're looking for training, you'll need to find a $c trainer. I only instruct warriors."]=3,
},
[164940]={ -- Kualiang Thunderfist
  ["Greetings, $c. Have you come to learn about combat specializations?"]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. If you're looking for training, you'll need to find a $c trainer. I only instruct warriors."]=2,
},
[164941]={ -- Laphandrus Voidheart
  ["Greetings, $c. If you're looking for training, you'll need to find a $c trainer. I only instruct warlocks."]=1,
},
