  ["Greetings, $c. If you're looking for training, you'll need to find a $c trainer. I only instruct priests."]=1,
},
[164952]={ -- Ezul'aan
  ["Greetings, $c. If you're looking for training, you'll need to find a $c trainer. I only instruct paladins."]=1,
},
[164954]={ -- Juisheng Halfclaw
  ["Greetings, $c. If you're looking for training, you'll need to find a $c trainer. I only instruct monks."]=1,
},
[164955]={ -- Frazzle Frostfingers
  ["Greetings, $c. Have you come to learn about combat specializations?"]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. If you're looking for training, you'll need to find a $c trainer. I only instruct mages."]=2,
},
[164957]={ -- Camille Taylor
  ["You've come for training in order to pass it on to your pets?"]=1,
  ["Ah friend, I only help hunters and their pets."]=2,
},
[164960]={ -- Dalgrun Steelpine
  ["There are three specializations available to Hunters: Beast Mastery, Marksmanship and Survival. Beast Mastery Hunters are masters of the wild who can tame a wide variety of beasts to assist them in combat. Marksmanship Hunters are master sharpshooters who excel in bringing down enemies from afar. Survival Hunters are skilled rangers who favor the use of explosives, animal venom, and coordinated attacks with their bonded beast."]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. If you're looking for training, you'll need to find a $c trainer. I only instruct hunters."]=2,
  ["Greetings, $c. Have you come to learn about combat specializations?"]=3,
},
[164962]={ -- Mithlos Falconbriar
  ["Greetings, $c. Have you come to learn about combat specializations?"]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. If you're looking for training, you'll need to find a $c trainer. I only instruct druid."]=2,
},
[165107]={ -- Kleia
  ["It is so nice to meet you! I am Kleia, an aspirant of Bastion. There is so much to teach you about our realm! But do not worry--all will be explained in good time. Words cannot express how glad I am for your arrival!"]=1,
  ["You likely have many questions. Do not worry! All will be explained in good time. Are you ready to begin the next chapter of your existence?"]=2,
  ["Why is it you have come here, adventurer?"]=3,
},
[165379]={ -- Researcher Au'daluk
  ["Greetings, traveler. I'm researching ancient relics here in the Shadowlands. Care to join me?"]=1,
},
[165403]={ -- Opulence Ba'hare
  ["Welcome. What do you seek from the brokers? We are ever at your service."]=1,
},
[165505]={ -- Loretta Banks
  ["My job is to charter flights on behalf of King Wrynn. If you have received a special assignment on behalf of the crown, I may be able to arrange a flight for you."]=1,
},
[165701]={ -- Ceridwyn
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[166124]={ -- Sika
  ["Hello! Humble steward Sika is here to help!"]=1,
  ["Oh no! Is Sika in trouble?"]=2,
},
[166227]={ -- Kleia
  ["It is so nice to meet you! I am Kleia, an aspirant of Bastion. There is so much to teach you about our realm! But do not worry--all will be explained in good time. Words cannot express how glad I am for your arrival!"]=1,
  ["You likely have many questions. Do not worry! All will be explained in good time. Are you ready to begin the next chapter of your existence?"]=2,
  ["Why is it you have come here, adventurer?"]=3,
},
[166307]={ -- Caretaker Kah-Toll
  ["Greetings, Maw Walker. Once you have grown strong enough, this vault will grant you a boon that Oribos deems appropriate for your endeavors in aid of the Purpose. This will happen at a regular interval as long as you are active in our aid. I believe your kind refer to the nature of that interval as 'weekly'."]=1,
},
[166640]={ -- Au'larrynar
  ["Are you seeking some... enhancement? A little more power for your punch, some sizzle to your magic. It can be yours, for a price."]=1,
},
[166996]={ -- Mithdran Dawntracker
  ["It's insulting that we have to deal with these quilboar. They'll soon face the full might of the Horde."]=1,
},
[167032]={ -- Chromie
  ["Hey there, adventurer! Wherever you want to go, I can help you get there! Time works in mysterious ways, but you don't look like a stranger to mystery."]=1,
},
[167247]={ -- V'kerra
  ["Where would you like to fly?"]=1,
},
[167424]={ -- Overseer Kah-Sher
  ["Let us begin to align your path to the Purpose. Do you think you can manage that?"]=1,
},
[167425]={ -- Overseer Kah-Delen
  ["A mortal in Oribos? The Purpose has brought a mortal to us?"]=1,
},
[167429]={ -- Quartermaster Richter
  ["How may I be of service?"]=1,
  ["What can I do for you?"]=2,
},
[167603]={ -- Fixer Bixie
  ["Everything can be fixed, we can fix this too."]=1,
},
[167738]={ -- Foreman Au'brak
  ["Welcome, stranger. We are at your service."]=1,
},
[167881]={ -- Ta'lan the Antiquary
  ["Are you bringing me something?"]=1,
},
[168011]={ -- Zo'sorg
  ["Well met, Maw Walker."]=1,
},
[168032]={ -- Flwngyrr
  ["Put down your roots."]=1,
},
[168122]={ -- Foreman Scug
  ["No time to be a chatterbox. Gotta keep my eyes on them workers."]=1,
},
[168252]={ -- Protector Captain
  ["Who are you, stranger?"]=1,
},
[168540]={ -- Rohaka Tuskmaul
  ["I'd rather ride on the back of a dire wolf than inside of one."]=1,
},
[168551]={ -- Tamanji
  ["Greetings, $c. Have you come to learn about combat specializations?"]=1,
},
[168553]={ -- Telotha Pinegrove
  ["Greetings, $c. Have you come to learn about combat specializations?"]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. If you're looking for training, you'll need to find a $c trainer. I only instruct druid."]=2,
},
[168596]={ -- Gormok Ogrefist
  ["Greetings, $c. Have you come to learn about combat specializations?"]=1,
  ["Greetings, $c. If you're looking for training, you'll need to find a $c trainer. I only instruct warriors."]=2,
},
[168597]={ -- Avaros Dawnglaive
  ["Greetings, $c. If you're looking for training, you'll need to find a $c trainer. I only instruct paladins."]=1,
